window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":6001,"title":"Chapter 6001: Water Moon Cave","paragraphs":["Chapter 6001: Water Moon Cave","If Divine Wood King consumed the treasures bestowed by Realm King and embarked on the path of resurrection in the future, there was hope to surpass this Pope of the Ancient Moon Religion.","But now, there was no doubt that the Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect was the strongest.","A family like the Bai Clan, or rather the Bai Divine Mountain, could nurture a generation of Popes for the Ancient Moon Sect.","This had a lot to do with their internal cultivation methods.","At Bai Divine Mountain, the cultivation emphasis was primarily on one’s state of mind.","When the mind and spirit are unified, one becomes invincible.","According to Wu Zuo’s information, Tongtian Buddha’s experience after entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime was the simplest.","Upon entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he joined Bai Divine Mountain.","Breaking through to become the Universe Master was also very smooth; it took less than an era to achieve.","However, after becoming the Universe Master, Tongtian Buddha encountered great trouble. Blame it on Realm King.","He gave Tongtian Buddha a very special inheritance.","The premise of receiving this inheritance was to have Tongtian Buddha convert a life within a certain paradise world.","Tongtian Buddha initially thought this was a simple matter, but he regretted it upon entering that paradise.","He wasted millions of eras on this.","To the point where even Bai Divine Mountain almost forgot about him within the sect.","“Water Moon Cave!”","A peculiar cave paradise beneath Bai Divine Mountain, seemingly ordinary but had trapped Tongtian Buddha for countless ages.","The pyramid Jian Wushuang rode silently entered this cave.","There were no Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation in Bai Divine Mountain.","As for whichever Bai Clan ancestor saw Divine Wood King’s flourishing, they had long gone to visit Divine Wood King.","Even if they were in their lair, they wouldn’t be able to discover Jian Wushuang.","In the entire Primordial White Heaven, or the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Only the Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect noticed Jian Wushuang’s arrival.","“A pyramid? Jian Wushuang!”","The Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect, with her tall figure, gazed at the location where Jian Wushuang descended.","“To cause such a disturbance in the Eternal Realm of Tian Cang, then suddenly return to the Ancient Moon Spacetime, how interesting!”","What she was staring at was Jian Wushuang’s vitality. She just didn’t feel like exchanging it originally, but seeing Jian Wushuang again, she felt somewhat moved. However, knowing that Jian Wushuang had entered the Water Moon Cave for important matters, she didn’t go directly to find him but waited for Jian Wushuang to come out before visiting him.","...","When Jian Wushuang rode the pyramid into the Water Moon Cave, he also felt that gaze, but he ignored it.","Now, in the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime, no one dared to make him unhappy, not even any Pope.","Whoosh!","A slender figure directly stepped onto the land of the Water Moon Cave.","The scenery was beautiful, with picturesque mountains and rivers!","It was a rare paradise.","After his arrival, he put away the pyramid.","With a thought, he could sense the only Universe Master in this cave.","Most of the cultivators in this cave were mortals.","There were very few Immortal-level cultivators.","Emperors were even rarer.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang could sense that within billions of miles around, there was no trace of battle.","This indicated that Tongtian Buddha had done a good job of conversion.","The cultivators of the whole world were peaceful.","Standing on a hillside in the jungle, he glanced around and felt quite comfortable.","At this moment, from a small path in the jungle, came the sound of sparse hoofbeats.","After a while, a group of people and horses appeared.","There were only a few people, with varying levels of strength, all mortal warriors.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t be riding horses.","When these people passed by the hillside and saw Jian Wushuang standing there dumbfounded, dressed luxuriously like a rich young master, they didn’t sense any aura of a","warrior from him.","According to past experiences, encountering a rich young master in the deep mountains and old forests, what else could they do?","Of course, rob him!","But these warriors all dismounted, shouting loudly, “Is this young master lost?”","Even when speaking, they had to dismount to avoid looking down on him.","How polite!","Jian Wushuang turned around, also very courteous, “No, I was just attracted by the scenery","here and stopped to admire it for a while!”","“Oh. Since that’s the case, then we’ll...”","Before the other party finished speaking, Jian Wushuang leaped into the air directly.","“Thank you for your concern, I’ll take my leave first!”","Jian Wushuang flew slowly, allowing the warriors below to catch sight of his figure.","Upon realizing that Jian Wushuang was a cultivator capable of flight, these people revealed expressions of extreme envy.","It wasn’t until Jian Wushuang disappeared from view that they mounted their horses and continued on their journey.","Leaping over forests and crossing a canyon, he spotted an ordinary small town.","Thin smoke rose from within the town, and smiles adorned the faces of its inhabitants.","It was mid-afternoon when Jian Wushuang arrived, witnessing scenes of ordinary people returning home from their labor to have their meals.","Men returned home with hoes, reaching before sunset to enjoy the meals prepared by their","wives.","As long as their families were safe and sound, it was the greatest tranquility for them. Passing through the canyon, he arrived at the plains where commoners congregated the most. The night passed by in the blink of an eye, and Jian Wushuang hadn’t even witnessed a single scene of conflict.","It wasn’t until the second day, when the sun was high in the sky, that the place came alive.","The fact that they could sleep until this time indicated that these commoners faced no","pressure whatsoever.","They rose early for exercises, had their meals, and drank tea, maintaining an extremely","leisurely pace of life.","There was no oppression from landlords or thieves in this mortal world.","Jian Wushuang flew all the way, testing the results of his enlightenment.","Among the farmhouses he observed, there were no Buddhist statues being worshipped.","That was the brilliance of the Buddhist philosophy.","After observing the common folk, he turned his gaze towards warriors and even cultivators.","They were all the same.","Teaching the methods of cultivation, they emphasized going with the flow.","Cultivation was also about going with the flow.","Either visiting friends or secluding oneself for cultivation.","There was simply no conflict.","As for the needed treasures, they were either refined by friends or cultivated by oneself.","Conflicts were extremely rare.","In places where conflicts did occur, they were merely sparring matches.","After wandering for three days, Jian Wushuang had surveyed the entire Water Moon Cave.","His eyes eventually settled on a small city within the Water Moon Cave.","The city was populated by cultivators, with numerous entrances totaling to 1 million.","Tongtian Buddha was among them.","His appearance had changed a lot.","He looked younger than before, dressed in a plain light blue robe, with thick eyebrows and big","eyes.","With folded hands, he walked calmly along the streets.","There was no longer the radiant aura of the past; now, he was understated.","He resembled a young monk.","After making a round, it was time to greet Tongtian Buddha.","Jian Wushuang’s figure flickered, directly entering the small city.","He had timed it perfectly, arriving early at a roadside stall.","In the early morning, the stall owner was shouting about white porridge, spicy dishes, and","steamed buns.","Although it was a small city frequented by cultivators, most of the residents were still","warriors.","They hadn’t reached the level of fasting.","So, there were still worldly foods available.","Jian Wushuang found a spot by the street and loudly ordered, “Two bowls of porridge, four","steamed buns, two meat, two vegetarian!”","One aspect of this place that Jian Wushuang admired was that Tongtian Buddha had not simply copied his own Buddhist practices here."]},{"number":6002,"title":"Chapter 6002: Master Tongtong?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6002: Master Tongtong?","People still could kill each other.","So there were meat buns.","The stall owner carried two steaming bowls of white porridge and walked over with small steps. “Young master, your porridge is here, and the buns will be served to you immediately!”","After placing the white porridge down, he was somewhat curious why Jian Wushuang, alone, ordered two servings of white porridge.","Though curious, he didn’t dwell on it too much, instead, he turned to lift the steamer lid and fetched the buns.","Jian Wushuang casually picked up a pair of chopsticks. There were complimentary spicy pickles on the table, and he ate the porridge with the pickles.","It had been many years since he had done such a thing.","With just a sip, he felt warmth spreading throughout his body.","Leisurely sipping his porridge, he quietly awaited Tongtian Buddha’s passing.","In just a few breaths, counting the steps, Tongtian Buddha arrived.","“Tongtian!” Jian Wushuang set down his chopsticks, not turning his head, sitting upright at the table, his lips moving slightly as he muttered the name “Tongtian.”","In the bustling street, hardly anyone could hear.","Unless they were deeply cultivated practitioners, obviously, there were no such powerful individuals passing through so early in the morning.","Only Tongtian Buddha heard those two words.","It made his expression change, freezing him in place.","In the entire city, no movement escaped his mental perception.","Hearing someone utter his title, he immediately became nervous.","Turning his head to locate the source of the sound, he saw a stranger’s figure.","Even if it were a dog inside Water Moon Cave, he would recognize it.","The moment he saw the unfamiliar figure, he knew the newcomer was extraordinary.","Definitely not a life from within Water Moon Cave.","But he cultivated within Water Moon Cave, and Bai Divine Mountain had long sealed off this place.","With only him here, how could there be outsiders coming in?","Thinking of this, he felt a stir in his heart and stepped towards that figure.","Approaching the table, he still couldn’t believe his intuition.","“Have a seat!” Jian Wushuang didn’t turn his head, but pointed to the seat across from him, where a bowl of porridge was placed.","Tongtian Buddha walked hesitantly to the opposite side. After seeing the familiar face, he sat down abruptly.","Full of disbelief, he said, “Jian Wushuang!”","His eyelids trembled, unable to believe that the person before him was Jian Wushuang, who had entered Ancient Moon Spacetime with him.","“Drink the porridge first, it won’t taste good when it’s cold!” Jian Wushuang buried his head in his porridge, not saying much.","Tongtian Buddha suppressed his surprised expression, picked up a pair of chopsticks, but still didn’t start eating.","At this moment, the stall owner approached with a basket of buns and set it down, reminding them, “The ones on the left are vegetarian, the ones on the right are meat-filled. Enjoy your meal...”","But when he saw the monk sitting across from Jian Wushuang, he froze, “Master Tongtong?” Clearly, he recognized Tongtian Buddha.","The mere mention of the name “Tongtong” made Jian Wushuang burst into laughter, almost choking on his porridge.","He couldn’t believe that the revered Tongtian Buddha, surrounded by a halo of Buddha light, was referred to as “Tongtong” here.","“Virtuous!” Tongtian Buddha clasped his hands together towards the stall owner and silently uttered a phrase.","The stall owner, noticing the dark circles under Tongtian Buddha’s eyes, casually remarked, “Tongtong, are you off to Qingshui Tower again?”","This remark only fueled Jian Wushuang’s laughter.","Tongtian Buddha could only smile wryly, not denying it.","The stall owner, after giving a curious glance, ceased further inquiry, but couldn’t help but wonder why this Master Tongtong was so attached to the Qingshui Tower in that alley.","Jian Wushuang picked up a meat bun, took a bite, and with a mouth full, muttered, “Master Tongtong, looks like you’re having a good time lately, able to spend nights at places like Qingshui Tower!”","“Wushuang, how did you find me?” Tongtian Buddha, lacking any appetite, asked the question that had been on his mind.","Knowing that few people were aware of his whereabouts, even on Bai Divine Mountain.","Jian Wushuang’s ability to locate him surprised him.","Moreover, after so many years, he had planned to actively seek out others, never expecting Jian Wushuang to find him first.","For countless years, struggling in the mortal world, Tongtian Buddha had lost his aura of strength, devoid of the majesty of a Universe Master, instead appearing like an ordinary","person.","Even sitting at a roadside stall made him feel awkward.","Jian Wushuang finished his bun in a few bites, wiped the grease from the corner of his mouth with his sleeve, then slowly spoke, “Finding you wasn’t simple. Someone informed me of your whereabouts, so I came here!”","Before Tongtian Buddha could inquire further, Jian Wushuang pointed to the sky and continued, “It was someone who passed on your inheritance!”","“Ah, I see!” Tongtian Buddha blinked, realizing that was the only possibility.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s restrained aura, he knew the other party must be stronger than him.","Among the top ten inheritors.","Even the first to fall, Fan Tianfeng, was stronger than the current Tongtian Buddha.","Back in Qishen Temple, Tongtian Buddha’s talent actually surpassed Zhen Wuyang and the","others’.","He was one of the top Inheritors in the entire Original Universe.","But now, he was just an ordinary Universe Master in the Third Tribulation realm.","Above Water Moon Cave, Tongtian Buddha’s Origin Source Universe was hidden.","Internally, it was desolate.","Apparently, he hadn’t cultivated his Origin Source for a long time.","His divine power was ordinary, only around 200,000.","Tongtian Buddha felt a bit embarrassed, awkwardly smiling, “These years, I’ve been trapped","in the trial of this inheritance, neglecting my cultivation!”","Seeing his calm demeanor, Jian Wushuang admired him a bit. Being surpassed by everyone","else but remaining so indifferent showed an exceptionally high level of character.","But what did that matter?","Could it put food on the table?","Could it defeat those in the Seventh Tribulation realm?","Could a Universe Master still be trapped by the mortal world?","Jian Wushuang sighed, “Do you need help?”","“No, I’m close to success!” Tongtian Buddha’s expression changed as he began to recount his","current achievements.","Almost the entire Water Moon Cave had been converted.","Countless people had been influenced by him.","This influence wasn’t due to strength but rather Tongtian Buddha’s words and deeds over the","years.","Since entering Water Moon Cave, he had completely abolished his own power, even traveling","the entire place on a donkey.","That donkey must have been exhausted from carrying him around.","Just the time spent traveling probably amounted to 100,000 eras.","But his efforts were not in vain. He was close to success.","Now, only three people in Water Moon Cave remained unaffected.","These three were still unconverted!","And they were all in this small city.","Tongtian Buddha had stayed in the small city for 10 years, all for these three people.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang became interested.","With a mental flick, he sensed the locations and auras of the three individuals through","causality.","They were all ordinary people with low martial cultivation.","Calling them cultivators would be an insult.","According to the information in causality, these three hadn’t done anything particularly","egregious.","They were just petty criminals."]},{"number":6003,"title":"Chapter 6003: My Heart Has Not Changed!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6003: My Heart Has Not Changed!","Actually, it wasn’t worth Tongtian Buddha’s time to be here.","“Thief, prostitute, robber!”","The combined strength of these three wasn’t even a match for Jian Wushuang’s breath.","But Tongtian Buddha shook his head, “It’s not that simple. Over these years, I’ve observed that the fortunes of these three are exceptionally strong. They’re no ordinary people. There must be some powerful figure who has arranged something special against me. We mustn’t act recklessly!”","He had become somewhat numb to it all now, seeing complexity in everything.","With just these three, Jian Wushuang could have dealt with them with a bit of time, but he was somewhat skeptical.","With a casual gesture, time around them began to accelerate.","Jian Wushuang stood up, observing the changes around him. With a flick of his hand, time froze, and he and Tongtian Buddha found the thief. The thief was in the act of stealing lambs from a farmhouse.","“Some things don’t need my intervention. It’s quite simple, really. If he wants to steal sheep, just turn him into one and be done with it. After all, he’s just a mortal, living a few hundred years at most, while you can still break free from this!”","The thief didn’t steal sheep out of choice but out of not knowing how to obtain one through legitimate means.","Now, Jian Wushuang was about to teach him a way to acquire a lamb.","With a divine power, he directly altered the thief’s physique, allowing him to rise to the ranks of a martial arts expert.","No longer would he need to steal for a single sheep.","Tongtian Buddha stood by, watching without intervening, nor did he heed Jian Wushuang’s words.","Initially, they thought they had dealt with the problem, but soon Jian Wushuang felt some regret.","After becoming a martial arts expert, the thief not only didn’t abandon his thieving habits but intensified them.","From stealing, he progressed to robbery, and even murder.","It wasn’t as simple as they thought.","Minor changes could amplify the evil in one’s heart infinitely.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang once again altered time, this time to a roadside stall.","Even the porridge on the table emitted steam.","“Wushuang, I’ve told you, this is a test from some powerful figure. It’s not as simple as you think!” Tongtian Buddha chuckled in triumph.","But Jian Wushuang was still stubborn, feeling that if he couldn’t change even a mortal, he had reason to doubt.","With a flash of body and mind, when he reappeared, there were bloody hands on the table. Since teaching to fish didn’t work, he would just cut off the head of the ringleader of evil deeds and see what the consequences would be!","Tongtian Buddha clasped his hands together, silently chanting, “Virtuous!”","“This is true virtue!”","Peering into the karma, they found that the thief had indeed stopped stealing because the people in the small town were kind, and the thief met a good end.","It was a beautiful ending.","Then came the second one.","The prostitute!","This was also why Tongtian Buddha was mocked as the main culprit behind the scenes in the alley of fireworks and willows.","Prostitution wasn’t inherently evil in this world.","But the deeds of this prostitute were extreme.","And extreme was evil!","Every one of her clients ended up with broken families because of her.","Jian Wushuang, with Tongtian Buddha, found the prostitute.","Instead of teaching her to fish, they sought punishment.","Hiss...","The prostitute had a bewitching appearance, truly a scourge.","This time, the punishment was simple. They directly disfigured her face.","Her appearance became ugly, her skin starting to rot.","This was the punishment for wrongdoing.","Jian Wushuang was unlike Tongtian Buddha; he wouldn’t give these people too many chances.","Tongtian Buddha shook his head disapprovingly.","The courtesans lost her beauty, and her business plummeted.","Though the red-light district was ruthless, it still harbored the world’s compassion.","The courtesan, having lost her patrons, didn’t starve to death. Instead, her became servants in the brothels, securing their well-being in old age.","The last one!","A bandit.","This time, Jian Wushuang didn’t waste words; he swiftly dealt with the opponent’s life.","With a single action, he transformed the entire world into a paradise as imagined by ordinary people.","Pure and without impurities.","“Everything’s settled now; your test is over!” Jian Wushuang clapped his hands, indicating","that everything was sorted out.","But Tongtian Buddha continued to shake his head, sighing, “The world may have changed for the better, but my heart remains unchanged!”","“Your understanding is still lacking. Ultimately, you only sought to become stronger for yourself, thus changing them... Tongtian, you lack love in your heart!” At that moment, Jian Wushuang directly exposed Tongtian Buddha’s innermost thoughts.","Jian Wushuang, seemingly carefree, was actually astute.","Cutting off the thief’s hand, messing up the courtesan’s face, killing the bandit-","It was all a facade, all for this moment.","Tongtian Buddha, initially serene, now had a drastically changed expression, his state of","mind shaken.","Years of effort were destroyed by Jian Wushuang’s words.","“No!” Tongtian Buddha plunged into darkness, unwilling to acknowledge the darkness","within his heart.","Deprived of the Buddha’s radiance, he transformed completely into a flame of darkness!","Jian Wushuang shook his head in dismay. “Wu Zuo was right about you; you’re truly trapped!”","Water Moon Cave was just a facade.","All talk of enlightening sentient beings was a lie.","Or rather, it was a lie to Tongtian Buddha.","This was the brilliance of Realm King.","In reality, the only one who needed enlightenment was Tongtian Buddha himself.","The entire Water Moon Cave was an illusion!","Jian Wushuang saw through it with a single point.","This place was not a hidden paradise but an infernal abyss.","The territory of Bai Divine Mountain.","Tongtian Buddha hadn’t participated in Bai Divine Mountain’s trial at all; instead, he had","made a grave mistake, falling into hell and being punished there all along.","This was why no one outside paid attention to him.","When hell manifested, even Bai Divine Mountain trembled.","Tongtian Buddha’s previously bald head even grew long hair.","With hair cascading down and eyes shrouded in darkness, his transformed heart remained","selfish.","From Buddha to Demon Lord.","As Bai Divine Mountain shook, soon, a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation descended","to investigate.","“Wutian!” Upon seeing Tongtian Buddha, the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation","from Bai Divine Mountain exclaimed, preparing to suppress him.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was no longer concealed, fully exposed.","With a single palm, he directly pushed away the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation,","causing no harm.","Boom!","After being pushed away, the Universe Master was extremely surprised. Upon seeing Jian Wushuang’s face, he was stunned. “Jian... Jian Wushuang?”","“Don’t bother him; any losses will be mine!” Jian Wushuang crossed his arms, standing in the","void, observing Tongtian Buddha’s transformation.","Tongtian?","Wutian!","The changes were indeed significant.","And the change in strength was even greater.","As long as Tongtian Buddha was willing to abandon his former hypocrisy and become a true","demon, it was possible to leap over the Seventh Tribulation.","This was the opportunity given to him by Realm King.","Opportunity belonged to everyone, and everyone was equal.","The opportunities for each of them, ten in total, were actually quite similar.","It depended on how they seized them.","Tongtian Buddha, or rather, Wutian, the Heaven of the Infernal Abyss!","At this moment, he was struggling with the last shred of consciousness in his heart.","As long as this consciousness was erased, he could successfully transform."]},{"number":6004,"title":"Chapter 6004: Breaking the Illusion","paragraphs":["Chapter 6004: Breaking the Illusion","It was uncertain whether the other party would recognize him when the time came.","“Did Realm King already know that someone would come to expose him?” Jian Wushuang sighed deeply, quietly waiting for the other party’s reaction.","But curiosity lingered in his heart.","Most likely, even if he didn’t come, Wu Zuo would.","To expose the illusion and unleash the true Wutian Demon Lord.","As he pondered these thoughts, the current master of Bai Divine Mountain beside him began to feel restless.","The Nether Hell was the pinnacle treasure of Bai Divine Mountain, completely integrated with it. Now that outsiders had intruded, this was a big deal. He first informed the ancestral patriarch of the Bai family, then, feeling uneasy, he also informed the senior sister of the Ancient Moon Sect.","That senior sister was also the Emperor of the Ancient Moon Sect.","The ancestral patriarch of the Bai family, knowing that Jian Wushuang was on his Bai Divine Mountain, was initially chatting with the people from the Ancient Wood Sect and Divine Wood King. Suddenly, he couldn’t sit still.","Fortunately, through Divine Wood King, he learned from Jian Wushuang that it was for one person.","Only then did he feel relieved.","After Divine Wood King’s encounter with them in the Wanliu, his favor towards Jian Wushuang greatly increased. Moreover, they were all close friends who had experienced life and death together, so he also persuaded him on the side, “Brother Bai, I’m not criticizing you. If Wushuang can find someone on your Bai Divine Mountain, it’s your good fortune. You want the power of Life, right? Now, let’s go to the Primordial White Heaven. With my face, it’s a piece of cake for you to exchange for the power of Life!”","“If that’s the case, then I’ll trouble you, Brother Divine Wood!” The ancestral patriarch of the Bai family finally reacted and hurriedly smiled, taking out the flying treasure directly.","Such matters couldn’t be delayed.","They wanted to leave immediately.","Seeing the flying treasure of the other party, Divine Wood King’s eyes flickered, sighing, “Brother Bai, you’ve had a good time these years. I’ve been wanting to get a flying treasure of the Eighth Tribulation realm for so long, but I just haven’t had the chance. Sigh!”","The ancestral patriarch of the Bai family had known Divine Wood King for so many years, how could he not know what the other was thinking? Immediately, he took out the Origin Source from the flying treasure and handed it directly to Divine Wood King, “What am I, just a little treasure, what’s the big deal? Brother Divine Wood, just take it. If you need anything in the future, just say it. In the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime, isn’t it still us old folks who call the shots!”","His daughter was the Emperor of the Ancient Moon Sect.","In the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime, they truly had the upper hand.","When the incarnation of which heavenly maiden was completely destroyed.","The entire Ancient Moon Spacetime began to recover.","In the future, the world would truly belong to them.","Divine Wood King felt a bit embarrassed but, thick-skinned as he was, he accepted it and his expression brightened.","Personally controlling the flying treasure, he headed towards the Primordial White Heaven. At this moment, the Ancient Moon Pope also arrived at the Bai Divine Mountain. However, he concealed his figure in the void, intending to pay his respects only after Jian Wushuang came out.","But before long, he sensed the aura of the Divine Wood King and his own father.","So, he also emerged from the void.","Upon meeting each other, without speaking, they understood each other’s thoughts.","The path of resurrection was about to begin.","There were many scattered tribulations with great potential, all on the verge of perishing, waiting for the power of Life!","Apart from Danbao, in the entire Northern Spacetime, only Jian Wushuang had a continuous supply of Life force.","Once Jian Wushuang appeared, it would attract countless strong individuals.","Of course, not to besiege Jian Wushuang, but sincerely to exchange.","No matter how high the price, there was no complaint.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t demand exorbitant prices either, just sticking to the usual rates.","Even at this price, he made quite a profit.","In a previous exchange in the Ancient Wood Continent, he obtained numerous treasures. However, there were too few Origin Source treasures. Although he acquired quite a few, lighting up the second and even third universe this time depleted his resources.","Only some primordial stones were left, and he was reluctant to use them.","Maintaining the Origin Source Universe incurred considerable expenses.","His universe was incredibly vast, requiring a large amount of primordial stones.","The infinite power of the Starry Sky also required an infinite supply of primordial stones to","sustain it.","Those powers didn’t come out of thin air.","It’s just that his reserves were relatively abundant.","Just like the power of Life, converting it required the power of All Things.","And the power of myriad things required devouring the treasures nurtured by heaven and","earth.","In summary, Jian Wushuang’s Life force could be converted from cabbage, but it was definitely not at cabbage prices.","Who made him the sole owner of the entire Northern Spacetime?","Deep in the abyssal hell, after settling the Divine Wood King, Jian Wushuang hadn’t really thought about the power of Life.","Anyway, he currently lacked some treasures, and he could cooperate with the other party to exchange some later.","In the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, all the exchanged treasures were given to Wu Zuo.","It just happened to make a deal with the Ancient Moon Spacetime and the Bai Family.","He didn’t like dealing with those wandering cultivators, as it was troublesome dealing with small quantities.","The life or death of those Scattered Tribulations had nothing to do with him.","He would rescue or, let’s say, donate when he saw them, but he wouldn’t deliberately do so.","The moral golden light obtained from exchanges was of little use.","Karmic forces or golden lights, it was the same.","Just like Tongtian Buddha now, facing one’s own heart was the right approach.","“Done!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he stared at the no longer struggling Wutian","Demon Lord, the former Tongtian Buddha.","He was sitting cross-legged by a black river, his face somewhat haggard.","But his Origin Source had already ascended several levels.","Jian Wushuang looked dazzlingly, able to sense the aura of the Seventh Tribulation realm,","and the divine power was extremely violent.","At least a basic divine power of 2 million.","And Wutian Demon Lord’s Origin Source was within his body.","Which means, the Origin Source Universe had entered the divine body.","This was something only those of the Eighth Tribulation could achieve.","Originally, only Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo could do it, but now Tongtian Buddha had also","achieved it, so his strength should be not weaker than Wu Zuo’s.","Another powerful ally.","There was still no news of Hu Qing for now, but it shouldn’t be too bad.","This added a lot of confidence to him in dealing with Mie Sheng.","Whoosh!","Feeling the opponent’s aura stabilize, Jian Wushuang flew over actively, “Tongtian?","Wutian?”","“Tongtian is already dead!” Wutian sneered, “You chose it, Jian Wushuang!”","This statement was not wrong at all. Jian Wushuang indeed shattered Tongtian Buddha’s","state of mind, leading him to fall completely into the demonic path.","Seemingly extreme, Jian Wushuang’s actions were actually a reflection of Tongtian Buddha’s","inherently extreme nature.","Changing a world to the extreme.","There was only goodness, no evil!","Then where does goodness come from? Punishing evil and promoting goodness!","Without evil to punish, the entire world seemed to become good, but in fact, this world had","become a great evil.","Evil towards whom?","Evil towards goodness!","There’s an interesting book among the mundane world called the ‘Diamond Sutra’.","Its description of goodness could be said to be profoundly simple.","The existence of evil was just to set off greater goodness.","“Wutian, that’s a good name. Once Tongtian, now Wutian, you really have quite a lot of grievances with heaven!” Jian Wushuang joked to ease the atmosphere."]},{"number":6005,"title":"Chapter 6005: Incarnation of the Nether Hell","paragraphs":["Chapter 6005: Incarnation of the Nether Hell","Only, Wutian, now, wasn’t in the mood to listen to Jian Wushuang’s banter.","Rising from the ruins, Wutian had achieved a new height, freed from past constraints, though the memories lingered.","He knew why Jian Wushuang had come.","To return to Qishen Temple.","“Jian Wushuang, I have no interest in Qishen Temple anymore. You’ve come to the wrong place!” Wutian rose, his aura surging.","A terrifying presence swept all, shaking the entire Nether Hell.","This Nether Hell itself was a treasure of the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation realm, born with the extraordinary enlightenment of Realm King.","But now, this Nether Hell began to merge with Wutian’s Origin Source Universe.","The entire Nether Hell became his Dao Arena.","The aura was immensely majestic.","The Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm from the Bai Divine Mountain felt a bit panicked. This was their Bai Divine Mountain’s treasure, now fallen into Wutian’s hands.","Initially, Tongtian Buddha came to Bai Divine Mountain because of mistakenly killing a saint of Bai Divine Mountain, hence suppressed in this Nether Hell.","But what happened back then wasn’t entirely Tongtian Buddha’s fault. Speaking of which, Tongtian Buddha punished evil and promoted good by killing that saint of the Bai family. Who was also the descendant of the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","As the overlords of the Primordial White Heaven, the Bai family couldn’t swallow this humiliation and immediately had Tongtian Buddha suppressed.","The name Tongtian Buddha used back then was Wutian.","To uphold its own reputation, Bai Divine Mountain didn’t directly kill Tongtian Buddha but suppressed him under the pretext of cleansing.","Achieving the present Wutian!","But unexpectedly, the stolen chicken wasn’t worth losing the rice. The Nether Hell was forcibly merged into Wutian’s Origin Source Universe.","After passing through four Tribulations consecutively, Wutian reached the level of the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","With a mere movement, he could annihilate the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm from Bai Divine Mountain.","Even if the ancestors of Bai Divine Mountain came, they were no match for him.","The nineteen sealed king powerhouses all appeared extremely old, barely sustaining themselves.","Only Divine Wood King was lucky enough to recover to his peak, while the other sealed king powerhouses, though they had gained considerable Life force, were still far from their peaks. Without the luck of Divine Wood King, not only would they have not reached their peak, but they wouldn’t have advanced to the perfection of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","They had also formed a good relationship with the God of Life. In the future, their path to reincarnation would undoubtedly be at the forefront.","“The ancestor is outside. Jian Wushuang, take me away quickly. Please have the ancestor suppress Wutian!”","The space here had been sealed off; no Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm could leave. They could only hope Jian Wushuang would take them away.","But Jian Wushuang was indifferent, saying calmly, “Everything lost by Bai Divine Mountain is my doing. The rest has nothing to do with you!”","Now he was entitled to say this.","What did it matter to acquire this Nether Hell?","It was nothing more than a matter of Life force.","But when a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation hesitated, he transmitted a message to the Patriarch.","Expecting a scolding, he was surprised when the Patriarch not only didn’t get angry but became excited, informing him that everything could be sold to Jian Wushuang.","As long as he produced the Life force, everything was worth it.","Jian Wushuang was extremely generous about this, not being stingy at all.","After all, these treasures would ultimately fall into his hands.","Though Wutian claimed to be uninterested in Qishen Temple, as Tongtian Buddha after his transformation into the demonic path, he had become Wutian, with a drastically changed personality.","Normal people might not trust each other, but Jian Wushuang did.","He could tell that Wutian still had an attachment to Qishen Temple, and he had just helped him out a big favor, otherwise, he would still be trapped in Water Moon Cave.","Demon!","That was the demon of the righteous path.","It had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang.","And the demonic path was not inhabited solely by irrational monsters; it wasn’t as terrifying as it seemed.","Someone like Chi Jiuxiao belonged to the demonic path, a powerful and terrifying puppet.","Wutian was the real demon.","“You’ve changed a lot, but don’t forget where you came from, and especially don’t forget who gave you everything!” Jian Wushuang stepped onto the Black River, his aura trembling.","Upon hearing this, Wutian laughed arrogantly, “That depends on whether you have the qualifications!”","Buzz!","Instantly, his aura surged, the power within the Nether Hell gathering around Wutian, divine power skyrocketing from 2 million to 3 million.","The speed of it startled Jian Wushuang.","3 million, 4 million, 5 million.","It finally slowed down after reaching 5 million.","It was almost on par with Wu Zuo.","With the blessing of the Nether Hell and the Nether Secret Technique taught by Realm King, it","was normal for the amplification to reach this level.","The stronger Wutian became, the more advantageous it was for Jian Wushuang.","“Now, are you satisfied with me?” Wutian laughed wildly, demonic flames rising with every","movement.","Jian Wushuang drew his sword, a gesture he would make to every Inheritor of Qishen Temple,","it was a sign of respect, not treating them as insignificant.","Clang!","The Wanjie Sword emerged, dispersing the demonic flames around, the faint blue stellar power killing all worldly beings.","“A sword determines the winner. If I lose, consider it repaying your favor and erasing everything that happened. If you lose, you must return to Qishen Temple with me!”","Jian Wushuang’s tone was stern, after drawing his sword, he had also changed somewhat, with the killing intent of the sword path surging within him.","The desire for battle was rising.","At this moment, Wutian was also extremely shocked by Jian Wushuang’s state after drawing","his sword.","Without answering, he just nodded slightly.","After the transformation, his personality naturally changed, becoming somewhat arrogant.","Unwilling to face reality.","The demonic flames turned into a huge savage beast, demonic light soaring into the sky.","The demonic flames all around transformed into terrifying demonic beasts from within the Nether Hell, charging towards Jian Wushuang.","It was the fear of everyone.","But Jian Wushuang just closed his eyes slightly, seamlessly merging into the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, divine power bursting forth, allowing Wutian to see how powerful","Jian Wushuang truly was.","“Sixth Tribulation?” Wutian could hardly believe it.","It wasn’t that he didn’t believe in Jian Wushuang’s divine power, but that he couldn’t believe Jian Wushuang would be a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm.","How could his realm be lower than his?","In fact, many people were astonished at why Jian Wushuang’s realm was so low.","Many people realized it only after the fact.","The realm itself carried divine power that didn’t belong to this realm, so it must have had","something extraordinary.","This principle was quite simple.","It’s just that Wutian’s memories inherited from Tongtian Buddha revealed how terrifying Jian","Wushuang’s potential was.","Back when he was still the Emperor, he had suppressed everyone.","In their understanding, they had firmly believed that Jian Wushuang’s realm would surpass","their own.","Even though Wutian had just gained the inheritance and risen rapidly, he still held this belief.","“Tsk tsk, I didn’t expect you to be just a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation level. Don’t blame me for bullying the weak!” Wutian’s expression was somewhat ferocious as he roared, “Nether Hell!”"]},{"number":6006,"title":"Chapter 6006: Infinite Tribulation","paragraphs":["Chapter 6006: Infinite Tribulation","This was his Dao Arena, and fighting him here, even an Eighth Tribulation realm expert wouldn’t faze him!","In the chaos of hell, this was Wutian’s world, and he circled Jian Wushuang with abandon.","Everything around them was under his control.","Jian Wushuang, however, kept his eyes tightly shut, holding the Wanjie Sword in reverse.","He waited for the right moment to strike!","He still wanted Wutian to make the first move, to avoid any dissatisfaction from his opponent later.","But as he waited and waited, an impatience grew within him.","His eyebrows twitched naturally.","This gave Wutian an opportunity.","The demonic path was most adept at manipulating hearts.","Everything that had just happened was his trap.","In his view, Jian Wushuang had fallen for it.","“Infinite Tribulation!”","Wutian clasped his hands together, embodying both the demon and the saint.","His form multiplied into thousands, rushing towards Jian Wushuang with demonic flames.","Countless ghosts condensed into a demon-subduing staff.","In the Nether Hell, Wutian was a god, not a demon.","The enemy was the demon.","The purpose of the Nether Hell was to obliterate all demons!","“You overthink things!” Jian Wushuang’s lips curved upward. Indeed, he had been somewhat impatient just now.","But not because of Wutian’s trap.","It was simply his nature.","The demon-subduing staff descended from the sky.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and lightly swung his sword, uttering only one word, “Life!”","Buzz!","The shadow of the sword, initially a faint image, instantly transformed into a cosmos, as terrifying as a stretch of spacetime.","This was the Sword of Life, containing the true meaning of spacetime.","A long river of spacetime swept forth, capable of obliterating not just a hell, but an entire universe.","Yet this sword, paradoxically, held the hope of life.","Wutian felt an unprecedented terror, one that struck directly at his soul.","The light blue power of the starry sky instantly extinguished his demonic flames.","The immensely powerful demon-subduing staff shattered the moment it touched the sword shadow.","One sword strike broke his Infinite Tribulation!","His divine body felt a sense of powerlessness, and his form retreated continuously.","Blood seeped from the corner of his mouth as the violent backlash began to fracture his divine body.","At that moment, he thought of his own downfall.","Had he just risen, only to fall now?","Wutian, despite his unwillingness, still maintained the dignity of a Demon Lord!","Not the slightest bit of fear!","He forcefully suppressed the backlash and steadied himself.","On Jian Wushuang’s side, he calmly sheathed his Wanjie Sword. “The hope of life is truly miraculous!”","With a gentle flick of his finger, time and space returned to tranquility. The strike from earlier was retracted back into his body, and the demon-subduing staff returned to its original state. But Wutian’s injuries did not disappear.","Jian Wushuang could have done this as well, but out of respect for the other’s dignity, he chose not to.","“Wutian, you must keep your promise!”","Wutian raised his head slightly, his voice low. “You indeed did not disappoint me. Did you go directly to the Realm God Continent after obtaining the Realm God Token?”","He couldn’t comprehend why Jian Wushuang, a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation, was so powerful and instinctively thought of the Realm God Continent.","It was only after he had just received that token and the introduction to the Realm God Continent that he understood that the Nine Core Spacetimes were merely subsidiary spacetimes outside the Starry Sky.","Similarly, there were three other subsidiary spacetimes.","Above the Four Great Subsidiary Spacetimes, there existed the Realm God Continent.","Only with the Realm God Token given by the Realm King could they go to the Realm God Continent.","“Well...” Jian Wushuang touched the back of his head, somewhat embarrassed. He hadn’t actually been to the Realm God Continent, and the Realm God Token had been used to repair","the pyramid.","Seeing his hesitation, Wutian didn’t press further. After a shift in demeanor, he became extremely reserved.","“Forget it, I’ll explain it to you later. We still have a long time together!” He was also embarrassed to explain, but he needed to resolve the matter of the Realm God Token sooner rather than later. Everyone was heading for the Realm God Continent. His biggest goal at the moment, aside from dealing with Mie Sheng, was to consider the future.","The two engaged in awkward small talk, but they ignored the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulations Realm from Bai Divine Mountain.","At this moment, the latter was trembling in a corner of the Nether Hell.","The recent battle between the two.","No matter which side, either could crush him easily.","How could he not be terrified?","Especially of Jian Wushuang. He looked at him as if he were a monster.","A Sixth Tribulation realm, so powerful. If not for the obvious cultivation realm, he would believe Jian Wushuang to be an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","“I almost forgot about you!” The conversation with Wutian was dull; the other had changed and become very reserved. Shifting the topic, Jian Wushuang looked at the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation from Bai Divine Mountain. “Friend from Bai Divine Mountain, estimate the losses here, including this endless Nether Hell, and the psychological impact on you. Calculate how much Life force it would take to buy all of this!”","“Well...” He found it difficult to ask.","After a moment’s hesitation, “Friend Wushuang, I cannot decide on this matter. The ancestors are waiting for you outside. How about letting them decide?”","Jian Wushuang’s divine sense slightly extended, and he detected three Eighth Tribulation","auras, one of which was very familiar and incredibly powerful, beyond his capability.","Divine Wood King!","There was also another presence, relatively weak, with divine power reduced to about 5 million, and an aura very similar to that of the Universe Master in front of him. It was highly","likely to be the ancestor of the Bai family.","The last presence was the strongest of them all.","Even the most powerful being in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","An Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, hailing from the Bai family, stationed in the Ancient","Moon Sect.","The current Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t even see through the depths of his power, which was at least 15","million.","“It’s really lively here!” Jian Wushuang casually tore apart the Nether Hell, wrapped Wutian and the Universe Master with a thought, and left the place immediately.","Before leaving, Wutian naturally retracted the Nether Hell.","Swish!!!","The figures of the three flashed and arrived in the clouds of Bai Divine Mountain.","Divine Wood King, who had been reminiscing with the Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect, immediately stood up from the tea table upon seeing Jian Wushuang bring people in, and hurriedly greeted, “Brother Wushuang, you didn’t even give us a heads-up before coming back. That’s not very considerate!”","The ancestor of the Bai family and the Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect also rose to their feet. They treated Jian Wushuang as an equal, even one level higher.","Especially the ancestor of the Bai family, who bypassed Divine Wood King, his face full of smiles, showing no anger at Jian Wushuang’s intrusion into his Bai Divine Mountain, but rather some flattery, “I’ve long heard of the famed Jian Wushuang. Seeing you in person, it’s truly better than a hundred stories. A hero indeed emerges in youth!”","“It’s just a minor matter. I heard that Brother Divine Wood was rebuilding the Ancient Wood Sect, so I didn’t want to disturb him!” Jian Wushuang lightly responded to Divine Wood King, then looked at the ancestor of the Bai family with an apologetic smile. “I’m sorry for the trouble I’ve caused by coming to Bai Divine Mountain this time!”","This visit to Bai Divine Mountain indeed caused quite a bit of trouble!"]},{"number":6007,"title":"Chapter 6007: 30 Billion","paragraphs":["Chapter 6007: 30 Billion","“Fellow Daoist Wushuang, please don’t say that. Divine Wood King and I have always regarded each other as brothers. If you call me senior, it truly embarrasses this old man. If you don’t mind, just call me Brother Bai. I am only slightly older than you, Brother Wushuang. In the future, this might be the only advantage I have over you!” The ancestor of the Bai family spoke with extreme politeness, showering Jian Wushuang with flattery.","Divine Wood King, upon hearing the Bai family ancestor’s words, couldn’t help but scoff inwardly. Back when he had yet to reveal his true strength, this old man wouldn’t even spare him a proper glance.","Whenever they met, he would always hold his nose high.","He feared that others wouldn’t know that the current Pope of Ancient Moon Spacetime was his daughter.","Now that he had revealed his power and was one of the top figures in Ancient Moon Spacetime, with a connection to the God of Life, the Bai family ancestor was willing to call him “Brother Divine Wood”.","Everything still boiled down to strength.","Jian Wushuang naturally understood this principle and knew why the other party was being so courteous.","After a few polite exchanges, he brought up the matter of compensation and proposed a trade with Bai Divine Mountain, and even with the Ancient Moon God Sect.","“Origin Source treasures?”","The Bai family ancestor, who had just sat down and started making tea, asked in surprise, “Brother Wushuang, how much do you need?”","The Pope of Ancient Moon Spacetime sat to the side without speaking.","The Bai family ancestor had already discussed it with the Pope of Ancient Moon Spacetime.","If Jian Wushuang’s demand for Origin Source treasures was not excessive, then Bai Divine Mountain would handle it.","If Bai Divine Mountain couldn’t meet the demand, the Ancient Moon God Sect would step in.","Divine Wood King wasn’t interested in this matter. He had acquired a vast amount of Life force, enough to share with some juniors and friends, and still had a huge reserve left. “Around this amount,” Jian Wushuang said, holding up three fingers.","The Bai family ancestor, seeing this, asked, “300 million primordial stones?”","This quantity was just manageable for their Bai family.","After countless years of accumulation, they had enough.","The best Origin Source treasure was primordial stones.","If primordial stones weren’t enough, they could use some Origin Source treasures to make up the difference.","“No, no,” Jian Wushuang shook his head and then stated a number that would drive anyone mad.","“30 billion!”","“I need 30 billion primordial stones. If primordial stones are not enough, then Origin Source treasures will do. If Origin Source treasures are still not enough, then treasures of all kinds. If even treasures of all kinds are not enough, then...”","Before Jian Wushuang could finish speaking, the Pope of the Ancient Moon personally poured tea for him, speaking in a steady tone, “Our Ancient Moon Sect will accept!”","“Good, the Pope is indeed magnanimous!” Jian Wushuang praised.","This amount of transaction.","Aside from the three Eternal Realms, it seemed only the Ancient Moon Sect could afford it.","The three Eternal Realms did not have a single dominant entity.","Among the nine spacetimes, only the Ancient Moon Spacetime was entirely dominated by the Ancient Moon Sect.","They controlled everything.","“Transaction time?”","The Pope of the Ancient Moon asked about the matter of utmost importance to her.","That was the time.","In fact, no matter how much time was needed, it was bearable; the main thing was to see Jian Wushuang’s sincerity.","When the time came, one hand would deliver the power of Life, and the other would provide the primordial stones.","Jian Wushuang rubbed his chin and calmly said, “100,000 years. In 100,000 years, I will produce three 30 billion worth of Life power!”","“Agreed!”","“But...” At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s brow moved, and his tone changed slightly, “I need the Ancient Moon Sect to provide 300 million primordial stones in advance!”","This was his startup capital.","In a span of 100,000 years, it would not be possible to convert such a massive amount of Life power.","He also needed to create a space with a slow flow of time, at least 10,000 times slower, and it had to be extremely stable.","More importantly, his Life power did not come out of thin air; it required a large amount of the power of All Things.","Although the power of All Things was easy to obtain, he couldn’t possibly devour the Origin Source Universes of cultivators!","Therefore, he needed 300 million primordial stones to continuously create Life power.","In fact, 100 million would be enough.","But his third universe still required a considerable amount of primordial stones.","To stabilize the three universes and connect them in a line.","A massive amount of primordial stones was needed.","Now, the path of resurrection had not yet appeared, and his Life power still had value.","Once the path of resurrection emerged, or he went to the Realm God Continent, Life power","would no longer be worth much.","He needed to make a few more gains quickly.","300 million was not a small number, and the Pope of the Ancient Moon could not afford to be careless, so she set a precise time.","But providing 300 million in advance was something she could decide on her own.","If it was three hundred billion, she wouldn’t be able to come up with it alone. Even returning","to the Ancient Moon Spacetime, she would have to consult with the elders to make calculations.","But 300 million as a deposit was not a problem for her.","She immediately took out 300 million primordial stones.","This time, she had brought quite a few with her.","The reason she could part with them so readily was her trust in Jian Wushuang.","After all, he possessed the power of Life and had made a great name for himself in the Wanliu","Divine Realm. He wouldn’t run away over 300 million primordial stones.","After receiving the primordial stones, Jian Wushuang felt more confident.","This time, he would light up the third universe in one go. As for the Tribulation, he could take","his time; it wouldn’t be too late to undergo it on the way back.","The Bai Family Patriarch watched as the 300 million primordial stones fell into Jian Wushuang’s hands so effortlessly, feeling a bit emotional. Comparing it with his own possessions, he instantly felt they were too small.","“Don’t worry, Brother Bai. I’ll also take care of your share and deliver it in 10,000 years!”","Seeing the other party’s concern, Jian Wushuang did not hold back. A bit more or less didn’t make much difference.","Moreover, compared to his previous exchanges on the Ancient Wood Continent, 300 million","was an astronomical figure.","Back then, it was small families and forces he was dealing with, incomparable to the Bai Family of the Primordial White Heaven.","Once the deal was settled, everyone didn’t want to delay Jian Wushuang’s time any longer.","After some brief pleasantries, they all took their leave.","Divine Wood King and the Ancient Moon Pope also left.","Only the Bai Family Patriarch remained.","After finding a prime location for Jian Wushuang, he also hurriedly took his leave.","As for Wutian, originally a prisoner suppressed by the Bai Family, in deference to Jian Wushuang, he was treated as if nothing had happened, with good food and drink fully","provided.","Before closing his retreat, Jian Wushuang reminded Wutian not to act rashly.","At most, in 10,000 years, they would leave the Primordial White Heaven.","Wu Zuo and the others, heading to the Azure Sea Spacetime, had also smoothly found Gu","Qianluo.","Soon, they would reach the Ancient Moon Spacetime and rendezvous with them.","The last person was Hu Qing.","At that time, they would need the Realm King to personally search for his whereabouts.","Once Hu Qing was found, it would be time for them to leave the upper stream of the","Spacetime River.","Returning to Qishen Temple!","It was getting closer and closer.","A ten-thousand-year retreat for Jian Wushuang felt like ten eons.","Because of the accelerated time, this incredibly long period surpassed the time he had spent","cultivating.","In the beginning, it was manageable as he lit up the third universe.","This was still considered cultivation, and then it was about connecting the three universes to","become one.","A rudimentary form of the Spacetime River had already taken shape.","It was also the foundation."]},{"number":6008,"title":"Chapter 6008: Exhausted","paragraphs":["Chapter 6008: Exhausted","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The issue of crossing the Seventh Tribulation was completely resolved after connecting to the universe.","All that remained was to bring down the great Tribulation.","However, he didn’t have the time to do it now.","Instead, he turned his attention to creating the power of Life.","For ten eras, he repeated the same task over and over.","The monotony was driving Jian Wushuang insane.","His mind and spirit were exhausted!","Time seemed to pass slowly.","Because he had set a deadline, he didn’t dare to rest.","He continued this monotonous routine for ten whole eras.","Finally, he transformed a sea of Life.","Worth 30 billion primordial stones, more than enough.","Jian Wushuang first took out the main portion, then sealed it in a mustard seed.","This was for his deal with the Ancient Moon Sect—30 billion primordial stones worth of life force.","It was enough to help dozens of eight Tribulation realm experts return to their peak.","The revival of all the eight Tribulation realm experts within the Ancient Moon Sect was no problem, and it could also keep them continuously fighting, replenishing their vitality.","As for the Seven Tribulation realm experts, even more could be revived; it was up to the Ancient Moon Sect to decide how to proceed.","Most forces still placed great importance on the Seven Tribulation realm experts.","Then there were the Sixth Tribulation realm experts, whose numbers were too vast.","Moreover, most of the Eighth Tribulation experts in the Ancient Moon Sect had families and their own intertwined forces.","It was likely that besides restoring themselves, they would also help their families.","That number would be even more enormous.","30 billion might actually not be enough.","But restoring themselves posed no issues at all.","“Phew!” Jian Wushuang entered an ice spring within his cave dwelling, immersing his entire body comfortably at the bottom of the spring. Both his body and soul were absorbing the power within the spring to nourish themselves.","This time, he was truly exhausted.","He had also felt his limit.","After resting for a whole month, he finally emerged from the bottom of the ice spring. With a shake, he evaporated the water droplets from his body, put on a white robe, and walked out of his cave dwelling.","The moment he stepped out, the ancestor of the Bai family immediately descended.","Clearly, he had been waiting for this day.","Not long after, the Pope of Ancient Moon Spacetime also arrived.","“Brother Wushuang, you’ve worked hard this time!” The Bai family ancestor could hardly contain his excitement, constantly weighing a small mustard seed in his hand.","Inside it was the accumulation of the Bai family over the years.","Over the past hundred thousand years, he had sold off his possessions and gathered 300 million primordial stones.","But now, with the Life force about to be obtained, those things didn’t matter.","As long as he didn’t sell his innate treasures, he could sell anything else to exchange for Life power.","With 300 million primordial stones worth of Life force, the Bai family ancestor only needed 30 percent to restore himself to his peak. To be safe, he could keep another 20 percent, and the remaining half could be used to restore the rest of the Scattered Tribulation in the family.","Although the Bai family only had two members at the Eighth Tribulation realm, there were quite a few at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","This amount of Life force would be enough to fully restore them all.","There would even be some left over.","At that time, they could sell some at a high price to cover the family’s deficits.","It was simply a surefire, profitable deal, so naturally, he treated Jian Wushuang with great respect.","Jian Wushuang stretched his body. This time, he truly had worked hard, but he still maintained a calm expression. “Since everyone is here, let’s begin!”","As he spoke, he took out two mustard seeds, handing one to the Bai family ancestor and the other to the Pope of Ancient Moon Spacetime.","After inspecting them, their faces first showed shock, then immense joy.","Anyone who saw this amount of life force couldn’t help but be amazed.","Seeing that there was no problem with the Life force, the two also readily handed the primordial stones to Jian Wushuang.","The Pope of Ancient Moon Spacetime had previously given 300 million, leaving two hundred and 29.7 billion remaining.","The Bai family ancestor had 300 million primordial stones.","Adding them together made 30 billion.","With these primordial stones, even if Life force became worthless in the future, Jian Wushuang could still reach the peak of the Eighth Tribulation without venturing into secret realms.","As for the Ninth Tribulation, no one in the Northern Spacetime had yet achieved it.","He didn’t know how many primordial stones it required, and even if there were references, his own Origin Source was different from others’, incomparable.","For instance, the speed at which his Origin Source Universe nurtured primordial stones was a hundred times that of an ordinary Universe Master.","Now, having lit up three universes, it had reached an astounding thousandfold.","A typical Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation could produce 1,000 primordial stones in one era, and a powerful one might manage 10,000, not counting outsiders like them.","From what he had learned, Wu Zuo’s Origin Source Universe could produce 50,000 primordial stones in one era, five times stronger than the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Now, Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source Universe was even more exaggerated.","It could nurture a million primordial stones in one era.","When he reached the Seventh Tribulation, it might be 10 million.","The more it nurtured, the faster it consumed.","The subsequent cost to light up universes had skyrocketed to over 100 million primordial stones.","And this was just for the fourth universe. For the fifth universe, it might require more than a billion primordial stones.","Moreover, there were Tribulations to pass, which would also be a significant expense.","In the future, he would have to seek out major forces for transactions whenever possible.","He had to make more preparations for the future.","“Pleasant transaction!” Overall, Jian Wushuang was very pleased. The hard work he had put in was now yielding substantial returns, and his face bore a smile.","The ancestor of the Bai family was even more delighted. If Jian Wushuang hadn’t been present, he would have wanted to go into seclusion immediately.","“Come, come, Brother Wushuang, the banquet is ready...”","Jian Wushuang did not decline, as he didn’t mind spending a couple of days.","To show his sincerity, the Bai family ancestor had even left the Ancient Moon Pope to accompany Jian Wushuang for drinks, as she was his daughter after all.","Even though she had become the Pope of Ancient Moon Spacetime, that didn’t change anything.","The thoughtful Bai family ancestor had also invited Wutian to resolve past grievances.","He wasn’t foolish; he could see that the relationship between Wutian and Jian Wushuang was not ordinary.","The banquet went smoothly. Jian Wushuang had many conversations with the Bai family ancestor and the Ancient Moon Pope.","They mainly discussed the fall of Ancient Moon Spacetime.","From the two of them, he learned more about the Celestial Maiden.","Although the Celestial Maiden had completely disappeared, Jiang Shang remained.","She was the reincarnation of the Celestial Maiden.","Know yourself and your enemy, and you will never be defeated!","Only one person was missing from the banquet. Jian Wushuang originally thought the Bai family ancestor would bring along Divine Wood King, but unfortunately, he did not come.","There was no need to greet him then.","Soon he would leave with Wutian.","The next meeting might be a long time away.","The banquet lasted several hours. Knowing the two were quite busy, the Bai family ancestor was eager to return to his peak, and the Ancient Moon Pope had to report back. Although she was the Pope, those 30 billion primordial stones were the accumulation of Ancient Moon Sect, and she still needed to distribute them among the old members after returning.","Jian Wushuang also needed to prepare to meet Wu Zuo and others.","Now, after 100,000 years, without the pyramid, Wu Zuo and others were probably already near Ancient Moon Spacetime."]},{"number":6009,"title":"Chapter 6009: Wu Zuo Asks for Help!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6009: Wu Zuo Asks for Help!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At that time, they would be able to search for Hu Qing together.","Then, they said goodbye to Ancient Moon Spacetime, bidding farewell to the entire upper reaches of the spacetime river.","“Brother Bai, no need to see us off. We have plenty of time in the future!” Jian Wushuang, taking Wutian with him, waved back as he tore through the void and left Bai Divine Mountain.","Since reincarnating into Ancient Moon Spacetime, Wutian had not yet left during the daytime.","Unlike Wu Zuo, who had traversed the nine major spacetimes, and even the Realm God Continent.","Swoosh!!","The two of them reached the void, and Jian Wushuang took out a golden pyramid, startling Wutian.","“What is this?” Wutian asked in surprise. He could sense the pyramid’s mighty power, a","force capable of suppressing his Nether Hell.","It was a supreme treasure above the Eighth Tribulation level.","Seeing Wutian’s astonished expression, Jian Wushuang felt very pleased, “This is a spacecraft of the Machine Clan. It’s your fortune to witness it in the Northern Spacetime!”","Ding!","The golden pyramid hovered above them, drawing both of them inside.","Upon entering, Jian Wushuang clasped his hands behind his back, “Babata, teleport us to the Qiankun Hall!”","“Yes, master!” Babata’s voice echoed around them, and soon they were in the so-called Qiankun Hall.","This was the central hall of the pyramid.","It had places for resting and cultivation.","Jian Wushuang casually found a comfortable cushion and sat cross-legged, raising his hand in greeting, “If you’re not in a hurry to cultivate, just find a spot to sit. If you need anything, ask Babata to help you. Everything can be taken care of!”","After saying this, he began pouring himself a drink and leisurely drank it.","To showcase the pyramid’s capabilities, he deliberately had Babata report on their surroundings.","Immediately, several huge screens appeared in front of them, displaying all external scenes, with numerous green dots flickering.","The green dots represented Universe Masters.","If they were enemies, they would be red dots.","Even distances and titles could be marked.","Wutian watched all of this as if he were a country boy entering the imperial city.","He stared blankly for a long while before finding a place to sit, then tentatively said, “Babata!”","“I’m here!” Babata’s figure instantly appeared before Wutian.","Wutian even sensed the Life force within Babata, took a deep breath, and said, “Copy all the information on Ancient Moon Spacetime for me!”","“No problem!” Babata said, fiddling with a small screen. In a short while, he handed a device to Wutian, “Everything is on here. You can browse it at your leisure. If you have any questions, feel free to call Babata at any time!”","After finishing speaking, he disappeared directly.","Wutian held the celestial canopy, not needing to flip through it as everything about Ancient Moon Spacetime automatically displayed above.","From the opening of spacetime to the present era, everything was recorded above.","“Jian Wushuang, this Babata, do you still have another one of it?” Apparently, he was also somewhat tempted. Even though his temperament was restrained, he couldn’t help but inquire, wanting to get one for himself.","This was just too convenient!","Anyone would be tempted.","Jian Wushuang revealed a hint of a smile and calmly said, “In the North Spacetime, perhaps only this one remains. If you want it, you can wait to go to the Realm God Continent later to obtain one. But I must remind you, this pyramid was snatched from a super powerhouse comparable to the Ninth Tribulation realm!”","Upon hearing “comparable to the Ninth Tribulation realm”, Wutian’s eyelids twitched for a moment, but he quickly dismissed the idea.","He began to continuously browse through the information about Ancient Moon Spacetime on the celestial canopy.","From the opening of spacetime, the era of celestial maidens, the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths, the era of downfall, most of it pertained to a certain period of time.","After reading these, without looking at several epochs in between, he directly opened up events that occurred in the past million epochs.","The fall of the Flame God!","This was a major event, and the demise of Fan Tianfeng was also recorded because it was due to Fan Tianfeng’s issue that led to the fall of the Flame God, so naturally, it would be recorded.","Apart from this, there was the disappearance of the Wu Hua Secret Realm.","Then came the opening of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Until the disappearance of the Wanliu Divine Tree, and then the disappearance of the Ancient Moon Ruins.","In Ancient Moon Spacetime, the three most dangerous secret realms had all disappeared.","They were all closely related to the initial ten individuals.","The disappearance of the Wanliu Divine Wood was related to Jian Wushuang, and the relationship was not small.","Although the Ancient Moon Ruins were established by the Celestial Maiden, they also had the existence of Huiqing.","As for the Wu Hua Secret Realm, there was no need to say much; it was prepared for Wu Zuo, and after Wu Zuo left, the Realm King","took it away.","These three major secret realms, except for the Ancient Moon Ruins, were not the secret realms born in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The Wu Hua Secret Realm was put into Ancient Moon Spacetime by the Realm King.","And the Wanliu Divine Tree was moved from the Starry Sky to the Northern Spacetime by Weiss.","This time, everything was gone.","Having learned about the recent changes in Ancient Moon Spacetime, Wutian was especially astonished by what Jian Wushuang had done.","He witnessed and even helped a God of Life.","Jian Wushuang, under Wutian’s astonished gaze, simply drank his wine in silence, pretending to be nonchalant.","Ding!","Master, Wu Zuo is requesting assistance!”","Babata instantly flew over, his face filled with urgency.","Once inside the pyramid, Jian Wushuang entrusted all communication tokens to Babata.","Upon hearing about Wu Zuo’s request for help, Jian Wushuang downed the contents of his cup in one gulp and calmly asked, “Coordinates, time, opponent!”","A series of orders were given.","Babata quickly responded, “It will take approximately half a year to reach the desolate area outside Ancient Moon Spacetime. The opponent is a top-tier expert at the Eighth Tribulation. Currently, they pose no threat to Wu Zuo and the others, but someone","has been abducted!”","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t sit still upon hearing this, immediately standing up. “Who? Who has been abducted?”","“Ye Lingxiao!”","Relieved upon hearing the name, Jian Wushuang let out a sigh. Fortunately, it wasn’t someone from his own group who had been taken.","However, it wasn’t surprising that Ye Lingxiao had been abducted, just unexpected that it had happened so quickly.","“Help me contact Wu Zuo!” Jian Wushuang’s expression darkened.","At this moment, anyone daring to offend him or Wu Zuo was either an outlaw or someone lurking in the shadows.","They weren’t afraid of their backgrounds or their strength.","For a top-tier expert at the Eighth Tribulation, theoretically, Wu Zuo should be able to handle it.","If they could still abduct someone under these circumstances, it meant that their divine power was estimated to be over 8 million, already reaching the peak level.","It was just that Wu Zuo hadn’t noticed.","Moreover, only Ye Lingxiao was taken, which meant that they still had some concerns","about their background and strength.","Babata immediately helped Jian Wushuang contact Wu Zuo in real-time.","Wu Zuo’s face appeared directly on the canopy.","“Wu Zuo, are you all right?” Jian Wushuang first expressed concern about their safety.","Only after seeing that everyone’s expressions were normal through the canopy did he finally relax.","However, Wu Zuo grumbled, “Wushuang, hurry up and come pick us up. That person hasn’t escaped far. Hurry over, catch up with that bastard, I’ll make him regret it!”","Wu Zuo, who had never suffered a setback, feared neither heaven nor earth. Not only was he beaten up this time, but his people were also abducted.","How could he let it go?"]},{"number":6010,"title":"Chapter 6010: Ye Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 6010: Ye Clan","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Wanyan, who was beside him, also came over with an anxious expression and said, “Wushuang, I left some divine power on Lingxiao. I can sense the position of that mysterious expert. With the speed of the pyramid, we can catch up with them!”","“Alright, you all wait here. I’ll see you in half a year.”","Jian Wushuang didn’t say much more and directly ended the communication.","He instructed Babata to activate the black hole-level speed to head to the desolate area.","The speed of an ordinary Eighth Tribulation realm was not even one-tenth of the pyramid’s.","And this was at black hole-level speed.","If it were at secret realm-level speed, it could catch up with Ancient Beings.","However, the consumption of Black Radiance Essence would be too much, which he couldn’t afford at the moment.","Buzz!","The pyramid tore through spacetime and began to move at full speed.","Jian Wushuang was also pondering who dared to target Ye Lingxiao!","Firstly, he could rule out the Blood Demon Temple?Master.","The other party had been honest at that time and should not dare to provoke him again.","But to be safe, he still contacted the other party, both to probe and to ask if they knew anyone else who possessed the blood-colored power.","The Blood Demon Temple Master was also extremely surprised to learn that Ye Lingxiao had been taken!","He first proved his innocence and then analyzed the situation for Jian Wushuang.","Very few people knew about the blood-colored power.","At least in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, no one could control it except himself.","Apart from appearing in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, Ye Lingxiao had only been in the Ancient Moon Spacetime where she was born.","Jian Wushuang immediately had a reaction and, after thanking the other party, had a hypothesis in mind.","“Black Heaven, Ye Family!” His expression turned somber, “Babata, send me the information on the Ye Family!”","As soon as Babata heard the Blood Demon Palace Master mention the Ye Family, he had already gathered the information on them and took it out now, “Master, all the information on the Ye Family is here. I also contacted the Ancient Moon Pope and Divine Wood King in your name. All the information we got from them is in here.”","“Good!”","Jian Wushuang took the screen and began to review the information on the Black Heaven Ye Family and some past events involving Ye Lingxiao within the Ye Family.","The Ye Family, the first family of the Ancient Black Heaven, was quite similar to the Bai Family.","Both had established eight-star sects.","Their ancestors were all king-level existences.","The Ye Family’s Ye Xiaowang, a peak Eighth Tribulation expert, had once obtained a Life Fountain in the Ancient Moon Ruins and had always maintained his peak condition.","The Blood Robe Sect he established had also remained prosperous. The current head of the Ye Family, Ye Lingyun, was also a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master, extremely powerful, already at the level of a marquis.","And Ye Lingxiao was Ye Lingyun’s younger sister.","They had the same father but different mothers.","Their father was a Seventh Tribulation rogue cultivator.","Not particularly outstanding.","But among his children, there were quite a few remarkable figures.","Ye Lingyun was a Universe Master at the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation.","Ye Lingxiao was also a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation.","There were several other descendants, all Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulation level.","This lineage, because of a few promising younger members, was highly regarded by Ye Xiaowang.","The young master of the Blood Robe Sect, whom Jian Wushuang had slain earlier, was Ye Lingyun’s son.","The reason for the young master’s arrogance was well-founded.","After reading the introduction of the Ye family, Jian Wushuang began to review everything about Ye Lingxiao.","Born over tens of millions of eras, Ye Lingxiao had achieved the status of a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation realm.","This period was not considered short.","Jian Wushuang had encountered many prodigies, many of whom reached the Fifth Tribulation Universe Master level within just 100,000 eras.","For instance, Wu Li!","Born around 100,000 eras ago, Wu Li had now reached the Half-Step Seventh Tribulation realm.","He followed Danbao to the Realm God Continent, and with the treasures bestowed by the Realm King, it was not difficult for him to achieve the Seventh Tribulation.","This could be considered as late bloomers achieving greatness, becoming prodigies.","Looking through Ye Lingxiao’s experiences, Jian Wushuang did not find anything extraordinarily outstanding.","Shortly after Ye Lingxiao was born, he became an Emperor. Later, after successfully passing his Tribulation, he quickly became a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation realm, almost within 10,000 eras. In the subsequent tens of millions of eras, he remained a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation.","This seemed normal enough, encountering a bottleneck that one couldn’t break through.","But Jian Wushuang did not think so.","“An explosion of progress in a short period, followed by a long silence?” He pondered to himself, recalling the incident of Tongtian Buddha transforming into Wutian.","It was quite similar; shortly after entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime, Wutian shone brightly and then fell silent. Although this was due to the Bai family’s suppression, the potential was inherent, and even the Nether Hell couldn’t suppress it.","Once broken through, it transformed into a dragon.","Ye Lingxiao’s background was far more complicated than it appeared, and it was not simply because of a bottleneck that he was stuck at the Fifth Tribulation Universe Master level. It was most likely due to the blood-colored power within him.","“Babata, turn around, head to Daughter Kingdom!” Jian Wushuang suddenly changed his route, thinking about the source of everything.","It was when he first encountered the blood-colored power.","“Yue Kingdom, the Chen family!”","Although the entire Yue Kingdom had been destroyed, the records of Yue Kingdom should still be with Empress Fengchen. She definitely knew much more about the Chen family than he did.","He needed to ask the Empress about the past events concerning the Chen family.","The current Empress was no longer in her imperial position. With Yue Kingdom gone, she had left the Infinite Great World, was saved by the Queen of the Daughter Kingdom, and had since been hiding there without any news.","The last time he went to the Daughter Kingdom, he did not see her.","Originally, it was to avoid awkwardness, but now he couldn’t care about such things.","The power of blood was so special, and all indications pointed to Ancient Moon Spacetime. He had to figure it out.","Otherwise, even if he found Ye Lingxiao, he wouldn’t be able to solve the issue all at once.","The most crucial reason was that he too coveted the power of blood.","It was a juicy piece of meat that everyone was eyeing; how could he not be tempted?","Of course, he wouldn’t harm Ye Lingxiao. The best outcome would be a win-win situation.","He knew that the power of blood needed to be digested.","Back then, he had benefited endlessly from just a beetle, and the beetle wasn’t even an Emperor.","Now, a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation who controlled the power of blood would surely soar!","The pyramid changed direction, and in just an hour, it was hovering over the Daughter Kingdom.","“Babata, you take Wutian to pick up Wu Zuo and the others. I’m afraid I’ll be staying here for a while!” Jian Wushuang sensed that there was no trace of the Empress’s aura within the Daughter Kingdom, indicating that she was most likely not there. He would have to search for her.","So, he let Babata take Wutian to pick up Wu Zuo and the others, while he went alone to find the Empress and ask about the Chen family.","Wutian didn’t understand the power of blood, but seeing Jian Wushuang so serious, he didn’t ask too many questions and rested with his eyes closed.","Swoosh!","As soon as Jian Wushuang left the pyramid, the surrounding space changed.","The pyramid headed towards the desolate area outside Ancient Moon Spacetime, while he descended into the capital of the Daughter Kingdom.","Out of respect for Queen Yun Zhi, he only revealed a slight trace of his aura, not making a grand entrance."]},{"number":6011,"title":"Chapter 6011: Going to the Daughter Kingdom Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 6011: Going to the Daughter Kingdom Again","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He quietly waited for the experts from the Daughter Kingdom to find him.","Sure enough, the moment his presence was detected, a team of experts from the Daughter Kingdom descended.","“It’s you?” The person who arrived was familiar; it was the same female Valkyrie from the capital who had initially received Jian Wushuang and Jinchen.","A Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation.","Her strength was extremely formidable.","She was not weaker than Empress Fengchen of the Infinite World back then.","Jian Wushuang remained humble and calmly said, “I came suddenly and disturbed you. Please report to the Queen that Wushuang seeks an audience!”","“Follow me!” The Valkyrie knew Jian Wushuang was special.","He had been an Emperor back then, but in the blink of an eye, he had become a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation, just like her. She had also heard of his terrifying combat power and naturally dared not neglect him.","She led Jian Wushuang towards the imperial city of the Daughter Kingdom.","In the shadows, the Queen had already been informed.","After entering the imperial city with the Valkyrie, they headed straight to the main hall.","Upon seeing the familiar figure, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and respectfully said, “Junior Jian Wushuang pays respects to Queen Yun Zhi!”","“Mm!” Queen Yun Zhi displayed the same smile as before. “I can sense that your divine power has surpassed mine. You don’t need to call yourself a junior anymore. From now on, just call me Yun Zhi.”","Although Jian Wushuang had only revealed a bit of his basic divine power, the power contained within was extremely special.","As a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation, she could tell that the power Jian Wushuang revealed was not inferior to hers in her own Dao Arena.","Of course, if he intentionally hid it, she wouldn’t be able to see through it.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression turned serious and solemn, “I cannot. The Queen has shown me great kindness, and I should still pay my respects as a junior!”","“Sigh!” Queen Yun Zhi shook her head helplessly. Seeing the now ambitious Jian Wushuang, who had not changed his original intentions, she felt pity for Jinchen, who was no longer around.","After a sigh, Yun Zhi slowly stood up and looked at Jian Wushuang, “You must have something important to attend to this time.”","“Yes, junior has an important matter to inquire about... the Empress!” After some hesitation, he still addressed her by Empress Feng Chen’s title.","Queen Yun Zhi’s expression turned somewhat surprised, then she showed a troubled look.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang quickly explained, “Please don’t worry, Queen. I came this time to ask about some matters related to the former Yue Kingdom. It has nothing to do with Jinchen...”","He was afraid of being misunderstood, so he directly stated his reason.","The destruction of Yue Kingdom had actually occurred during the time of the Sacred Assembly when all the experts on Ancient Wood Continent were focused on the Sacred Assembly, and no one noticed.","After the Sacred Assembly ended, the Wanliu Divine Tree was also activated.","The disappearance of Yue Kingdom seemed even more insignificant.","Moreover, the Ancient Wood Sect was gone, so no one cared.","Shi Kingdom couldn’t even take care of itself; their patriarch had also fallen.","The Flame God was also gone.","They had lost the support of an Eighth Tribulation powerhouse.","It wasn’t until Shi Xiu successfully passed the Tribulation and became a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation that the situation stabilized.","However, the status of the Shi Kingdom had plummeted.","Or rather, the presence of all Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingchao was declining.","Now, the Ancient Wood Continent was under the dominion of the Ancient Wood Sect, and its ruling power was exponentially stronger than ever before.","Moreover, since Divine Wood King emerged from the Wanliu Divine Tree, his personality had changed significantly.","He opened the sect’s doors wide, accepting disciples from all walks of life without discrimination.","Now, the overall strength of the Ancient Wood Sect had surpassed many eight-star sects.","On the Ancient Wood Continent, the Ancient Wood Sect stood unrivaled.","Once even the Shi Kingdom could bully them a bit, but now they had truly revealed their profound foundation.","This was all thanks to the formidable presence of Divine Wood King.","In the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime, he ranked among the top three.","Even those Universe Masters who had returned after enduring Eighth Tribulation were no match for him.","Only the current Ancient Moon Pope could suppress him using the Origin Source of the universe.","With the sect’s power flourishing, the Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingchao were having tough times.","Now, each remained low-key.","Moreover, two of the Sixteen Kingdoms had been annihilated.","The Yongheng Kingdom disappeared due to the emergence of Babidi.","Yue Kingdom was also massacred by a mysterious strongman, leaving only Fourteen Kingdoms now.","Back when Yue Kingdom was destroyed, many actually knew about it but had no time to deal with it.","Only Queen Yun Zhi, who had a particular concern for Yue Kingdom, personally went to take a look and saw the truth of Yue Kingdom’s destruction through spacetime!","Now, hearing Jian Wushuang ask about Yue Kingdom, she was somewhat surprised.","Both had misunderstood each other.","“Do you want to know how Yue Kingdom was destroyed?” The Queen Yun Zhi slowly paced, walking up to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang didn’t expect to gain unexpected information, so he patiently asked, “Please enlighten me, Your Majesty!”","“The Yue Kingdom of those years...” The eyes of the Queen Yun Zhi held a trace of reminiscence, recalling a scene she had witnessed back in the Yue Kingdom, along with a terrifying figure left in the spacetime.","“Starting from the seventh year of the Ancient Wood Assembly, cultivators in the Yue Kingdom began to be slaughtered. At first, no one noticed, but as various sects and families were exterminated, cultivators began to flee the Yue Kingdom one after another. A strong cultivator of the royal family of Yue Kingdom, before falling, sent a message to me. But at that time, I was in seclusion!”","During the time the assembly was underway, Queen Yun Zhi had not long broken through to the Seventh Tribulation and had not ventured out. She was only in seclusion, cultivating in the Daughter Kingdom.","She did not pay attention to any information from the outside world.","By the time she emerged from seclusion, all the cultivators of the Yue Kingdom had been exterminated, turning it into a desolate place.","The powerful members of the Yue Kingdom’s royal family were gone, and surrounding forces began to probe.","Once they found there was no threat, they occupied what was once the Yue Kingdom.","Now, millions of eons had passed, and it no longer resembled its former self.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, “Were all the cultivators and ordinary people gone?”","“Yes, I was also very shocked when I saw it!” Queen Yun Zhi nodded.","To be able to wipe out the cultivators of an entire kingdom, especially when the Yue Kingdom’s royal family included several loose cultivators in the Sixth Tribulation, who were quite powerful, and yet they had no ability to resist and fell.","The culprit must have been a strong cultivator at least in the Seventh Tribulation to be able to achieve such silent slaughter.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have sought the Empress to understand the Chen family.","Now, the strong cultivators of the Yue Kingdom were very few.","Some lucky ones were not in the Yue Kingdom during that period and escaped the calamity.","For example, those who attended the assembly.","But even those people’s luck wasn’t much better, as they fell one after another in Dragon God’s Great World.","There were very few real Yue Kingdom people left now.","The Empress Fengchen could be considered one, the last ruler of a fallen kingdom!","And then there was Wu Li.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t be considered a Yue Kingdom person, because Ancient Moon Spacetime never gave him a sense of belonging.","“Was it a demonic cultivator?”","He wondered what kind of culprit it was, but to be able to annihilate an entire kingdom, sparing neither cultivators nor ordinary people, leaving none alive, it could only be a demonic cultivator.","Queen Yun Zhi recalled that figure and shook her head silently, “No... I reversed spacetime and saw its appearance; it wasn’t a human!”","“A desolate beast?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes moved with some surprise. If it was a desolate beast, then its audacity was too great."]},{"number":6012,"title":"Chapter 6012: The Real Murderer Who Destroyed Yue Kingdom","paragraphs":["Chapter 6012: The Real Murderer Who Destroyed Yue Kingdom","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Furthermore, wild beasts at the level of Seventh Tribulation wouldn’t dare venture into the Sixteen Qingchao Kingdoms.","Beasts at that level were treasures in themselves and would be hunted down if discovered.","They wouldn’t dare covet human territories.","“It’s not a wild beast either. Its power is very strange, something I’ve never seen before, and its divine power carries a bloody scent. If I’m not mistaken, those fallen experts were all absorbed by it. It has forged its divine power from the blood essence of countless cultivators!” The voice of Queen Yun Zhi trembled slightly.","What she had seen during the reversal of time clearly made her very apprehensive.","Hearing about the blood-colored power, Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed in surprise. “Blood-colored power!”","“Hmm?” Queen Yun Zhi looked at Jian Wushuang. “You know about the blood-colored power?”","Surprised, Jian Wushuang took a breath and thought of something terrifying.","He directly stated his purpose for coming, “To be honest, I came to find the Empress because of the blood-colored power, and I think I know who the culprit behind the destruction of Yue Kingdom is!”","At this moment, he remembered the beetle he had once sealed in the blood-colored altar.","It contained blood-colored power, but at that time, it wasn’t much of a threat and he hadn’t paid much attention to it.","Later, he visited the Shi Kingdom, and the massacre at the mansion happened just when he was preparing for the Sacred Assembly, so he didn’t investigate deeply.","Only now did he realize.","The culprit behind the mansion massacre and the destruction of Yue Kingdom was likely that beetle.","With no bottlenecks, the blood-colored power alone could infinitely enhance it.","However, back then, the blood-colored power was too scarce. It could increase divine power by a couple hundred thousand units, but more than that was unimaginable.","Even if the beetle had devoured all the blood-colored power, it shouldn’t have become powerful enough to destroy the entire Yue Kingdom!","After hearing the words of Queen Yun Zhi, he understood that the beetle could devour the blood essence of cultivators, which is the essence of divine power.","Imagine a regular cultivator at the First Tribulation level, who, after devouring tens of thousands of Emperors, reaches the Second Tribulation level, and then starts devouring First Tribulation level cultivators.","In a few years, it could grow to a terrifying extent.","Now, having devoured an entire nation’s experts, it might have reached the peak of the Seventh Tribulation level.","“It’s not too late!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes gleamed with killing intent. This was a significant threat that needed to be dealt with promptly.","Although it wouldn’t threaten him for the time being, it would definitely pose a threat to the entire Northern Spacetime in the future.","Infinite growth—this couldn’t be allowed.","It was more terrifying than Chi Jiuxiao.","He couldn’t accept it.","And with the thought of Ye Lingxiao being taken away, he couldn’t help but think along these lines.","If the powerful being behind this was that beetle, then it was over.","Inside Ye Lingxiao’s body, there was an endless supply of blood-red power.","Even for a super powerful figure like the Blood Demon Hall Master, this power would be a great help. If the beetle absorbed it, he would no longer be a match for it.","Speaking of which, it was all his own fault.","Back then, he had destroyed the Chen family, attracting the strong of the Yue Kingdom’s royal family to investigate, and then, by a twist of fate, he obtained that damned insect.","Although it had increased his divine power significantly, it had now brought about such a threat, endangering the entire Northern Spacetime.","Queen Yun Zhi, seeing Jian Wushuang’s tense expression, comforted him, “Don’t worry. Over the years, I have been constantly observing the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands, and even other spacetime realms. Nothing like what happened in the Yue Kingdom has occurred again. Any Sixth Tribulation experts who died mysteriously, I kept an eye on. That terrifying entity should not have appeared again!”","“Perhaps it doesn’t care about those practitioners anymore,” Jian Wushuang voiced his speculation.","Maybe the beetle found that absorbing practitioners yielded too little blood-red power, so it chose to hide and seek the source of the blood-red power instead.","Upon hearing his words, Queen Yun Zhi’s eyes flickered as she frowned and said, “You came to find Fengchen to investigate the blood-red power?”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang nodded, “I have a friend with a blood-red Origin Source who was just taken away!”","“Let’s go, I’ll take you to Fengchen!” Knowing the gravity of the situation, Yun Zhi wrapped Jian Wushuang with her Thought power, ready to tear through space.","However, Jian Wushuang proactively tore through space and said, “Your Majesty, give me the coordinates. I’m faster!”","“Very well!” Yun Zhi dispersed her power and was enveloped by Jian Wushuang’s Thought power. In an instant, they left the Daughter Kingdom.","Turning to look at the young man beside her, in the blink of an eye, he had already surpassed her, causing a strange feeling in her heart.","The location of Empress Fengchen was actually not far from the Ancient Wood Continent.","It was in the gap between the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","This was the so-called Outer Domain Jian Wushuang always mentioned.","Secret realms and cave heavens were everywhere.","However, those secret realms were all owned by someone.","Inside them were either the Origin Source Universes of Universe Masters or trial grounds for certain families.","The place Jian Wushuang and Yun Zhi were heading to was a spacetime secret realm.","It was very famous in the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","That place was a realm where even experts at the Sixth Tribulation and Seventh Tribulation ventured, and occasionally, some experts at the Eighth Tribulation would also visit.","“Qixuan Domain!”","Seven-colored lights swirled around, forming a super-secret realm.","It contained countless treasures.","Formed during the fall of Ancient Moon Spacetime, this secret realm encompassed countless sect ruins, with some treasures useful even to Universe Masters floating on the periphery.","And it had persisted for ages.","Even an eight-star sect would struggle to conquer it, because inside there was a chaotic Origin Source.","Only a peak Eighth Tribulation Universe Master could suppress this secret realm, but doing so would result in backlash, making it a high cost no one was willing to bear.","It remained unclaimed, attracting strong practitioners from nearby continents to explore it.","In the Outer Domain, survival below the Tribulation realm was difficult, so when Jian Wushuang once claimed he was wandering in the Outer Domain, many were surprised!","And now, before him was one of the most dangerous secret realms in the outer realms, the Qixuan Domain.","Stronger than this were the spacetime secret realms nurtured within the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","A Sixth Tribulation Universe Master would fall at the core of the Qixuan Domain, a Seventh Tribulation expert would be injured, and some restrictions could even trap Eighth Tribulation experts.","Previously, Jian Wushuang would only dare to observe such a secret realm from afar.","But now, there was nothing here that could trap him.","If only the pyramid were here, with one black hole-level attack, he could shatter the Qixuan Domain.","“In the inner area!” Approaching the Qixuan Domain, Jian Wushuang instantly locked onto Empress Fengchen’s location, “Seems she’s in quite a bit of trouble!”","After pinpointing the location, he ignored any prohibitions and forcefully broke through.","This scene terrified the Tribulation realm experts on the periphery.","“A big shot!”","“The prohibitions here can’t be broken by a Sixth Tribulation expert, and yet someone dares to force their way in. He must be a Seventh Tribulation expert!”"]},{"number":6013,"title":"Chapter 6013: Long Time No See","paragraphs":["Chapter 6013: Long Time No See","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Among the powerful beings on the periphery, they sensed the entire Qixuan Domain trembling and spotted Jian Wushuang and his companion in a stream of light.","“The Queen of the Daughter Kingdom of the Ancient Wood Continent, a top-tier powerhouse among the Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation!” Recognizing Yun Zhi’s identity, the unnamed powerhouse sucked in a breath of cold air.","In the Qixuan Domain, reaching the Seventh Tribulation was enough to dominate.","A Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation was comparable to a super powerhouse who had undergone the Eighth Tribulation.","They dared to intrude boldly!","Among the fallen Seventh Tribulation powerhouses in the Qixuan Domain, none were Universe Masters.","But it wasn’t certain that all internal dangers had been exposed; there might be hidden restrictions that could threaten the Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation.","Jian Wushuang, however, was fearless and barged through without hesitation.","The terrifying power of the Starry Sky casually crushed those restrictions and even some ignorant puppets attempting to block their way were torn to shreds.","The savage beasts were smart enough to keep their distance.","Along the way, remnants of sects were torn apart, countless treasures burst out, but Jian Wushuang couldn’t be bothered to spare them a glance.","The value of some treasures here ranged from hundreds to thousands, with the most expensive ones having once been worth millions of primordial stones, although such super treasures were rare throughout history.","For Jian Wushuang now, even millions of primordial stones were beneath his notice.","If it were billions, he might consider taking action.","His indifference, however, gave the onlooking powerhouses a great opportunity; countless Seventh Tribulation powerhouses went crazy plundering, sparking one thrilling life-and-death battle after another, which was extremely exciting.","It’s just a pity Jian Wushuang couldn’t see it.","The Empress was in the core area of the Qixuan Domain.","At this moment, she was facing off against two Seventh Tribulation powerhouses.","Although she had reached the peak of the Sixth Tribulation after receiving the treasure from Jian Wushuang, she still felt somewhat powerless against two Seventh Tribulation Scattered Tribulation cultivators.","If it weren’t for the rumors from the outside world that Jian Wushuang was her son-in-law, she might have died on the spot today.","In the heart of the core domain.","Empress Fengchen gazed proudly at the two Seventh Tribulation experts, blood staining her lips, but she showed no sign of retreat.","“Why bother!” sighed one of the two Seventh Tribulation experts facing each other. “Fengchen, if it weren’t for Jian Wushuang, we would have killed you long ago. Don’t be so ignorant!”","The gaze of the other Seventh Tribulation expert turned cold. This was the Qixuan Domain, a place where battles were commonplace. They wouldn’t hold back because of anyone’s background. If Queen Yun Zhi continued to resist stubbornly, they wouldn’t hesitate to strike.","If it were just ordinary treasures, they wouldn’t risk attacking Fengchen, who had a connection with Jian Wushuang.","But that particular treasure was crucial to both of them.","Because it housed a spring of Life Essence, which was extremely valuable. If they obtained it, they could restore themselves to their peak.","That’s why they dared to take such risks.","“No more nonsense, if you want it, show us your full strength!” Queen Yun Zhi’s tone was resolute, showing no signs of backing down.","The last time she retreated, the entire Yue Kingdom suffered.","She gained strength through that experience.","But she lost everything she once had.","The once incredibly beautiful vision was all gone.","The position of the Holy Maiden?","The Ancient Wood Sect had been rebuilt, and the position of the Holy Maiden was long gone.","She didn’t want to go back to that place of heartache.","After exchanging a glance, the two Seventh Tribulation experts nodded to each other and issued their final ultimatum, “In that case, don’t blame us for being ruthless!”","As soon as they finished speaking, they were about to make their move.","But they felt the surrounding spacetime trembling.","In such a situation, either an extraordinary treasure had appeared, or a super strong individual was disrupting the Qixuan Domain.","“Hmm?” The three who were about to act were all stunned.","Just now, an extraordinary treasure had appeared here, worth millions of primordial stones if sold.","The chance of another treasure appearing was too slim. It was probably caused by the commotion from the arrival of a super strong individual.","“Could it be?”","“Can’t be that there’s a super strong individual already, aware that the power of Life has emerged here!”","Those two Seventh Tribulation experts were somewhat panicked.","The appearance of the God of Life made the Scattered Tribulation in the entire Northern Spacetime become tense.","In pursuit of the power of Life, they had reached the point of resorting to any means necessary.","If it was indeed a super powerhouse descending, then they would have no chance.","“Attack!”","Without any hesitation, the two of them wanted to obtain the power of Life before the arrival of the super powerhouse and then use it.","Empress Fengchen, however, sensed a familiar aura.","It was the aura of Queen Yun Zhi.","As for Jian Wushuang’s aura, she couldn’t perceive it.","Hum!","“I have descended, yet you still dare to act!” In the depths of spacetime, a giant face appeared, its expression somewhat angry.","With a cold snort, it shattered the divine bodies of the two Seventh Tribulation experts.","After dispersing, they reformed, but still suffered heavy injuries.","Empress Fengchen looked at the majestic face in the depths of spacetime, her eyes flickering, somewhat stunned. Her lips moved slightly, hoarsely saying, “Jian Wushuang?”","Whoosh!","After the projection of divine power descended for a breath, Jian Wushuang and the true form of Queen Yun Zhi also arrived.","“Jian Wushuang!!!” The two heavily injured Seventh Tribulation experts exclaimed in unison, both fearful and delighted at the name.","Delighted because Jian Wushuang possessed boundless Life force, yet fearful because of his strength.","Jian Wushuang paid no attention to the two Seventh Tribulation experts but went straight to Empress Fengchen, his voice softened, “Your Majesty, it’s been a long time.”","Indeed, they hadn’t seen each other for a long time. Since they parted ways in the Dragon God Continent, millions of epochs had passed in the outside world. Seeing each other again, both their strengths and statuses had undergone earth-shaking changes.","Looking at the once designated consort before her, Empress Fengchen’s heart was filled with mixed feelings. She had long anticipated that Jian Wushuang would be a calamity for Yue Kingdom, but she hadn’t expected it to be this severe.","Although the fall of Yue Kingdom had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang, everything in the past couldn’t be separated from him.","“Why have you come?” Seeing Jian Wushuang reminded her of the past, stirring up turmoil in her heart.","Seeing the other’s grim expression, Jian Wushuang was about to speak but was interrupted by Queen Yun Zhi.","She still wore that irresistible smile as she gently floated towards Empress Fengchen, taking her hand, and softly said, “Fengchen, Wushuang is here because of Yue Kingdom’s situation...”","The rest of the conversation was more confidential, so Queen Yun Zhi chose to use telepathy.","Jian Wushuang then saw Empress Fengchen’s expression gradually relax. Inevitably, he couldn’t help but sigh inwardly that Queen Yun Zhi’s character was indeed better.","Dealing with such a powerful woman as Empress Fengchen required a gentle approach.","And for Queen Yun Zhi to come in person.","If it were him, it would probably be quite troublesome.","“Alright, let’s talk about it when we get back!” Queen Yun Zhi patted Fengchen’s shoulder, her tone casual, as if everything was not a problem.","Empress Fengchen did not reply but tacitly agreed."]},{"number":6014,"title":"Chapter 6014: I Will Do My Best","paragraphs":["Chapter 6014: I Will Do My Best","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After dealing with the Empress, Jian Wushuang turned his head to glance at the two Seven Tribulation experts, who were kneeling in terror in the void, their heads buried between their knees, trembling.","This reminded him of a time when he had been in such a plight himself.","So, he didn’t make things difficult for the two.","With a thought, he tore through the fabric of space, carrying the Empress and Queen Yun Zhi away.","But before leaving, he left behind two masses of life force potent enough to drive Eighth Tribulation experts mad.","“Unbelievable...” The two Seventh Tribulation experts stared at the masses of Life force for a long time, unable to believe their eyes.","Once they realized Jian Wushuang had truly departed, they bowed several times in the direction he had left, before daring to accept the Life force and directly absorbing it on the spot to restore their divine bodies.","In the depths of the Imperial City of the Daughter Kingdom, beside a fake mountain.","Jian Wushuang stood under a peach tree, arms crossed.","He listened carefully to the Empress recounting the history of the Chen family.","He tried hard to uncover anything suspicious.","“Black Heaven, Ye family!” Jian Wushuang’s gaze shifted.","Finally, he heard what he wanted amid their conversation.","Though he had some guesses, there was still some uncertainty in his heart. Now knowing that the Chen family hailed from the ancient Black Heaven and that an ancestor of the Chen family had once married a disciple of the Blood Robe Sect.","“This is all I know about the Chen family...” The Empress finished, looking at Jian Wushuang, evidently wanting to know if there was any connection between the destruction of Yue Kingdom and the Chen family!","At this moment, Jian Wushuang also reached his final conclusion.","After taking a deep breath, he admitted, “Your Majesty, I’m deeply sorry!”","“The culprit who destroyed Yue Kingdom wasn’t the Ye family, but a monster, the same cocoon that Yan Long Patriarch gave me in the Great Hall!”","He directly revealed the truth, which was the real reason behind the destruction of Yue Kingdom.","As for the Ye family, Jian Wushuang didn’t want them to be implicated.","The influence of the blood-colored power was significant; one small mistake could lead to a repeat of the tragedy.","He could handle it, but the Empress and Queen Yun Zhi couldn’t!","If it was indeed related to the Ye family, it was his own matter, not much related to the Empress.","Moreover, he would soon leave the upstream spacetime. Whether he would come back or not was uncertain. In the future, he wouldn’t be able to protect the Empress anymore.","“A cocoon!” At this moment, a trace of helplessness appeared on Fengchen’s face as the strands of her hair fluttered before her eyes. It was the mockery of fate. The cocoon she had once disregarded ended up destroying Yue Kingdom.","After learning the identity of the murderer, she felt anger but didn’t know how to vent it. Instead, she wandered aimlessly until Queen Yun Zhi’s guidance helped her find peace.","Now, she felt empty.","Seek revenge?","She didn’t have the strength for it.","Endure silently?","That wasn’t her nature.","So, her only hope rested with Jian Wushuang.","“I will do my best...” Jian Wushuang didn’t make any promises, only stating that he would try his hardest.","Because he hadn’t thought about seeking revenge for Yue Kingdom; his goal was to help Wanyan find Ye Lingxiao.","To gain the power of blood, to strengthen himself.","He didn’t think much beyond that.","The atmosphere became somewhat awkward for a moment. After Jian Wushuang got the answer he wanted, he didn’t linger, hastily taking his leave.","Queen Yun Zhi didn’t try to detain him, but rather got up to personally see him off.","In the upper echelons of the Daughter Kingdom.","“Master, there’s no need for further farewells, thank you for this time!” Jian Wushuang expressed his gratitude with a cupped fist.","But Queen Yun Zhi had something to say, her expression somewhat distant. “Jian Wushuang, on behalf of Fengchen, I apologize for what happened before, back then...”","“Born for the Dao, as long as there’s no regret, there’s no need to apologize to anyone!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, interrupting Queen Yun Zhi. He knew what she was going to say.","Though he had once complained about the Empress behind her back, he was still alive and well now, so he harbored no hatred.","He just felt sorry for those people from back then.","Queen Yun Zhi’s gaze flickered, realizing that Jian Wushuang wasn’t the type to hold grudges.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t have sent those treasures back then, so she didn’t say anything more.","With a rippling sound, Jian Wushuang stepped into the void and bid farewell casually before departing gracefully.","Only after the temporal rift closed did Queen Yun Zhi’s figure begin to dissipate, returning to the imperial city of the Daughter Kingdom.","In the Primordial Black Heaven.","Perpetually night!","But within the void, there was a hint of bloody aura piercing through the heavens.","That was the Blood Robe Sect established by the Ye Family.","Amidst the blood glow, there were numerous universes, all containing the Origin Source Universes of Universe Masters and some universe secrets.","The Blood Robe Sect was situated within one of these secret realms.","Compared to the Ancient Wood Continent, the Primordial Black Heaven was extremely stable, but it didn’t hold many treasures.","Treasures harbored dangers.","Initially, the Ancient Wood Sect’s sects were established directly outside the Wanliu Divine Realm to suppress everything.","However, the Blood Robe Sect had no place to suppress, merely constructing their sect within the blood glow in the void.","The Long Night City!","Both the Ye Family and the Blood Robe Sect resided in this grand city.","Legend has it that this place used to be the Origin Souce Universe of the Ye Xiaowang.","The Long Night City was once called the Long Night Secret Realm, a main secret realm within the Ye Xiaowang’s Origin Souce Universe.","Swish!","A white-robed young man tore through the void and arrived outside the Long Night City. Beside him was a figure clad in black robes, unmoving, with features completely concealed, even their breath entirely veiled.","The white-robed youth glanced up at the towering city ahead without hesitation, then, accompanied by the black-robed figure, he stepped into the Long Night City amidst the crowd.","Indistinguishable from the masses, he wore pristine white robes, and his bald head was the only thing that made him stand out.","As he entered through the city gates, the white-robed monk glanced back at the void outside, twirling a string of prayer beads in his hand. With a subtle movement, wisdom gleamed in his eyes.","“It seems Jian Wushuang has also arrived!” the white-robed monk muttered to himself before turning and entering the city.","If Jian Wushuang had seen this person’s face, he would have been delighted for sure.","Hu Qing!","Since the destruction of the Ancient Moon Ruins, he had reappeared, now arriving at the Long Night City in the primordial black sky.","And his reason for coming was similar to Jian Wushuang’s.","Upon request, to resolve a crisis.","Just as Hu Qing entered the Long Night City with the black-robed figure, they headed straight for the Ye family Ancestral Mansion!","“Kindly inform the master that there is a woman named Ye Lingxiao who wishes to see the head of the Ye family!”","Hu Qing spoke with a calm demeanor, being exceedingly courteous to the two guardians of the Ye family’s gates, both of whom were at the Tribulation level.","He appeared harmless!","The two gatekeepers of the Ye family’s mansion were shaken upon hearing Ye Lingxiao’s name. The long-lost young lady of the Ye family had actually appeared?","If Jian Wushuang knew that it was Hu Qing who had taken Ye Lingxiao away, he would be even more shocked!","The mysterious strong individuals encountered by Wu Zuo and the others also surfaced.","It was the “Hu Qing” they were looking for!","“Senior, please wait a moment. I will report this immediately!” The two gatekeepers were not fools. Unable to discern Hu Qing’s strength, they naturally had to be cautious, especially since the visitor came in the identity of the Ye family’s young lady.","Reporting was only natural.","The current head of the Ye family was none other than the father of the Blood Robe Sect’s master."]},{"number":6015,"title":"Chapter 6015: Ye Wudao","paragraphs":["Chapter 6015: Ye Wudao","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was also Night Lingxiao’s father.","“Yue Wudao!”","Buzz!","In the backyard of the clan, an old figure suddenly appeared outside the clan gate.","“Xiao’er?” Yue Wudao’s voice trembled slightly.","His children were all extraordinarily talented. Not to mention his eldest son, Yue Lingyun, who became the master of the Blood Robe Sect, even his eldest daughter, Yue Lingxiao, had become a Fifth Tribulation Universe Master at an early age.","But then she mysteriously disappeared.","After searching for so many years, she actually came back. How could he not be happy?","When Hu Qing saw the person he wanted to see, he gently took off his black robe, revealing the figure of Yue Lingxiao.","And at that moment, Yue Lingxiao regained consciousness.","Originally forcibly taken away and then losing consciousness, upon regaining it, she saw her father and the familiar clan mansion.","Yue Wudao was in a great mood, he stepped forward and grabbed his daughter’s hand, showering her with questions and concern.","But Yue Lingxiao was a bit at a loss.","She glanced at Hu Qing, but she had no impression of him whatsoever.","Everything felt like a dream.","“Let’s go, back home!” Yue Wudao pulled his daughter towards the mansion. It was only then that he noticed Hu Qing standing beside them. If he hadn’t seen him with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have noticed Hu Qing’s presence.","Only then did he realize, and he turned to look at his daughter, obviously wanting Yue Lingxiao to introduce him.","But he couldn’t see through him; he must be a super strong individual.","At least a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation.","But Yue Lingxiao didn’t know who Hu Qing was!","Before the awkward silence could set in, Hu Qing took the initiative to introduce himself, “I am Tianji. I happened to come across the search for relatives message sent out by the Yue Family, and I found Miss Yue unconscious in the Desolate Land, so I brought her back!”","Desolate Land?","Unconscious?","Yue Lingxiao didn’t believe it in her heart. She was certain that the monk in front of her had taken her away.","But she couldn’t say these things now, so she didn’t refute.","She didn’t believe it, but Yue Wudao did!","Upon hearing that the person who saved his daughter’s life was visiting, Night’s family warmly welcomed Hu Qing into their ancestral home.","Word of this quickly spread.","Even their eldest son, Ye Lingyun, was summoned back.","A banquet was arranged within the family to celebrate their daughter’s return and to express gratitude to Hu Qing.","The feast concluded late into the night.","Hu Qing was accommodated in a guest room.","As for Ye Lingxiao, her return to the family was somewhat involuntary. She didn’t harbor much affection for this family; otherwise, she wouldn’t have hesitated to return.","But today, seeing her father’s attentiveness, she felt a sense of wavering and confusion.","It all felt like a dream.","After the banquet, ostensibly to retire for the night and ease the tension, she actually slipped into Hu Qing’s guest room.","This was Ye family’s ancestral home, where nothing escaped the eyes of Ye Wudao.","He stood with his hands behind his back, facing the window, with his eldest son, Ye Lingyun, behind him.","“Lingxiao has returned. The plan we made originally shall continue!” Ye Wudao’s once amiable expression was replaced by a sinister look.","Ye Lingyun’s expression shifted slightly as he respectfully said, “Father, about that person...”","“Hmph!” Ye Wudao snorted coldly. “Tomorrow, give him some treasures and send him away. If he refuses to leave, then... dispose of him!”","Ye Lingyun swallowed hard, feeling his father’s words were somewhat extreme. He was a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation, yet he couldn’t sense any aura from Hu Qing. How was he supposed to handle this?","“But, Patriarch is currently in seclusion. Who will handle this?”","“You need not worry about that. I have a solution!” Ye Wudao sneered. “Lord Xilu hasn’t absorbed any cultivators for a long time. That Tianji is probably a high-level cultivator at the Eighth Tribulation, and unlike the strong ones in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, no one would care if he’s eliminated!”","At the mention of Xilu, the contemporary Blood Cloth Sect Master, Ye Lingyun couldn’t help but shudder.","That was a monster.","He had always been extremely wary, but with his father and the Patriarch cooperating with Xilu, he had no choice.","Seeing his son’s unease, Ye Wudao comforted him, “Alright, I’ll take care of it personally. You don’t need to intervene. Just ensure everything we need is prepared. This time, our Ye family’s overall strength will soar...”","The entire Ancient Moon Spacetime was quite stirred up now.","With the disappearance of the Ancient Moon Ruins, the Ancient Moon Spacetime lost its burden.","There would emerge a large number of strong individuals in the future.","By then, their eight-star sects, and even the Ancient Moon Sect, might be replaced.","Changes had to be made now, which meant attaching oneself to the thighs of the powerful.","Cooperate with the strong and share everything.","Previously, as the power of the Ancient Moon Spacetime waned, they had to rely on the Ancient Moon Sect to maintain their position.","Moreover, few strong individuals were born at that time, and they could handle it themselves.","But advancing further was difficult.","Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","19 eight-star sects, regardless of the disparity in their strengths.","No one dared to overstep.","But this balance would soon be broken.","Ye Wudao harbored great ambitions in his eyes, though he was a Scattered Tribulation, he still hoped for a resurrection.","Anything was possible in the future.","Ambition was only natural.","“Divine Wood King of the Ancient Wood Continent has already rebuilt the Ancient Wood Sect. His own strength surpasses that of the Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation level. And the Patriarch of the Bai Family of the Primordial White Heaven, not long ago, somehow got associated with","Jian Wushuang, gaining a burst of Life force, and the overall strength of the family erupted again.","“And the Ancient Moon Sect also gained Life force, probably because of that Jian Wushuang. They are all getting stronger. How can my Ye Family afford to stagnate?”","Ye Wudao tone was low as he turned to look at his son, “Some sacrifices are necessary, for the family!”","However, Ye Lingyun didn’t think so, but he didn’t refute his father either.","He was a Universe Master, he had a better future, and he had the pride of a strong individual.","To enhance the family’s strength, sacrificing his sister.","Then the next time to enhance the family’s strength, would it be his turn to be sacrificed?","Speaking of it step by step, sacrificing just one sister.","That would still be a very embarrassing thing and would become a stumbling block for his Dao Heart.","After a moment of silence between father and son, Ye Lingyun took his leave.","He didn’t want to stay in this family for long, because the chill was heavy!","Outside the mansion.","Within the guest room.","Hu Qing saw Ye Lingxiao enter through the door, and he knew the purpose of her visit. With a flick of his finger, he froze the spacetime, even the Ye Family Patriarch couldn’t peek into this place.","“Who are you exactly?” Feeling the stillness of the surrounding spacetime, Ye Lingxiao was first scared, then pretended to be calm, “What’s the matter, are you afraid?”","Hu Qing sat cross-legged on the soft couch, lifted the teacup with his hand, took a sip of tea, and calmly said, “You’ll know my identity later. For now, just remember","one thing, I won’t harm you!”","“Heh!” Ye Lingxiao didn’t believe it, “You won’t harm me? Then why did you send me back to the Ye Family?”","She wasn’t a fool, she knew some of the Ye Family’s plans, so she had been avoiding coming back."]},{"number":6016,"title":"Chapter 6016: Raising the Flag","paragraphs":["Chapter 6016: Raising the Flag","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Now being sent back to her family by the mysterious powerful figure before her, it was hard for her not to link it to her father’s schemes.","She had just contacted Wanyan, who was far away in the desolate land, informing him that after being abducted and taken hostage, she was returned to the Ye Family.","Feeling a bit more confident now, she spoke with a tone of both probing and threat, “Regardless of your intentions, it’s best not to harbor ill thoughts. My good friend will come to rescue me soon!”","Then she added, “By the way, don’t underestimate my friends. The reason you were able to snatch me away before was because Jian Wushuang wasn’t around. He controls the power of Life and is comparable to the peak of the Eighth Tribulation. He’s also friends with ancient existences. When he comes, he will take me away too!”","As Ye Lingyun spoke, a look of satisfaction appeared on her face.","She raised Jian Wushuang’s name as a flag, linking herself with him.","Back then, Jian Wushuang and the others had been able to defy even the Blood Demon Temple Master to protect her.","Even the Eternal Being, “Elder Tian Cang,” treated him with courtesy.","Hearing the name Jian Wushuang, Hu Qing’s expression changed slightly.","Ye Lingxiao thought the other party was afraid and began to persuade him kindly again, “If you are at the Scattered Tribulation level, I can help you exchange some Life force. If you are at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation, there’s no need for us insignificant people to be at odds. Why not let me go?”","“Alas!” Hu Qing sighed, feeling somewhat misunderstood, and said, “I can assure you that I will not harm you, nor your mentioned friends. If you truly care for them, it’s best not to let them come.”","Unable to persuade him, Ye Lingxiao felt a little annoyed. She turned to leave directly. Just as she pushed open the door, she paused, her tone turning cold, “You’re just afraid!”","With that, he left straight away.","At that moment, the surrounding space returned to calm!","Deep within the ancestral home, Ye Wudao observed his daughter but didn’t notice anything amiss.","However, he also harbored some apprehension towards Hu Qing’s strength.","With a thread of Thought power, he transformed into a avatar and quietly left the Ye Family ancestral home.","Heading towards the back mountain.","That area belonged to the Ye family, and ordinary people couldn’t enter at all.","Because the Patriarch was in seclusion there and disliked being disturbed.","Apart from the Patriarch, there was also a terrifying presence that had arrived here millions of epochs ago.","This terrifying presence was a central figure in Ye Wudao’s plan.","Back then, despite facing a Scattered Tribulation, he managed to regain control of the family not solely due to his status as the Patriarch’s son-in-law.","It was also because of his decisiveness and ruthlessness.","But most importantly, it was because of a blood-red treasure he obtained in the past.","This treasure had once alarmed the Ye Xiaowang.","That’s how he, with a Scattered Tribulation body, became the head of the Ye family.","You should know that in the past, the head of the Ye family would also be the head of the Blood Robe Sect.","But when he took over, he changed the rules.","Whoosh!","On the ancestral mountain, a blood-colored storm swept through.","Ye Wudao stepped up to the highest point. Before a blood-colored giant gate, he stopped and respectfully revealed a humble expression, saying, “Lord Xilu, I have an important matter to report!”","“Gurgle!” A surge from deep within the throat caused the surrounding blood force to dissipate. Then, the giant gate shook and opened a gap. A huge eye appeared in the gap, staring at Ye Wudao as he nervously sweated.","“Come in and speak!” A deep voice came from behind the door.","Ye Wudao took a deep breath, cautiously stepping inside the giant gate.","The scene behind the blood gate was like a relief on the gate.","It was a blood-red cave.","At the end of the cave, there was the pulsation of blood.","After entering the cave, Ye Wudao kept his head down, not daring to look around.","“I sense the source of blood from you!” Xilu’s figure swayed and he came behind Ye Wudao, greedily sniffing the scent.","Ye Wudao was startled and quickly turned around, seeing a monstrous face larger than his body, extremely terrifying.","Xilu’s visage was like that of a bug transformed into a human. Entirely green with black spots, thin, but with a huge head.","“Lord Xilu, it’s the return of the young miss. She’s currently at the mansion!” Ye Wudao faced Xilu, not daring to waste words, and reported everything straightforwardly.","Upon hearing about the rumored practitioner with a blood-colored Origin Source, Xilu’s expression brightened. “No wonder you exude such a marvelous aura,” he remarked.","But from Ye Wudao’s words, he also learned about an obstacle.","“Eighth Tribulation?” Xilu strode towards the mass of blood-red within the cave, casually seating himself. “Take him into the void; leave the rest to me!”","He had full confidence in his own strength.","Since leaving Yue Kingdom, he had possessed the pinnacle divine power of the Eighth Tribulation.","Now his divine power had reached a terrifying 15 million, the perfection of the Eighth Tribulation.","Throughout the Ancient Moon Spacetime, the only one he feared was the Pope of the Ancient Moon.","As for Divine Wood King, at most, he could only suppress him, unable to defeat him.","So, he dared not openly attack in the Long Night City.","He intended to lure Hu Qing into the void before striking.","Ye Wudao hesitated for a moment before saying, “For this, I need the help of the Patriarch. I’ll go request him later, and we can act tomorrow!”","“Good!” Xilu wasn’t interested in Hu Qing, but he was greatly interested in Ye Lingxiao.","He had absorbed countless practitioners, devouring not only their blood essence but also their wisdom and all their excess.","Such as bloodlines?","And legacies.","It could be said that he was a grandmaster encompassing myriad paths.","But those were all auxiliary.","Only the complete power of the blood-red could transform him once more.","After reaching the perfection of the Eighth Tribulation, ordinary practitioners were useless against him.","Only Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters could make him stronger.","But those Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters, each could carry their own Origin Source Dao Arena, making it difficult for him to kill even one.","With no target in sight, he came to the Ye Family.","Speaking of which, he also originated from the Ye Family.","...","Ye Wudao didn’t dare linger in Xilu’s cave and hurriedly took his leave.","Standing on the ancestral mountain, he began to contact the Patriarch, Ye Xiaowang.","He originally thought Xilu could directly kill Hu Qing, but unexpectedly, it was so troublesome. He","had no choice but to inform the Patriarch of the process as well.","At the peak of the ancestral mountain.","An elderly man with white hair and a hooked nose stood atop it, his face filled with vicissitudes.","Upon noticing the arrival of the younger Ye Wudao, he remained silent.","He was the Ye Xiaowang.","The appointed sealed king of the Ancient Moon Sect.","Moreover, during the era of the Celestial Maiden, his strength far surpassed that of the original Divine Wood King and others.","This formidable deterrent force had been maintained until now.","All of it stemmed from his legacy.","Or rather, a treasure.","After obtaining that treasure, his blood essence had never faded.","Blood essence represented divine power. If divine power didn’t fade, then one would remain at the peak forever."]},{"number":6017,"title":"Chapter 6017: Do You Dare to Come to the Void?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6017: Do You Dare to Come to the Void?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If it weren’t for forcibly breaking through the Ninth Tribulation realm back then, he could have maintained his status as the Eighth Tribulation Universe Master all along.","It was all because of greed!","And this greed hadn’t ceased yet.","Seeing Divine Wood King surpassing himself, the Patriarch of the Bai Family also regained his peak.","He was anxious!","So he chose to cooperate with the terrifying existence that emerged from the blood-colored treasure.","All the talk about the power of Life back then was fake. Everything was because of that treasure.","Now, he didn’t even know if his calculations were wrong.","But in the pursuit of power, he had no choice.","“Wudao, you’ve worked hard this time!” After a moment of silence, Ye Xiaowang unexpectedly showed a gentle expression, turning to look at Ye Wudao, the descendant who resembled him the most.","Equally greedy.","The pursuit of power had reached its peak.","Even his own daughter could be betrayed.","But she was also his descendant!","Although this descendant was probably a reincarnated practitioner, he also had the bloodline of their Ye Family.","For a moment, Ye Wudao didn’t understand the Patriarch’s meaning and was a little dazed. “Patriarch...”","“Tomorrow, I will go to visit that Daoist Tianji. You just need to stabilize Xiao’er. As for Lingyun, don’t trouble him anymore. Let there be a quiet person left for our Ye Family!” After living for so many years, Ye Xiaowang had seen through some things.","“Yes!” Ye Wudao’s face brightened.","With the matter settled, he didn’t linger on the clan mountain and went straight back to the main mansion.","But on the clan mountain, the Ye Xiaowang remained standing.","The matter of seclusion was also revealed.","Gazing at the blood-red sky, he fell into thought.","The next day!","A trace of blood color streaked across the sky.","Long Night City welcomed the second day.","There was no daytime, only night.","Let’s use the crimson color to differentiate.","For cultivators, they don’t particularly pursue black and white; either is fine.","Everyone can get through.","Hu Qing had been in the room the whole time, waiting for someone to come to him.","“Hmm?”","A presence, no less formidable than his own, descended upon the sect residence.","He noticed the visitor immediately, a faint smile playing on his lips as he began to rise to prepare tea. “You’re here already!”","He couldn’t resist a teasing remark.","Initially, he was worried the other party might take some time.","By then, Jian Wushuang and the others might arrive.","That would be somewhat disadvantageous to him.","Hu Qing’s aim was to settle everything before Jian Wushuang and the others arrived.","Then, he would take the initiative to approach Jian Wushuang and return to Qishen Temple together.","This place was just an interlude.","Someone had commissioned him to come here.","That’s why he was so attentive.","If it weren’t for the commission, he would have gone to find Jian Wushuang long ago.","Clack!","The wooden door made a crisp sound.","Hu Qing’s voice remained calm. “Please come in.”","The door of branches was pushed open.","An old man with a hooked nose stood at the threshold wearing a gray linen robe. Instead of entering, he smiled lightly. “Dao Friend, could we have a chat in the void?”","As he spoke, he forcefully manipulated a strong divine power, pulling Hu Qing through the fabric of space, entering the void of the Primordial Black Heaven.","Hu Qing still held a cup of tea in his hand, surprised. “So direct?”","“Tsk tsk, aren’t you the same?” Ye Xiaowang sneered.","Bringing Ye Lingxiao back to the Ye Family without mentioning compensation was quite suspicious, especially coming from a super powerhouse at the Eighth Tribulation.","Bringing Ye Lingxiao to the Ancient Moon Spacetime in the desolate land was quite laughable.","Would an Eighth Tribulation super powerhouse need to curry favor with their Ye Family?","While the Ye Family was influential in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, in the broader context, there was only one family with an Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouse, hardly considered top-tier.","At best, they were second-rate.","An Eighth Tribulation super powerhouse wouldn’t bother currying favor with a second-rate family, leaving only one reason.","The other party was probing them.","Probing their treasures.","What did the Ye Family have?","The blood-colored power!","And the crimson treasure of the Ye Xiaowang.","“You’ve entered my Ye Family, and for whatever reason, I don’t want to know, but today you must die!” Ye Xiaowang spread his arms, and the surrounding spacetime instantly began to solidify.","“Bloody splatter!”","The power of blood instantly enveloped the entire spacetime.","Including the two cultivators.","Except, there was also a thin monster approaching from afar.","Buzz!","The newcomer was also the target of Hu Qing this time.","“Xilu!” Hu Qing’s face showed a hint of joy, he somewhat liked this directness.","Coming up and striking immediately.","With much less beating around the bush.","Actually, he could have acted in the Long Night City, but in order not to kill those cultivators by mistake, he had been waiting for them to come to him.","He was unwilling to harm the innocent, but the other party was trying not to expose their identity.","Xilu was somewhat surprised to hear his name being called out directly, his figure also stopped, and his gaze was astonished as he said, “You know me?”","“A product of the Machine Clan, someone has been eyeing you since the moment you were born in the Northern Spacetime!”","Ye Xiaowang was also very surprised!","He didn’t expect someone to know about Xilu’s situation. “Not good!”","He quickly realized that something was amiss.","Hu Qing knew about Xilu’s existence.","Perhaps there was a big shot behind this.","Coming here was also to eradicate Xilu.","He understood Xilu as well, a creature without bottlenecks.","Allowing it to grow would definitely be a disaster for the Northern Spacetime.","Hu Qing came here, probably to eradicate Xilu.","Being so confident, then...","“Attack together!” Ye Xiaowang didn’t hesitate, directly roaring angrily, and his divine power soared to 13 million.","Xilu also knew that this time he had encountered a tough opponent, his golden power erupted, and his divine power directly broke through to 15 million.","One at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm, one at the complete stage of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","The two joined forces, even if the Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect came, it would be difficult to suppress them.","However, Hu Qing was extremely calm, he was prepared for this.","With both hands open, one hand brought down the sun and moon, and divine power surged like a spring eruption.","At the same time, there was also a huge heavenly canopy descending.","That was Hu Qing’s Origin Source Dao Arena.","The Origin Source Dao Arena of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","He inherited the last Origin Source of the Celestial Maiden, and reached the complete-stage of the Eighth Tribulation in one fell swoop.","His divine power also erupted to 15 million.","The sun and moon in his hands turned into an ancient staff, sweeping away everything.","The solidified space was instantly shattered.","“How is this possible?” Ye Xiaowang couldn’t believe it, his spacetime blockade was instantly broken, and he also felt the true strength of Hu Qing.","The Universe Master at the complete-stage of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","With the Dao Arena descending, Hu Qing’s divine power surged again.","It had already reached the level of the Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect.","Xilu was also a little panicked. At this moment, he only had 15 million divine power.","Seeing spacetime being shattered, both of them were in mortal danger.","“Ye Xiaowang, hand over that treasure to me now, otherwise, we will all perish!” Xilu anxiously looked at Ye Xiaowang. The reason he returned to the Ye Family was for the power of blood within that treasure.","But he underestimated Ye Xiaowang’s ambition, how could he possibly give away such a crucial treasure."]},{"number":6018,"title":"Chapter 6018: Hu Qing’s Horror!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6018: Hu Qing’s Horror!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He was not Divine Wood King, willing to give up his treasure.","Xilu was not Danbao either, who could keep his promise.","However, Hu Qing didn’t care about any of this. He swung his ancient staff and charged straight at Xilu.","Ye Xiaowang posed no threat to him. He wasn’t here for Ye Xiaowang, but to eliminate Xilu.","This monster did not belong to the Northern Spacetime.","He had come on the orders of the Realm King to kill Xilu.","“Heaven Wheel!”","Hu Qing shouted angrily, sweeping his staff towards Xilu and shattering his divine body instantly.","In his Origin Source Dao Arena, he was almost invincible.","He relentlessly crushed Xilu without holding back at all.","Xilu’s divine body continually shattered and then regenerated.","Having absorbed so much blood-colored power, he had long attained an immortal body, but each injury caused a backlash to his divine body. This method of endurance was not a solution.","“Damn it!” Xilu roared, “Ye Xiao, you’ll die with me!”","An enraged Xilu cursed Ye Xiaowang!","If he had absorbed that blood-colored treasure, he would not be in such a passive state.","The blood-colored power was crucial for the first stage of his life. As long as he could fully devour the blood-colored power, he would step into the Ninth Tribulation. At that point, how could he fear the bald monk in front of him?","Ye Xiaowang noticed that Hu Qing did not attack him, making him even less anxious.","Compared to Ye Wudao’s plan, he valued his treasure more.","Without the treasure, the blood-colored power would be useless to him. Why would he give the treasure to Xilu?","“Hmph!” Ye Xiaowang snorted coldly, completely ignoring Xilu being crushed by Hu Qing. “When you came, you were probably eyeing my treasure, a wolf with wild ambitions. How could I let you succeed!”","He hadn’t fully mastered that treasure himself. When the path to resurrection opened in the future, he would have endless opportunities. How could he abandon it?","Boom!!!","Xilu’s divine body shattered again, and his strength began to decline.","After restoring his original form once more, he wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth and said defiantly, “Damn it, if I had reached the complete form of the first stage, how could you defeat me? I have the bloodline of the Frost Demon Clan, and I can become even stronger!”","He clenched his fists, forcibly enhancing his divine power, and actively charged at Hu Qing.","However, the disparity in their strength was immense.","Hu Qing didn’t even use his ancient staff. He lifted a foot and kicked Xilu hard in the face, sending him flying through the void.","But in the next moment, his figure flashed and appeared within the clouds below. Xilu’s body, uncontrollably plummeting, was caught by Hu Qing’s staff.","Amplified by a secret technique, this strike directly halved Xilu’s divine power.","Xilu was rendered completely incapable of fighting.","“Hiss...” Ye Xiaowang couldn’t help but gasp when he saw this.","That staff strike just now, if it had been him, he would have perished.","The mysterious strong man before him was too terrifying; the two of them didn’t even have the ability to resist.","Suspended in the void, with only half his body left and unable to even regenerate his flesh, Xilu’s eyes were about to burst. Clenching his single fist, he raved, “Kill me! If you kill me, my blood will stain the entire Northern Starry Sky. If you dare, kill me!”","“This is the first time I’ve heard such a request!” Hu Qing sent out a huge wave of energy with one hand, suppressing Xilu’s divine power to its lowest again. “But I can’t grant it!”","When the Realm King entrusted this task to him, he had said not to kill Xilu in the Northern Starry Sky.","It was best to seal him first.","After sealing, he would be sent to the Realm God Continent for execution.","The Realm God Continent, akin to the Divine Realm of the subsidiary spacetime, was the ultimate place for All Things and much more stable than the subsidiary spacetime.","By the time Xilu was executed there, there would be no backlash. Even if there was, it couldn’t affect the Realm God Continent.","Moreover, the Realm God Continent housed mechanical beings that could disperse this blood energy.","“Ye Xiaowang, someone wants to give you a chance. Bring your daughter Ye Lingxiao here, and all past grievances will be forgiven!” Hu Qing stood in the void, speaking calmly.","Sealing Xilu required a person and a supreme treasure.","Ye Lingxiao, who wielded the blood-colored Origin Source, was needed to seal Xilu.","She would be reborn then, and the Realm King had already promised to reshape her Origin Source.","However, the reshaped Origin Source would be that of an Emperor.","With the Realm King’s help, Ye Lingxiao could cultivate to the Fifth Tribulation again, or even higher.","Upon hearing Hu Qing’s words, Ye Xiaowang didn’t hesitate and agreed immediately.","He had no chance to resist now.","With a single hand, he summoned Ye Lingxiao from Long Night City.","Originally resting in the clan residence, Ye Lingxiao suddenly appeared in the dark void, somewhat dazed. Before she could comprehend the situation, she saw her ancestor and a mutilated monster.","“Old Ancestor?” Ye Lingxiao glanced at the Old Ancestor and felt an overwhelming aura rising behind her.","Seeing that it was Hu Qing, she couldn’t help but shudder.","She had long guessed that the other party would have ulterior motives but didn’t expect it to happen so quickly.","Ye Xiaowang casually tossed Ye Lingxiao over and respectfully said, “Dao Friend, I suppose there’s nothing more for me here, right?”","“Alright, you may leave!” Hu Qing steadily caught Ye Lingxiao, no longer paying attention to Ye Xiaowang. Instead, he gently said, “Forgive me!”","Before Ye Lingxiao could react, Hu Qing reached out with one hand, thrusting it into her abdomen and extracting a complete Origin Source.","A blood-red Origin Source, with blood dripping down.","Buzz!","Ye Lingxiao’s divine body trembled, and her Life force began to drain away.","“No!”","A roar of unwillingness echoed from the depths of spacetime.","A massive pyramid instantly descended.","The spinning pyramid came to a stable stop, and the recent scene caused Wanyan’s face to change dramatically.","“Hmm?” Only then did Hu Qing realize someone had arrived. Seeing the pyramid, although he couldn’t sense the specific aura, he knew who was inside!","As the pyramid had just arrived, Jian Wushuang also tore through spacetime to get there.","Seeing Hu Qing present, his heart leaped with joy. It was effortless—all the people had gathered.","But when he saw the corpse in Hu Qing’s hands, he froze on the spot.","Then he saw Wanyan rush out of the pyramid like a madman.","Hu Qing wanted to explain, but there was no time. He had to seal Xilu immediately because the blood-red Origin Source wouldn’t last long.","He had said he wouldn’t harm Ye Lingxiao; this blood-red Origin Source was a disaster within her body and had to be removed.","The person wasn’t truly dead but would reincarnate and obtain a better Origin Source.","By then, he would make amends, even if it meant setting up a grand banquet to apologize, but he couldn’t ignore the Realm King’s request.","Faced with the enraged Wanyan, he could only seal the spacetime, blocking him.","At this moment, Wu Zuo and Dongsheng also rushed out of the pyramid, stopping Wanyan."]},{"number":6019,"title":"Chapter 6019: Ye Lingxiao’s Fall","paragraphs":["Chapter 6019: Ye Lingxiao’s Fall","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang also reacted, breaking Hu Qing’s sealed spacetime with a single hand and questioning, “Hu Qing, what are you doing?”","Although he had initially thought of using Ye Lingxiao to enhance his own divine power, he had never intended to harm her!","He had always pursued a win-win situation.","Why had Hu Qing turned into a killer?","This wasn’t Hu Qing’s character.","Having known Hu Qing for so many years, he couldn’t believe Hu Qing would do such a thing. But the facts were right in front of him; what could he do but question him?","They hadn’t returned to Qishen Temple yet, and he didn’t want to cause any discord midway.","“Brother Wushuang, I will give you an explanation, but not now!” Hu Qing, holding the blood-colored Origin Source, handed Ye Lingxiao’s corpse to Jian Wushuang. Then, he formed seals with his hands and began preparing to seal Xilu.","Holding the cold corpse, Jian Wushuang sighed and glanced at the monster. He was sure it was the one that had escaped from him.","Xilu, too, noticed Jian Wushuang. His eyes were filled with complexity, and he turned to look at the blood-colored Origin Source in Hu Qing’s hand, his greed evident.","If he could devour this Origin Source, he might reach the peak of the first stage.","Hu Qing formed seals and glanced at the still-present Ye Xiaowang. With a casual wave, he forcibly extracted the treasure from Ye Xiaowang’s body.","A blood-colored crystal.","It closely resembled the one atop the pyramid.","Seeing all this, Jian Wushuang seemed to understand. He brought Ye Lingxiao’s corpse to Wanyan’s side.","“Wanyan, don’t worry. As long as her soul hasn’t returned to the River of Time, I can help you revive her!” Wu Zuo comforted from the side.","As long as there was a soul, he could ask the Realm King for help. The Realm King could assist in Ye Lingxiao’s reincarnation.","But her memories might be lost.","Jian Wushuang didn’t know how to comfort him, so he just patted his shoulder.","Everything depended on Hu Qing’s explanation.","He had no other way.","Meanwhile, Hu Qing confronted Xilu, who was seriously injured. Jian Wushuang was curious.","Why were these two fighting? Logically, they shouldn’t have any conflict!","Everyone else was also very surprised.","At this moment, a phantom descended from above.","Dressed in dark green, with antennae on his forehead, it was the projection of the Realm King.","Seeing the Realm King appear, Jian Wushuang reacted immediately.","Pulling Wu Zuo along, he hurried forward.","“Greetings, Realm King!” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands in salute.","Wuzuo, now acting more respectfully, exchanged pleasantries before bringing up Ye Lingxiao’s reincarnation.","Realm King smiled faintly and pressed his palm down, “Rest assured, I have already prepared a new Origin Source and body for her. She has successfully reincarnated!”","The reason for the delay was because he went to guide Ye Lingxiao’s soul to reincarnate.","And upon birth, she would be an Emperor.","She possessed the Ultimate Origin Source.","For Realm King, this was not difficult.","Upon hearing this, Wanyan hurried forward, gratitude evident in his eyes.","If he had known that Ye Lingxiao’s death was orchestrated by Realm King, he might not have felt this way.","In truth, everything behind the scenes was Realm King’s plan.","Ye Lingxiao’s appearance by Wanyan’s side was also his doing.","“Alright, once Hu Qing seals Xilu, let him explain to you!” Realm King’s expression was indifferent, but he was thinking that after Hu Qing sealed Xilu, he would take Xilu directly back to the Realm God Continent.","He would leave the remaining explanations to Hu Qing.","He couldn’t be both the good guy and the bad guy.","The honest Hu Qing would take on everything.","Only then did everyone carefully look at Hu Qing and Xilu.","Wu Zuo exclaimed, “Hu Qing, how did you become so strong?”","Exceeding 15 million divine power, overwhelming everything.","Far stronger than Divine Wood King.","Currently the number one in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Only slightly weaker than those Eternal Beings.","“This power, it’s somewhat strange?” Jian Wushuang noticed through Hu Qing’s divine power that there was something peculiar about it.","That power indeed belonged to Hu Qing, yet it wasn’t exactly Hu Qing’s current power.","19 million divine power—this level of battle strength was something only Chi Jiuxiao had achieved before.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but marvel.","He had thought his own abilities were already extraordinary, but it turned out Hu Qing’s strength was just as formidable.","Seeing their astonishment, Realm King explained, “This is Hu Qing’s secret technique. His true self isn’t this powerful, but he possesses the battle strength of the peak of the Eighth Tribulation!”","“Secret technique?” Jian Wushuang was moved, “What kind of secret technique is this powerful!”","At the peak of the Eighth Tribulation, having 12 million divine power was impressive.","The limit was 15 million divine power, but achieving that was extremely difficult.","How long had Hu Qing been cultivating?","“Future Self!” Realm King clasped his hands behind his back, a look of pride on his face. “With my guidance and the power left behind by that Celestial Maiden, Hu Qing created the ultimate secret technique of the Heavenly Dao, the Future Self, which allows him to harness future divine power!”","In other words, Hu Qing in the future could reach this level.","Jian Wushuang quickly grasped the key point and sighed, “To overdraw future power, there must be backlash, right?”","“Yes, there is indeed backlash, but his Heavenly Dao has been cultivated to perfection. Unfortunately, he was born in the wrong era. If it were in the past, I might have had to relinquish my position as Realm King!” The Realm King couldn’t help but lament.","Jian Wushuang was not too surprised. Hu Qing had always had a profound understanding of Zen, and the end of that path was the Heavenly Dao.","This also made him think of that eyeball.","The eyeball transformed from the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","The Spacetime Dao within the chessboard turned into the Tribulation Armor.","The eyeball was the essence of the chessboard.","With such reliance, he felt at ease handing the eyeball to Hu Qing.","Hu Qing had the strength to wield this supreme treasure.","Although this supreme treasure was left by Teacher Xuan Yi, it was indeed not suitable for him.","He could only give it to Hu Qing to use.","Now, Hu Qing had the strength.","Future Self!","Clad in white robes, unstained by dust, his divine power could shake the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Hu Qing formed a seal with one hand and held a blood-colored crystal with the other.","Although Ye Xiaowang was unwilling, he dared not step forward.","Compared to handing the treasure to Xilu, he trusted Hu Qing more.","Because there was no murderous intent on Hu Qing.","Even though Ye Lingxiao had died at Hu Qing’s hands, he still believed Hu Qing would not harm him.","The key was that facing such a powerful Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, if he wanted him dead, it wouldn’t take more than a breath to finish him off.","Hu Qing really didn’t care about him.","As the seal and the blood-colored crystal merged, combined with the blood-colored Origin Source, Hu Qing whispered, “Demon Sealing Wave!”","Buzz!","The surrounding spacetime was instantly shattered.","The originally intact Primordial Black Heaven was no longer whole.","In the void, there was a patch of paleness.","The twisted spacetime turned into a tornado, rushing towards Xilu.","Trying to seal him.","This was the sealing method taught by Realm King, and it was the only way to seal and send Xilu away."]},{"number":6020,"title":"Chapter 6020: Future Self","paragraphs":["Chapter 6020: Future Self","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Because the opponent didn’t belong to the Northern Spacetime but came from the more powerful Southern Spacetime.","Even in the Southern Spacetime, Xilu was a terrifying existence.","Created by the Machine Clan, he accidentally drifted into the Northern Spacetime.","At first, Realm King didn’t notice it. It was only because of the appearance of the pyramid and the faint aura it leaked that Realm King discovered that there was a similar power in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It was Xilu’s power.","Fortunately, the opponent hadn’t become a complete form and could be sealed.","Otherwise, the entire Northern Spacetime could have faced destruction.","“Damn it!” Xilu had no way to resist the seal, and his physical body was already in shambles, making it impossible to escape.","Just as he was in despair, a glimmer of opportunity appeared in his eyes.","It was a power from the Ancient Moon ruins.","Xilu mobilized the last bit of divine power within him, and his appearance instantly changed to that of a Celestial Maiden.","This was the power he had absorbed when the Ancient Moon ruins disappeared.","When this power emerged, Hu Qing’s technique paused momentarily.","Xilu’s face lit up with joy. “Now’s the time!”","He spread his hands, and from the vortex of the seal, there was an endless blood force.","It could seal him, but he could also absorb it!","The reason he had been severely injured was probably to prevent him from absorbing the blood power within the seal.","The blood treasure and the Blood Origin Source.","These were necessary treasures for Xilu to become a complete form in the first stage.","Once absorbed, he could step into the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Realm King noticed something was wrong and hurriedly shouted, “Hu Qing, don’t hesitate, act now!”","But it was too late.","At such a critical moment, hesitating for even a breath’s time could result in a major mistake, not to mention that Hu Qing had underestimated Xilu’s power.","He originally thought the opponent was powerless, but he didn’t expect Xilu to actively absorb the scarlet blood power.","“Haha, thanks for helping me!” Xilu crazily absorbed the blood force, laughing maniacally, “You’re all going to die!”","Buzz!","The seal was shattered.","In the deep void, Hu Qing’s true self directly appeared.","It merged with his future self.","Divine power erupted once more.","“Senior Realm King, I’m sorry to disappoint you!” Hu Qing said regretfully, “I can only keep him in the Northern Spacetime!”","The original plan was to send him to the Realm God Continent and then destroy him.","But now that it was uncontrollable, he could only kill him on the spot.","Although this would leave a hidden danger, it was better than letting him become a complete form.","Realm King panicked at this moment and hurriedly persuaded, “Don’t! Let him become a complete form, I can still send him out of the Northern Spacetime.”","However, at that time, he would no longer be able to kill Xilu.","But as long as it didn’t endanger the Northern Spacetime, Realm King couldn’t care less.","Hu Qing was momentarily stunned but did not follow Realm King’s suggestion. Instead, he proactively attacked Xilu.","Now, Xilu had only recovered to his peak and was far from being Hu Qing’s match.","With his future self, Hu Qing’s divine power directly exploded to 20 million.","This was also the limit that the Northern Spacetime could bear.","Xilu, who had just recovered to his peak, was again severely injured in his divine body. He turned and threatened Realm King, “Northern Realm King, in my inherited memory, you exist. You are a dead man. If I fall in the Northern Spacetime, I, Xilu, swear to make your Northern Spacetime collapse. Stop that lunatic, and I promise to leave the Northern Spacetime once I become a complete form!”","Jian Wushuang and the others were bewildered, not knowing what was happening.","The situation suddenly reversed.","Realm King was hesitating.","The complete form of Xilu was terrifying, but dying in his Northern Spacetime was even more terrifying.","He couldn’t make a choice.","“No, there’s another way!” Jian Wushuang stepped forward at this moment. He had been observing for a long time and finally understood the situation. “Realm King, don’t forget that the Northern Spacetime can bear life divine power up to 20 million. Even if Xilu reaches his complete form, he won’t exceed 20 million. At that time, let the three Eternal Beings seal him together, wouldn’t that work?”","After all, the limit was 20 million divine power. By then, with four against one, how could they lose?","Four super strong beings could drive the opponent away.","Realm King’s expression was very uncomfortable. He had considered this idea, but mainly because the opponent was a special creation from the Southern Spacetime, he didn’t dare to gamble.","It was better to send Xilu away now.","“It’s best not to view Xilu with common sense. His creator is someone you wouldn’t even dare to imagine. If anything goes wrong, the Northern Spacetime is finished!” Realm King frowned, rejecting Jian Wushuang’s suggestion.","Beside him, Wu Zuo didn’t seem to care at all, adopting a defeatist attitude, he said, “At worst, we can just run away to the Realm God Continent. I don’t see what’s so good about the Northern Spacetime anyway, even the Ninth Tribulation realm can’t exist here!”","Smack!","Realm King lifted his foot and fiercely knocked on Wu Zuo’s head, cursing, “Don’t forget, your soul comes from the Northern Spacetime. If the Northern Spacetime is gone, do you think you can survive?”","To stay alive!","It might be possible.","Their Soul Origin Source came from the Northern Spacetime, but it wasn’t bound to it.","But if they really did that, they would likely lose any hope of advancement.","If their Origin Source Universe was gone, they could rely on the path of resurrection.","If the Origin Source of the Northern Spacetime was gone, then the practitioners of the Northern Spacetime would truly have no path of cultivation left.","After realizing the gravity of the situation, everyone turned to look at Realm King.","It was clear that they agreed with his course of action.","They would send Xilu away first.","No matter what happened next.","As long as it wasn’t in the Northern Spacetime, it wouldn’t be their problem.","“I’ll go stop Hu Qing!” Jian Wushuang reached out and summoned the pyramid, then turned to Realm King and said, “I can launch an attack of the secret realm level, but it requires a large amount of Black Radiance Essence. We don’t have this in the Northern Spacetime, Realm King, you must give me enough Black Radiance Essence!”","Realm King, upon hearing this, finally remembered that Jian Wushuang still possessed the Machine Clan’s treasure, the ‘Pyramid’.","With a swish, tens of thousands of Black Essence Crystals appeared. “Make sure to stop Hu Qing for me!”","“Rest assured!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Hu Qing was now unwilling to bear the crime and thus wanted to leave Xilu behind.","A blue aura erupted, directly performing the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Jian Wushuang stood behind Hu Qing, with the pyramid hovering above him.","“Babata, do not attack without my order!” He didn’t plan to attack Hu Qing; persuading him was still the best option.","The words he had just spoken to Realm King were only for the sake of the Black Radiance Essence.","However, he also believed Realm King was right—sending away the scourge Xilu was much better than keeping him.","“Hu Qing, stop!”","His voice was solemn, and he looked at Hu Qing with steady eyes.","At this moment, Hu Qing, who was frantically attacking, was also somewhat helpless against Xilu.","His attacks couldn’t keep up with Xilu’s absorption.","His divine power had already surpassed 15 million, reaching an astonishing 18 million."]},{"number":6021,"title":"Chapter 6021: The Soft-Hearted Hu Qing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6021: The Soft-Hearted Hu Qing","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Brother Wushuang!” Hu Qing turned his head and saw Jian Wushuang. His heart leapt with joy, and he quickly said, “Brother Wushuang, if you leave Xilu here now, there’s still hope. Hurry...”","Before Hu Qing could finish speaking, Jian Wushuang interrupted him, “Hu Qing, you need to see the situation clearly. This is the Northern Spacetime, our homeland. Do you want to leave a permanent scourge here?”","“Brother Wushuang...” Hu Qing’s expression shifted. He didn’t want to leave a disaster in the Northern Spacetime, but he also didn’t want this calamity to wreak havoc elsewhere.","This was the Northern Spacetime, where he could still exert some control.","If Xilu reached the Realm God Continent, it would be over.","No one would be able to suppress him.","And there would be no limit of 20 million units of divine power.","“I understand all of this!” Jian Wushuang’s tone was heavy. “But don’t forget, the powerhouses on the Realm God Continent are much stronger than you, and with all the gods gathered there, it’s not as terrifying as you think. If we stop now and let Realm King send him away, it’s still not too late!”","But Hu Qing felt a pang of guilt.","This time, he really had to take the blame.","Seeing the hesitation in Hu Qing’s expression, Jian Wushuang pressed his advantage, “Don’t worry. Once we get to the Realm God Continent, we’ll have a chance to defeat Xilu. But here in the Northern Spacetime, it’s not possible. Listen to me—after we resolve the Qishen Temple issue, I’ll go with you to the Realm God Continent to face Xilu together. It’s been a long time since we’ve fought side by side, brother!”","“But...” Hu Qing was still hesitant.","“No buts!” Jian Wushuang shouted angrily, “If Xilu dies in the Northern Spacetime, our homeland is finished. If he goes to the Realm God Continent, we won’t have that worry. You need to understand what’s important!”","As he spoke, Jian Wushuang also observed the changes in Xilu. The opponent was still continuously absorbing the blood-red power, and his divine power had reached 19 million.","Even if Hu Qing took action now, he wouldn’t be able to kill Xilu.","In the end, Hu Qing did not persist and lowered his head.","Realm King, on the other hand, took out a super spatial teleportation array, ready at any moment.","As soon as Hu Qing stopped, he would move Xilu into the array, and then Xilu could be sent to the Realm God Continent.","“Now!” Jian Wushuang quickly transmitted a reminder to Realm King.","Unfortunately, this time, Xilu didn’t want to comply.","Realm King took the initiative to contact Xilu, wanting to send him away, but his offer was refused.","“After fighting for so long, you want me to leave?” Xilu revealed a fierce expression. “You sure have some nerve!”","His divine power erupted once again, reaching a staggering 20 million.","Hu Qing turned around to find that Xilu’s divine power had surpassed his own, his expression changing accordingly.","“What’s going on?” Jian Wushuang was about to inquire with Realm King when a streak of light pierced through his chest directly.","Even his Tribulation Armor couldn’t withstand it.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s divine body shattered into pieces.","Xilu made his move.","While absorbing the power of blood, he attacked the crowd.","One of the streaks of light happened to hit Jian Wushuang.","As for Hu Qing, he could easily fend off Xilu’s attacks; after all, Xilu hadn’t achieved his full potential yet, his divine power only equal to Hu Qing’s.","But others couldn’t withstand such an assault.","Boom!","Hu Qing’s divine power erupted once again, transforming into numerous phantoms to help others fend off the attack.","“It’s over!” Realm King’s face turned ashen; he had already notified the three Eternal Beings to come.","But Xilu’s divine power was still growing.","When the three Eternal?Beings arrived, it would only mean death.","Because Xilu’s divine power had completely surpassed 20 million, reaching the Ninth Tribulation level.","“Tsk tsk, complete form!” His whole body radiated a golden light, charging forward to attack Hu Qing.","Every move he made caused the entire Northern Spacetime to tremble.","All practitioners felt the terrifying power emanating from him.","Hum!","Before everything erupted, Babata controlled the golden pyramid to envelop Jian Wushuang inside.","And he arranged a healing chamber to revive Jian Wushuang.","The previous attack had directly shattered not only his divine body but also his origin source. Jian Wushuang couldn’t even muster his divine power, let alone his life force.","“Master!” Seeing Jian Wushuang wake up from unconsciousness, Babata hurried forward.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power was extremely weak, unable to mobilize the Origin Source. Now, Xilu was almost like how Chi Jiuxiao was at his peak.","How could he withstand the opponent’s attacks?","“Babata, unleash your strongest attack, target Xilu, spare no effort!” Jian Wushuang struggled to get up and saw Xilu outside, fear evident in his eyes.","Xilu was not Chi Jiuxiao; he possessed absolute intelligence.","Trying to outsmart him was simply impossible.","Only a direct strong attack would work.","Babata silently prayed, willing to sacrifice everything, and disappeared from the control room.","Mobilizing the essence of myriad dark brilliance, preparing to go all out.","A secret realm-level attack now had little effect on Chi Jiuxiao.","Only a cosmic-level attack could kill him.","Babata gathered the Black Radiance Essence, condensing the power of the entire pyramid, and even the red crystals trembled.","With full force, a cosmic-level attack.","A strike with 30 million divine power.","Enough to annihilate everything.","Destroying the Ancient Moon Spacetime would be a matter of moments.","Realm King also noticed the reaction from the pyramid’s side, feeling a glimmer of hope.","“Hu Qing, step aside!” Jian Wushuang’s voice lacked strength.","He almost perished from that last strike.","If they didn’t fight desperately now, they would all perish here.","Originally, he just wanted to acquire some scarlet blood power to enhance his divine power, but he didn’t expect things to escalate to this extent.","In the void, Hu Qing was still battling the first-phase complete form of Xilu. Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s message, he was also somewhat surprised.","“Step aside!” Jian Wushuang roared with all his strength, a red button appearing within reach.","Babata said heavily, “Master, everything is ready, the cosmic-level attack can be launched at any time!”","Snap!","Seeing Hu Qing step aside, Jian Wushuang pressed the red button directly, only then realizing that this attack was at the cosmic level.","The entire pyramid erupted with a dazzling red light.","A blue beam shot into the sky.","A blue aura.","That was the power of the Starry Sky.","Seeing this scene, even Realm King was extremely surprised!","Hard to believe.","A strike containing 30 million divine power erupted instantly.","The blue beam soared towards Xilu.","“Huh?” Xilu hadn’t even had time to be astonished before he felt the fragmentation of divine power.","As a complete form, Xilu possessed a divine power of 23 million.","He was already at the level of the Ninth Tribulation.","But facing a strike with 30 million divine power, he too would perish.","In that moment, he regretted!","“Realm King of the North, I’m willing to leave, hurry and send me away!” Xilu struggled to block with both arms and shouted loudly at Realm King, “If I perish here, your North Spacetime will be doomed. Remember, I was created by Zamasu. He will come after you.”","Initially, Realm King had given up, ready to let Xilu perish in the Northern Spacetime."]},{"number":6022,"title":"Chapter 6022: Sending Xilu Away","paragraphs":["Chapter 6022: Sending Xilu Away","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Because he knew the relationship between Jian Wushuang and Weiss was extraordinary, perhaps Weiss would take action to eliminate Xilu.","Now, upon hearing about Zamasu, his heart lit up.","Zamasu was an extraordinary existence, more troublesome than letting the blood-red power invade the Northern Spacetime.","Realm King’s mind stirred, and he said coldly, “Do not resist!”","Before Xilu, who was resisting attacks from afar, was completely shattered, a trace of divine power entered the super array.","That was Xilu’s core.","Swish!","Buzz!","A loud hum sounded, and the great array activated, causing Xilu to completely disappear from the Northern Spacetime.","However, the cosmic-level attack emanating from the pyramid did not stop.","Relentlessly, after losing its target, it surged straight into the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Wherever it passed, spacetime shattered.","It directly pierced through the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime, only stopping when it reached the desolate land.","Xilu disappeared, leaving behind only some remnants of the blood-red power, staining the Primordial Black Heaven.","This was easily solved.","If Xilu had died in the Northern Spacetime, at least one Ancient Moon Spacetime would have been stained red.","At that time, there would be no way to remedy it.","Now it was simple, just clear away the blood-red power.","This blood-red power was like rootless water.","Very easy to handle.","Inside the pyramid.","Jian Wushuang recovered his Origin Source and then mobilized the power of Life to restore his divine power.","“Phew!” Looking at the weak Babata in front of him, without guessing, he knew that the pyramid was probably severely damaged, and the Black Radiance Essence obtained from Realm King was also exhausted.","No!","There were still the original seventeen sides.","Patting Babata’s head, he moved his figure and directly left the pyramid.","Outside, the blood-red horror was disturbing the Primordial Black Heaven.","But except for Hu Qing, everyone else’s faces showed victorious smiles.","This battle, they won!","In the Northern Spacetime, victory was achieved.","However, victory eluded them.","“Hu Qing!” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, noticing the embarrassment and guilt on the other’s face.","But that didn’t matter much.","In the future, when his own strength grew, he would deal with Xilu himself.","There was no need for guilt.","Realm King appeared pleased at this moment, approaching Hu Qing and patting his shoulder. “Young man, don’t be under pressure!”","Then he turned to Jian Wushuang. “Jian Wushuang, I owe you a favor this time. The matter with Xilu is not as simple as you think. 100,000 eras ago, I dealt with a troublesome fellow, even more formidable than Xilu. But now, the Northern Spacetime should be free of such threats. You can safely return to Qishen Temple to deal with the Starry Sky God of Death who arrived from the future!”","“Alright!” Jian Wushuang listened quietly, not saying much.","“Well, there are still some matters to attend to. I’ll take my leave now. The blood energy here is precious, don’t waste it!” Realm King felt a bit embarrassed as he left hastily, handing Jian Wushuang a small green bottle. “Inject the blood red power into this bottle. It should enhance your divine power!”","With that, he left hurriedly.","Wu Zuo and the others followed slowly.","No one said much.","After returning to the pyramid together and calming down for a while, Jian Wushuang spoke up. “Anyway, we’ve dealt with a big problem in the Northern Spacetime this time. There’s no need for everyone to feel guilty!”","“Yeah, if you really feel bad about it, we can all go to the Realm God Continent together in the future and reclaim our honor!” Wu Zuo chimed in.","Eight people.","Perhaps only Hu Qing truly felt remorse.","As for the Lord Guangying, he was fine; he hadn’t participated.","Dongsheng and Wanyan didn’t care either; they had no intention of going to the Realm God Continent.","After all, it was too distant.","At least an Eighth Tribulation was necessary, and the Northern Spacetime was sufficient to support them to that level with low danger.","There was no need to venture into the Realm God Continent.","Although Wutian, with his considerable strength, harbored thoughts of going to the Realm God Continent, he wasn’t confident about Xilu.","However, he was confident about another thing. Wutian believed that killing Xilu was to prove his strength rather than serving any so-called Dao Heart.","Hu Qing, on the other hand, was trapped by his Dao Heart.","He felt sorry for the strong ones of the Realm God Continent.","By sending a scourge to the Realm God Continent, he preserved the Northern Spacetime.","“Hu Qing, rest assured, I promised, and I have never broken my word. Once the matters of Qishen Temple are settled, I will accompany you to the Realm God Continent to deal with Xilu!” This time, he was determined.","Seeing Hu Qing surpass him again, he also felt competitive.","He wanted to become stronger.","Wu Zuo, on the side, was staring at the green bottle in Jian Wushuang’s hand, unable to help saying, “Why don’t we go clean up those blood essences first!”","Blood essences contained the purest divine power, which couldn’t be wasted.","Although Jian Wushuang’s expression turned a bit unpleasant upon hearing this, feeling Wu Zuo was too impatient, deep down, he was more anxious than anyone.","“Ahem!” He cleared his throat and casually tossed the bottle to Wu Zuo. “You guys go clean up first, I’ll check the damage inside the pyramid. Hu Qing, stay and help me!”","“No problem, leave it to me!” Wu Zuo took the bottle and left the pyramid with his men.","Jian Wushuang then took Hu Qing to inspect the issues within the pyramid.","There was no time for repairs now. They had intended to ask Realm King for help, but he had left too quickly.","So, they took matters into their own hands to see what could be fixed.","And they also took the opportunity to discuss what had happened over the years.","Various incidents in the Ancient Moon Ruins.","Finally, they brought up the issue of Jiang Shang.","He got the correct answer.","Jiang Shang was indeed the reincarnation of a celestial maiden, but just a remnant soul.","Meanwhile, chaos reigned outside.","Strongmen from all over the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands came to investigate.","Upon seeing Wu Zuo, they refrained from approaching and were persuaded to leave by him.","The Ancient Black Heaven was finished.","The Ye family and the Blood Robe Sect had to relocate.","19 eight-star sects.","Only the Blood Robe Sect lost its territory.","Although the Ancient Moon Ruins had also suffered losses, only the core was vanished, leaving a significant portion of the territory intact, including their stronghold.","Ye Xiaowang suffered heavy losses this time, losing treasures and their home.","But they could do nothing about it.","Like dogs with no home, they were driven away from the Primordial Black Heaven by Wu Zuo.","Now the Primordial Black Heaven couldn’t be called the Black Heaven anymore; it was the Blood Heaven.","Even after the absorption of blood essences into the jade bottle, a strong color remained.","And those fragments of spacetime kept drifting. This place wasn’t suitable for cultivation anymore. Clearing the blood essences aside, this area would become a dangerous place in the future.","Apart from the Ye family, other strongmen were quite excited.","Seeing others fall while they progressed felt more comfortable.","Especially considering the bad reputation of the Ye family and the Blood Robe Sect.","The power of blood came to a halt, mainly because of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","The carrier was a mechanical life from the Southern Spacetime who happened to bring the power of blood with them."]},{"number":6023,"title":"Chapter 6023: “Zamasu?”","paragraphs":["Chapter 6023: “Zamasu?”","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This matter could not be thought about in detail. If one thought about it closely, it would be discovered that the Southern Spacetime had a kind of animosity towards the Northern Spacetime.","The bloody aura was a unique interest of physical life.","Xilu relied on this bloody aura to enhance his divine power. It had to be said that the strong individual who created this guy definitely targeted flesh and blood life forms.","“Zamasu!” Jian Wushuang silently recited this name inside the pyramid and remembered it in his heart.","Even Northern Realm King was extremely apprehensive. The strength and status of the other party were probably quite extraordinary.","After checking the pyramid, Jian Wushuang brought Hu Qing to the resting cabin.","“Hu Qing, how about this? From now on, we will take the pyramid back to Qishen Temple. It will take about four eras to reach the Original Universe!” Jian Wushuang said proudly.","This was currently the fastest method.","In fact, if he asked, it wouldn’t be impossible for the Realm King to teleport them to the Original Universe, but that would lose the fun.","Some things needed to be done by oneself.","Hu Qing sat cross-legged on a mat, his face returned to normal, and he smiled faintly, “I’ll follow Brother Wushuang’s arrangements for everything!”","“Your strength is the strongest now. We’ll still need to rely on you in the future!” Jian Wushuang said politely, then asked seriously, “Hu Qing, did you discover anything in the Ancient Moon Ruins?”","His words had another meaning. He was not only curious but also wanted to understand the thoughts of that Celestial Maiden.","Otherwise, when facing Jiang Shang after returning, he wouldn’t know how to act.","Hu Qing understood as well. After taking a deep breath, he replied, “Brother Wushuang, I will handle Jiang Shang’s matter myself. Don’t worry, I have a plan!”","“Good!” Jian Wushuang heard this and didn’t say more, but he didn’t truly believe it in his heart. If Hu Qing had a plan, Xilu would have died long ago.","Sometimes, one couldn’t afford to be soft-hearted.","Initially, he hoped that Jiang Shang, for Hu Qing’s sake, could break away from Mie Sheng.","Now, it seemed that was not possible.","The two chatted casually for a while, then began their cultivation.","Once the bloody power was fully absorbed, they would set off immediately!","They had waited for this moment for a long time.","Several million eras.","They didn’t know how Qishen Temple was now!","The bloody aura of the Primordial Black Heaven had taken tens of thousands of years to be completely cleansed.","If Xilu had indeed perished here, the cleansing time wouldn’t match the spreading time.","By then, the entire world would have been invaded by the bloody aura.","That would have been a big trouble.","Fortunately, they had finally sent Xilu away, and Realm King had personally gone to clean up the aftermath. It was uncertain if it could be resolved.","If it was resolved, then it had nothing to do with them. If not, they would still have to deal with it in the future.","10,000 years passed in an instant.","The blood aura had been cleared away.","The group sat together in a circle. Except for Hu Qing, everyone else was extremely interested in the blood aura.","At this moment, it was as if they had returned to the scene in Qishen Temple, sitting around the bones of Dong Jun.","It was the same when they arrived, and now it was the same upon their return.","They hoped that this return battle would go smoothly.","Hu Qing had cultivated a future self, and with a divine power of 20 million, he had already reached the limit of the Northern Spacetime.","Even if Mie Sheng was at the same level, they still had a chance to protect themselves.","“Everyone, don’t hold back, go ahead!” Wu Zuo said with a greedy look on his face, already a bit impatient.","This blood-colored aura could increase one’s basic divine power.","And because of Xilu’s influence, the divine power increased by this blood aura was extremely pure, capable of breaking the limit of one’s realm.","Back then, the limit for Emperor Jian Wushuang was only 200,000, but in the end, he was able to reach 400,000.","Everyone was eager, starting to absorb the blood-colored aura.","The weakest among them were Dongsheng and Wanyan.","Their basic divine power was the weakest, so they absorbed it the fastest.","They quickly reached one and a half million.","As Sixth Tribulation Universe Masters, their basic divine power was 1.5 million, and with secret techniques, they could break through to 2 million divine power.","The strength of these two saw a significant leap.","They directly rivaled the peak of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Then there were Gu Qianluo and Lord Guangying, whose divine power was similar, both peaking at over 2.3 million.","Now, their basic divine power broke through to 1.8 million, and at their peak, they could burst out with over 2.8 million.","This was already the limit of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Their improvement this time was indeed substantial.","If they had purely relied on cultivation, it would have taken at least until the Seventh Tribulation realm to achieve such power.","Seeing Hu Qing’s limit made them realize they still needed to work hard.","After this great improvement, they also gained confidence in themselves.","“So quickly, already done?” Wu Zuo laughed aloud, “This blood aura hasn’t even been used up by one ten-thousandth, everyone, keep going!”","Wutian, on the other hand, sneered from the side, “Hmph, it’s not like you absorbed that much either!”","“Want to test it, Tongtian?” Wu Zuo’s face darkened as he clenched his fist, his basic divine power already surpassing the 2 million mark.","Since the change in Tongtian, Wu Zuo still called the other by his old title, making Wutian quite uncomfortable.","Both were at the Seventh Tribulation realm, and their strengths were similar.","Originally, Wu Zuo was slightly stronger than Wutian, but now that Wutian had absorbed more of the blood-colored aura, he could stand shoulder to shoulder with Wu Zuo.","It was a pity that Zhen Wuyang did not come, and Fan Tianfeng had also fallen.","Otherwise, these two should not be weaker than Wu Zuo.","Although two people were missing, Jian Wushuang was still very pleased, having gathered eight people to return together.","They did not fail Zhen Ling’s trust.","It was just a bit late.","“Whoosh!” His basic divine power was also constantly increasing, breaking through the 2 million mark without any sign of stopping.","Back then, under the Emperor’s limit, he could double his power.","This time was no different.","As his basic divine power continued to soar, his divine body fully accepted it.","He reached 3 million in basic divine power in one go.","He still had the capacity to absorb more, but he chose to stop.","Doubling it was enough.","A Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm with 3 million in basic divine power.","It was worth noting that there were four other equally heaven-defying Sixth Tribulation masters here, but their basic divine power was just over 2 million, and at their peak, no more than 3 million.","However, Jian Wushuang could achieve 3 million in basic divine power, and at his peak, he could reach tens of millions.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang suddenly stood up, clenched his fists, and shouted in a low voice, “Beast God’s Power!”","Red light enveloped his entire body.","His divine power surged by another 30,000.","“Ten times!”","Boom!","His aura shook the entire pyramid.","At this moment, Babata flew over, exclaiming, “6 million divine power!”","Without using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, he could unleash 6 million in divine power.","With a basic divine power of 3 million, performing the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation could now achieve 8 million.","Plus the amplification from the Origin Source Dao Arena.","Three universes could amplify by 60 percent, reaching about 13 million."]},{"number":6024,"title":"Chapter 6024: Taixu Secret Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 6024: Taixu Secret Realm","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Brother Wushuang!” Wu Zuo was pushed back by the aura, and after steadying himself, he exclaimed, “Why has your divine power turned dark red? Wasn’t it blue before?”","He was aware of Jian Wushuang’s peak secret technique, but now it was red, and it was the power of the Beast God, indicating that he hadn’t used his peak secret technique.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang withdrew his aura and said calmly, “This is the power of the Beast God, I just tried it by chance!”","However, the others looked incredibly shocked.","Even Gu Qianluo, who was once ambitious, lowered his head in self-admission of inferiority.","Among those present, only Hu Qing could compare with Jian Wushuang.","“Hu Qing, what is your base divine power?” Jian Wushuang looked at Hu Qing, wanting to know his base divine power.","“10 million!” Hu Qing replied calmly.","Wu Zuo and the others secretly clicked their tongues in amazement.","“Monsters, you are all monsters!”","The few stopped paying attention to Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, each returning to absorb the blood-colored aura, aiming to reach their extreme state.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t too surprised after hearing 10 million.","A base divine power of 10 million, coupled with the amplification from the Origin Source, reached 15 million, and with the Future Self technique, Hu Qing had a divine power of 20 million.","Hu Qing’s strength was indeed the strongest among all of them.","In the Wanliu Divine Tree, without restrictions, Chi Jiuxiao could exceed 30 million.","He was the strongest existence Jian Wushuang had ever seen.","But Hu Qing was different; he was a cultivator.","His future potential was even greater.","Moreover, there were restrictions in the Northern Spacetime, making it impossible to surpass the 20 million mark.","Only if Danbao created a Life secret technique to elevate the entire Northern Spacetime could it be done.","But that was a distant prospect; the matters of the resurrection path alone were uncertain.","Not to mention elevating it.","“Everyone, I plan to undergo my Seventh Tribulation before setting off. It will take some extra time!” Jian Wushuang withdrew his aura and glanced at everyone.","Originally, he had planned to undergo the Tribulation midway, but now, having absorbed the blood-colored aura, his divine power had reached perfection but not its limit.","He wanted to undergo the Tribulation first before absorbing more blood-colored power.","Upon hearing that Jian Wushuang was about to undergo the tribulation, everyone’s eyes flickered.","“Tribulation?”","That was a major event, and a good one too.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was already so powerful as a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation; after undergoing the Tribulation, wouldn’t he almost be able to rival Hu Qing?","Everyone was very supportive since they were not in a hurry.","At this moment, Wu Zuo spoke up, “Brother Wushuang, do you have any plans for the location of your Tribulation?”","This question made Jian Wushuang pause; he had never thought about it.","“Isn’t it possible to undergo the Tribulation anywhere?” He spread his hands, feeling completely confident and not thinking it was necessary to pick a specific location or time.","“Hey!” Wu Zuo stood up and patted him on the shoulder, saying, “You don’t quite understand. Even if you are absolutely confident about passing the Tribulation, you should choose a place with good feng shui. You will need an enormous amount of power for your Tribulation. Basic divine power is 3 million, and just the divine body tribulation alone might consume tens of millions of primordial stones. Although we have money, we should still learn to save!”","Jian Wushuang indeed did not understand this.","However, hearing that he could save on mixed element stones piqued his interest. The divine body tribulation consumed the least for him. 3 million divine power indeed required tens of millions of primordial stones, which he didn’t mind, but the Supreme Tribulation of the Origin Source Universe was different.","That consumption was truly significant.","Undergoing the tribulation for three perfect universes together would probably need over 100 million primordial stone.","This was only the Seventh Tribulation.","The Eighth Tribulation was 100 or even 1,000 times stronger than the Seventh, requiring even more primordial stones. Given his scale, it would probably take Life force equivalent to a million epochs to gather that many primordial stones.","The key issue was, although his Life force was infinite, the Scattered Tribulation was not.","In the Northern Starry Sky, there were only so many Eighth Scattered Tribulation ones. Even counting those at the Seventh and Sixth Tribulation levels, he couldn’t sell that many.","Aside from the top-tier powerhouses, the remaining Fifth Tribulation ones, and even weaker Scattered Tribulation ones, couldn’t produce many primordial stones.","Although there were many of these people, their primordial stones were pitifully few. How could they gather enough?","Jian Wushuang was also planning ahead, hoping to save some primordial stones if possible.","After all, he needed to cultivate to the Eighth Tribulation level in the Northern Starry Sky.","He wasn’t planning to go to Realm God Continent without reaching the Eighth Tribulation level.","Especially to deal with that monster Xilu, he wouldn’t join in the excitement without at least 20 million divine power.","In the following time, Wu Zuo gave Babata the coordinates, and they entered a core area of the Northern Starry Sky.","It was also a spacetime secret realm.","“The Taixu Secret Realm!”","At this moment, everyone had almost finished their cultivation and looked towards the Taixu Secret Realm in the sky.","Spacetime secret realms were very rare in the entire Northern Starry Sky.","This particular one bordered the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It contained endless dangers but also opportunities.","Back when Wu Zuo underwent his Tribulation, it was in this place.","However, that time, he was led by the Realm King.","So he didn’t encounter any danger.","This time, a few of them entering would not have such a privilege.","Just as they entered the periphery, they discovered a group of Seventh Tribulation wild beasts, with their leader being at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation, possessing a divine power of 2 million.","If a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation came, they would struggle to navigate even the outskirts.","Only those of the Eighth Tribulation dared to venture.","The weakest of the Eighth Tribulation possessed at least 3 million divine power, while the stronger ones could surpass 5 million divine power.","There was no danger in exploring the outskirts.","Jian Wushuang and his companions did not linger. They directly traversed the group of wild beasts, shattering those ignorant creatures into powder.","This was without even launching an attack. If they had attacked, even the simplest star-level attack would have annihilated these wild beasts.","However, that would have been too wasteful.","They had exhausted all the 10,000 units of Black Radiance Essence given by Realm King.","Only the original 17 units remained, so Jian Wushuang naturally needed to conserve them.","Some, like Wu Zuo, who were itching for a fight, went out and killed for a while, naturally crushing those wild beasts swiftly, annihilating the entire group in the time it took for one incense stick to burn.","Moreover, they purely destroyed without collecting any treasures from the wild beasts.","The treasures on the wild beasts, mostly beast cores, were of no interest to them, tainted as they were with a bloody aura.","Jian Wushuang was in no hurry. Once they had annihilated the wild beast group, they headed deeper into the Taixu Secret Realm.","The place Wu Zuo mentioned was in the core of the Taixu Secret Realm.","It was extremely dangerous but still accessible.","Typically, Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation only stayed in the inner areas and did not dare approach the core.","It was rumored that the core of the Taixu Secret Realm held great terror.","It was the relic of an ancient sect.","A sect from the primordial era of the Northern Spacetime."]},{"number":6025,"title":"Chapter 6025: The Age of Sorrow","paragraphs":["Chapter 6025: The Age of Sorrow","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At their peak, there were dozens of Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation.","The Primordial Era was too long ago for them, having surpassed even the era when the Celestsial Maiden was born.","The powerful beings from that time had basically all fallen.","Moreover, at that time, there might not even have been a God of Death; once dead, they truly died.","Their souls did not return to the God of Death.","That period could be considered a part of the Northern Spacetime’s past!","Although many super powerful beings were born, they didn’t bring any change to this world.","The pyramid flew past the endless floating debris in the outer perimeter and entered the inner region.","These were fragments of stone rings.","Though called fragments, each piece had a diameter exceeding ten billion miles, with some strange life forms living on them.","However, these life forms were relatively weak.","There were also powerful Special Life Forms living there, but they posed no threat to them.","The greatest danger in the inner region still came from the restrictive powers.","These were the broken formations from the Taixu Holy Land of old.","These formations could easily trap an Eighth Tribulation being.","Therefore, it was quite dangerous.","The pyramid’s flying speed slowed down. With Babata’s control, they weren’t worried about being trapped.","Even if they were trapped, Jian Wushuang could break through the restrictions.","They didn’t even need Hu Qing’s help.","The strongest Eighth Tribulation beings born in the Taixu Holy Land back then hadn’t reached the Eternal level.","Eternal!","20 million units of divine power, the limit borne by the Northern Spacetime, also locked its Origin Source at this stage.","If an Eternal being had been born in the Taixu Holy Land back then, it probably wouldn’t have been destroyed.","The era when the Tian Cang Elder was born was around the same time as the Taixu Holy Land.","“We’re almost there!” Wu Zuo could already see the solar disc at the core region through the sky.","Along the way, they didn’t encounter any cultivators.","Since the birth of the God of Life, all Eighth Tribulation beings had become cautious about their lives.","In the past, they had always fought because they wanted to reach the Ninth Tribulation.","Now that they knew the Ninth Tribulation Realm was hopeless, they settled down, waiting for the God of Life to elevate the life level of the Northern Spacetime before venturing out again.","Thus, their journey was quite easy.","Some secret and dangerous places are not treacherous because of the danger inherent to them, but rather due to the internal strife and slaughter among their own kind.","Jian Wushuang looked at the scene in the sky and marveled, “The once Holy Land of Taixu, it was likely the peak force in the entire Northern Spacetime. Even after so many years since its downfall, its core remains so intact!”","“Indeed!” Wu Zuo sighed, “Back when Realm King brought me here, he said the greatest pity was this Holy Land of Taixu. Within it, a being once emerged who mastered spacetime at the Eight Tribulation. If not for the circumstances in the Northern Spacetime, this being could have easily stepped into the Ninth Tribulation, reaching a level comparable to Realm King!”","Mastering spacetime!","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but gaze into the distance.","He recalled the words Realm King had once said to him, that if Hu Qing had been born in a different era, he might have had the potential to become a Realm King.","Mastering the Heavenly Dao.","Mastering spacetime.","Few could achieve such feats in the Tribulation realm.","“We’ve arrived!”","After the pyramid entered the core, Wu Zuo called out to Babata to stop, then pointed to the solar disk and said, “Above this is the most unique place for tribulation in the entire Northern Spacetime. If any of you feel confident, you can give it a try!”","Among those present, there were two at the Seventh Tribulation, Wu Zuo and Wutian, whose levels hadn’t yet reached the Eighth Tribulation. They wanted to further solidify their foundation and were in no rush to","face the tribulation.","However, the few at the Sixth Tribulation were confident in their ability to undergo Tribulation but had been holding back, thinking of returning to Qishen Temple.","Now, hearing Wu Zuo’s introduction, they were somewhat tempted.","Jian Wushuang was not stingy. He directly took out 400 million primordial stones and distributed them to Dongsheng, Wanyan, Guangying, and Gu Qianluo.","Although these people were not lacking in Tribulation treasures, they probably didn’t have many primordial stones.","This was a token of his goodwill!","After all, they were going to face Mie Sheng together.","“Don’t be polite!” Seeing their surprised expressions, Jian Wushuang smiled lightly and said, “Do not be careless about the Tribulation. It’s not too late to prepare well before attempting it. We still have time!”","Returning only required four eras.","There was indeed no rush.","Jian Wushuang calmed his mind, took out a mustard seed, and handed it to Hu Qing. “Within this mustard seed is a treasure that I think should be quite suitable for you. Why not cultivate with it for a while?”","Just like for everyone, he took out something for Hu Qing, which was that eyeball.","The Skysight Heavenly Chessboard had transformed, and it was related to the Heavenly Dao.","It was most suitable for Hu Qing.","“This...” Hu Qing hesitated a bit, but Jian Wushuang forced it into his hand.","He turned to glance at Wu Zuo. The other’s treasures were definitely more numerous than his, so he didn’t give him anything.","As for Wutian, he really didn’t have any treasures to give at the moment. He recalled the treasures that Realm King had given him back then and gave all of them to Wutian.","Those were the treasures needed to pass the Eighth Tribulation.","Even though Realm King had given them Tribulation-passing treasures, it absolutely couldn’t compare to the complete rewards received after accomplishing great deeds within the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Those treasures were of great use to an ordinary Universe Master.","But to him, they were already useless.","Because he had long made up his mind to walk a brand new path.","To break through the heavens and the earth with strength.","He didn’t need those things anymore.","Only the primordial stones, which fully contained the Origin Source of divine power, were useful to him.","The remaining treasures were no longer useful to his realm, and keeping them would only take up space. It was better to give them away.","Wutian, Tongtian.","He had treated him well back then, and now that he had changed his heart and could return to the Qishen Temple with him, naturally, he had to take out some treasures to motivate him.","Wutian originally intended to refuse. He had his pride and, with his previous memories, knew that Jian Wushuang was once his junior.","How could he accept treasures from a junior?","But when he sent his mind into the mustard seed, he changed his mind.","Now, Jian Wushuang had already surpassed him. He couldn’t be regarded as a junior anymore.","Moreover, since he chose to return to the Qishen Temple, he must be given some benefits, right?","Thus, he accepted the treasures.","Only then did Jian Wushuang relax. “Babata, teleport me to the Solar Disc!”","Shua!!!","As soon as he finished speaking, he was already on the Solar Disc.","He personally witnessed the great terror within the core.","Speaking of great terror, it was actually some residual souls left behind by fallen Universe Masters.","These residual souls continuously devoured and merged, condensing into some terrifying entities.","They had soul bodies and used soul power.","Their strength was not weak; there were quite a few exceeding tens of millions.","For an average Eighth Tribulation, it was indeed a great terror. For an Eighth Tibulation expert daring to venture here, they needed at least the strength of someone like Divine Wood King to deal with these terrifying soul bodies.","As Jian Wushuang stepped onto the Solar Disc, his expression also paused, and he instantly displayed the","Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","He casually applied the Origin Source.","His divine power reached 13 million."]},{"number":6026,"title":"Chapter 6026: Xilu’s Special Ability","paragraphs":["Chapter 6026: Xilu’s Special Ability","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He now realized that, with his current strength, being on this disc was indeed somewhat dangerous.","Not everyone was a Realm King, and even those soul entities had to show respect.","When those soul entities saw him, they swarmed around him.","The disc was enormous, and the soul entities were scattered all over.","Fortunately, there were fewer of them in this area. If he wanted to undergo his Tribulation here, he had to clear out the surrounding soul entities and then set up a large formation.","At that time, others could also come here to undergo their Tribulations.","Otherwise, with these soul entities around, undergoing the Tribulation was out of the question—avoiding being torn to pieces would be a miracle.","No wonder only Wu Zuo knew that this place was highly beneficial for undergoing Tribulations.","There wasn’t a single rumor about it outside.","Those who could reach this place were all Eighth Tribulation perfection experts, and they couldn’t undergo Tribulations anymore.","Trying to help their juniors would come at an enormous cost.","They didn’t have the protection of a pyramid; just traversing those perilous areas could be disastrous if they got trapped.","Eighth Tribulation experts could endure it, but Seventh Tribulation experts couldn’t. Once trapped, it could last for billions of epochs, and Seventh Tribulation experts would perish, forced to undergo their Tribulations within the constraints, which would not only be unhelpful but also backfire.","In summary, only Jian Wushuang and his companions had the ability to bring people here to undergo their Tribulations.","Jian Wushuang had already mapped out a large formation in his mind. As the soul entities attacked, he transformed into countless figures, flying in all directions.","He personally experienced the power brought by the disc.","His true self, however, was resisting those soul entities.","Some of those soul entities had soul power exceeding 10 million.","They were around 12 million.","Even he couldn’t quickly defeat them.","He could only draw the Wanjie Sword, aiming for a quick battle.","But just at that moment, his avatars reached the depths of the disc, and a force pressed down on him so intensely that he couldn’t breathe. Instantly, his feet sank into the top of the disc, and he couldn’t even fly.","It was important to note that his avatars each possessed divine power in the tens of millions, yet they couldn’t achieve flight.","“This is the core!” Jian Wushuang quickly realized, his telekinetic force spreading around, discovering that he had already reached the core of the disc.","His main body descended from above, observing some small circles on the disc.","“9,999!”","“My main body is within the 1,000 rings, which means those previous rings cannot trap me at all. However, the 10th ring where my clone is located has already immobilized me!”","Why didn’t Wutian inform him about this!","And it seems this disc is no ordinary object.","At this moment, his main body lost its will to fight, directly rushing deeper, leaving those confused and ignorant soul bodies drifting on their own.","Whoosh!","The clone instantly returned to the main body. His main body entered the 10th ring, just a step away from the 1st ring, the very center of the disc. Yet, he dared not explore further.","His main body was within the 10th ring, still able to move. This meant the boundary here was 13 million divine powers.","Without this divine power, once entered, he would likely be trapped.","This was not a prohibition, but a control over power.","Jian Wushuang stopped and observed for a long time, unable to discern any clues.","He intended to communicate with Wutian, but before he could speak, Wutian urgently signaled for him to return.","Though somewhat surprised, he didn’t hesitate.","With a flash, he left the sun disc and ordered Babata to perform spacetime transmission, re-entering the pyramid.","Upon entering the pyramid, before he could inquire, seeing a projection in the chamber, he understood the reason for his recall.","“Lord Realm King?”","“Jian Wushuang!”","He didn’t expect to meet Realm King again so soon, and wondered if it was because of this place?","That sun disc indeed had some strangeness to it, definitely a treasure that couldn’t be taken away, far more valuable than the pyramid, at least in the Ninth Tribulation.","But Realm King didn’t mention the pyramid, instead bringing up Xilu.","“Gone missing?” Jian Wushuang’s gaze sank, surprised. “Wasn’t Xilu personally transmitted by you yourself, Lord Realm King... how could he be missing?”","Realm King’s expression also looked somewhat embarrassed. The teleportation array he set up was indeed special, originally capable of monitoring Xilu. However, upon arriving at the Realm God Continent, he found that Xilu couldn’t be located.","“Jian Wushuang, actually, this concerns you!” Realm King spoke out at this moment, revealing the truth. “Try to conceal your aura now and you’ll see!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was even more astonished. Without hesitation, he immediately restrained his aura, but found nothing unusual.","“That’s it!” Realm King slapped his thigh, then continued, “Xilu must have acquired your special divine power and quietly mastered your method of restraint!”","This time, Jian Wushuang was completely unable to sit still and exclaimed, “How is that possible? If that’s true, wouldn’t Xilu become extraordinarily powerful?”","With that thought, he felt somewhat hopeless.","If Xilu truly became extraordinarily powerful, his strength would double.","His divine power already surpassed 20 million, and if he were to use the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, wouldn’t it reach 40 million?","He didn’t dare to imagine.","How powerful would the other party be then?","At the peak of the Ninth Tribulation realm?","Realm King sighed, “This time, I have two pieces of news, both bad.”","“Please, go on!” Wu Zuo on the side couldn’t help but urge, anxious. Their greatest concern now was Xilu’s resurgence.","“But there’s also one good news!” Realm King’s expression softened!","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","Seeing Realm King’s change in expression, Jian Wushuang knew it was good news.","Surely, Xilu couldn’t enter the Northern Spacetime, so Realm King was so relaxed.","So, the bad news couldn’t be too bad.","As he guessed, after Realm King breathed a sigh of relief, he said, “The good news is that Xilu’s divine power is too strong to enter the Northern Spacetime. The bad news is, once the life level in the Northern Spacetime increases, Xilu will be able to come in!”","“Phew!” Jian Wushuang also breathed a sigh of relief. Then there was no problem.","They could actively seek trouble with Xilu, provided their own strength was sufficient.","It wouldn’t be good if they were being watched.","The threat of Mie Sheng hadn’t been lifted yet, and now another terrifying entity was eyeing them; that wouldn’t be pleasant.","“Doesn’t that mean we have enough time to prepare, and maybe Xilu won’t go after cultivators anymore? Maybe he won’t come back to the Northern Spacetime!” Wu Zuo realized the crucial point at this moment.","And as much as possible, he imagined Xilu in a positive light.","“Clap!” A crisp sound rang out.","Realm King snapped his fingers, “More or less. Xilu’s identity is very special, created, although somewhat targeting flesh and blood life forms, the life level in the Northern Spacetime is too low to satisfy him anymore. There’s a high probability he won’t come back, and the Realm God Continent is more suitable for his survival!”"]},{"number":6027,"title":"Chapter 6027: Realm King God!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6027: Realm King God!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Realm King, is Xilu a threat to the Realm God Continent?” Hu Qing spoke up at this moment, feeling somewhat uneasy, worried about bringing trouble to the Realm God Continent.","“It’s unlikely. The Realm God Continent boasts far more powerful beings than the Northern Spacetime. With all the gods gathered there and Lord Realm King God overseeing, there won’t be any disturbances!”","Realm King God!","At the mention of this title, curiosity flickered in the eyes of the crowd.","Realm King waved his hand dismissively and said, “You’ll understand when you get to the Realm God Continent. Some things cannot be spoken of.”","“Lord Realm King, if Xilu is unlikely to return, then shouldn’t there be no issue? Why mention two bad news?” Jian Wushuang was curious why Realm King seemed tense when he arrived.","“Well...” Realm King hesitated, then replied with a hint of tact, “One of these bad news concerns you!”","Jian Wushuang pointed to himself in surprise, “Me?”","“Yes, do you remember the metallic lifeform you killed?” Realm King mentioned the metallic brain from before, then continued, “Before his demise, he left behind two perfect metallic puppets, and there’s one more unfinished puppet. Let’s not dwell on that.","Regarding the two intact metallic puppets, they’ve been programmed to kill you. Initially, I thought they were of average strength, planning to inform you once your strength was sufficient to handle them. But this time when I searched for Xilu, I encountered them...","Their divine power has reached the Ninth Tribulation, and they’re still repairing the third puppet, the most perfect one that the metallic brain didn’t create. Once repaired, their threat to you will surpass that of Xilu!”","Jian Wushuang was utterly dumbfounded this time, nearly stumbling as he couldn’t steady himself.","He had almost forgotten about this matter. Now reminded by Realm King, he dared not go to the Realm God Continent. It seemed like enemies were everywhere.","The others also looked at Jian Wushuang with pity in their eyes.","“But don’t worry too much. Even if they find a way to enter the Northern Spacetime, I’ll inform you in advance, giving you time to prepare!” Realm King reassured.","Jian Wushuang found it increasingly difficult to accept.","In the beginning, sparing the brains was also for the sake of the Northern Spacetime.","But now, they were being hunted.","This matter, the Realm King had to take responsibility for.","Feeling somewhat guilty, Realm King spoke up at this moment, “You’re going through Tribulation, right? I’ll let you use the Yin-Yang Wheel of Life and Death here once. I guarantee you can successfully pass the Tribulation, provided that your cultivation realm is high enough. If it’s not high enough, even gods can’t help you!”","However, Jian Wushuang couldn’t feel any joy at all.","He could successfully pass the Tribulation anywhere; he just wanted to save some primordial stones.","But now, even Realm King was impoverished, which meant poverty for Jian Wushuang.","Because there were no valuable treasures to offer.","He could only vaguely mention the matter of using the Yin-Yang Wheel of Life and Death to pass the Tribulation.","“Alright, that’s it. After you successfully pass the Tribulation, dealing with Mie Sheng should be enough. Then, you can focus on cultivating well and can go to the Realm God Continent anytime!” After finishing, Realm King reminded, “Jian Wushuang, those two metal puppets of yours haven’t been fully repaired yet, and you should do it soon.”","Jian Wushuang could only grit his teeth and nod.","“Oh, by the way, I heard that you exchanged your Realm God Token for treasures in Tian Cang. Next time you need something, just come directly to me instead of exchanging it with others using the token!” With a generous gesture, Realm King threw another token to Jian Wushuang.","Then, with a flash, he left the pyramid and entered the Yin-Yang Wheel of Life and Death. After a while, the area above was cleared.","Jian Wushuang, who had lost his temper, could only take the Realm God Token and, with the others who were about to undergo tribulation, enter the Yin-Yang Wheel of Life and Death.","No need to say more, Realm King was absolutely reliable in this matter.","After stepping onto the disc again, Jian Wushuang found no resistance at all.","He directly entered the first ring.","“You all come one by one, I won’t stay here any longer. Good luck to you all!”","After saying that, the projection of the Realm King disappeared.","Jian Wushuang and the others stayed above the disc.","Exhaling deeply, Jian Wushuang extended his hand, “Who’s going first?”","Since he had spent a longer time in tribulation, he decided to give others the opportunity first.","Dongsheng, now at the limit of the Sixth Tribulation, eagerly stepped into the 1st ring.","The Tribulation began.","Buzz!","The divine body Tribulation merely lingered on Dongsheng’s body for a moment before disappearing instantly.","Evidently, reaching the limit with the divine body meant that the Seventh Tribulation was child’s play.","It passed in an instant.","The most challenging part was still the Supreme Tribulation of Origin Source.","Their Origin Source Universes were scattered all over.","For this Tribulation, they needed to connect their avatars with their universes and then descend the Supreme Tribulation.","Judging from Dongsheng’s expression, it seemed effortless for him, as he easily passed within a day.","Both Origin Source and divine power were enhanced.","“Congratulations!” Jian Wushuang and the others gestured respectfully.","Dongsheng laughed loudly, “This place is extraordinary. I feel like I want to continue onto the Eighth Tribulation.”","Even Wutian, who had been solemn, couldn’t help but crack a smile.","This time, Realm King brought some good news.","However, compared to the safety of the Northern Spacetime, this good news seemed somewhat insignificant.","Ye Lingxiao has been reborn!","After reincarnation, Ye Lingxiao was in the mid-stream Spacetime.","When they returned, they could go and see.","Whether Wutian could reconnect with his past depended on the other party’s ability.","After Dongsheng succeeded, Wutian was next.","It took him almost a day to succeed completely.","Mainly because their Origin Source Universes were too far away; otherwise, it could have been faster.","The divine body Tribulation was successful in an instant.","The Origin Source Tribulation, though slower, probably took at most half an hour.","Moreover, after the two brothers successfully passed the Tribulation, their divine power greatly increased.","Now, their basic divine power was over 2.5 million.","Both Lord Guangying and Gu Qianluo also successfully passed the Tribulation.","They were slightly stronger than Dongsheng and Wutian, and their divine power had also reached 3 million.","If they could also master the Origin Source Dao Arena, their strength would probably be comparable to Wutian.","Unfortunately, without the blessing of the Dao Arena, their peak state would be at most over 4 million divine power.","Although Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source Universe was inside his divine body and could be extracted at any time.","In theory, passing the Tribulation should be the simplest.","However, he had a hunch that this time passing the Tribulation would take at least 10,000 years.","The divine body Tribulation.","This level wasn’t simple for him.","This wasn’t like before.","The divine body Tribulation would crush the divine body once again, leading to rebirth.","It also meant that he would regain a new life.","How could it be ordinary!","To embark on a new path of cultivation, he would have to start by changing during the Tribulation.","He would suppress his divine power to the basic level and then undergo the Tribulation."]},{"number":6028,"title":"Chapter 6028: The Purest Divine Power!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6028: The Purest Divine Power!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Only by doing so could the purest divine power be washed out.","“Wushuang, it’s your turn!”","After Dongsheng and Wanyan successfully transcended, they all turned to Jian Wushuang, anticipating his Tribulation.","Since their own Tribulations had gone smoothly, they thought Jian Wushuang’s would be the same, especially considering his greater strength, which should make the Tribulation relatively easy for him.","But only Jian Wushuang knew that his Tribulation might not be simple.","Stepping forward, he left a residual image in the void.","Upon entering the first stage, he immediately triggered the divine body Tribulation.","Hum!","His fundamental divine power erupted completely.","3 million!","Lord Guangying noticed that Jian Wushuang hadn’t used his full power, only basic divine power.","Astonished, he said, “So confident that you don’t even use secret techniques?”","“It’s just the Seventh Tribulation, 3 million divine power is enough!” Gu Qianluo beside him, now much more honest, gave a fair assessment.","However, Hu Qing inside the pyramid didn’t agree.","Because the power contained within that Tribulation far exceeded even his Eighth Tribulation.","Jian Wushuang floated in mid-air, fists clenched.","The Tribulation burst out from his divine body.","The force that stirred the Starry Sky began to cleanse his divine body.","Divine power also began to differentiate, one giving birth to two, two giving birth to three, and three giving birth to infinity.","It continued to disperse until it reached Jian Wushuang’s limit.","3 million divine power was divided into trillions.","This was his limit.","As the divine power was broken down to its limit, the Tribulation triggered in the Starry Sky began to cleanse the divided divine power.","Blue thunderbolts continuously crushed Jian Wushuang’s divine power, only to reform after being shattered.","It was a vicious cycle.","Such a terrifying aura, the onlookers saw it for the first time and couldn’t help but marvel!","“No wonder he’s so strong, his Tribulation transcends ours!” Lord Guangying widened his eyes, clenching his fists.","At that moment, they finally understood where the gap lay!","In fact, Jian Wushuang was also experiencing this level of Tribulation for the first time.","Since he was going to tread a completely new path.","He had to face the strongest Tribulation.","Purifying his divine power.","1st Tribulation to wash away myriad Tribulations.","This was just the beginning.","Each Tribulation required him to cleanse himself countless times.","Then the Second Tribulation would descend.","Stronger than the last by twofold.","The Third would be triple.","Myriad Tribulations meant myriad-fold.","Each Tribulation took ten years.","Myriad Tribulations equated to 100,000 years.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows; it was his first time triggering Tribulations from the Starry Sky.","For ordinary cultivators, Tribulations usually stemmed from their own divine bodies.","His was no exception.","But his divine body’s Origin Source Universe possessed the power of the Starry Sky!","So, what he triggered was the Tribulation of the Starry Sky.","While other cultivators faced Tribulations originating from within themselves.","The highest Tribulation that the Origin?Source Universe had to undergo came from the Northern Spacetime.","Because they were practitioners of the Northern Spacetime, not ones who triggered the highest Tribulation from the Starry Sky.","“The Starry Sky!” Jian Wushuang squinted slightly, “The Tribulation I face comes from my Starry Sky!”","Self-triggered Tribulation.","Self-strengthening.","This was indeed unprecedented.","Originally focused on the power of the Origin Source.","Now, he paid even more attention to his divine body and divine power.","The stronger the Tribulation, the greater the help to him.","He had no worries at all; instead, he was eager to try.","100,000 years of purification.","He wanted to see what realm his divine power would reach.","Boom!","The first Tribulation passed.","And 10 years had also passed.","Even Hu Qing and others came to the disc to watch his Tribulation.","“I actually comprehended the secret technique of divine power in Brother Jian Wushuang’s Tribulation!” Lord Guangying couldn’t help but exclaim, then continued to comprehend and cultivate.","He seemed to treat Jian Wushuang as a treasure.","Everyone gathered around, starting to comprehend and cultivate.","Especially the four who successfully crossed the Tribulation this time, they didn’t rush to absorb the blood essence, but improved their own divine power techniques one by one.","Jian Wushuang paid no attention and continued to cleanse his divine power.","After passing the first Tribulation.","His divine power decomposed once again, and he continued to cleanse it after decomposition.","The basic divine power remained at 3 million.","But he was confident enough to defeat someone with 5 million divine power using his 3 million divine power.","This was the divine power after cleansing.","As the Tribulations continued to descend.","The 4th time, the 5th time, the 100th time, the 1,000th time.","His divine power had spread throughout the entire Starry Sky.","Of course, the divine power after decomposition was in his own Origin Source Starry Sky, not the external Starry Sky.","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist, and the entire Origin Source Starry Sky trembled.","He even had an impulse to break his own Origin Source.","But soon he suppressed this impulse.","One force shatters all methods.","It’s not about breaking his own methods.","Breaking his own Origin Source Starry Sky would be tantamount to self-destruction, right?","Jian Wushuang put aside this plan.","His divine power continued to grow stronger, and the Tribulation also continued to strengthen.","From the first Tribulation, he began to use those primordial stones.","He spent tens of thousands of them.","Now, after the 1,000th Tribulation, he had spent billions of primordial stones.","Much larger than his budget.","This was just the beginning. If he completed all the Tribulations, he would probably need to spend hundreds of billions of primordial stones.","“If it weren’t for the special circumstances here, I’m afraid even 30 billion primordial stones wouldn’t be enough for this time!”","He was still careless. If it weren’t for Wu Zuo’s reminder, he would probably have failed the Tribulation.","Without enough primordial stones in reserve, he couldn’t continuously restore his Origin Source.","Without restoring the Origin Source, there would be no power of All Things.","The cornerstone of divine power is All Things.","With the continuous supplementation of the power of All Things, he could transform it into divine power.","Treating each cleansing in this way could keep his basic divine power at its peak.","And he couldn’t use secret techniques.","If he used secret techniques, the divine power cleansed during the Tribulation would be the amplified divine power from the secret techniques.","After successfully crossing the Tribulation, there would be no improvement in the basic divine power.","Originally, the basic divine power should be invisible in color.","Using the power of the Beast God would make it dark red.","Using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation would make it blue.","Now his basic divine power, without using secret techniques, had turned into a faint golden color.","And with each cleansing, the color became deeper.","Although the basic divine power hadn’t increased, his current divine power was worth 10,000 compared to others’ 2,000.","The foundation of divine power had undergone a qualitative leap.","He would become stronger and stronger.","“The 9,999th Tribulation!”","“Break!”","Boom!","Facing the thunder arcs outside his body, he punched the ground.","That was the Yin-Yang Life and Death Wheel, according to what Realm King said, it was a super treasure.","But he punched it, and it dented.","“Only one Tribulation left!”","Having crossed Tribulations for thousands of times.","Each Tribulation, divided into ten thousand times.","The quality of divine power changed!","The last Tribulation descended from the Starry Sky.","But it wasn’t his Starry Sky, it was the external Starry Sky.","“What?” Jian Wushuang looked up at the sky in astonishment.","A golden Tribulation descended from the sky.","Infinite power contained the highest punishment of this world.","It was a Tribulation beyond the highest Law Rules of the Starry Sky.","It was too incredible.","It might incur jealousy from the heavens."]},{"number":6029,"title":"Chapter 6029: Golden Divine Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 6029: Golden Divine Power","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Now, Jian Wushuang wasn’t afraid at all; he charged straight towards the Tribulation Lightning.","He wanted to shatter the Tribulation Lightning ahead of time.","The divine power that had dispersed in his Origin Source Starry Sky quickly reassembled.","At the moment it returned to his body, Jian Wushuang felt unprecedentedly powerful. He clenched his fist and struck with all his might.","Boom!","A wisp of golden fish appeared from the Tribulation, descending from the Starry Sky.","This scene left the observers in awe.","It was the first time they had ever seen a Tribulation take form.","No matter what happened now, Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised.","He was breaking his own limits, transcending the path of cultivation within this world.","Seeing unusual phenomena during a Tribulation or a Supreme Tribulation was normal.","But when he was about to attack that golden fish, he found that before he could even get close, his five orifices began to bleed.","A strange sound echoed in his ears, a sound only he could hear.","It was a voice he had never heard before, resonating in his mind.","“How reckless!”","In the Starry Sky, 1 of the 12 Star Spirits, Weiss, was watching Jian Wushuang’s Tribulation. Beside him stood a small humanoid figure with purple skin and no hair, upright ears, looking very petite.","Jian Wushuang didn’t understand who Weiss was talking about.","Assuming it was him, he fiercely punched, continuously attacking Weiss.","Weiss parried while observing Jian Wushuang.","He felt that the path Jian Wushuang was taking was too harsh.","In fact, the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique technique he had given was already very suitable for Jian Wushuang.","Without becoming a god, he could still be one of the top cultivators in this world.","Why make things difficult for himself?","Smack!","Distracted, Weiss took a punch during the fight. He wasn’t angry at all; instead, he was delighted and said, “Beerus, it seems your destructive power has increased again!”","After saying that, his aura increased another notch, and with a casual strike, he sent Beerus flying.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, encountered a major problem.","He couldn’t get close to the golden fish, and he had no way to deal with the Tribulation taking form.","So he returned to the ground, restored his basic divine power, then clenched his fists, causing his body to swell immensely.","“Come on, let me see just how strong you really are!”","He was going to rely on his physical body to withstand the attack.","Could this Tribulation, having taken form, even attack him? At most, it would cleanse his divine power.","But then, something unexpected happened.","The golden fish circled in the sky, then darted towards him at an angle he couldn’t comprehend, breaking through his divine body.","It was as simple as a cold spear piercing through tofu.","Jian Wushuang was in disbelief.","His incredibly strong divine body had been breached in a single strike.","He hurriedly repaired his body, feeling a twinge of fear.","But then, the golden fish continued to attack him.","There was no cleansing of his divine power; instead, he was injured repeatedly.","Each time he got hurt, the golden fish would attack again before he could even take a breath.","Even though he had the primordial stone and could instantly recover his divine power with a single breath, each subsequent attack grew stronger.","And the speed of the attacks was increasing.","He was almost at his limit.","He really wanted to use the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation to test how powerful the opponent was.","But with such constant consumption, his primordial stone wouldn’t suffice!","And he hadn’t yet crossed the Supreme Tribulation of the Origin Source.","He didn’t dare to continue resisting head-on.","As the golden fish charged at him again, Jian Wushuang, in a fit of rage, shouted, “Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","A deep blue aura surged, creating waves.","Unknowingly, he had fully mastered the Super Ancient Transformation.","He had reached a perfect state.","In this perfect state, the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation amplified his divine power a hundredfold.","In terms of divine power, that was 6 million.","Since he was already using a secret technique, he no longer restrained himself.","Tribulation Armor appeared on his body.","The wildly operating Tribulation Armor began to absorb the golden Tribulation.","With the Tribulation Armor, the perfect Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, and the support of the Origin Source Dao Arena, his divine power directly broke through to eighteen million.","The golden fish once again charged at his divine body, like a stubborn donkey heading straight for a tree trunk.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand and pinched the fish with two fingers, then tossed it away.","With a flash of his figure, he appeared behind the golden fish and threw a punch, shattering the once invincible golden fish into pieces.","Countless strands of golden divine power appeared in the void.","At this moment, his tribulation armor began to continuously absorb that surge of golden power.","The golden divine power skyrocketed.","The divine power brought by the Tribulation Armor instantly surpassed 2 million.","The golden divine power then disappeared.","The Tribulation was over!","Jian Wushuang felt the changes throughout his body.","He clenched his fist, feeling that extraordinary divine power.","He now even had the confidence to crush Chi Jiuxiao with one punch.","Although that seemed somewhat unlikely.","Chi Jiuxiao’s peak was at 30 million divine power.","He was probably not yet a match for him.","But as for the complete form of Xilu, he was confident he could defeat him.","As for Mie Sheng.","This was, after all, the Northern Spacetime.","Mie Sheng’s strongest was no more than 20 million divine power.","This time, he didn’t need anyone’s help; he could defeat Mie Sheng by himself.","His confidence soared.","Unprecedented.","Confidence in himself.","Upon noticing that Jian Wushuang had successfully passed his tribulation, everyone stopped their cultivation.","The recent surge of golden divine power had also greatly benefited everyone’s comprehension.","“Everyone, give me a quarter of an hour!” Jian Wushuang landed and sat cross-legged at the center of the Yin-Yang Life and Death Wheel, his divine power returning to the Origin Source Starry Sky.","He was about to face the Supreme Tribulation.","Because it had already descended into his Origin Source.","All three universes experienced changes, some significant, some minor.","Countless collapsed secret realms, exploding Starry Sky, and debris from spacetime turbulence in black holes began to invade his Origin Source.","This was the Supreme Tribulation.","Always bringing trouble.","The biggest problem among them was the celestial bodies.","Formed from debris and containing the power of all things, they became Special Life Forms.","These Special Life Forms, like pests, resided in Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source.","If they weren’t eradicated, his Origin Source universe would shatter.","This was why many Universe Masters failed their tribulations and saw their Origin Sources collapse.","He initially thought that walking a different path would change the Supreme Tribulation, but it turned out to be the same ordeal.","Unfortunately, despite all his preparations.","Upon entering his Origin Source, his divine body transformed into countless forms.","He suppressed those Special Life Forms everywhere.","He didn’t even need to use the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, as those special life forms had only a few million divine power each.","He could easily shatter them with a wave of his hand.","It took less than a quarter of an hour, just the time it takes to burn an incense stick, to pass the Supreme","Tribulation.","The exploding stars and ruptured black holes began to self-repair.","The needed power came from the Origin Source.","For this repair, Jian Wushuang had to feed it with primordial stones.","Even so, the cost was minimal.","Compared to the consumption of the divine body Tribulation, this was just a drop in the bucket.","After handling the Origin Source.","He returned to his true form."]},{"number":6030,"title":"Chapter 6030: I’m Not Dead Yet!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6030: I’m Not Dead Yet!","“Whoosh!” At the moment he opened his eyes, he exhaled a heavy breath. Just as he tried to move his body, he felt a sharp pain.","The pain was excruciating.","During the cleansing of his divine body, he could endure it, and he eventually got used to it.","But now, having lost that cleansing tempering, he felt the pain acutely.","Unable to stand steadily, he collapsed directly.","Everyone rushed forward, and Wu Zuo, with reddened eyes, said, “It’s over. Brother Wushuang has failed his Tribulation and is going to die!”","“Disband!” Wu Zuo wailed.","Upon hearing the word “disband”, Jian Wushuang immediately sat up and, with a darkened face, said, “I’m not dead yet. Even if I failed the Tribulation, I’ll just become a Scattered Tribulation cultivator. I won’t die!”","After saying that, he really fainted.","This time, he was truly exhausted.","After closing his eyes, only a trace of his Thought power sensed the situation in front of him.","Everyone exchanged insights on cultivation and Tribulation experiences before putting him into the pyramid.","Then Babata placed him into the rest cabin.","There, a life-sustaining liquid filled the cabin, and his whole body was submerged in the green fluid.","Under Babata’s control, the pyramid left the Taixu Secret Realm.","This time, their destination was the Original Universe!","Qishen Temple!","“I have returned!”","The others either cultivated or discussed Dao in the Qiankun Hall.","They traversed the Nine Great Spacetimes, entering the true Desolate Land, where the spacetime river flowed turbulently.","It was not suitable for opening new spacetime realms.","When the Celestial Maiden opened the spacetime, they always chose the depths of the upstream regions, and other spacetimes were similar.","Originally, in the upstream, Realm King had opened three long rivers of spacetime.","They had all grown to the Eternal Realm.","But they existed since ancient times.","The other spacetimes were opened by those Ninth Tribulation experts who fell while attempting to open new spacetime realms.","Most of them fell directly after opening the spacetime.","Just like the giant Jian Wushuang had encountered in the Starry Sky.","He opened a world and died of exhaustion.","Flying through the Desolate Land was the most tedious.","It took an entire era for them to leave the upstream.","Passing through the convergence area was the most dangerous.","They didn’t encounter a single cultivator on their way.","Nor would anyone seek trouble by going to the middle or even downstream.","Of course, there were also some spacetime passages that could lead to the midstream, but those passages were all unstable.","They were not as reliable as the passage crafted by Zhen Ling.","However, there had been Realm King secretly helping back then. Otherwise, that old fellow, Zhen Ling, wouldn’t have been able to handle such a big task.","After the pyramid completely entered the midstream spacetime, Jian Wushuang finally woke","up.","This time, he was truly exhausted.","He had slept for an entire era.","It took him a long time to gradually recover.","Having been inactive for such a long time, as soon as he got up, his body made a series of creaking sounds.","He moved his shoulders slightly and hoarsely asked, “Babata, where are we?”","Swish!","The small Babata appeared instantly. Seeing Jian Wushuang awake, he excitedly said, “Master, you are finally awake. We have now entered the midstream spacetime, and in 400,000 years, we will reach the first tributary of the midstream spacetime!”","“Good, not bad!” Jian Wushuang removed his clothing and turned to enter a hot spring. After lying comfortably in the water, he continued to ask, “Has anything happened along the way?”","“12 million years ago, in a turbulent area, we encountered a strange spacetime beast with extremely powerful divine power. It tried to attack the pyramid but was killed by Wu Zuo!”","“6.8 million years ago, upon entering the midstream region, we discovered a team of six practitioners exploring from the upper stream, all at the Seventh Tribulation. However, they were all Scattered Tribulation practitioners. Hu Qing tried to persuade them, but they stubbornly pressed on and have since perished!”","“300,000 years ago, we found a drifting other shore flower in the spacetime and had the pyramid pluck it!”","“10,000 years ago...”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but wave his hand to interrupt Babata, “Alright, there’s no need to report trivial matters. You may go now.”","After dismissing Babata, he also got out of the hot spring. Divine power evaporated the water droplets from his body. He casually took out a blue robe and put it on. With a shift of his form, he directly entered his own cave dwelling.","This was also the core, the deepest part of the pyramid.","The cave dwelling was well-equipped.","There was even a space for practicing martial arts.","Having not exercised for a long time, he soon found himself an opponent in the practice","space.","This opponent was himself.","His true self sat cross-legged on the top of a mountain within the practice space.","Two avatars flew out from the original body and entered the valley below the mountain.","The avatars did not use any secret techniques, relying purely on basic divine power for their confrontation.","There was no other way; he could only have the avatars undergo trials.","After all, there were no opponents.","Everyone else was cultivating.","He felt it inappropriate to disturb others.","The avatars continuously familiarized themselves with the current divine power.","The original body was also cultivating.","After reaching the Seventh Tribulation, he had not yet had the opportunity to stabilize his","realm.","Once the three universes were repaired, they began to self-maintain.","Jian Wushuang also started preparing for the Eighth Tribulation.","He began planning his universe.","The bottleneck for the Seventh Tribulation was three universes.","So, what about the Eighth Tribulation?","It might be five universes, or it could be nine.","The required resources were almost beyond his capability to afford.","He could only first create a framework.","Then gradually illuminate those universes.","The Origin Source needed to be constructed, but he was not in a hurry to enhance his divine","power.","There was still a lot of blood-colored aura, and since he had reached the Seventh Tribulation,","he could completely elevate his divine power to its peak.","However, there was still plenty of time, and he did not want to improve too quickly.","He wanted to give his divine body some time to breathe.","After exploring for tens of millions of years, he finally managed to achieve the ultimate plan","for cultivating divine power and the Origin Source.","The target for the Origin Source was nine universes.","Once accomplished, he could undergo the Eighth Tribulation, but that goal was still very","distant.","As for divine power, he did not have a clear limit.","However, the basic divine power must reach 5 million.","3 million for the Sixth Tribulation, 5 million for the Seventh Tribulation realm, which was not","unreasonable.","After figuring out the path for cultivation.","He then began to study his secret techniques one by one.","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation had already reached perfection.","The remaining task was just to become familiar with it, and there was nothing more to","cultivate.","However, there were still many problems to solve with the Starry Sky Chronicles.","Currently, the Reincarnation Sword was still somewhat clumsy.","However, the Spacetime Sword had already reached the Minor Accomplishment stage.","The Reincarnation Sword was not even at the entry-level.","Because he did not know whether he could perform it next time.","As long as he could master the basics, performing it would not be difficult; the issue was how","many times it could be used.","Life, Death, Reincarnation, and Spacetime.","Of the first four sword moves, only the Reincarnation Sword had not reached entry level.","The Life Sword had already reached perfection, and the Death Sword had also achieved Major","Accomplishment.","As long as the first four swords were all cultivated to Perfection.","He could perform the fifth sword move.","The Spacetime Reincarnation Sword.","That would be a new height in his swordsmanship.","The fifth sword would likely only be achievable once he reached the Eighth Tribulation.","In the Seventh Tribulation, it was already commendable to cultivate the first four sword","moves to perfection.","This was also the goal he set for himself!","Reaching perfection with the Death Sword required the help of Mie Sheng. Of course, this help","might lead to Mie Sheng’s fall."]},{"number":6031,"title":"Chapter 6031: Even Eternals Can Be Defeated","paragraphs":["Chapter 6031: Even Eternals Can Be Defeated","Life and death had both reached perfection, allowing his Reincarnation Sword to achieve mastery naturally.","Once he got started, everything would become simple.","What had always held him back was the Death Sword.","Once he broke through this barrier, everything else would follow.","Jian Wushuang understood this principle.","The Starry Sky Chronicles and the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation were different.","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation was a secret technique that augmented power. It was tightly bound to divine power.","However, the Starry Sky Chronicles was his strongest Origin Source sword technique.","It was primarily offensive.","This difference was fundamental.","He wasn’t as anxious about the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","He always approached it with a gradual progression.","Back in the underwater world, he had a complete outburst that allowed him to master it prematurely.","Now that he had reached perfection, his pursuit wasn’t as intense.","He wasn’t thinking about continuing to create and advancing towards the Origin Source Sword Dao.","The paths for the first five swords of his swordsmanship were clear.","“The sixth sword, “Even Eternals Can Be Defeated!”","Looking back, the name seemed a bit small-minded.","Now, he could already rival Eternal Beings.","His divine power had reached 18 million at its peak.","Moreover, his divine power was purer and more violent.","He could completely rival ancient existences.","That required the sixth sword.","If the sixth sword truly emerged, he could almost cut down those in the Ninth Tribulation.","Thinking of this, he couldn’t help but laugh.","The cultivation of secret techniques wasn’t achieved overnight; it required a lot of time and research.","Each of his incarnations began different tasks.","With a complete Dao Heart, he could multitask without any discomfort.","Swish!","His true self took out the Tribulation Armor and the Beast God Weapon.","The function of the Tribulation Armor was actually not as effective as the Beast God Weapon. Unfortunately, his Beast God Weapon contained Beast God Power, which was different from the Starry Sky Power of the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Unable to achieve stacking.","To stack them together, at least the power of the Beast God and the power of the Starry Sky needed to be consistent.","Currently, he could easily elevate the Origin Source within the Beast God Weapon to the perfect level of the Eight Tribulation.","However, this was now of little use to him.","The Tribulation Armor was different; it enhanced his basic divine power, perfectly matching the aura of his divine power.","Now, the aura of his basic divine power was golden.","The Tribulation Armor had also turned golden.","It remained consistent with him.","Adding 2 million divine power was not much to him, but if he could stack it, that would be a different story.","“Beast God Weapon!” Jian Wushuang gently stroked it, elevating the Beast God Origin Source to its peak. “When I return to Qishen Temple, I will see if I can find the remaining eight Beast God Weapons. I hope that in the future, we can fight side by side again!”","As his fingers touched the Eye of the Beast God, many thoughts came to his mind.","The Feather Continent.","He thought of the Trial World.","When he first obtained the Eye of the Beast God, he only used the Beast God Power to suppress others within a Domain.","At that time, he knew very little about divine power.","Even with the One Thought Universe, he used it to suppress others.","Later, when he realized that this was his Dao Arena, he began to try to enhance his divine","power.","Through gradual exploration, he grasped more.","After a moment of silence, he put away the Beast God Weapon. It was now useless.","If he couldn’t find the remaining eight Beast God Weapons, he would give this one away or keep it as a collection.","Collecting it would be somewhat wasteful; giving it away would be better.","Letting it continue to fight was the true fate of such a treasure.","He put away the Beast God Weapon and donned the Tribulation Armor.","Buzz!","A golden aura spread out.","Jian Wushuang’s entire body erupted with a golden aura, surrounded by arcs of electricity.","Basic divine power of 3 million, plus the 2 million brought by the Tribulation Armor.","A total of 5 million basic divine power.","The norm for the Seventh Tribulation realm, comparable to the threshold of the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","And he could still continue to absorb the power of the scarlet blood.","“Extreme Freedom Intent Technique!”","The Extreme Freedom Intent Technique, which he couldn’t even begin to master, he had only","seen used by Weiss.","It appeared so ordinary, yet he was helpless against it.","This was the strongest secret technique he had ever seen.","Inexplicably powerful.","In his mind, he constantly simulated the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique. Initially, he thought he could grasp something after reaching the Seventh Tribulation, but he still","couldn’t understand it.","Unable to even get started, he couldn’t see the whole picture at all.","“If only Weiss were still here, I could ask him for advice.”","“Forget it, there’s still plenty of time in the future.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and decided not to dwell on it.","Unknowingly, quite some time had already passed.","It was time to go out and get some fresh air.","His avatar was still cultivating and in combat.","His true self leisurely entered the Qiankun Hall.","“Eh?” Wu Zuo stood up first, holding a wine cup, and walked over. “Wushuang, you finally showed up. I heard from Babata that you woke up a long time ago but never came out to show","your face!”","In Qiankun Hall, Hu Qing was meditating in silence, and Wanyan was eagerly awaiting the day he could see Ye Lingxiao’s reincarnation.","Wu Zuo, on the other hand, was drinking alone.","He couldn’t get along with the lovesick Wanyan, and Hu Qing, who was meditating, ignored","him.","Seeing Jian Wushuang, Wu Zuo was very happy. He quickly made room and filled Jian","Wushuang’s cup with wine.","“After waking up, I still felt a bit off, so I stabilized my realm a bit!” Jian Wushuang said casually as he sat down and clinked glasses with Wu Zuo, chatting leisurely.","At this moment, Wanyan walked over and asked, “Wushuang, how far is it to the world where","Lingxiao’s reincarnation is?”","“This...” Jian Wushuang didn’t know either. Just as he was stunned, Babata flew over and","provided the answer.","“There’s still 100,000 years to the God Tower Spacetime!”","Wu Zuo frowned and reprimanded, “Wanyan, that’s enough. You ask every few years during this journey. She won’t run away, so why are you so anxious?”","“Brother Wu Zuo, you can’t say that. It’s normal for Wanyan to be anxious!” Jian Wushuang saw Wanyan’s embarrassed expression and comforted him, “Wanyan, don’t worry. Realm King said she should retain some memories and even reminded the other party. Maybe she’s","waiting for you!”","Wanyan’s expression became excited, and he nodded vigorously, “I hope so!”","At this moment, Hu Qing also opened his eyes. Seeing Jian Wushuang, he sensed a divine power aura not weaker than his own and said, “Congratulations, Brother Wushuang!” “It’s nothing, I just barely caught up with you,” Jian Wushuang replied modestly.","Wu Zuo, beside them, exclaimed, “Wushuang, has your basic divine power reached 15","million?”","“No, no...” Jian Wushuang waved his hand with a smile, but when he heard 15 million divine","power, he was stunned and turned to Wu Zuo, asking, “Why did you mention 15 million divine","power?”","Wu Zuo scratched his head, puzzled, and pointed to Hu Qing, saying, “While you were asleep, Hu Qing’s basic divine power had already increased to 15 million!”","“Just luck, thanks to those blood-colored auras!” Hu Qing replied with a calm smile.","Jian Wushuang was a bit surprised. He originally thought Hu Qing wouldn’t use those blood- colored power, but he hadn’t expected him to absorb them.","The Novel will be updated first on this website. Come back and continue reading tomorrow, everyone!"]},{"number":6032,"title":"Chapter 6032: Abyssal Spacetime","paragraphs":["Chapter 6032: Abyssal Spacetime","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Because of his arrival, the four of them rarely sat together to chat and drink.","Cultivation also required a balance between relaxation and intensity.","One couldn’t always remain in seclusion.","In fact, it was only because Wu Zuo and the others had top-tier strength within the group.","They weren’t in a hurry.","Wanyan was preoccupied with concerns about his partner, so he didn’t have the mind to cultivate.","Otherwise, he would also be cultivating.","Wu Zuo was at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation, with nearly 10 million units of divine power.","There was even less need to mention Hu Qing. When Jian Wushuang heard that Hu Qing’s divine power reached 15 million, his head hurt.","Of course, it wasn’t because he was jealous of Hu Qing’s superior strength.","Currently, his strength couldn’t be simply measured by numbers.","The abundance and purity of his divine power made him unafraid of any opponent.","Even if the opponent had an ancient existence with a base divine power of 20 million, he could still fight them.","It was just surprising that Hu Qing chose to absorb the blood-colored aura.","Hu Qing’s personality was as pure as his white robes, unstained by dust!","Absorbing the blood-colored aura was essentially adding karmic burdens to himself.","Because that blood-colored aura came entirely from the divine power and life of other cultivators.","According to Hu Qing’s usual character, he wouldn’t absorb it.","Yet he chose this shortcut.","It probably wasn’t that simple.","Jian Wushuang didn’t ask much, keeping his thoughts to himself.","100,000 years passed quickly.","Jian Wushuang and his companions often drank wine and discussed the Dao.","When they encountered some strange phenomena, they would pause briefly but not for too long.","They didn’t have the leisure for prolonged breaks, especially since they needed to find Wanyan’s Dao Companion.","As they delved deeper into the middle spacetime, they encountered more and more cultivators.","Along the way, Wu Zuo personally captured some Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation, searched their souls, and then released them.","They injected some information about the middle spacetime into Babata’s light brain.","Soon, the entire structure and some background of the middle spacetime’s forces were clarified.","The middle spacetime river had many tributaries, unlike the upper spacetime, which had only nine tributaries, many of which were created by superpowerful beings.","In contrast, no one opened up the middle spacetime river; it was entirely formed naturally.","Each tributary contained a spacetime.","These spacetimes intersected and advanced together, each at its peak.","There were a total of 36 spacetimes.","Among them, the Shen Ta Spacetime ranked last.","This spacetime only had the foundation of an eight-star sect like the Ancient Moon Spacetime, let alone compared to those Eternal Realms.","The entire middle spacetime probably couldn’t gather 50 strong beings of the Eight Tribulations Realm.","However, one aspect was much stronger than the nine upper spacetimes.","Most of the Eighth Tribulation powerhouses here were Universe Masters.","Especially in the leading middle mainstream spacetime, the “Abyssal Spacetime”, which had three Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation, divided into elder, middle-aged, and young.","Although there were few strong individuals, there were many treasures.","The Life force was sufficient to supply those Scattered Tribulation cultivators.","Even the Scaterred Tribulation cultivators often maintained their peak state.","This was an era of youth.","The upper reaches seemed like a stable state after a period of expansion, while the middle reaches appeared younger, with less deep foundations.","As for the lower reaches of the original universe, they were rather lacking.","They belonged to the infancy stage.","There were only a few Universe Masters.","“Babata, is there any news from Moro Spacetime?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but ask about the Moro Spacetime of the past.","At the moment he heard this name.","Wu Zuo’s expression also darkened.","Moro Spacetime, that was from an even more distant era.","But compared to the forces of the upper reaches, it wasn’t actually that distant.","“We have detected it. Moro Spacetime has now been renamed to the Nianshen Secret Realm, an ultimate spacetime secret realm, more advanced than the upper-level spacetime secret realms, and extremely dangerous. According to records, more than 10 Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation level have fallen within it!”","The Nianshen Secret Realm!","There was a look of reminiscence in Wu Zuo’s eyes as he tried to recall the Moro Spacetime of the past.","He was still very young at that time.","After becoming a named disciple of Qishen, he learned that there were many other spacetime regions outside.","But he had never gone out.","Crossing spacetime required the power of a Universe Master.","No one had predicted the tribulation of that time.","It was just a creation of Qishen Temple; Wu Zuo didn’t even participate in the final battle.","Though he always said otherwise, deep down, he knew why he hadn’t participated.","He was afraid!","With countless Universe Masters falling, even as an Emperor, he was terrified, hiding in Qishen Temple, afraid to venture out.","Just the aftermath had left him severely injured.","Seeing Wutian’s somewhat embarrassed expression, Jian Wushuang patted his shoulder reassuringly and said, “We’ve grown stronger; there’s no need to worry!”","Upon reaching the Shen Ta Spacetime and finding Wutian’s Dao Companion, they decided to pay a visit to the Nianshen Secret Realm where Moro Spacetime once existed, to see what it was like and to understand why it had been destroyed.","And to search for traces of Mie Sheng.","It would be beneficial to them all.","The pyramid continued to rotate, piercing through spacetime, completely entering the world where cultivators resided.","In the gaps between these spacetime rivers lay desolate lands.","These desolate lands were barren because the surrounding spacetime had absorbed all the power and Origin Source, leaving the land barren.","Only desolation remained.","Yet, amidst this desolation, there was still some vitality.","Some Universe Masters were attempting to shuttle through to other spacetimes.","That wasn’t particularly dangerous.","But those who aimed to ascend up-stream were having a rough time.","Apart from reincarnation, it was almost impossible to ascend up-stream.","Unless their divine power was extremely strong, and they had treasures with them.","Going against the current was too difficult.","Unlike going downstream.","Initially, Fan Tianfeng had ridden a supreme treasure, bringing along a group of powerhouses, even dragging along the Flame God.","After countless epochs, they finally reached the Original Universe.","“We’re only a stick of incense away from the Shen Ta Spacetime!”","Wanyan was so excited that he stood up.","Babata continued his explanation, “As the name suggests, the Shen Ta World possesses a leaning tower that has existed since ancient times. It’s a treasure crafted by a super powerful being, reigning over time in the Shen Ta World for a period surpassing the lifespan of beings within it. Currently, it’s occupied by the Ancient Tower Divine Kingdom.","The Ancient Tower Divine Kingdom is home to a Eighth Tribulation powerhouse, with divine power estimated to be between six to eight million. Over four billion epochs ago, they lost their Origin Universe while exploring the Nianshen Secret Realm!”","Listening to the introduction of the Shen Ta Spacetime, everyone seemed quite relaxed.","Because they needed to halt for a while, after Ye Lingxiao’s rebirth and with his new identity, it wasn’t feasible for him to just leave with Wangyan directly.","Certainly, they had to stay for a period of time.","Moreover, they needed to visit the Nianshen Secret Realm after the destruction of the Moro Spacetime.","They would also need to pause for a while.","They informed the others as well, inviting anyone who wanted to take a breather outside to come along.","However, the others were all busy digesting the divine power they had absorbed and were not interested in this."]},{"number":6033,"title":"Chapter 6033: Looking for Ye Lingxiao","paragraphs":["Chapter 6033: Looking for Ye Lingxiao","After entering the annual secret realm, just notify them.","The Shen Ta Spacetime!","The rotating pyramid sliced through spacetime like thin paper, fully entering the Shen Ta Spacetime.","In the mid-stream or middle-level spacetime, strong practitioners were scarce, and most of the spacetime was unified by one power.","Because the external pressure was too great, if you were not unified internally, you would be attacked by other spacetimes.","Unlike the nine major spacetimes, where there were many strong practitioners, making it impossible to unite as one.","Moreover, their foundations were extremely deep, making it impossible to be invaded.","After entering the Shen Ta Spacetime, Jian Wushuang and the others truly had their eyes opened.","At the edge of the spacetime, there was a super large formation guarding it.","There was also a vast army of practitioners guarding it.","It was like an iron barrel.","However, for true strong practitioners, entering the Shen Ta Spacetime was as simple as drinking water.","After the pyramid broke through spacetime, it hid its presence; otherwise, these practitioners would have been startled.","Although it seemed strict on the surface.","It was not completely closed; there were some passages for entry.","But that was too troublesome.","If they wanted to take the official route, it would probably waste decades of their time. This time was actually nothing to them, but now Wanyan didn’t want to wait even a moment. “Wanyan, can you sense the karmic connection of Ye Lingxiao now?” Jian Wushuang asked.","After Ye Lingxiao was reincarnated, he had the memories of his past life, so naturally, he also had their karmic connection.","So they could search through the karmic connection.","But they couldn’t find it across spacetime.","So they had to enter the Shen Ta Spacetime first to find Ye Lingxiao’s exact location.","Wanyan’s breathing was a bit rapid, clearly somewhat nervous. He moved his mental power and began to search for Ye Lingxiao through the karmic connection.","“Hmm?” He frowned, then said in surprise, “It seems to be in the capital of the Ancient Tower Divine Kingdom! And the presence is somewhat chaotic... Wushuang, let’s go to the capital of the Ancient Tower Divine Kingdom first!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and instructed Babata to directly enter the capital.","The movement within spacetime was very fast.","Moreover, the Shen Ta Spacetime was not very large.","It was about the same size as the Ancient Wood Continent back then.","The pyramid maintained at black hole-level speed, allowing them to traverse the entire Shen Ta Spacetime in just one day.","Heading to the core of the Ancient Tower Divine Kingdom took about five hours.","Buzz!","They didn’t have the heart to look at the scenery of the Ancient Tower Divine Kingdom and went straight toward the kingdom.","The four of them stood in front of the sky curtain, observing their positions.","Five hours passed in the blink of an eye.","In other words, it was an ownerless aura.","Like rootless water, it was drying up.","In this situation, either Ye Lingxiao was about to perish, or he had stayed here for a while and","now left.","Originally wanting to keep a low profile, Jian Wushuang no longer hid. With a flash, he","dragged Wanyan away from the pyramid.","Mid-level spacetime was unlike the upper-level spacetime.","Occasionally, two mysterious Seventh Tribulation experts might appear without raising","suspicion.","But it was different here. Once they appeared, it would likely arouse everyone’s suspicion.","They didn’t plan to stay here long and naturally didn’t want to cause trouble, just wanted to","hide themselves.","But now they were discovered, hiding would only alert the enemy, so it was better to reveal","themselves.","Swish!","The two appeared above the six great secret realms.","The aura of the Seventh Tribulation Realm was directly exposed.","The divine power was restrained.","If they exposed their divine power, the Eighth Tribulation expert of the Shen Ta Spacetime","would be too scared to come out.","After revealing the aura of the Seventh Tribulation Realm, the ancestor indeed relaxed his","vigilance.","It wasn’t really vigilance, just not as apprehensive.","“Two fellow Daoists, why have you come to my Shen Ta Spacetime?” A steady voice resounded through the world, but only the two of them could hear it.","The other party was very cautious and did not ask much, just inquired why they were here.","Seeing Wanyan’s bewildered expression, Jian Wushuang stepped forward, “We’re here to find a friend. Apologies for the rudeness just now!”","Their previous actions were indeed a bit rash, directly using mental power to probe the other","party’s lair.","Crash!","A hole broke in the spacetime, and an elderly face appeared before them.","It was the Eighth Tribulation expert of the Shen Ta Kingdom.","“Senior Shen Ta!” Jian Wushuang slightly cupped his hands.","The other party’s Dao Name was Shen Ta, and the name of the Shen Ta Spacetime also came","from his Dao name.","This was very common."]},{"number":6034,"title":"Chapter 6034: You’d Better Not Do It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6034: You’d Better Not Do It!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just like Ancient Moon Spacetime, the term ‘Ancient Moon’ also came from the Celestial Maiden.","Earlier, it was called Celestial Maiden Spacetime, but it was later changed.","Shen Ta noticed that the two were quite familiar with the place, but couldn’t discern their identities, which made him a bit surprised. He continued, “Oh, since you’re looking for someone, why not give me a name? In my spacetime, there is no one who can’t be found!”","These words had a hint of hostility, clearly still holding a grudge over the earlier incident.","This was actually normal.","Jian Wushuang gave an awkward smile, glanced at Wanyan beside him, and signaled for him to speak.","He didn’t know the cause and effect of Ye Lingxiao or her specific location.","“I want to find this person!” Wanyan casually drew a line, directly extracting a bundle of causal aura and tossing it to Shen Ta.","This aura contained the cause and effect of Ye Lingxiao.","If the other party truly knew, that would be best.","Moreover, the location of Ye Lingxiao was in the core of the six great secret realms, evidently also a member of the royal family of Shen Ta Kingdom.","Realm King hadn’t broken his word; Ye Lingxiao’s reincarnated identity was not inferior to the Ye family of the past.","Shen Ta became even more puzzled upon seeing a piece of causal aura. After taking it, he just glanced at it, his expression unchanged, and said with a faint smile, “You two must be mistaken. This aura seems to have never been to my Shen Ta Spacetime!”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. He could tell the other party was lying. The only reason they were being so polite now was out of respect for Ye Lingxiao.","If they dared to hide anything, they wouldn’t hesitate to force their way in and search.","Don’t doubt their strength.","Even if all the strongmen of the middle-tier spacetime combined, they wouldn’t be a match for Jian Wushuang alone.","Shen Ta walked out directly from the spacetime tunnel. Standing in front of the two was his true form. Divine power slowly surged, dark flames filling the spacetime. He stared at them firmly and said coldly, “Yes!... She is not here.”","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang had already transmitted a message to Wanyan, telling him to go in directly.","He would block Shen Ta himself.","He also promptly shattered the super array of the six great secret realms, all in the blink of an eye.","Before Shen Ta could react, he found that the area behind him was already in ruins.","The array was broken in an instant.","Wanyan directly entered the six great secret realms.","Jian Wushuang then blocked Shen Ta, “You’d better not make a move. It will be good for everyone this way!”","Clang!","He drew his sword!","When he drew his sword, the pyramid also appeared from the void.","Hu Qing and Wu Zuo also stepped out.","The two of them only revealed their basic divine power, and it immediately subdued Shen Ta.","Wu Zuo’s divine power was decent, not as strong as Shen Ta’s.","However, Hu Qing’s basic divine power was over 10 million.","“You... who exactly are you?” This time, Shen Ta was completely subdued, continuously retreating, but was blocked by Wu Zuo from behind.","Jian Wushuang toyed with the Tribulation Sword, originally intending to scare him a bit. He didn’t expect Hu Qing and Wu Zuo to come, which frightened Shen Ta senseless.","Jian Wushuang then put away the Tribulation Sword and said, “Senior Shen Ta, don’t be afraid. As I said, we are only here to find someone. And it looks like the person we’re looking for is related to you. It might even be a good thing for you, don’t you think?”","Shen Ta swallowed hard. When he saw the cause and effect, he knew who Jian Wushuang and the others were looking for.","And his relationship with that person was indeed significant.","She was his own granddaughter!","A direct descendant!","It was indeed a good thing for him.","Shen Ta’s figure trembled slightly. First, he looked at Hu Qing. With just one glance, his mind couldn’t help but tremble. He couldn’t see through her at all, but he could guess that her divine power exceeded 10 million. He was an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","Much stronger than him at his peak.","Being able to come to the Six Secret Realms silently, she was definitely not an ordinary person.","“Stop looking, she really isn’t here!” Shen Ta’s expression turned somewhat forlorn.","Wu Zuo thought Shen Ta was lying again and threatened, “Old man, don’t try to fool us, or else...”","He finished with a wicked smile and glanced at the Six Secret Realms.","“She’s not here!” Wanyan emerged from the Six Secret Realms with a serious expression. He turned to Shen Ta, his voice icy, “Still unwilling to speak?”","Patience had its limits.","Jian Wushuang was also nearing his limit. He slightly restrained his aura and said gently, “Senior Shen Ta, if there’s something difficult for you to say, just tell us, and we will solve it for you. As long as you tell us the whereabouts of that person!”","Tell?","Shen Ta’s eyes moved, and he was indeed somewhat tempted. But thinking about the involved matters, his face turned ashen, and he closed his eyes.","This puzzled Jian Wushuang and the others.","Not even willing to speak until death?","Jian Wushuang lost his patience, rushed directly in front of Shen Ta, unleashed his divine power to 10 million, and placed one hand on his head, just a hair’s breadth away. His tone changed dramatically, threatening, “If you still don’t speak, I don’t mind searching your soul. Don’t think that because you are an Eight Tribulation, I can’t do anything to you!”","At these words, Shen Ta’s face changed instantly. He hurriedly took half a step back and exclaimed in surprise, “You’re not a Seventh Tribulation?”","“I am a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master, but that doesn’t stop me from searching your soul!” Jian Wushuang slowly lowered his hand and continued, “Don’t doubt it, you can try if you like!”","Shen Ta stared at Jian Wushuang, truly panicking this time. He didn’t dare to gamble.","“I can tell you!” In the end, he chose to compromise.","Seeing Shen Ta compromise, Wu Zuo’s expression softened. He immediately put on a smile, patted Shen Ta on the shoulder, and praised, “That’s more like it. Cooperate with us, and you won’t suffer any loss!”","“But you must agree to one condition of mine!” Shen Ta’s expression changed, appearing somewhat resolute.","“What condition?” Wu Zuo’s face darkened, knowing it wasn’t simple.","Shen Ta indeed directed his gaze at Jian Wushuang. He could see that among these people, Jian Wushuang was the leader.","“You must guarantee the safety of Shen Ta’s spacetime!”","After a long silence, Shen Ta stated his condition.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, “That’s simple!”","He seemed to understand Shen Ta’s concerns.","Shen Ta’s spacetime was at the bottom of the middle ranks, probably already targeted by others.","The significance of Ye Lingxiao was likely great and had been sold out by Shen Ta.","Wanyan also nodded at this time, “As long as you tell her whereabouts, I can guarantee that Shen Ta’s spacetime will be absolutely safe!”","He was now a Seventh Tribulation, with a basic divine power of 3 million, and with secret techniques, was on par with Shen Ta.","Moreover, with Jian Wushuang and the others around, protecting Shen Ta Spacetime was not a small problem.","Seeing Jian Wushuang nod, Shen Ta divulged everything.","These Eightth Tribulation of the middle-level spacetime had more backbone compared to the upper-level spacetime.","If it were the upper-level spacetime, they would have confessed everything long ago, and there wouldn’t be so many issues."]},{"number":6035,"title":"Chapter 6035: Gu Xiao’er","paragraphs":["Chapter 6035: Gu Xiao’er","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Losing the Origin Source Universe was a death threat to those at the Eighth Tribulation level.","Without the Origin Source Universe, there was no path forward.","Living became a torment.","But in the uper-level spacetimes, those at the Eighth Tribulation level who were wandering Tribulations always thought of ways to prolong their lives, trying to survive by any means.","However, Shen Ta did not think this way.","His current reason for living was to protect Shen Ta Spacetime.","Upon hearing this explanation, everyone changed their views about him.","From the bottom of their hearts, they felt a newfound respect, which showed on their faces.","This made Jian Wushuang think of Qishen. Before undergoing his Tribulation, Qishen chose self-dissolution.","He simply did not want to face himself after failure.","Life!","Rebirth!","This news had not yet reached the mid-level spacetime, otherwise, these people would not have given up so early.","When Wanyan heard this, although anxious, she did not interrupt.","“The person you are looking for is actually my granddaughter. Her name is Gu Xiao’er!” As Shen Ta spoke, there was a proud glint in his eyes.","Upon hearing this name, Wanyan couldn’t help but mutter, “Xiao’er!”","“She must be a reincarnation, right?”","“Yes!” Wanyan replied calmly, without any concealment.","Shen Ta chuckled, “Actually, I have known for a long time that she is a reincarnation, but she now carries the blood of my Gu family. Even if she is a reincarnation, in this life, she is still a member of the Gu family and a comfort to me in my old age!”","This made Wanyan a bit uncomfortable, but after thinking about it, she did not argue.","When Jian Wushuang heard this name, he immediately communicated telepathically with Babata, asking him to investigate Gu Xiao’er.","Such a task was simple for Babata, who could easily capture a strong figure from Shen Ta Spacetime to accomplish it.","No need to let Shen Ta toy with them.","“Master...” Babata quickly gathered the information and relayed it all to Jian Wushuang.","After listening, Jian Wushuang’s expression became a bit grim, thinking to himself, “So that’s how it is!”","Upon learning the truth, he felt that Shen Ta’s earlier words were just an excuse to avoid trouble from them.","Because the reincarnation of Ye Lingxiao had already been given away by Shen Ta.","To put it nicely, she was married off.","To put it bluntly, she was given away.","He initially wanted to tell Wanyan directly, but feared she might act impulsively upon hearing it, so he let Shen Ta explain it slowly.","After finishing the prelude, the following events became even more dramatic.","In her reincarnation, Gu Xiao’er possessed the perfect body of an Emperor crafted by Realm King. In just 10,000 years, she became an Emperor.","In less than an epoch, she reached the Fourth Tribulation realm and became a Universe Master.","She once crossed four Tribulations at once.","She was the pride of the entire Shen Ta spacetime.","Shen Ta highly valued this granddaughter.","Originally, they intended to groom her as their successor.","However, jealousy shattered this plan.","Ten thousand years ago.","Gu Xiao’er, who had already reached the pinnacle of the Fourth Tribulation realm, followed her friend to explore the outskirts of a mysterious realm and was targeted.","Tidal Spacetime!","Located on the other side of the river of time and space, it was extremely powerful, ranking seventh in the entire mid-level spacetime.","It was home to a peak Eighth Tribulation realm expert.","There were also five Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters within this spacetime.","It was a top-tier spacetime.","Ye Lingxiao was noticed by a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master who proactively brought up a marriage proposal.","Shen Ta originally disagreed.","It was practically akin to robbery.","Moreover, Ye Lingxiao’s talent was exceptional, about to reach the Fifth Tribulation realm. In the future, she could at least grow to the Seventh Tribulation realm.","She would be the revival master of Shen Ta spacetime.","How could they send her away?","“Sigh!” Shen Ta sighed, “That Seventh Tribulation Universe Master Haibodong had a unique status. If I hadn’t agreed at the time, I’m afraid...”","“And you still agreed!” Wanyan fumed with rage after listening.","This happened ten thousand years ago. No wonder her aura disappeared so quickly. If they were any later, they would have had to search from one spacetime to another.","Anything could happen in a span of ten thousand years.","Wanyan could hardly bear to imagine.","Jian Wushuang patted his shoulder. He had the most experience in such matters, but even he didn’t know how to comfort him.","All they could do now was save her.","First, they needed to bring Ye Lingxiao back.","If that didn’t quell the anger, they could kill that Seventh Tribulation expert. That was doable.","That was all he could do for Wanyan.","Time couldn’t be reversed.","“Tidal Spacetime, Haibodong!” Wanyan’s face showed killing intent, and he gritted his teeth, “She is your own granddaughter. As you said, she carries the blood of your Gu family. How could you bear to send her to an old seven-tribulation guy?”","Shen Ta looked troubled at these words.","Jian Wushuang and Wuzuo felt slightly wounded, realizing they had also become old guys!","But that wasn’t important.","What mattered was that if Shen Ta wasn’t afraid of death, why would he compromise?","Could it be that a Seventh Tribulation, for a woman, could destroy Shen Ta Spacetime?","That was unlikely!","There were thirty-six tributaries in the mid-level.","Tidal Spacetime was just seventh, not first.","Even if it were first, it wouldn’t turn the world upside down.","There must be hidden reasons.","That was why Shen Ta hesitated so long to speak.","“Because of Abyssal Spacetime!” Shen Ta’s face showed fear as he continued, “Tidal Spacetime is not frightening, Haibodong is not frightening, I could crush him with a flip of my hand, but his sister is the saintess of Abyssal Spacetime, and the partner of the Abyssal Lord, and their son is also an Eightth?Tribulation Universe Master!”","In other words, Haibodong’s nephew was an eight-tribulation Universe Master.","No wonder he dared to be so arrogant.","Jian Wushuang had substantial information about Abyssal Spacetime.","The Abyssal Lord was likely a peak Eighth Tribulation expert.","The Abyssal Demoness, the Abyssal Lord’s Dao Companion, was also an Eighth Tribulation master.","Their son was an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","The combined strength of these three Universe Masters made Abyssal Spacetime the overlord of the mid-level.","No wonder Tidal Spacetime was so arrogant.","Haibodong dared to act so boldly.","He came demanding someone!","Jian Wushuang didn’t care about that. Even if they were peak eight-tribulation, with at most fifteen million divine power.","He could defeat them with ease.","“It’s a minor issue!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “Wanyan, let’s go to Tidal Spacetime!”","At this moment, Wanyan felt like he had swallowed a fly, furiously glaring at Shen Ta, but he eventually nodded.","Minor issue!","Shen Ta’s face lit up with joy, sensing a turning point, and he had never heard of people like Jian Wushuang from mid-level spacetime.","They must be from higher spacetime.","With such backing, Shen Ta spacetime also had hope.","“Dear friends, if you forcibly rescue Xiao’er, please don’t go back on your word!” Shen Ta’s tone was pleading.","After learning Ye Lingxiao’s whereabouts, he had long lost patience. Moreover, Ye Lingxiao had been sent away by Shen Ta, so he wouldn’t show the other party any mercy."]},{"number":6036,"title":"Chapter 6036: Twist","paragraphs":["Chapter 6036: Twist","“Humph!” he snorted coldly. “I need to consider your conditions carefully now. Whether I agree or not depends on Gu Xiao’er. If not, then...”","Shen Ta’s expression changed dramatically as he looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief. How could a super strong person with immense divine power not keep his promise?","This was not what he had expected!","“This...” Shen Ta’s face turned awkward.","Wu Zuo, standing beside, mocked, “What ‘this’? Go home and wait for the news!”","Even Hu Qing didn’t come out to say anything good this time.","Speaking of which, the reason Ye Lingxiao ended up like this was because of Hu Qing.","But overall, it was still the Realm King.","If he had informed them earlier, this wouldn’t have happened.","The main issue was that Realm King didn’t take Wanyan seriously. If it were him, or Wu Zuo and Hu Qing, they probably wouldn’t have dared to do this.","Although he was the Realm King of the Northern Spacetime, he had no combat power.","He still needed them to do things!","How could he dare offend them?","“Let’s go!”","The four of them didn’t say anything more and directly entered the pyramid.","“Babata, activate secret realm speed. No need to hide our presence. Head to Tidal Spacetime at the fastest speed!”","Jian Wushuang gave the order directly.","“Yes!” Babata executed the command immediately. With the target locked, the secret realm speed could turn the twisted spacetime into a straight line.","The speed was so fast that it surpassed the existence of eternity.","Of course, the consumption was also great.","The secret realm speed, if sustained for a million years, would consume a black shining","essence.","From Shen Ta Spacetime to Tidal Spacetime was not too far.","It only took three days.","If it were at black hole speed, it would take at least several years.","The midstream of the spacetime river was much larger than the upstream.","But there were too many desolate areas.","The tributaries were also smaller.","But the range was larger.","The downstream was even larger, bigger than the mid and upper streams combined.","As for the end of the stream, they had never been there, so naturally, they didn’t know.","It was only heard that it was the same as the Starry Sky.","Unfortunately, no one had been there.","It was all hearsay.","If there were an opportunity, Jian Wushuang would definitely investigate it.","Buzz!","The spinning pyramid broke through everything, and all the secret realms blocking the way were shattered.","After leaving the Shen Ta Spacetime, it burst out with dazzling light in the desolate land, attracting the attention of many powerful beings.","They had never heard of such a flying treasure before.","They all thought it was a treasure newly obtained by some super strong person.","Through the sky, Jian Wushuang saw these reckless Universe Masters and showed no mercy,","directly charging and crushing all those Universe Masters.","In an instant, hundreds of super strong beings fell.","The sky turned blood-red.","Their arrogance was understandable.","Because although the pyramid’s aura was very strong, its power was not apparent.","This time, those people did not need to see; they all perished directly.","“Haibodong should not be among them; otherwise, it would have been too easy for him!” Wu","Zuo sensed the divine power aura outside through the sky.","Wanyan had a cold expression, also with some excitement.","Finally seeing it again.","“Don’t worry, we’ll reach their territory in three breaths!”","Jian Wushuang, with his hands behind his back, had a sharp gaze.","Boom!!!!","While speaking, the pyramid had already smashed through spacetime and entered the Hai","Family’s territory.","If not for the concern of accidentally hurting Ye Lingxiao, he would have had Babata control","the pyramid to directly crash into the Hai Family’s territory.","“How dare you!” An angry voice came from the depths of the territory.","A young man in golden robes flew out from below, realizing that the small team that had just","gone out had all perished.","Those were three Universe Masters of the seventh Tribulation realm!","Just perished like that?","It must have been done by an Eighth Tribulation realm.","This didn’t even need guessing.","The Hai Family’s old ancestor, “Sea Emperor!”","One of the most powerful Eighth Tribulation realm beings in the mid-level spacetime.","A peak Eighth Tribulation realm Universe Master.","An existence with divine power surpassing 10 million.","“Don’t you dare show your face?” The Sea Emperor’s furious strike directly hit the top of the","pyramid.","In private, he had already sent a message to his daughter in Abyssal Spacetime.","Because this time, the pyramid came aggressively, definitely having the confidence to hold","him back.","He dared not be careless.","If he had known that there were two super strong beings in the pyramid who could easily crush him, he would have been scared and fled long ago.","The Sea Emperor, with divine power surpassing ten million, made friends with those stronger","than him.","Although he had a few enemies of similar strength, none dared to be so bold as to come to his","territory.","After his strike, he wanted to test the pyramid."]},{"number":6037,"title":"Chapter 6037: Irrelevant?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6037: Irrelevant?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Unexpectedly, the pyramid remained motionless, and its power even visibly grew stronger.","The previous strike had been absorbed by the pyramid.","While the Sea Emperor was still astonished, Jian Wushuang and his companions appeared.","The figures of the four appeared, directly sealing off the spacetime.","Their opponent had no way to escape.","“Wanyan, do you want me to accompany you down?”","“I can handle it myself!” Wanyan only cast a cold glance at the Sea Emperor before directly entering the Sea Family’s territory.","Jian Wushuang originally wanted to accompany him, worried about encountering danger, after all, this was the enemy’s stronghold.","They couldn’t afford to be careless.","They couldn’t afford to make a mistake in this critical moment.","The Sea Emperor was somewhat astonished to see the four appear because he didn’t recognize them at all.","Moreover, it seemed that they didn’t take him seriously, directly entering the territory right under his nose.","Just from sensing their aura, he couldn’t see through any of them.","Jian Wushuang and his companions did not expose their Origin Source, but instead, released their divine power.","Wu Zuo’s divine power was comparable to the peak of the Eight Tribulations Realm.","As for Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, there was no need to mention; their divine power alone was enough to frighten their opponent.","Suddenly, three peak Eight Tribulations Realm powerhouses appeared.","How could the Sea Emperor not be surprised!","“Who are you?” The Sea Emperor’s face was grim. The sudden threat made his divine power tremble, and the surrounding spacetime was sealed off, leaving him with no way to escape.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze was cold as he stared at him and said, “If you want to fight, I can accompany you. If you don’t dare, then stand still!”","He did not start a massacre.","They would decide what to do after finding their person; everything depended on Wanyan’s decision.","“Dao Friends, if there is any offense, why not speak it out!” At this moment, the Sea Emperor was thoroughly scared.","It wasn’t his fault for being timid; Jian Wushuang and his companions intended to intimidate him.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been so obedient.","“I said, no nonsense!” Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold, and the power of the Starry Sky directly impacted the Sea Emperor’s divine body.","With just a glance, the Sea Emperor was severely injured.","The Sea Emperor didn’t dare to move at all.","The pressure Jian Wushuang gave him reminded him of the Abyssal Lord.","That was his son-in-law.","Even more powerful.","Even if the Abyssal Lord came, he probably wouldn’t be able to stop Jian Wushuang and his companions.","After Wanyan descended, he directly rushed towards the depths of the territory.","Sensing that familiar aura, he couldn’t wait to break into a small courtyard.","Bang!","He pushed the door open and entered.","What greeted his eyes was a woman in a black dress, holding a baby.","Because of the turmoil outside, the baby kept crying.","The woman in the black dress isolated the external disturbances, coaxing the baby to sleep.","“Xiao’er!” Wanyan’s voice trembled slightly.","Seeing the baby and the doting expression in Ye Lingxiao’s eyes, he was completely stunned.","At this moment, his heart felt as if it were being cut by knives.","The woman in the black dress, upon seeing Wanyan burst through the door, looked surprised. She then gathered divine power with one hand and assumed a defensive posture.","Clatter!","At this time, Jian Wushuang also arrived in the courtyard, carrying Sea Emperor and bringing Hu Qing and Wu Zuo along.","He turned to glance at Wanyan, then looked at the reincarnated Ye Lingxiao.","They all stood there in a daze.","“What’s going on?”","Sea Emperor couldn’t help but speak up, “Fellow Daoists, if I have offended you, kill me then. This has nothing to do with the rest of my Sea Family!”","“It has nothing to do with them!” Wu Zuo said coldly, “You stole my brother’s woman. How could this have nothing to do with it?”","Sea Emperor looked troubled. “A woman?”","He had taken many women, indeed guilty of that.","But the woman in the black dress before him was his daughter-in-law.","She wasn’t stolen!","He had personally gone to propose marriage, and the other party had agreed.","“Xiao’er, don’t you remember me?” Wanyan asked in disbelief.","The woman in the black dress was the reincarnated Ye Lingxiao, now known as Gu Xiao’er.","Seeing Wanyan’s anguished expression, she was somewhat moved. But seeing Sea Emperor being restrained, she shouted angrily, “I don’t know you!”","Her gaze towards Wanyan also turned hostile.","“This...”","Jian Wushuang suddenly remembered what the Realm King had said.","A perfect emperor’s body!","A perfect opportunity!","But nothing was mentioned about memories.","This causal force was also a guiding method given by the Realm King.","Jian Wushuang suddenly understood.","Silently, he thought to himself, “This is bad, the Realm King has misled us!”","Things had come to this point; they couldn’t back down now!","“Wanyan, act quickly, take her away first!” Wu Zuo also understood.","Knowing they were tricked by the Realm King, but there was no other way now.","They could only take Gu Xiao’er away first.","Otherwise, coming here would make them look too foolish.","Wanyan stepped forward but faced intense resistance from Gu Xiao’er.","No one could understand his feelings at this moment.","With a swift chop, he knocked her unconscious.","Holding Gu Xiao’er, he felt as if she were a stranger, remembering the recent scene.","Seeing Wanyan succeed, Jian Wushuang released Sea Emperor and left the courtyard with Wanyan. He ordered Babata to summon the pyramid to this place.","Buzz!","The pyramid descended, and a triangular plate floated in the air.","Wanyan, carrying Gu Xiao’er, stood on it.","Jian Wushuang and the others stepped back and followed him onto the plate.","At this moment, an aura erupted from within the clan grounds.","“Xiao’er!”","Someone was also calling out Gu Xiao’er’s name.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes burned with anger, an anger directed at the Realm King.","Now, he could only take it out on this person. Without waiting for the person to approach, he struck out with his palm, destroying the courtyard.","The abandoned baby was caught securely by Hu Qing.","With a single strike.","Sea Emperor desperately tried to block it. Otherwise, that Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm would have perished.","Jian Wushuang glanced coldly and then led his people into the pyramid.","Then they fled in haste.","Their appearance seemed fearful!","Fear of being discovered by others.","Fear!","Fear of what?","They had sought Ye Lingxiao openly, but ended up sneaking around like thieves.","Especially Wanyan, who was startled and surprised.","Through the sky screen, he glanced at the Sea Family’s grounds below, seeing Haibodong rushing over in sorrow.","That Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","“He doesn’t look very old!” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself, stroking his chin. Seeing Haibodong’s appearance made it hard for him to believe that the other was a domineering figure.","And he lost the will to kill.","In the sky screen.","Sea Emperor used divine power to restrain Haibodong.","“This matter is not something you can handle. Leave it to your father, and I will definitely give you an explanation!” Sea Emperor urged earnestly.","But Haibodong’s eyes were red, watching the pyramid disappear before him, collapsing to the ground.","After the pyramid left.","Sea Emperor also let go, releasing the time and space restraint.","He felt more confident now, looking at his son, he sighed, “They are super strong beings from upstream spacetime, stronger than the Abyssal Lord. We can’t afford to offend them!”"]},{"number":6038,"title":"Chapter 6038: Shen Ta’s Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 6038: Shen Ta’s Plan","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To this day, he still couldn’t believe he would encounter such a powerful enemy.","Moreover, he didn’t understand why they were targeting Tidal Spacetime.","He was half-convinced by the earlier words, and seeing the other party take away his daughter-in-law, he was even more astonished.","Gu Xiao’er came from Shen Ta Spacetime.","She met Haibodong because of the Nian Secret Realm.","Back then, Gu Xiao’er fell into a forbidden place, and it was Haibodong who conveniently saved her.","Afterwards, the two got to know each other.","They had a grand wedding ten thousand years ago.","Now they already had a daughter.","There had never been any discord between them!","If there had been, it was before the wedding, when Shen Ta was very reluctant.","He wanted to groom his daughter to become his successor, but she ended up marrying Haibodong of Tidal Spacetime.","But this couldn’t be considered a robbery!","It was a mutual agreement between the two.","Hai Huang pondered over the events of today and decided to send a message to Shen Ta.","At this moment, Shen Ta was leisurely sitting on his throne, with a black-robed figure below him reporting on the matters from Tidal Spacetime.","The Hai family territory had been invaded by a mysterious strong enemy, and they couldn’t resist.","Currently, the entire spacetime was sealed.","“Haha, good!” Shen Ta stood up in delight, “It would be best if the entire Hai family were destroyed, so Xiao’er can return to Shen Ta Spacetime!”","But before he could celebrate for long, he received a message from Hai Huang, and his expression turned cold.","Gu Xiao’er had been taken.","Even the baby was not left behind.","Three Universe Masters of the Hai family were dead, along with dozens of Sixth Tribulation experts.","The news spread quickly, shaking the entire mid-level spacetime.","A mysterious golden head.","An unknown super strong enemy.","Upper-level spacetime?","That was a mystery to them all.","Because it was too difficult to travel from mid-level to upper-level spacetime.","Only an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master could do it, and they had to be a top-tier Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","In mid-level spacetime, those Universe Masters with such power were the pillars of their respective spacetimes and would not risk venturing to the upper levels.","After all, he couldn’t set his mind at ease.","Some Scattered Tribulation warriors risked their lives to explore.","However, most returned without success, and some were completely lost.","Regarding the upstream spacetime, they only knew about the existence of nine major spacetimes.","Countless super-powerful beings resided there.","As for other details, they were completely in the dark.","Moreover, most of this information was recorded in their inheritances.","No one in the entire midstream spacetime had ever been to the upper-level.","Now, suddenly hearing that a super-powerful being from the upper-level spacetime had descended,","they were all very excited.","Their curiosity about the upstream spacetime was their greatest motivation.","Everyone wanted to reach higher places.","But Shen Ta didn’t think that way, as he could hardly protect himself.","He only wanted his daughter to return and become his successor.","“Three Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation realm died?” Shen Ta’s eyes sparkled with joy, but when he heard that Haibodong was still alive, his expression darkened again.","As long as Haibodong wasn’t dead, Gu Xiao’er wouldn’t give up.","As for the dead Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation realm, they had nothing to do with him.","He didn’t have the ability to spy on Tidal Spacetime, and the other side had Abyssal Spacetime as a powerful backer.","Almost no one dared to pay attention to Tidal Spacetime!","“He actually survived!” Shen Ta frowned, his tone filled with reluctance.","Recalling the expressions Jian Wushuang and others had shown in front of him, they should have been ruthless people.","How could they not have killed Haibodong?","The current situation was still acceptable to him; his daughter had been taken away.","Originally, it was a bad thing.","But it also depended on who had taken it.","If it was a super-strong person from the upper reaches of spacetime, then it was hard to say.","“If my Gu family were to secure this great mountain, it might be even better!”","Shen Ta’s eyes flickered as he pondered this matter.","In the desolate lands outside of Tidal Spacetime, a pyramid floated in mid-air, remaining motionless.","Having left Tidal Spacetime, Jian Wushuang stopped.","Inside the Qiankun Hall of the pyramid.","The four of them gathered together.","Hui Qing held a baby, while Wanyan looked at the unfamiliar woman before him with a distressed expression.","There was a significant connection in karma, but the other party simply did not remember him.","It was as if she were a stranger.","“Wanyan, what should we do now?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Wanyan, who also had no idea.","They couldn’t just snatch someone and stand there watching!","It was supposed to be a natural course of events, but Gu Xiao’er’s resistance made them all passive.","It made them seem like heinous criminals, robbing someone else’s Dao companion.","Jian Wushuang had done many such things before, even encountering situations where others tried to snatch his bride.","But without the excitement, he had never felt this awkward.","Because the other party was unwilling to leave.","When he had taken Gong Miaoyi at Qishen Temple, she had been very cooperative.","This had avoided any awkwardness.","Now, this was a situation he was encountering for the first time.","Wanyan blinked, took a deep breath, and pointed a finger.","A beam of light shot out from his fingertip and entered Gu Xiao’er’s body.","After the light entered, it didn’t take long for her to slowly awaken.","Her eyelashes fluttered before she opened her eyes.","What she saw were four faces.","One was a young man with blue hair, and another was a middle-aged man in a yellow robe with a sallow complexion.","Only Wanyan looked like a normal person.","As for Hu Qing, a bald monk, he was even more unique.","Buzz!","As soon as she woke up, Gu Xiao’er immediately tried to snatch the baby from Hu Qing’s hands.","But as a Universe Master in the Four Tribulation Realm, she couldn’t move among the four of them.","With a single point of his finger, Hu Qing controlled Gu Xiao’er.","“Xiao’er, do you really not recognize me?” Wanyan’s eyes were red as he looked at the woman in front of him, feeling a chill in his heart.","But he couldn’t blame her; she had no memory of him.","It was normal that she didn’t recognize him.","Gu Xiao’er gave Wanyan a disgusted look and said coldly, “Are you crazy? I don’t know you at all. If you have a grudge against the Hai family, just kill me!”","She turned her head away coldly, unwilling to look at Wanyan’s affectionate gaze.","“Sigh!” Hu Qing sighed beside her. “Wanyan, brother...”","It was clear he was ready to persuade him.","But how could Wanyan give up like that? He immediately turned his head to Wu Zuo, as if grabbing onto a lifeline.","“Wu Zuo, brother!”","Thud!","As he spoke, Wanyan knelt down directly.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo hurried to support him.","“No need for that...” Jian Wushuang said as he pulled Wanyan up, trying to comfort him, “Restoring past life memories shouldn’t be difficult; there will always be a way!”","There would certainly be a way, but the current Ye Lingxiao already had a child. Wanyan might not be able to accept it!","Moreover, it seemed that Gu Xiao’er and Haibodong had a very good relationship.","If she really recovered her memories, it would probably be even more awkward than now.","Wu Zuo understood what Wanyan wanted and comforted him, “Don’t worry, this issue originated from Realm King. I will get you an explanation!”","Although he said this, he couldn’t guarantee that Gu Xiao’er’s past memories could be restored."]},{"number":6039,"title":"Chapter 6039: Lost Memories","paragraphs":["Chapter 6039: Lost Memories","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Wanyan’s face was deathly pale, and only after hearing Wu Zuo’s assurance did he slowly get up.","Although Gu Xiao’er, who was immobilized beside him, did not know why these people were looking for him, he was somewhat surprised to see Wanyan like this.","He hesitated in his heart, wondering what would happen if his memories from his past life were truly restored.","What would happen to his current memories?","Who would take the lead then?","These were all issues.","Perhaps at that time, he would no longer be the same as he was now.","But what could he do?","He was now under someone else’s control, and his daughter was in their hands.","Gu Xiao’er’s eyes reddened, and a tear silently fell.","“Wu Zuo, contact Realm King now!” Jian Wushuang, worried that something else might go wrong, urged Wu Zuo to quickly get Realm King to settle Gu Xiao’er’s situation.","What should have been a joyful reunion had now turned into a tragedy.","Wu Zuo took out a strange token and began to transmit his message to Realm King.","“Good!” Hu Qing hesitated, wondering whether to intervene.","He had a lot of experience with restoring past life memories.","Because he, too, had memories of a past life.","But he had completely severed them.","In his past life, Hu Qing had been a super prodigy in the Buddha Realm.","The only Daoist who had mastered the Ultimate Way!","His Dao title was “Tianji”.","But later, in order to rid himself of past life memories, he had suffered greatly to become who he was now.","And some emotions from his past life still affected his entire life.","Now Wanyan was encountering the same issue.","Having emotions in a past life was troublesome enough.","Having them in this life as well made things even more complicated.","Perhaps it was best not to restore the memories.","But he did not dare to advise against it; Ye Lingxiao’s death was partly his fault.","In fact, he was the real culprit.","Realm King was the mastermind.","In the end, Jian Wushuang was the biggest instigator.","If he hadn’t gone to destroy the Chen family to seize treasures back then, he wouldn’t have released the monster Xilu.","There wouldn’t have been Ye Lingxiao’s death later on, and he wouldn’t have made such a formidable enemy for himself.","Hu Qing got dragged into it as well.","The killing!","Too much karma had been tainted.","If you counted them all, every time Jian Wushuang killed, it would attract a powerful threat.","First, it was the blood sacrifice that led to Jiang Shang, which then involved Hu Qing.","Then it was Broly.","On the Dragon God Continent, the third time he wanted to kill, he was stopped by Wu Li because of Dan Bao’s peculiarity.","Otherwise, he would have made a terrible mistake again.","Now, to the current Xilu.","Everything was related to slaughter.","Jian Wushuang’s breathing became somewhat heavy. From now on, he truly needed to restrain his desire for slaughter.","It hadn’t been like this before. Ever since he mastered the extreme way, he committed the grave mistake of slaughter every time he pursued the ultimate.","Wanting to change was very difficult.","This time, after arriving at the Hai family, he almost had the intention to slaughter again.","Fortunately, he only shook and killed some Universe Masters and did not attack the weak.","He couldn’t continue doing this. As he thought this, a ray of light descended from the sky.","Realm King projection!","Swish!","“What do you need me for?” Realm King’s voice was somewhat lazy. He hadn’t been idle lately.","Because many things had happened on Realm God Continent.","First, Xilu was sent over, causing dissatisfaction among the other Realm Kings.","Moreover, the troubles he had sent to Realm God Continent previously had also been revealed.","All of this still began with Jian Wushuang’s slaughter.","Back then, when he killed the metallic light brain, he left a disaster behind, which Realm King sent to Realm God Continent.","Also, when he killed the young master of the Blood Clothes Sect, he entered the underground of Falling Phoenix Slope and discovered a pink flesh mass. Through the tunnel he entered, it also escaped.","Having no other solution, Realm King could only send these disasters away.","Because he had no time to set up plans now.","Clearing the metallic life forms had taken him an unknown amount of time to plan.","Ultimately, it succeeded.","Later, it involved Mie Sheng, and he also had a plan to retrieve.","Now, Jian Wushuang and his team were returning to deal with Mie Sheng.","But Xilu and the metallic beings created by the metallic light brain, he had no time to plan for them and could only send them to Realm God Continent.","Unfortunately, everything had cause and effect. Sending them there also required him to find people to solve them.","Jian Wushuang and others were the best fighters for this.","Saying that he was cleaning up after Jian Wushuang and others was not as accurate as saying Jian Wushuang was cleaning up Realm King’s mess.","The Northern Spacetime was far worse than they thought.","No way around it, the true form of Realm King had fallen, leaving only consciousness. It was already good enough to maintain things as they were.","If the Northern Spacetime were like the other spacetimes, it wouldn’t be in this current situation.","Divided into upper, middle, and lower classes, strong individuals were rare.","Only the nine major spacetimes in the upper class were worth looking at.","For so many years, they hadn’t even cultivated a decent strong individual.","Once questioned by the Starry Sky, he would have to die again.","Having no other solution, Realm King now regarded Jian Wushuang and his team as his lifeline.","First, to cultivate them into super experts, which he could brag about.","Second, to solve those troubles.","So, as long as Wu Zuo called him, he almost always responded immediately.","After all, he needed them and couldn’t afford to offend them.","This time, after descending, he found himself in the middle spacetime and thought there was trouble, so he came down to see.","“Recover past life memories?” Realm King slapped his forehead upon hearing Wu Zuo’s words. He had indeed forgotten about this matter.","Back then, after helping Ye Lingxiao reincarnate, he casually tossed her into the middle spacetime.","Later, because of matters on Realm God Continent, he had long forgotten about Ye Lingxiao.","Actually, back then, if he had waited ten to twenty years, when Gu Xiao’er’s consciousness was weak, and restored past life memories, all of this could have been avoided.","So, Realm King was indeed a pit!","He wasn’t willing to wait ten to twenty years.","Now, it had come to this situation.","He himself was a bit embarrassed, but in his view, this was not a big deal. He immediately promised, “Don’t worry, it’s not too late now. I can erase her current consciousness and restore past life memories!”","Erase!","Upon hearing this, Gu Xiao’er’s face changed drastically.","Wouldn’t that be death?","Consciousness would perish, but the soul would remain.","In this way, restoring Ye Lingxiao’s past life memories would allow Ye Lingxiao to regain control of the soul.","Wanyan’s face froze upon hearing this. Looking at Gu Xiao’er, he could directly see the other party’s soul.","It was a subconscious struggle!","Who wanted to die?","“Wanyan, you must think clearly!” Hu Qing came out and said a word at this time.","He originally wanted to persuade but didn’t have the qualification to speak!","He was also involved in this matter.","Now seeing the other party hesitate, he actively persuaded.","Wu Zuo, however, didn’t care about these things and retorted, “At this point, what is there to consider? Just restore it. As for this baby, we can send her back then!”","“Wanyan, what do you think?” Jian Wushuang didn’t follow Wu Zuo’s words but looked at Wanyan.","He was the main person in this matter.","So, it was necessary to ask his opinion.","But they had never thought about asking Ye Lingxiao’s consciousness.","Even if her soul had no previous memories now, it still had consciousness."]},{"number":6040,"title":"Chapter 6040: “Forget It”","paragraphs":["Chapter 6040: “Forget It”","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Wanyan’s hands trembled slightly.","He looked at Gu Xiao’er, seeing the steadfastness from before.","That indomitable resilience!","It was this very character trait that he admired.","Yet now, he had to erase that resilience.","“Forget it!” The light in Wanyan’s eyes faded, full of desolation.","In the end, he gave up.","If he truly erased Gu Xiao’er’s memories, it would be akin to killing her.","He was unwilling to do that.","Because Gu Xiao’er was now a complete person.","Not a mere object.","Realm King, not understanding matters of the heart, saw that everyone’s expressions were unpleasant and quickly said, “Actually, the soul can be exchanged. How about I split the soul into two parts?”","“No need!” Wanyan shook his head, then respectfully bowed to Realm King. “Thank you for your trouble this time, Realm King. I am fine now.”","Seeing this, Hu Qing felt very guilty but had no way to help.","Gu Xiao’er also saw that Wanyan was about to give up, and she breathed a sigh of relief.","Although she didn’t understand the relationship between these people and her past life, she could see Wanyan’s infatuation.","Realm King blinked his eyes but ultimately said nothing more. Realizing it was awkward to stay, he quickly bade farewell.","After sending off Realm King, Jian Wushuang and the others also retreated one by one.","Leaving Wanyan to calm down alone.","“Send her away,” Wanyan turned to Jian Wushuang, showing a bitter smile. “This time, I also troubled everyone.”","Jian Wushuang smiled awkwardly, “It’s a small matter. Since you can let go, then...”","Since he didn’t want to erase her memory, he couldn’t harm her and could only send her back.","What a disgrace!","They had all acted like fools before.","It was all Realm King’s fault for being unreliable.","Of course, that was just from their perspective. From Realm King’s point of view, there was no problem.","Compared to Ye Lingxiao, the matters of the Realm God Continent were clearly more important.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t chosen to bring Dongsheng and Wanyan back then, Realm King might not have even glanced at these people.","The pyramid changed direction and began to return the way it came.","At the edge of the Tidal Spacetime, Jian Wushuang stopped.","He didn’t want to go in and embarrass himself.","Letting the mother and daughter go here was good enough; this place was at the border and not dangerous.","“Is there anything else you want to say?” He looked at Wanyan, perhaps giving him one last chance.","Gu Xiao’er was leaving, and Ye Lingxiao would disappear forever.","Wanyan didn’t speak, took a deep breath, and turned his back on everyone, just shaking his head.","So resolute, Jian Wushuang naturally had nothing more to say.","After lifting the restriction on Gu Xiao’er, he said calmly, “Go!”","At this moment, Hu Qing also walked over and handed the baby in her arms to Gu Xiao’er.","After taking the baby, Gu Xiao’er finally breathed a sigh of relief. However, she still couldn’t face these people and said nothing, turning and leaving directly.","Seeing this, Wuzuo complained, “We’ve let her go, and she still doesn’t give us a good look.”","“Enough, we tied her up and brought her here, and you still expect a good look?” Jian Wushuang retorted irritably.","Staring at the disappearing figure, Jian Wushuang and the others finally turned to look at Wanyan.","But at some unknown point, Wanyan had already turned his head, staring at the figure of Gu Xiao’er, unable to let go for a long time.","“I need to go into seclusion!”","Leaving only this one sentence, Wanyan entered his own cave dwelling.","He wanted to become stronger!","Only powerful strength could compensate for his current emotions.","“Having long transcended the Five Elements of Heaven and Earth, matters of the heart only make one weak!”","Jian Wushuang sighed with regret; he saw things more clearly.","Walking the path of the strong is a lonely journey.","He wasn’t lacking in confidantes or life-and-death brothers.","But how many of them had followed him to this point?","Those from the Green Fire Realm, the Primeval Divine Realm, and the Grand Si Region were long gone.","Later, he arrived at Qishen Temple.","He met many people there as well.","Shan Jun, Bai Junwang, the old man with goat horn, Gong Miaoyi, and so on...","None of these people could keep up with his pace.","Such is the path of the strong.","If you have a Dao Companion, you must ensure that both progress equally.","For someone like Jian Wushuang, who brings calamity, it was even harder.","“Let’s go too!”","Swish!","The pyramid tore through the void, heading straight to the desolate land outside the Tidal Spacetime, towards the Nianshen Secret Realm.","To see the relics of the Moro Spacetime, they also had to move downstream.","As for Gu Xiao’er, after being released by Jian Wushuang and the others, she used a Spacetime Dao Talisman to return to the Hai family’s territory.","The family reunited, everyone showing joyous expressions.","Towards those mysterious powerhouses, they felt only fear.","No other emotions!","In the Shen Ta Spacetime, however, an old man, lonely and dejected, sighed with his head bowed.","In the midstream of the Spacetime River, it wasn’t just about love affairs.","There were also various struggles.","For example, the battle for supremacy!","The top-ranked Giant Peak Spacetime had always contended with the strong of the Abyssal Spacetime.","This struggle wasn’t for a city or a land.","It was a battle for the Abyssal Spacetime.","Now, hearing that super strong individuals from the upstream Spacetime had descended into the midstream Spacetime, a huge change occurred between the two.","Originally on the verge of conflict, the two sides began secret negotiations and even cooperation.","But this was only on the surface.","Behind the scenes, undercurrents surged.","It seemed unrelated to Jian Wushuang and his group, yet was intricately connected.","After leaving the Tidal Spacetime for 80,000 years, they traversed 33 Spacetime Rivers and vast desolate lands before seeing the largest Spacetime secret realm in the midstream.","The Nianshen Secret Realm.","Along the way, they encountered many practitioners.","Jian Wushuang made no attempt to hide, arriving openly at the outskirts of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","Many forces were stationed here.","Every moment, strong individuals were exploring the Nianshen Secret Realm.","As a spacetime-level secret realm, its scope naturally far exceeded those of the universe secret realms.","The outskirts alone were as large as a Spacetime River.","Like a star ring, it encircled the Nianshen Secret Realm.","Seeing the Nianshen Secret Realm for the first time, Jian Wushuang and the others were all shocked.","“Babata, how long would it take to traverse the entire Nianshen Secret Realm?” He had a purpose this time, aiming to explore the core.","Even exploring it entirely.","To search for traces of the Qishen and the Beast God Weapon.","The Beast God Weapon was the key.","This set of universe treasures was of great value.","Each one could reach the Eight Tribulations level.","If the nine Beast God Weapons were combined, it might become a rare Nine Tribulations universe treasure.","By then, his divine power could transform in quality, giving him the confidence to go to the Realm God Continent.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s intention to traverse the entire Nianshen Secret Realm, Babata widened his eyes in surprise, “Master, the current Nianshen Secret Realm can at most be explored to the area outside the core, the Flowing Sand Region. It was a Universe Master at the peak of the Eight Tribulations who described it. To enter the very core, you need to break through nine layers of restriction, each with resistance exceeding twenty million divine power, something almost no one can achieve!”"]},{"number":6041,"title":"Chapter 6041: Arrogant Pyramid","paragraphs":["Chapter 6041: Arrogant Pyramid","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“20 million?” Jian Wushuang was also taken aback.","A middle-level spacetime’s secret realm actually required 20 million divine power to break the restriction.","And it had nine layers.","It hadn’t been this difficult to enter the Taixu Secret Realm back then!","It seemed he had indeed underestimated this secret realm.","At this moment, Wu Zuo stepped forward and explained, “A spacetime-level secret realm is indeed not simple. The secret realms nurtured by the Northern Spacetime are all cosmic-level. Only the Realm God Continent can nurture spacetime-level secret realms. It’s normal for it to be a bit more difficult. Moreover, the Moro Spacetime back then was just a part of the Nianshen Secret Realm and couldn’t be considered its core. We can still go there to see some relics!”","“Moro Spacetime!”","Jian Wushuang held his breath. Not only had he crossed spacetime to enter Moro Spacetime, but he had also dreamed of Qishen when he walked the single-plank bridge.","That spacetime was like his nightmare.","Even though only relics remained now, stepping into it again made him extremely excited.","“Let’s go, enter the Nianshen Secret Realm!”","Before entering, he notified everyone except Wutian.","However, only Wutian left the cave and entered the Qiankun Hall.","The others weren’t very interested.","After all, it didn’t have much to do with them.","The inheritance they had received back then, although from Moro Spacetime, hadn’t been cultivated for long before they reached the nine great spacetimes.","Hundreds of millions of eras had passed.","They had long forgotten some of the inheritance from back then.","Now, being able to return was just to take one last look.","As for Mie Sheng, they didn’t know much.","Nor did they have any fear.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing’s strength was evident.","There was no one in the Northern Spacetime they feared.","Why fear a mere Mie Sheng?","Actually, only Jian Wushuang was a bit worried.","The others all thought the same.","Hu Qing was no different.","In the future, with 20 million divine power, even surpassing 20 million.","It was enough to dominate the entire Northern Spacetime.","Even on the Realm God Continent, they were super powerhouses.","Why would they fear a small Mie Sheng?","Buzz!!!","The pyramid swiftly broke through spacetime and rushed into the Nianshen Secret Realm.","This scene astonished the forces stationed on the periphery!","“The pyramid entered the Nianshen Secret Realm!”","“Quick! Notify Giant Sun Lord Immortal!”","“Inform the Abyssal Lord!”","Various major forces reported one after another.","The super strong individuals in the pyramid indeed attracted everyone’s attention.","Especially in the Abyssal Spacetime.","They were most wary of the super strong individuals from the upper spacetime.","Because the Abyssal Spacetime concealed a great secret.","This was also why the Giant Peak Spacetime always kept an eye on the Abyssal Spacetime.","“They’ve already broken the outer barrier!” Many people stood at a distance, watching the pyramid breaking through layer upon layer of barriers.","“Traversing the Demon Domain, how did they do it?”","Countless people were amazed!","The Nianshen Secret Realm was like a giant treasure trove to them, but also an extremely dangerous perilous land.","But those places, which seemed extremely dangerous to them, were completely crushed by the pyramid.","There was no resistance at all.","In the Nianshen secret realm, the most dangerous were those barriers.","These barriers could kill or trap people.","They were dead objects.","When called the most dangerous, it was actually meant for those strong individuals.","For the weak Universe Masters, the greatest threat in the Nianshen Secret Realm were those nian beasts!","This was also the origin of the name of the secret realm.","The nian beasts!","They were unique demonic beasts of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","They had absolute intelligence and tribes.","Some even established their own sects.","In the Nianshen Secret Realm, the nian beasts were unaffected by the barriers and could move freely.","Moreover, they were extremely powerful.","They were like the favored children of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","Enjoying the resources of the mysterious realm exclusively.","The deeper the nian beasts, the stronger they were.","And these nian beasts were gregarious demonic beasts.","There had once been an Eighth Tribulation strong individual, who encountered a group of nian beasts at the Eighth Tribulation level in the core area, each with divine power exceeding 5 million.","That Eighth Tribulation Universe Master was so frightened that he turned and ran.","Even so, he was still seriously injured.","These nian beasts were both a threat and an opportunity for cultivators.","The Nianshen Secret Realm not only produced some special treasures, but the most useful to cultivators were the demon cores of the nian beasts.","These demon cores could be used as the Origin Source of Life treasures, enhance divine power, and even enhance the Origin Source.","Not only that, the skeletal divine bodies of these nian beasts could also be used to refine treasures.","They were simply low-end versions of Beast Gods.","Jian Wushuang was delighted when he learned this through Babata.","These demon cores of the nian beasts could help him enhance his Beast God Weapons.","With this, a second refinement of the Beast God Weapons would allow Candle Dragon to be elevated to the Ninth Tribulation level.","If all nine Beast God Weapons could be elevated to the Ninth Tribulation level and then combined into one,","Jian Wushuang could hardly imagine the power.","“How far is it to the ruins of Moro Spacetime?” Jian Wushuang looked at the dangerous lands in the sky and realized it was getting more dangerous.","Currently, they had already entered the inner perimeter, where the dangers already threatened the Seventh Tribulation.","Most of the Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters also roamed here.","They could slay nian beasts and collect some treasures.","The power of these barriers was not from some sect’s ruins but seemed more like naturally formed barriers in the spacetime.","The more dangerous the place, the more powerful treasures would be born.","This was also manipulated by the will of spacetime.","Everything adhered to a balance.","Babata shook his head, performed a series of operations, and said somewhat uncertainly, “Master, I don’t have much information, but I can judge that Moro Spacetime is in the southeast direction, close to the core of the Nianshen Secret Realm. It will take ten days to reach!”","“Okay, be careful, no rush!”","Jian Wushuang wasn’t in a hurry at all. Since they had already arrived, it was better to be cautious.","He hadn’t taken this place seriously at first, but after arriving, his perspective changed.","Even the pyramid couldn’t cross, indicating that the core area held great threats.","Looking at the void barriers in the ruins, Hu Qing couldn’t help but exclaim, “These barriers actually contain the power of spacetime, no wonder they are so threatening!”","“The secret realm nurtured by spacetime naturally contains the power of spacetime. Hu Qing, you will understand when you reach the Realm God Continent. The power of spacetime is actually quite common. However, Brother Wushuang’s Starry Sky power is rare even on the Realm God Continent. The super strong individuals who master the Starry Sky power mostly come from super forces in the Starry Sky, each looking down on us spacetime cultivators!” Wu Zuo complained and then looked at Jian Wushuang with envy.","Obviously, he was very envious of Jian Wushuang, who mastered the Starry Sky power, because the Starry Sky power was too special.","Once mastered, it made one an absolute prodigy.","The Starry Sky power.","Not all Starry Sky cultivators could master it.","Just like spacetime cultivators, few mastered the power of spacetime!"]},{"number":6042,"title":"Chapter 6042: Scorched Earth!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6042: Scorched Earth!","So it appeared very special.","Jian Wushuang did not feel that way.","His Starry Sky power did not come from the Starry Sky they saw but from his own transformed Starry Sky.","Initially, he had also stolen Starry Sky power, but after being targeted by a super-powerful individual, he did not dare to use it again.","Later, he condensed the Origin Source of the Starry Sky by himself, thus fully mastering it.","If he guessed correctly, those prodigies who mastered Starry Sky power likely borrowed their power in the same way he did.","Just like the Origin Source power ordinary cultivators practice with.","Both come from the Universe Origin Source or Spacetime Origin Source.","It’s just that those cultivators in the Starry Sky naturally belong to the Starry Sky, so it’s normal for them to cultivate Starry Sky power.","What he did back then could only be called stealing.","Just like the father of Gong Miaoyi.","Borrowed power, though strong, never truly belonged to oneself.","At that time, he was fortunate to enter the Starry Sky through his Heart power. After mastering the Extreme Dao, he delved into Starry Sky power.","Good luck!","This was Jian Wushuang’s conclusion!","Bad luck would be like those dangerous places in the sky turning into ruins.","In the inner region, they often encountered some nian beasts.","Most were in the Sixth Tribulation, with the Seventh Tribulation being rare.","Even a nian beast in the Sixth Tribulation possessed over 1 million divine power. Comparable to an average Seventh Tribulation Realm.","Of course, Universe Masters in the Seventh Tribulation Realm would not fear these nian beasts.","But killing these nian beasts was extremely difficult, requiring formation setups and ambushes in advance.","Just like fishing.","Cultivators had a hard time walking here, following fixed routes, but nian beasts did not.","Restrictive power posed no threat to them, allowing them to escape freely.","Cultivators had no good way to deal with these nian beasts.","Only in the outer region was it easier to kill them.","Because the restrictions in the outer region had been broken by powerful beings, losing the protection of restrictions, the nian beasts, though strong, could not withstand the siege of cultivators.","However, the nian beasts in the outer region were mostly in the Third Tribulation, and killing them was not very useful.","Such high realms!","Now, it was time to observe the ruins left by Moro Spacetime.","He pocketed the demon core and led Wu Zuo and the others down the pyramid.","“Everyone, should we split up or walk together?” He turned to look at the three people behind","him.","Seeing the ruins left by Moro Spacetime, Wu Zuo couldn’t help but descend onto the pitch- black ground. With a casual grab, he seized a wisp of destructive aura.","A trace of sorrow crossed his eyes as he sighed, “I’ll walk alone for a while. I’ll find you later.”","“I won’t go with you either. Just notify me when we’re leaving!” Wutian’s face was cold and stern, without another word, he disappeared into the void.","Hu Qing watched this scene, not with sadness but rather with joy.","He was, after all, a disciple and descendant of Tongtian Buddha.","Seeing those he once followed reach new heights made him happy.","He didn’t feel that Tongtian Buddha had changed at all after becoming a demon.","“In that case, I’ll wait for you ahead with Hu Qing!”","In the end, it was he and Hu Qing who headed deeper into the Moro ruins together.","They walked slowly, investigating every spot, hoping to find something useful.","Or some traces left behind from the past.","Unfortunately, the devastation back then was too severe.","All that remained was scorched earth.","Among the ruins, only a few fragments of supreme treasures were scattered.","Jian Wushuang descended onto a relatively intact pillar, picking up a fragment of a supreme treasure from the ground, and lamented, “A Universe Treasure, reduced to such a state!”","Supreme treasures could still leave fragments behind, but those cultivators left nothing.","Wasn’t that even more pitiful!","The two continued walking, investigating as they went.","In the ruins of Moro Spacetime, they didn’t even encounter a single nian beast.","How tragic it was!","The once great Moro Spacetime had turned into a vast expanse of scorched earth, with","nothing left.","“What was Qishen thinking back then!” Jian Wushuang looked up at the sky, lost in thought.","Unwilling to face the failure of his tribulation, he took the entire Moro Spacetime with him to destruction, even reaching some sort of agreement with Mie Sheng."]},{"number":6043,"title":"Chapter 6043: What’s Left after Devouring","paragraphs":["Chapter 6043: What’s Left after Devouring","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He surveyed the scorched earth of the entire Moro Spacetime.","At that time, Qishen’s strength was much stronger than he had imagined.","Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm was already very modest.","Looking at these traces, it was at least comparable to the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm to achieve this.","The entire Moro Spacetime was destroyed.","“Virtous!” Hu Qing clasped his hands together and said calmly, “Brother Wushuang, the destruction here is related to devouring!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t need Hu Qing’s reminder to see this.","If it was simply destroying the spacetime river, he could do it too, but the state after destruction would never be a scorched earth.","Casually grabbing a handful of scorched earth, he could see through it that the ashes left behind should have been some kind of material force.","If it was destroyed by divine power, the entire Moro Spacetime would probably leave nothing behind.","It excluded the possibility that Qishen didn’t cultivate divine power and only followed the Origin Source route.","Then, if the other party wanted to destroy Moro Spacetime, they would also start from the Origin Source of Spacetime.","Destroying the Origin Source of Spacetime.","Then at the time of Moro Spacetime’s destruction, it would be like a dried-up ocean.","Water without a source would gradually deplete.","What should have been left behind would be a desolate land, not endless scorched earth.","“Qishen devoured this spacetime!” Jian Wushuang put down the scorched earth. It was still as he initially thought; Qishen’s fall was not so tragic but purposeful.","Hu Qing nodded in agreement, thinking similarly, then commented, “It should be to grow quickly, to force rapid growth, and the Origin Source he cultivated back then, following the Origin Source route, was probably to devour the Spacetime Origin Source. In the end, he failed and suffered a backlash, ultimately having no choice but to sever his devouring path and then prepare for his aftermath, like Qishen Temple!”","This speculation seemed reasonable to Jian Wushuang.","In their eyes, Qishen was already a petty person.","A petty person, how could he give up his path and be unwilling to undergo Tribulation?","“Delusional!” Jian Wushuang shook his head with a bitter smile. Qishen back then was indeed delusional.","He thought that by devouring the Origin Source of Spacetime, he could become the Master of Spacetime.","In Qishen Temple, the realm described above Universe Master was vaguely the Master of Spacetime.","But when Jian Wushuang reached the upper-level spacetime and broadened his horizons, he found out things weren’t that simple.","Above the Universe Master, there were currently various gods.","To really say there was a Master of Spacetime, it would be Realm King.","He controlled the entire Northern Spacetime.","He was the only one who was the Master of Spacetime.","The remaining superpowerful beings, whether they were those ancient existences in the Northern Spacetime or the cultivators of the Realm God Continent, were at most in the Ninth Tribulation.","He didn’t know the realms beyond that.","Realm King had never mentioned it.","Perhaps there was no realm above.","Beyond god?","Jian Wushuang did not dare to think about it.","Before meeting Wes, he might have speculated, but after encountering that monster, he felt he could never surpass him.","His word was law.","When he said you had to undergo the Tribulation, you had to do it.","When he said he would erase you, you had to die.","How could you surpass that?","You used divine power!","Others were true gods.","The power you used was bestowed upon you by others.","Perhaps his vision was limited, and there should be a way to surpass, but it was definitely not in the Northern Spacetime.","Now, he did not dare to think about it anymore.","He only felt that Qishen was somewhat pitiful.","If he had not spied on the Origin Source of Spacetime, perhaps Qishen could have become a Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation.","Then he could have gone to the upstream or upper-level spacetime, broadened his horizons, and maybe even obtained the Realm God Order, gone to the Realm God Continent, and still surpassed the Eighth Tribulation to reach the Ninth Tribulation.","Even if he couldn’t reach it, he could have become an eternal existence, first going to the Northern Spacetime to wait for the birth of the God of Life.","Why be so obsessed with spacetime, ending up splitting himself and falling?","Leaving behind so many disasters.","Qishen’s desire for life might have been even more persistent than Mie Sheng’s.","“Let’s go!”","After sighing, Jian Wushuang decided to leave.","This truth was within his expectations.","But it was also something he did not want to believe.","Qishen was most likely crippled by Mie Sheng.","What the shadow on the single-log bridge said back then might have been what Qishen said to Mie Sheng.","Zhen Ling’s hatred of the path of devouring originated from Qishen’s consciousness.","From the depths of his consciousness, he extremely hated devouring.","Then the three demon lords Qishen left behind.","Shan Jun, Gu Jun, and Mo Jun.","Were the evil incarnations of Qishen.","They also destroyed Qishen’s path of devouring.","The true spirit was so against it because of Qishen’s hatred!","“Wushuang, should we inform Wu Zuo?” Hu Qing hesitated, thinking if they told Wu Zuo their speculation, he might have a hard time accepting it!","Although Wu Zuo seemed somewhat shady and not like a good person, judging by his daily attire of a Daoist robe while shouting and killing, he was definitely not a good person.","But in his heart, he always held Qishen in high regard.","This was also Qishen’s charm.","So many people were willing to be buried with him.","Qishen definitely had extraordinary qualities.","Even if he was a villain, he had achieved the extreme.","Making everyone think he was a god!","“No need, it’s best if he doesn’t know about this. Let him wander here alone, while we head to the core. I happen to need some nian beast demon cores!” Jian Wushuang paused, then continued, “If you have nothing to do, you can join me!”","“Alright!” Hu Qing nodded in agreement.","He had nothing to do, and like Jian Wushuang, he came here to see how Qishen ultimately met his end.","In the vast scorched earth, the two left together.","Wutian didn’t think as much as Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing. Finding nothing in the scorched earth, he had already entered the core area.","Only Wuzuo stood alone before a pillar, silently wiping his tears.","That pillar was once the main pillar in a Dao Arena.","The Dao Arena naturally belonged to Qishen.","Thinking back to that time, he listened to Dao under this pillar.","Although he was only a registered disciple, after every lecture, Qishen would still send him a voice transmission, explaining anything he didn’t understand.","Now everything was gone.","At the peak of the Moro Spacetime.","Although the Universe Masters were the most respected.","Qishen Temple outwardly honored the Universe Masters, but internally, it revered the Emperors.","He cared deeply for every Emperor.","This was why Qishen had so many Emperors under his command, not Universe Masters.","The ones closest to Qishen were always those Emperors.","18 Divine Generals.","108 Divine Messengers.","And those disciples.","In the scorched earth, only Wu Zuo remained.","Jian Wushuang and the others had already entered the core of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","“A land of quicksand?”","Looking at the heaving quicksand before him, he found the place quite interesting.","In the quicksand, there were even some whirlpools."]},{"number":6044,"title":"Chapter 6044: Heaven’s Will","paragraphs":["Chapter 6044: Heaven’s Will","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","These whirlpools could even drag strong practitioners at the Eighth Tribulation realm into them.","However, there was no life-threatening danger; they would only be trapped, as there were some peculiar restrictions beneath the quicksand.","Because of this, even the nian beasts rarely appeared here.","The nian beasts could only be immune to the restrictions, but the quicksand was still extremely dangerous for them.","“Over the years, there must have been many nian beasts swallowed by this quicksand!” he thought, believing that even those nian beasts, with intelligence higher than that of practitioners, wouldn’t be immune to being swallowed.","The quicksand was like a filter, a large net for sifting out nian beasts.","Nian beasts at the Seventh Tribulation would likely be killed by the quicksand.","But the nian beasts at the Eighth Tribulation realm would not; they were probably just beneath it.","Without restrictions and no other dangers under the quicksand, they could naturally survive.","Moreover, the strongest of the human race could only enter this place.","Passing through this area of quicksand was too difficult.","At most, they could search within the quicksand for the treasures that leaked out.","And there were quite a few.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, after merely observing for a moment, discovered some treasures that had leaked out from the quicksand.","There were herbs and various kinds of treasures.","They emitted dazzling light.","But the distance was too far; even those at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation did not dare to venture forth.","Jian Wushuang had the strength, but not the inclination.","He had no interest in these treasures.","Hu Qing felt the same.","He had helped Realm King greatly and the treasures he had gained probably weren’t any less than those here.","“Let’s go down!” Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and directly flashed into the quicksand. The immense suction force caused his figure to pause, almost falling from mid-air.","The suction force exceeded millions of divine power.","But there was no need to directly use the Super Eternal AnTient transformation.","While in the Midstream Spacetime, he directly took out the Beast God Weapon.","The tribulation armor on his body also began to operate.","With a base divine power of 3 million, plus 2 million from the Tribulation Armor, his base divine power instantly reached 5 million.","Now, using the Beast God Weapon, there was no limit anymore.","His divine body could be freely amplified.","However, the Beast God Weapon had its own limit for him.","At most, it could amplify his divine power tenfold.","Amplified by more than 5 million.","His divine power reached tens of millions.","It perfectly countered the suction force, allowing him to walk freely.","As for Hu Qing, with a base divine power of 15 million, entering the quicksand area was as easy as walking, without any threat.","His divine power aura didn’t change, making him seem like an ordinary person.","The surrounding quicksand power encircled them and immediately avoided them.","This was the aura.","The aura of a strong person, an incomparably powerful person, would condense such an aura upon arrival.","Jian Wushuang looked on with some envy. If only his basic divine power could also reach fifteen million.","Unfortunately, he wasn’t in the Eighth Tribulation realm!","Every time Hu Qing practiced, it seemed as if there were no opportunities, or rather it appeared ordinary, yet he often exploded with strength that was incomprehensible to ordinary people.","Especially the peak secret technique of his future body.","It was definitely the strongest secret technique Jian Wushuang had ever seen.","It was comparable to his Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","No wonder he was a super strong person who had grasped the heavenly way.","Although Jian Wushuang was envious, he still asked with concern, “Hu Qing, how is your understanding of that supreme treasure?”","“To my shame, I’ve only grasped a little. My own cultivation realm is still somewhat low!” Hu Qing was extremely humble. He casually took out the chessboard and continued, “I almost forgot, this chessboard can also play a role here!”","“Oh!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. He had long since looked past Hu Qing’s humility. When Hu Qing said he had grasped a little, it absolutely meant he had grasped most of it, so it was not surprising. But the chessboard being able to function here made him a bit curious. “Give it a try. Speaking of which, it’s a bit embarrassing. When I got it back then, I couldn’t figure out anything!”","This was something he would only say to someone close. When the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard fell into his hands, his greatest achievement was probably finding a successor for it.","He himself had only gotten a Tribulation Armor.","And those early chess pieces on the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, which had been quite helpful to him.","But as for the function of this chessboard, he had no clue.","Hu Qing held the chessboard in one hand, pointed with a finger, and softly chanted, “Heaven’s Will!”","As soon as the words were spoken, the gigantic shadow of the chessboard descended.","Buzz!","One by one, the shadows of the chess pieces, holding various flags, were distributed around.","Hu Qing’s true form became incomparably majestic, like a god descending.","“Commanders, heed my order, stabilize the four directions of spacetime!”","“As you command!” The four chess pieces cupped their hands in salute, then orderly moved to their positions, placing the flags into the grooves of the chessboard.","The land of quicksand became still at this moment.","All the quicksand stopped moving.","The attraction force disappeared as well.","“What?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened in amazement. “This chessboard can even seal spacetime?”","Hu Qing nodded calmly and said, “That’s right. It can maintain a piece of spacetime. On this chessboard, not only can it seal spacetime, but it can also dispatch these chess pieces to battle!”","Dispatching chess pieces!","This didn’t surprise Jian Wushuang, as he had thought of this before but didn’t know how to use it.","He only knew a stupid method, which was to extract the Origin Source of the chess pieces, refine them into puppets to help him fight.","But in Hu Qing’s hands, he could mobilize all the chess pieces.","And judging by the looks of it, these chess pieces weren’t weak either.","It was still the same division as before.","God, Commander, General, Soldier.","Back then, he had absorbed all the Origin Sources of these chess pieces and used them to refine his own Origin Source and attempt fusion.","Now it seemed, he had taken the wrong path.","“Brother Wushuang, let these chess pieces guard this place. Let’s go down together and deal with those nian beasts...”","Before Hu Qing finished speaking, he felt a tremor.","In the vortex of quicksand, powerful divine power was surging.","Jian Wushuang exclaimed, “It’s the nian beasts!”","After spacetime was frozen, the quicksand became dead matter.","Unable to flow, naturally, there was no more attraction force.","Those nian beasts that had been sucked into the quicksand were now frantically reversing up the vortex, trying to rush out.","In this way, it also gave Jian Wushuang and the others a piece of information.","There should be a dead end below. If there were other exits, these nian beasts wouldn’t be in such a hurry.","Whoosh!","The next moment, the sand grains in the vortex were scattered, and the herd of nian beasts rushed out.","“An Eighth Tribulation realm herd of nian beasts?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with surprise.","Moreover, it seemed that each one’s divine power exceeded 10 million.","There were at least a hundred of them.","If they charged out of the Nianshen Secret Realm, the entire middle-level spacetime would be doomed.","Fortunately, these nian beasts only adapted to the Nianshen Secret Realm.","Otherwise, it would indeed be a great disaster.","But for Jian Wushuang, it was a rare supreme treasure.","The Beast God Weapon receded from his body, and a blue aura rose from him."]},{"number":6045,"title":"Chapter 6045: The Real Use of the Chessboard","paragraphs":["Chapter 6045: The Real Use of the Chessboard","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","Jian Wushuang directly unleashed his power, ready for a major battle.","However, before he could mobilize his Origin Source Dao Arena, Hu Qing stopped him.","“Brother Wushuang, there’s no need for such trouble!”","Jian Wushuang felt a bit embarrassed. “Let’s fight together. It’s not like I can’t handle these wild beasts!”","“No, no!” Hu Qing shook his head and corrected him, “Why wouldn’t we need to fight?”","Jian Wushuang was puzzled by Hu Qing’s words. “No need to fight?”","“Exactly!” Hu Qing nodded and pointed to the chessboard. “Listen to my command!”","Jian Wushuang looked over.","Only then did he understand that Hu Qing wanted to use the pieces on the chessboard to deal with these nian beasts.","But it was a whole group of nian beasts!","Each of them was at the Eighth Tribulation.","He doubted the chess pieces could withstand them.","Then he thought that Hu Qing might want to show off in front of him, so he didn’t stop him.","He would watch how Hu Qing controlled the pieces.","If it didn’t work, he would intervene.","He couldn’t just let Hu Qing exert all the effort while he held onto the treasures!","Buzz!","The chess pieces around moved again.","Those pieces that suppressed spacetime each held a piece.","This time, the pieces that appeared held standard long knives, their cold light flashing, extremely terrifying.","Jian Wushuang then realized that there was another set of pieces.","Moreover, these pieces had a divine power aura but no Origin Source.","The pieces marked with the character for “soldier” had divine power reaching 5 million!","The pieces marked with the character for “general” reached tens of millions.","However, those pieces marked with the character for “commander,” though rare and seemingly of higher rank, had no divine power.","He turned to look at the pieces marked with the character for “god.”","There were still three of them.","But the divine power they contained reached an infinite level.","He couldn’t see through them!","“I...,” Jian Wushuang was full of astonishment. “I can’t see through the pieces marked with the character for ‘god’!”","Hu Qing explained, “Brother Wushuang, these pieces marked with the character for ‘god’ should be embodiments of divine power. I can’t see through them either!”","Embodiments!","Jian Wushuang then understood.","Originally, he thought Hu Qing wanted the pieces marked with the character for “general” to fight and kill the nian beasts.","But it would still be slow.","Because their divine power was the same as that of the nian beasts.","Under the command of the handsome chess piece, even the soldier chess pieces could join the battle.","Moreover, they fought skillfully.","The number of chess pieces was about the same as the nian beasts, yet they could coordinate their attacks.","The number of nian beasts was more than they had expected.","After reaching a valley, they discovered an extraordinary treasure.","This treasure was an auxiliary supreme treasure.","An Origin Source.","Divine Power Origin Source!","It was actually nurtured on a tree.","To avoid damaging the tree during battle, Hu Qing suppressed the spacetime, and Jian","Wushuang personally collected it.","Then, using the chess pieces, they once again besieged the nian beasts.","“Haha, willows seem to bring good luck. The Wanliu Divine Tree was also so miraculous!”","Jian Wushuang carefully stored it away, feeling great.","He wanted to place this willow tree in the Qiankun Hall of the pyramid.","Then, sitting under the tree to cultivate would be twice as effective! Although the pyramid had an auxiliary function for cultivation, it only worked for metal","lifeforms and was of no use to them.","With this willow tree, he could even transport the Origin Source within the willow tree to","various caves.","But doing so would eliminate the benefit of cultivating under the tree.","Still, it was better than nothing.","“This willow tree is indeed extraordinary. If it were for a sect, it could completely elevate it to","another level!”","Even Hu Qing couldn’t help but praise it.","Speaking of the sect.","Jian Wushuang actually had this idea.","If Mie Sheng was dealt with.","What would happen to the Inheritors in Qishen Temple?","They couldn’t just disband on the spot!","They still had a mission.","To restore the glory of Qishen Temple!","To make Qishen great again.","Right now, Qishen was a joke.","Greatness had become a joke.","But this momentum couldn’t be broken.","And they were already prepared to keep this matter a secret.","At that time, they could use the excuse of restoring Qishen Temple to gather all the strong","together.","Unify the lower spacetime, then rush to the middle spacetime.","Break the barrier of the spacetime river.","Rush all the way to the upper spacetime.","As for going to Realm God Continent, he had thought about it, and with the threat of Xilu, he","had no choice but to go.","But he still had many things undone in his hometown of Northern Spacetime."]},{"number":6046,"title":"Chapter 6046: Entering Nianshen Secret Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 6046: Entering Nianshen Secret Realm","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","What initially seemed like a fantasy had to be completed.","Once Mie Sheng was dealt with, they could prepare one by one.","After killing the nian beast horde again, the two rested for a while.","Wu Zuo and Wutian transmitted coordinates to them, waiting for the two to come and join them.","As for the pyramid, Jian Wushuang had already put it away.","No one was willing to come out.","Everyone was desperately cultivating, unwilling to waste time.","Jian Wushuang was the same.","He collected these demon cores to refine his Beast God Weapon in the future.","However, after entering the Nianshen Secret Realm, he wanted to collect the lost Beast God Weapons but had no clue at all.","Logically, he should have felt the power of the Beast God Weapons within the spacetime of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","Yet, there was no response.","Most likely, they had been obtained by other practitioners.","Or they were completely destroyed.","Not a trace of Origin Source was left.","“Brother Wushuang, you two sure can run, entering this deep!”","Wu Zuo, who arrived first, couldn’t help but exclaim as soon as he landed, “This Nianshen Secret Realm is really strange. The scenery in the core area is like a patchwork, sometimes wind, sometimes fire. It’s truly uncomfortable!”","This remark caught Jian Wushuang’s attention.","“Patchwork?” It was only then that he thought of the dangerous places they encountered along the way.","It was indeed as Wu Zuo had said.","Some places were very obvious.","One step away was a sea of fire.","A step back was an ice field.","“You two wait here for Wutian, I will go ahead and take a look!” Jian Wushuang, thinking of this, set off immediately.","His figure flickered continuously, and he was able to break through the prohibitions they encountered.","Boom!!!","He broke through the prohibitions all the way, directly entering the junction outside the valley.","It was a barren land.","Let alone treasures, there wasn’t even a place to catch a breath.","He stepped in.","Looking at the junction.","He fell into deep thought.","“The Moro Spacetime in the southeast direction is the same!” His eyes flashed as he noticed something suspicious.","He originally thought that the Nianshen Secret Realm was condensed from the entire Moro Spacetime, but after arriving at the core, he realized it wasn’t that simple.","The Moro Spacetime was merely a part of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","Moreover, its location was not correct.","Back then, the Moro Spacetime was not here.","It was in a dried-up spacetime river.","The Nianshen Secret Realm seemed to possess an attraction, drawing all secret realms to merge into one place.","To provide a habitat for the nian beasts.","Thinking of this, he extended his mental power, continuously spreading deeper.","At a certain point, he stopped.","Because the restriction force there exceeded twenty million.","“Indeed!” He frowned and retracted his mental power.","Just touching that restriction, he noticed that it was somewhat different from the ones he had encountered before.","Because that restriction seemed to have just appeared.","Moreover, the restriction isolated spacetime.","At the core of the Nianshen Secret Realm, there was definitely some secret hidden.","However, entering it posed great danger.","He suspected that in the deepest part, there was a nian beast that had mastered the secret techniques of cultivators.","Otherwise, it would not have been able to seal spacetime.","Even the pyramid could not pass through.","Their attempt to enter the core was “difficult!”","Jian Wushuang returned to the canyon, and Wutian arrived at the same time.","The group did not notice that a hidden eye was always watching their direction and route.","Moreover, around them, various dangerous terrains were constantly shifting.","Like a puzzle, constantly moving.","When Wutian arrived, he mentioned encountering a Thunder Canyon according to the route given by Jian Wushuang, but Jian Wushuang did not encounter it.","Everyone couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat.","Kaw, kaw...","A crow perched on a treetop, cawing mockingly at the group.","The entity manipulating all this could see Jian Wushuang and the others’ actions through the crow.","In the deepest part of the Nianshen Secret Realm, within a dark forest.","The pitch-black forest was devoid of any light.","In the depths of the forest, there was a cave mansion.","Flocks of crows flew out from this place, monitoring the entire Nianshen Secret Realm.","At this moment, a nian beast at the complete-stage Eighth Tribulation cautiously walked towards the cave mansion.","Upon entering the cave mansion, there was a faint light.","These light sources came from the red eyes flickering on the cave walls.","If viewed closely, one could see that the owners of these eyes were crows.","The nian beast stopped in the depths of the cave mansion and rasped in its unique language, “King, they are still planning to move forward!”","“Send another team of nian beasts to lead them into the Flame Mountain!”","The one called King revealed a hint of flame power through the red light, but no features were visible.","The nian beast, without any hesitation, turned and left.","Another team of nian beasts?","Nian Six?","Jian Wushuang was still unaware that their route had long been manipulated, like puppets on strings.","Actually, after they realized something was wrong, they were all ready to leave.","Because the Nianshen Secret Realm was not under their control.","Moreover, none of them lacked treasures.","There was no need to take risks.","The King of the Nianshen Secret Realm did not realize that his unnecessary actions would bring him immense trouble.","“Brother Wushuang, let’s leave now. Hearing what you said, I also feel this place is eerie and a bit scary!” Wu Zuo shrank his neck, suddenly becoming timid.","Jian Wushuang broke the twig he was holding and stood up, “Let’s go, right now!”","He also felt the sensation of being watched but could not pinpoint the observer.","It was definitely a stronger entity than them.","Staying here would indeed be dangerous.","It was better to leave early; after all, they had enough demon cores.","Hu Qing looked deeply into the distance, unable to discern anything different, just feeling a sense of danger around them.","Leaving was indeed a wise choice.","“Hmph!” Wutian expressed his disapproval of their decision, saying coldly, “A small secret realm scares you like this, yet you boast about being invincible in the Northern Spacetime, how laughable!”","Wu Zuo’s face reddened, and he retorted angrily, “If you’re so brave, go ahead. I won’t accompany you!”","“Alright, let’s leave now!” Jian Wushuang, for safety, directly took out the pyramid.","Preparing to take everyone away in the pyramid.","This would also avoid the first wave of attacks.","After boarding the pyramid, they did not follow the original route back but followed Babata’s route to leave the core of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","Once out of the core, they would make further plans.","But there was no need for additional plans; if they left smoothly, they would head straight to the downstream spacetime.","Buzz!","The pyramid broke through restrictions all the way, trying to leave the Nianshen Secret Realm via the shortest route."]},{"number":6047,"title":"Chapter 6047: One Incense to Burn, That’s All the Time I Need","paragraphs":["Chapter 6047: One Incense to Burn, That’s All the Time I Need","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang, concerned, stood at the forefront of the sky screen, observing the situation outside.","“Eh?” With a thought, he sensed a powerful presence within the restriction ahead. Before he could react, the pyramid charged in at an incredible speed.","“Be careful!”","Boom!","The pyramid crashed violently against the restriction, creating only a small breach.","However, the pyramid still squeezed through the breach and entered the world within the restriction.","From the outside, the inside of the restriction looked like a lush green grassland, but once inside, they realized it was actually a sea of fire.","There was also a towering mountain constantly spewing flames.","“It’s a group of nian beasts!” Jian Wushuang noticed nian beasts active at the top of the flaming mountain and let out a sigh of relief.","However, there was an unusual aura among the group of nian beasts.","The others noticed this too.","Wu Zuo exclaimed, “The complete-stage of Eighth Tribulation realm!”","18 million units of divine power.","Among the nian beasts, there was one with a high crown, standing proudly at the peak of the flaming mountain.","This was the strongest nian beast Jian Wushuang had ever encountered.","It actually possessed 18 million units of divine power.","Stronger than the complete-stage Eighth Tribulation realm.","It was no longer comparable to a Beast God; it was a living Beast God!","Jian Wushuang felt a bit excited.","But the threat still lingered around.","He didn’t dare to make a move.","Not because of fear of danger, but fear of wasting time.","Their goal was to return to the downstream spacetime.","Not to make stops along the way.","Moreover, everyone had plenty of treasures.","It was only Jian Wushuang who needed the nian beast’s core.","He couldn’t let this minor issue affect the bigger mission.","“Forget it, dealing with it would probably take some time, let’s move on!”","“Wushuang, give me the time it takes to burn an incense stick, and I can help you deal with it!” Hu Qing’s eyes were filled with battle intent.","It was clear he wanted to help Jian Wushuang take down this nian beast.","Hu Qing and Wu Zuo knew the most about the Beast God Weapon.","They understood how much it would help Jian Wushuang.","Wu Zuo, wanting to see more of Hu Qing’s combat prowess, urged, “Brother Wushuang, don’t hesitate. It’s just killing a nian beast leader, it’s a simple task for Hu Qing. Don’t worry, it won’t take long!”","“Tsk tsk, the threat you’re talking about can’t be just this nian beast, right?” Wutian mocked from the side.","He thought they were being overly cautious.","Like being scared of shadows.","Afraid at the slightest threat.","Jian Wushuang extended his senses, probing around. Finding nothing unusual, he lowered his guard, thinking nothing could escape his notice. Besides, the feeling of being watched seemed to have vanished once they entered this place.","“Alright!” He nodded towards Hu Qing, “Be careful!”","Hu Qing, filled with confidence, responded, “Don’t worry!”","With a swift movement, he left the pyramid.","Reappearing, two figures of Hu Qing appeared in the sky.","“A future body!”","The last time in the Primordial Black Heaven, Wu Zuo and Wutian were too far away to see clearly. This time, witnessing it had a massive impact on them.","“Divine power over 20 million!” Wu Zuo couldn’t help but exclaim.","Wutian, standing nearby, clenched his fists and gritted his teeth, “How did he cultivate to be able to create such a defiant secret technique!”","“23 million divine power!” Jian Wushuang swallowed hard; it had surpassed the limit of life-bearing capacity.","This was somewhat beyond ordinary!","When divine power reached 20 million, the Law Rules of the Northern Spacetime would suppress it.","Hu Qing, on Flame Mountain, was also a bit surprised. He had only used half of his Future Self, yet it could unleash 23 million divine power.","This place seemed to have no restrictions on him!","Nor did he feel any suppression from the Northern Spacetime.","This made him frown.","Nevertheless, he acted quickly, smashing the entire Flame Mountain with just one punch.","The nian beast was also extremely surprised!","It had been sent by the king to attract cultivators, originally thinking that those cultivators would leave in a hurry upon seeing it.","Unexpectedly, these people were so brave.","Moreover, the white-robed monk leader in front of them was so powerful.","One punch destroyed the entire Flame Mountain.","The sky was instantly filled with red fireballs, continuously bombarding the ground.","“King, I am far from being his opponent!” Nian Six was completely panicked.","He wanted to use the restriction to leave.","But the current Hu Qing was too powerful; the future body already had the combat power of the Ninth Tribulation Realm.","Looking at the fleeing Nian Six, he pointed a finger, directly killing Nian Six.","Only a demon core remained.","Inside the pyramid, Jian Wushuang and the others had their mouths wide open.","Seeing Hu Qing’s terrifying methods, cold sweat appeared on their foreheads.","Luckily, he was on their side.","If an opponent was this strong, they wouldn’t even have the chance to escape.","Snap!","Hu Qing used one hand to absorb the demon core from the sky into his hand.","The future body disappeared.","Only the original body returned to the pyramid.","“Hu Qing, you can actually break the Northern Spacetime’s restriction. Your future body is truly extraordinary!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but praise.","His Super Eternal Ancient Transformation used the power of the Starry Sky and should be able to break this Law Rule, but the power Hu Qing used wasn’t the power of the Starry Sky!","Yet he could still break the restriction of this spacetime.","Hu Qing, after hearing this, showed a puzzled expression like everyone else, then shook his head, “I don’t know why I suddenly broke the limit either. In the past, I couldn’t break this limit at all, and just now I only used half of my power. I didn’t expect to reach 23 million divine power!”","“Half!” Jian Wushuang and the others gasped again.","“Terrifying!”","Half was already this powerful.","The full strength of the future body might reach 30 million!","That would be double the basic divine power.","Similar to Jian Wushuang’s Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","A defiant secret technique!","This time, Wu Zuo was the first to calm down. He quickly interrupted everyone, waving his hand, “Wait, could it be that this place is not restricted by the Northern Spacetime, so Hu Qing could easily break through?”","Hu Qing’s eyes flickered, nodding, “I think so too!”","It could only be this possibility.","Breaking the spacetime limit was extremely difficult.","First, the Northern Spacetime had a restriction; the limit of divine power that life could bear was just over 20 million.","You could reach the limit, but you couldn’t break it.","If you truly broke it, it would be the legendary power breaking through ten thousand laws.","Hu Qing breaking the restriction so easily just now clearly wasn’t that.","It was due to this place.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang licked his lips.","Swoosh!","His figure rushed out.","In the apocalyptic scene, he looked up and roared, clenching his fists.","Divine power erupted instantly, constantly rising."]},{"number":6048,"title":"Chapter 6048: Boundless Nianshen Secret Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 6048: Boundless Nianshen Secret Realm","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Three cosmic dojos descended simultaneously!","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!” He gritted his teeth, thinking of unleashing his divine power to its limit to see if he could surpass the boundaries here.","The base divine power, combined with the Tribulation Armor, reached directly to 5 million.","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation doubled it, reaching 15 million.","The dojo increased it by 60 percent.","That’s an increase of 9 million divine power.","“My Super Eternal Ancient Transformation has indeed reached the perfect level!” Feeling the arcs of electricity from the divine power aura, incredibly powerful, easily piercing through spacetime.","The divine power reached an astonishing 24 million.","Even spacetime trembled.","He could now easily shatter the entire Nianshen Secret Realm.","Jian Wushuang felt an unprecedented strength.","His whole being was extremely comfortable.","This was his first time bursting out so perfectly.","Under normal circumstances, if his divine power could reach eighteen million, even if the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation reached its perfect level, he could only contend with super strong beings of twenty million divine power.","Now he could perfectly burst out, reaching 24 million divine power.","Inside the pyramid, besides Hu Qing, everyone else was also incredibly astonished!","Astonished at Jian Wushuang’s strength.","He could easily surpass twenty million.","“Jian Wushuang can also do it!” Wutian gritted his teeth, staring at Jian Wushuang outside, feeling unprecedented pressure.","That aura was enough to suppress them.","Wu Zuo was amazed at the wonder of this place.","It wasn’t subject to the constraints of the Northern Spacetime.","“There must be a huge secret here!”","Hu Qing’s eyes also narrowed slightly.","More surprised than them were the ones from the dark forest in the core area of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","When the King saw Hu Qing’s divine power surpass 20 million, he gasped, and then saw Jian Wushuang’s divine power also surpassing twenty million. He couldn’t sit still anymore.","“Notify Nian Nine to attack these people, at any cost, eliminate them!”","From the pitch-black cave mansion, waves of cold wind blew.","A herd of nian beasts moved out in the dark, only their eyes showing.","Each nian beast’s divine power surpassed twenty million.","“After absorbing the power of the abyss for so long, now is the time to act. They must be eliminated!”","The giant face on the throne showed a hint of disgust, saying viciously, “Damn humans, since you discovered the special nature of this place, you all must die!”","Buzz!","Countless crows flew out from the cave mansion.","The king in the face shadow also left the cave.","To ensure nothing went wrong, he decided to go personally.","Because Hu Qing and Jian Wushuang had great potential, and there were no constraints here, he feared they were hiding their true strength.","Jian Wushuang had to take action personally.","The king of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","Also the king of the nian beasts.","“Nianshen!”","Flame Mountain.","It had been completely destroyed.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang and his companions were still marveling at the peculiarities of this place, unaware that they had provoked a formidable expert.","Now, Jian Wushuang was contemplating whether to change his strategy.","He was quite intrigued and wanted to stay and investigate further.","“Isolate the Northern Spacetime and unleash more than 20 million divine power!” He took a deep breath and voiced a bold idea, “Everyone, this place is of great importance. Should we take the risk?”","“Let’s do it!” Wutian was the first to step forward, strongly agreeing.","He had just tried to unleash his full power, and his divine power had reached 15 million.","This was already at the level of complete-stage Eighth Tribulation.","Yet he was still a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulations level!","Such a great opportunity, how could he not take the risk?","Wu Zuo’s expression was grim. He knew more and naturally thought more.","“Brother Wushuang, you’re not thinking of...” Wu Zuo didn’t finish his sentence, but his meaning was clear.","No one was a fool.","This place could break through the Northern Spacetime’s restrictions.","So, could they acquire or spread this ability?","He thought of the Nianshen Secret Realm continuously absorbing nearby secret realms, becoming a spacetime secret realm as vast as a giant spacetime river.","If the Nianshen Secret Realm covered the entire Northern Spacetime, there would be no need to wait for Danbao to elevate the Northern Spacetime’s life level; they could directly achieve perfection and even give birth to Ninth Tribulation experts.","At the very least, they could take control of this place and be invincible here.","But first, they had to master the entire Nianshen Secret Realm.","Then they could add this special power to themselves.","If the enemy also reached the Nianshen Secret Realm, there would be no restrictions.","Everyone would be on equal footing.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang thought a lot, but ultimately settled on one idea.","“Wu Zuo, have you ever thought about transferring this place’s special power to your own Origin Source Dao Arena? Wouldn’t we be invincible and truly sweep through the Northern Spacetime?” Jian Wushuang became more excited as he spoke, pointing downstream, “You know the threat of Mie Sheng. Even at our current level, it’s difficult to deal with Mie Sheng. If we can get the secrets of this place, what would Mie Sheng be?”","This wasn’t an exaggeration; the threat of Mie Sheng was indeed great.","When they left the Qishen Temple, Mie Sheng had already transformed into the God of Destruction Temple!","This was similar to Danbao transforming into the Immortal Temple.","Danbao could suppress Chi Jiuxiao effortlessly.","If Mie Sheng could do the same, returning to face him would be suicidal even at their current level!","“But?” Wu Zuo was still hesitant because this violated the laws of the Northern Spacetime, and he was still the Realm King’s direct disciple!","Following Jian Wushuang to do things outside the laws of the Northern Spacetime indeed made him uneasy.","Hu Qing took the initiative to persuade at this moment, “Brother Wu Zuo, this place is also part of the Northern Spacetime. Eliminating it might even be a merit!”","He finished and nodded at Jian Wushuang, clearly agreeing with his idea and actions.","“Three to one, there’s nothing more to say. If you don’t want to do it, just pretend you didn’t see it!” Jian Wushuang was too lazy to persuade further and issued an ultimatum.","Actually, Hu Qing had a point. Exploring this place was solving a problem for the Northern Spacetime.","If they didn’t explore and left now to inform the Realm King, he might not have any solution either.","Eventually, they would still rely on them.","No one knew why Wu Zuo suddenly became cautious.","Perhaps he truly cared for the beings of the world!","He felt uneasy not informing Realm King about such a significant matter in advance.","But he also had his own thoughts.","When Wu Zuo heard they wanted to exclude him, he quickly said, “I agree, I didn’t say I didn’t! ... Just, regardless of the outcome, we must report this to Realm King, Brother Wushuang. We are cultivators, and while we consider our own power, we must also think about the safety of the entire Northern Spacetime!”","“Brother Wu Zuo is right, I agree with that!” Hu Qing nodded in agreement."]},{"number":6049,"title":"Chapter 6049: Crossing the Nianshen Secret Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 6049: Crossing the Nianshen Secret Realm","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and stared intently at Wu Zuo, creating a tense atmosphere.","Seeing the terrifying look in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, Wu Zuo was startled and quickly retreated, saying, “Brother Wushuang, this is just a small matter. You’re not going to kill me to silence me, are you?”","Smack!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward, coming face to face with Wu Zuo. Staring into his eyes, his voice turned exceptionally cold as he said, “I didn’t expect your ambitions to be this great!”","After scaring Wu Zuo a bit, he retracted his stern expression and continued, “I also agree with this matter. I’ll inform the Realm King afterwards!”","Hearing this, Wu Zuo finally breathed a sigh of relief.","“Babata, change direction and head towards the core of the Nianshen Secret Realm. I want to traverse the entire Nianshen Secret Realm!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the pyramid broke through time and space, along with those restrictions, and rushed in the opposite direction.","However, they also knew that they might not have control over their direction.","Searching like this might not lead them anywhere.","So, Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing destroyed the restrictions along the way. By doing so, the core area of the Nianshen Secret Realm couldn’t operate anymore, naturally opening up the route.","What they didn’t know was that, even flying aimlessly, they could encounter the manipulator behind all this.","Because the Nian God had quietly descended.","“Take action!”","Boom!","The pyramid, which was shuttling through time and space, encountered a towering nian beast head-on, which slapped it away with one hit.","The divine power just displayed definitely exceeded 20 million divine power.","Jian Wushuang was also taken aback.","The pyramid, out of control, flew backward, crashing into several dangerous places before coming to a steady stop.","“If it’s attacking us on its own, it saves us the trouble of searching for it!”","He wasn’t surprised by the divine power that the nian beast unleashed.","He and Hu Qing immediately left the pyramid.","Wutian and Wu Zuo stayed in the pyramid, as they couldn’t participate in battles of this level.","“Hu Qing, don’t reveal our true strength. It seems they’ve been targeting us for a long time!” Jian Wushuang reminded him through voice transmission.","The distant nian beast was also staring at them.","However, it didn’t attack again, nor did it move.","This puzzled Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, Hu Qing’s eyes flickered, and he made a shocking discovery, “Brother Wushuang, something’s not right. Although these nian beasts have different levels of divine power, I can feel that their life levels are the same!”","On the way, Hu Qing had a thorough understanding of killing so many nian beasts.","Jian Wushuang also raised his eyebrows and used his mind power to actively investigate.","He did not find anything different.","Was there no difference from those ordinary nian beasts on the periphery?","That meant the life level of the nian beasts had not changed, but their divine power could vary.","“This... impossible!” Jian Wushuang hurriedly took out two demon cores.","One was from the beast Hu Qing had slain on Flame Mountain.","The other was obtained in the Flowing Sand Domain.","The two were originally vastly different.","But after arriving here, he found that the two demon cores were identical, containing the same amount of power.","In other words, the strength of the nian beasts did not depend on the strength of divine power but on the terrain!","In a special area, they would become stronger.","The nian beasts on the periphery had the combat power of the third and fourth Tribulation realm.","But in the inner area, there were those with the combat power of the Seventh Tribulation.","It was not because they were individually stronger.","It was due to their location.","If all the nian beasts were at the core, they would have the combat power of the eighth Tribulation realm.","“So miraculous, no wonder!”","He had underestimated these nian beasts!","Currently, he could see that the core of the Nianshen Secret Realm was likely controlled by someone or a powerful alien race.","Otherwise, they would not be surrounded.","“Tsk tsk, I was wondering why there were groups of nian beasts at the eighth Tribulation realm level here, and why they didn’t directly guard the periphery of the Nianshen Secret Realm. It turns out that when they reached the periphery, their power was reduced!” Jian Wushuang moved his wrist, finding the situation increasingly interesting.","This place was roughly the core of the entire Nianshen Secret Realm.","But it was not the center.","In other words, moving forward, they might encounter stronger nian beasts.","Possibly even exceeding thirty million divine power.","Just like Akatsuki in the Ten Thousand Willows Divine Tree.","But they were also different from before.","Jian Wushuang swung his wrist and shouted, “Leave this nian beast to me!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the aura around him began to rise.","His figure flashed, shattering spacetime, and appeared directly in front of the nian beast.","At full burst, surpassing 20 million divine power, there were no constraints.","It was extremely exhilarating.","Standing in front of the nian beast, although his divine body had already transformed into his own form, towering and immense.","But it was still a head shorter than the nian beast.","“Gulp!” The nian beast’s eyes also contained intelligence. Feeling Jian Wushuang’s vast divine power, its heart sank.","Jian Wushuang, however, smiled slightly, lowered his head, and raised his arms suddenly, clenching both fists, and charged fiercely, transforming into a roaming dragon. The blue divine power filled the entire space.","His fists turned into dragons, directly crashing the nian beast into the sky.","He didn’t give the opponent any chance to breathe, lifted his leg, and kicked the nian beast’s head hard.","This blow directly caused cracks in the opponent’s divine body.","“Ah!!!!” Despite such a fierce attack, Jian Wushuang did not relent. He continuously gathered divine power in his hands, and two blue blasts flew out from his hands.","“Ha!”","The two divine power attacks, reaching their peak, hit the nian beast’s divine body solidly.","Directly shattering the opponent’s divine body.","This nian beast, with a divine power of over 20 million, had no chance to fight back under his attack.","He himself felt it somewhat unreal.","“Be careful!” At this moment, Hu Qing in the distance seemed to have noticed something and hurriedly shouted to him.","Jian Wushuang had not yet reacted and felt his divine body being restrained by a pair of arms.","He wanted to turn around and check, but he couldn’t move his body at all.","His heart skipped a beat: “It’s the nian beast!”","It was the nian beast that took advantage of his relaxation to rush behind him and hold him tightly.","He still didn’t understand what it was trying to do.","Hu Qing anxiously rushed over, loudly reminding, “It’s going to take you with it to self-destruct!”","Self-destruct!","The divine power of over 20 million, which he easily shattered, seemed unimpressive.","But if this over 20 million divine power were to self-destruct.","That would be no joke.","In the Nianshen Secret Realm, without the restraint of life divine power, it could explode beyond 20 million divine power.","But this kind of thing was like pulling seedlings to encourage growth.","The divine power had increased, but the secret techniques and treasures had not kept up.","To withstand the self-destruction of over 20 million divine power.","Relying solely on the divine body was not enough.","It required absolutely powerful treasures.","His mind raced, thinking back and forth, and it seemed he had no life-saving treasures on him."]},{"number":6050,"title":"Chapter 6050: I’m Not Dead Yet!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6050: I’m Not Dead Yet!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Only the Tribulation Armor could be used.","However, the current base divine power of the Tribulation Armor amplified to 2 million, and its defensive capability had a limit of 20 million at most.","The nian beast behind him possessed divine power surpassing 20 million.","“Damn it!” Jian Wushuang turned his head with difficulty, and before he could think of a countermeasure, a dazzling light exploded from behind, reflecting on his face.","Boom!!!","A huge explosion sound directly sent those who had rushed over flying into the distance.","The entire Nianshen Secret Realm trembled threefold.","The area where they were located began to collapse, but it did not implode.","Hu Qing, noticing this, was also taken aback.","The structure of the Nianshen Secret Realm intrigued them more and more.","It could fully unleash divine power, clearly indicating a life level higher than the Northern Spacetime.","However, the Nianshen Secret Realm was located in the midstream of the Northern Spacetime.","Realm King!","Would he know?","But now was not the time to think about that; the self-destruction just now was too powerful.","Hu Qing tentatively called out, “Brother Wushuang?”","Seeing no response, his heart sank, truly fearing that Jian Wushuang had fallen.","Buzz!","With a move of divine power, the surrounding dust instantly converged into a point.","The dust disappeared, and the ground was long gone.","But in a collapsed void, Jian Wushuang’s body was curled up in a ball, motionless.","At this moment, the pyramid also flew over, seeing Jian Wushuang below.","Wuzuo flew out directly, “Brother Wushuang?”","“He can’t be dead, can he?” Wutian’s expression was also somewhat grim. Although he had fallen into the demonic path, his relationship with Jian Wushuang was still quite special.","He was genuinely worried about Jian Wushuang’s safety.","Plop!","Jian Wushuang’s curled-up body trembled slightly, then he turned over, lying on his back.","“Ha!” He gasped heavily, his voice hoarse, “I’m not dead yet!”","Seeing him still able to move, everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","The three hurriedly flew over.","Hu Qing held the power of life, beginning to help Jian Wushuang recover his Origin Source.","Wuzuo took out some treasures for repairing the divine body and handed them to Jian Wushuang.","Wutian, looking around, found nothing worth taking out from himself, so he took out a jug of wine.","“Ugh!” Jian Wushuang’s face was pale, he covered his mouth and coughed dryly a few times, then took the wine jug and took a swig.","It had just been too dangerous.","Just a little more, and he wouldn’t have been able to hold on.","Fortunately, the Tribulation Armor had finally erupted.","It helped him withstand the attack.","Otherwise, there would have been a corpse left here.","“That nian beast...” Jian Wushuang gasped and continued, “It was definitely being controlled by someone. I could feel the intense desire to survive in it, but it still chose to self-destruct in the end. I fear someone is scheming against us in the core of the Nianshen Secret Realm and doesn’t want us to go deeper!”","Hu Qing also nodded and shared her reasoning.","“What?” Wu Zuo exclaimed, “How is that possible? The divine power of these nian beasts depends on the terrain. Does that mean there could be a group of nian beasts with more than 20 million divine power in the core?”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang, fully restored in divine power, stood up, took a sip from his wine flask, and said to everyone, “We’ve arrived. In the core, we might face a group of nian beasts with more than 20 million divine power.”","Wutian, though sinister and ruthless by nature, was also somewhat afraid. He said excitedly, “Are we still going to proceed?”","“What for?”","He couldn’t understand anymore.","If they were seeking to understand why the life level here was so high, the price was too great.","It might be better to leave now.","They hadn’t encountered a group of nian beasts yet.","Just one nian beast with more than 20 million divine power had nearly cost Jian Wushuang his life.","They really had no need to take such risks.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and shook his head, saying, “I’m afraid it’s difficult to leave now!”","He looked into the darkness ahead, where there was an entire forest.","A dark forest.","The area they had just been in was right next to this dark forest.","He guessed that place was likely the core of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","And also the place controlling the Nianshen Secret Realm.","“Who could it be?” He trembled slightly inside. He couldn’t think of anyone capable of creating such a secret realm.","Moreover, someone who could control it.","The person behind this was probably not a strong figure from the Northern Spacetime.","Most likely, they came from another spacetime.","Just like the Ten Thousand Willows Divine Tree.","Back then, the Ten Thousand Willows Divine Tree was brought by Weiss.","And inside the Ten Thousand Willows Divine Tree, there was a mechanical tribe’s intelligent brain.","A metal life form.","This came from the Southern Spacetime.","Also, Xilu was from the Southern Spacetime.","Could this place also be from the Southern Spacetime?","The Southern Spacetime had always been targeting them.","He couldn’t help but think this way.","If it were true, this time the trouble would indeed be great.","No less than the threat in the Ten Thousand Willows Divine Tree.","But last time they had Danbao to rely on; this time, no one would come to their rescue.","Relying solely on mortal bodies, so-called tens of millions of divine power was useless.","The other party could create a reverse heaven-like region like the Nianshen Secret Realm.","They didn’t need to guess to know that the other party definitely had means to threaten their lives.","Wutian’s words were not something he hadn’t considered.","Only when they truly understood did they realize they had no choice left.","Everyone also looked towards the dark forest.","It seemed to coil around an ancient beast god, giving them an invisible sense of oppression.","“Everyone, you need to think clearly. This might be the only chance in your lifetime...” Jian Wushuang turned to look at the three, explaining the importance of this matter.","If they controlled the Nianshen Secret Realm, they could walk unchallenged in the future.","As for Mie Sheng, returning to the downstream would allow them to annihilate him.","Of course, the premise was not to let Mie Sheng go unrestrained.","They were looking for a way to have their divine power unrestrained, which would perfectly suppress Mie Sheng.","Wutian gritted his teeth, “I cannot participate in this battle. It’s up to your decision!”","“Brother Wu Zuo, you take the pyramid and leave the Nianshen Secret Realm. Hu Qing and I will go on!” He also knew that the others couldn’t help this time.","If they all went, they might be wiped out by the enemy.","Wu Zuo hesitated, “Shouldn’t we leave the pyramid with you?”","“No need!” Hu Qing said at this moment, “The power required inside the pyramid is not enough to sustain this kind of battle!”","Jian Wushuang nodded firmly, “Say no more, you leave first, and leave the rest to us!”","At this moment, Wutian seemed to think of something and asked in surprise, “Is Mie Sheng really that powerful?”","If it weren’t for the threat of Mie Sheng, he couldn’t understand why Jian Wushuang was so desperate."]},{"number":6051,"title":"Chapter 6051: Juyang, from the Giant God Clan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6051: Juyang, from the Giant God Clan!","“Perhaps!” Jian Wushuang didn’t fully reveal the truth, knowing that only Wu Zuo and he truly understood the power of Mie Sheng.","Wu Zuo had learned about it from Realm King; he had witnessed it in the Wanliu Divine Tree.","In fact, he was the one with the most authority to speak on the matter.","Back then, when Mie Sheng incarnated in the Great Monk, the divine power he erupted with was beyond everyone’s imagination.","A god among the Starry Sky!","He didn’t even regard the Realm King as important.","In the end, it was Weiss who stepped in to resolve it.","Although Mie Sheng, in the downstream spacetime, was constrained by divine power,","They still couldn’t relax their vigilance.","The opponent’s Temple of Annihilation was an artifact.","If there was an opportunity to improve himself, Jian Wushuang wished he could reach the","Ninth Tribulation immediately to deal with Mie Sheng.","Therefore, when he discovered something unusual in the Nianshen Secret Realm this time, he wanted to explore it.","Every bit of strength he gained increased his hope of defeating Mie Sheng.","So, he couldn’t give up.","This was indeed the only opportunity.","They were about to return to the downstream spacetime, and the time left for them was running out.","“Take care, and don’t push yourself too hard!” Wu Zuo sighed and said solemnly.","After saying that, he left decisively with Wutian.","The two of them took the pyramid, along with the others who were still unaware, intending to leave the core area.","Watching the pyramid disappear from sight, Jian Wushuang said, “Now it’s our turn to act!”","If the pyramid wanted to leave the Nianshen Secret Realm, they had to attract the one in the","core.","Otherwise, the pyramid would definitely be intercepted and killed.","This was why he wanted Wu Zuo to take the pyramid away.","With the pyramid, at least they had a means of protection.","Their divine power hadn’t surpassed 20 million.","In fact, Jian Wushuang’s own divine power hadn’t reached 20 million.","It was just that during his Tribulation, he had refined golden divine power.","One force breaking a hundred others, resulting in his current combat power.","The two of them stepped into the void, rushing towards the direction of the Dark Forest.","The Dark Forest.","Inside that mysterious cave.","“Splitting up?” The face behind the throne showed a hint of surprise, and said calmly, “Are they afraid?”","Below the throne, there were three figures.","These three could be said to be the kings among the nian beasts.","Don’t underestimate the nian beasts by their life levels or divine power.","They had extremely complete bloodline inheritances.","The three nian beasts standing below the throne were the ones with the purest bloodlines in the entire Nianshen Secret Realm. Calling them Beast Gods wouldn’t be an exaggeration.","Moreover, they were ancient-level Beast Gods.","However, these three Beast Gods, whose bloodlines were incomparably pure, appeared to be overly cautious in the presence of the being on the throne.","They did not even dare to breathe loudly.","“Lord, what should we do now?” The three Beast Gods cautiously sought guidance, their eyes filled with fear.","This fear did not come from Jian Wushuang and the others but from the lord on the throne.","It was known that both Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing possessed divine power that could surpass 20 million.","If not for being in the Dark Forest, they could have easily defeated these Beast Gods.","But even so, they were not afraid.","They were not even afraid of death!","Just like the previous one, who chose to self-destruct.","They were not afraid of death, yet they feared the lord on the throne.","This situation was extremely peculiar.","If outsiders saw this, they would certainly say the three Beast Gods were foolish. They were not enslaved, so why didn’t they dare to fight?","However, outsiders did not know that even though they were not enslaved, their tribe was firmly controlled by this Cave Lord.","The entire Nianshen Secret Realm was created by this lord.","The Nian tribe could thrive until now also because of the Cave Lord.","If the lord on the throne felt they were no longer useful, he could rename the Nianshen Secret","Realm at any time.","This was the source of their fear.","They were willing to sacrifice their lives to maintain their value.","How pathetic.","“What to do?” The face on the throne froze slightly, then under the dark red halo, revealed a","horrifying face.","A face that was utterly decayed.","But judging from the facial features, it was clear that he was of the human race.","He looked up, overlooking the three Beast Gods of the Nian tribe below, and said coldly, “If I have to teach you how to handle this kind of situation, then there is no need for you to stay.” “No, no, we just didn’t expect these two damned human experts to discover the Dark Forest, and even... even Nian Seven’s death couldn’t stop them...”","The three Beast Gods hurriedly explained in fear.","It was mainly because this was the first time they encountered such a situation, where someone could come to the Dark Forest.","“Hmph!” The decayed figure on the throne slowly stood up, his body also decayed. Standing in front of the throne, he said in a cold voice, “Since Sang Gou couldn’t deal with them, then you go. If you can’t do it, let your descendants go, until the tribe is exterminated!”","Hearing the word extermination, although the three Beast Gods were terrified, they still harbored resentment in their hearts.","If they could kill the opponent, they were willing to die ten times.","But they understood that everything was given by the other party, and taking it back was just a","matter of lifting a finger.","So they had no choice!","“Go!” The decayed lord slightly raised his hand, visible fragments fell off his arm, without the skin covering, it was clear that his bones had a halo, which was metal!","The three kings of the Nianshen tribe left in despair.","On the throne, the decayed face made a decision.","“It seems the plan needs to be advanced!” The decayed figure played with the mysterious","token in his hand, injecting a wisp of thought power, and said gloomily, “Juyang, you should take your people and get out. The entire Middle Spacetime will become my ruined army in","three days!”","Thought power was injected into the token.","This message instantly reached Giant Peak Spacetime, the second-ranked in the middle-level spacetimes, following the Nianshen Secret Realm.","The ‘Giant Sun Immortal Lord’, or ‘Juyang’ was the overlord of Giant Peak Spacetime.","A peak Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation.","Only slightly weaker than the Abyssal Lord.","Moreover, he was from the legendary Giant God Clan!","At this moment, in a certain palace in Giant Peak Spacetime, upon receiving this message, Immortal Lord Juyang was first stunned, then couldn’t help but sigh.","“It seems the treasure of Abyssal Spacetime does not belong to me!” Immortal Lord Juyang","shook his head, losing the desire to compete.","If it were the Abyssal Lord, he had the time and confidence to contend with him.","But the existence from the Nianshen Secret Realm had notified him, and it was merely a one-","sided notification.","There was no room for negotiation.","Born in the Starry Sky, drifting to the Northern Spacetime.","In fact, this was his homeland.","But now, it was about to be destroyed.","“We should leave!” Juyang Immortal Lord turned to look at a few figures below the grand","hall, his voice somewhat desolate.","Although the Giant Peak Spacetime was vast and powerful, comparable to the Abyss Spacetime, and could be considered a dominant figure in the entire mid-level spacetime, the treasures he cared about were his fellow clansmen of the Giant God Clan, who shared his","status.","It was also a stroke of luck that he encountered several fellow clansmen in the mid-level of the Northern Spacetime, and they were all from the direct lineage of the Giant God Clan.","Although the Giant Peak Spacetime was vast and powerful, comparable to the Abyssal Spacetime, and could be considered a dominant figure in the entire mid-level spacetime, the treasures he cared about were his fellow clansmen of the Giant God Clan, who shared his","status.","It was also a stroke of luck that he encountered several fellow clansmen in the mid-level of the Northern Spacetime, and they were all from the direct lineage of the Giant God Clan."]},{"number":6052,"title":"Chapter 6052: Meeting an Old Friend in a Foreign Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 6052: Meeting an Old Friend in a Foreign Land","“Juyang, are you willing to accept this?”","A figure standing below stepped forward.","He showed no respect towards the second strongest in the middle-level-level Spacetime, instead showing some contempt.","In the entire Giant Peak Spacetime, no one dared to speak to Immortal Lord Juyang like this.","But when Immortal Lord Juyang heard this, he only sighed lightly and did not blame him. Because the person speaking, like him, was also a powerful member of the Giant God Clan. Moreover, he was from the direct lineage of the Giant God Clan.","In other words, they were family, sharing the same bloodline.","“Hmph!” Although this did not make Immortal Lord Juyang angry, another powerful member of the Giant God Clan could not hold back any longer and said coldly, “Frolasa, don’t forget who took you in at the beginning. Now you’re complaining, without even considering your own weight!”","Frolasa!","If Jian Wushuang heard this name, he would definitely be shocked.","This was the very divine spirit of the Giant God Clan who once threatened Qishen Temple.","In front of mortals, he was considered a deity.","Now, he was merely a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation.","Over millions of eras, this deity had risen from the First Tribulation to the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation in one breath.","Standing next to him was another Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation.","“Fuego!”","And there was also “Fimisa”, who was born after leaving Qishen Temple, who had also become a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation.","These two clearly sided with Frolasa.","So they dared to blame Immortal Lord Juyang.","After leaving Qishen Temple, Frolasa had not given up his habit of causing trouble. Hearing someone expose his past, his face darkened, and he shouted, “Chimei, don’t forget your status!”","The past events were indeed embarrassing. After being sent out by Zhen Ling, the three of them relied on Fuego to enter the middle-level-level Spacetime, where they happened to meet Immortal Lord Juyang.","At that time, Immortal Lord Juyang was already a peak strongman of the Eighth Tribulation. He was very happy to find his three clansmen and treated them without any airs.","Now, Frolasa and Fimisa were both peak strongmen of the Seventh Tribulation, and Fuego was of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Their wings had long been hardened.","Although they wouldn’t repay kindness with ingratitude, they wouldn’t voluntarily back down when it came to opportunities.","That Chimei, like Chi Jiuxiao, came from a collateral branch of the Giant God Clan and had no right to speak.","A shout of anger left him speechless.","Then, looking at Immortal Lord Juyang again, Flosa spoke once more, “Juyang, don’t forget, we are the Giant God Clan. What does that guy from Nianshen Secret Realm count for?”","The more Flosa spoke, the angrier he became. Being a member of the Giant God Clan was his greatest pride.","Although they were beaten like dogs in Qishen Temple in the past, now with their strength, they had gained confidence.","The key was that the strongman from Nianshen Secret Realm used to be a guardian of the Giant God Clan.","To call him a guardian was to put it nicely; he was essentially a guard dog.","Now, he was arrogantly riding over their heads.","Flosa naturally couldn’t stand it.","In response, Immortal Lord Juyang also had his own unspeakable difficulties.","If the person in the Nianshen Secret Realm had no backing, he wouldn’t have been so ready to slip away.","Instead, he would have summoned a powerful clan member to descend.","But that person had a background not inferior to their Giant God Clan.","Nothing could be done!","With almost equivalent backgrounds.","It then depended on individual ability.","His current strength was clearly not a match.","The guardian deity of the Giant God Clan, at the very least, was a Nine Tribulation Realm expert.","“Sigh!” Immortal Lord Juyang sighed and said, “No matter what, he is a demigod, and the person behind him is likely someone even our clan’s ancestor wouldn’t easily provoke. Making an enemy over such a small matter is really not worth it!”","“Does this mean the glory of our Giant God Clan is worth less than half a coin?” Frolasa was relentless, clearly not ready to leave.","Immortal Lord Juyang took a deep breath, squinting his eyes at Frolasa, feeling something was off.","In the past, although Frolasa was also arrogant, his arrogance was backed by his abilities. Not to mention his strength, his intellect alone made him one of the top figures in the entire middle-level Spacetime.","Frosa had been managing the entire Giant Peak Spacetime all along.","Although Juyang was called Immortal Lord, he was essentially just a top enforcer.","Normally, even he would heed Frolasa’s advice because Frolasa’s suggestions made sense.","But this time, it was so unusual that there was definitely something he didn’t know.","“If there’s something, just say it!” Immortal Lord Juyang said as he sealed the spacetime and looked at Frolasa.","Frolasa then gave a sinister smile, revealing his confidence.","The change this time actually stemmed from the Nianshen Secret Realm.","They had known for a long time that a mysterious expert from the upper-level spacetime had","descended.","When the pyramid entered the Nianshen Secret Realm, they also knew immediately, and nearly all the experts in middle-level spacetime saw it with their own eyes.","Not long after, something happened in the Nianshen Secret Realm.","They were being chased out.","Even a fool would know that it was definitely those Upper Spacetime experts who had caused","trouble in the Nianshen Secret Realm.","Of course, the experts from the upper-level spacetimes had nothing to do with them.","But they had something to do with Frolasa.","“Jian Wushuang!”","He had once personally visited the Nianshen Secret Realm to check the restrictions damaged","by the pyramid. In the Nianshen Secret Realm, he sensed the aura left by Jian Wushuang and","recognized him.","This made it related to him.","And just recently, he had also contacted Jian Wushuang.","He learned about Jian Wushuang’s findings in the Nianshen Secret Realm.","“Didn’t expect we’d meet this way!”","Frolasa and Jian Wushuang met through a token using Thought power.","They exchanged their information.","The core of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","The Dark Forest.","Jian Wushuang and Huiqing had already reached the edge.","“As I guessed, there really is an existence from an alien spacetime hidden here, and they come","from the Starry Sky!”","“Starry Sky?” Hu Qing’s expression darkened. Even though he was confident, hearing about a Starry Sky expert still made him involuntarily shocked!","It should be known that the Four Great Spacetimes were merely subsidiaries of the Starry Sky.","The real core was still the Starry Sky.","There, not only were the supreme rules complete, but there was also a complete cultivation system and an observable cultivation goal.","Jian Wushuang, however, remained calm about this.","He was someone who wielded the power of the Starry Sky and had his own Starry Sky.","Naturally, he didn’t think much of the Starry Sky.","Moreover, it was just an expert from the Starry Sky.","Mie Sheng also came from the Starry Sky.","His master, Xuan Yi, was likely from the Starry Sky as well.","And the divine spirit Frolasa back then also came from the Starry Sky.","The other side even claimed to be the number one clan in the Starry Sky!","When they met again, it was just like that.","Their realms were the same, but divine power...","Was vastly different.","He was much stronger than the so-called strongest clan, the Giant God Clan experts.","From what he learned from Frolasa, he also figured out the strength of the person behind the","scenes.","“Just a Scattered Tribulation, nothing to worry about!”"]},{"number":6053,"title":"Chapter 6053: The Sword Raises","paragraphs":["Chapter 6053: The Sword Raises","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Scattered Tribulation?” Hu Qing furrowed his brow and asked in surprise, “Brother Wushuang, how did you know?”","He had practiced the Heavenly Dao but could not deduce the crisis ahead, yet Jian Wushuang knew. Wasn’t that surprising?","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and said, “I met an old acquaintance, and he told me!”","The matter of Frolasa could be discussed later. For now, they still had to enter the Dark Forest and find out who was behind this.","The secret of the Nianshen Secret Realm was something he had to uncover.","Moreover, the other party had no intention of letting them go, so they might as well eliminate them entirely.","The Ninth Tribulation realm wasn’t frightening!","Especially when it was a Scattered Tribulation.","With him and Hu Qing working together, they were more than capable of handling it.","It could be seen as a chance to practice in advance.","After all, there were no restrictions in this place, and both of them could unleash divine power exceeding 20 million.","How much divine power could that Ninth Tribulation realm Scattered Tribulation have?","He really couldn’t speculate without more information from Frolasa.","After entering the Dark Forest, he felt that this place resembled the scorched earth left behind by Moro Spacetime.","The drained power here created a suffocating sensation.","“Something’s wrong!” Hu Qing’s body halted abruptly, coming to a complete stop.","Since they had entered the other party’s stronghold, something being off was normal.","But for Hu Qing to stop, he must have sensed danger.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze swept around, his single hand slightly moving back, ready to draw his sword at any moment.","He maintained his Super Ancient Transformation, with divine power of 18 million.","If he used the Origin Source Dojo, he could surpass 20 million at any time.","The person behind this was a Ninth Tribulation realm expert, so it was better to be cautious.","Speaking of which, this was his first encounter with a Ninth Tribulation realm expert, and he was curious.","“Have you discovered something?” He kept his eyes vigilant, observing his surroundings.","Hu Qing formed a hand seal, and an eye appeared above his forehead, seemingly probing the surroundings.","Buzz!","A highly concealed disturbance, which even Jian Wushuang hadn’t noticed, was directly locked onto by Hu Qing, who loudly reminded, “Southwest, someone is setting up a formation!”","Clang!","Jian Wushuang drew his sword immediately. The ice-blue blade slid out of the scabbard and instantly cut through countless shrubs.","“Spacetime!”","The fourth sword move.","A sword move powerful enough to kill all in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","It steadily suppressed the spacetime of the Nianshen Secret Realm.","It slashed in the direction Hu Qing had indicated.","“Setting up a formation?”","If they fought openly, they naturally wouldn’t be afraid, but they feared being trapped by a formation.","By then, they would have to fight whether they could win or not.","The control would be entirely in the opponent’s hands.","It had to be broken.","The Spacetime Sword shattered the space of the Dark Forest, freezing time.","The king of the nian beasts, who was setting up the formation, didn’t even realize he had been exposed.","He couldn’t feel time at all.","He only felt himself slowing down.","Then he entered a shattered spacetime.","“Dis....cov....ered....” he barely managed to say before his divine body began to shatter.","Along with the unfinished formation around him, everything shattered.","Like a mirror.","Shattered space, shattered scene.","“Third Brother!”","On the other side of the Dark Forest, sensing the disappearance of his companion’s divine power.","The leader of the nian beasts, unable to contain his grief, erupted in fury.","The three formations were interconnected, with one broken, the rest were rendered useless.","Now they could only brace themselves and charge forward.","“Huff!” Jian Wushuang’s breath was a bit unstable.","Although he had reached the level of minor achievement in the Spacetime Sword, it was still a bit taxing.","The full-force strike just now had reduced his breath by 30 percent.","But it didn’t affect his divine power.","“Are you okay?” Hu Qing looked at him, worried.","The power of that sword just now was extraordinary, even leaving Hu Qing in awe.","He shook his head and calmed himself, saying, “No problem, two auras are approaching, both with strong divine power, but they shouldn’t be the ones behind this!”","“Yes!” Hu Qing’s gaze also fixed ahead.","In an instant.","Two towering figures descended.","The other two kings of the nian beasts arrived.","They possessed 20-five million divine power in the Dark Forest.","If they had completed the formation, they would have been even stronger.","But that sword shattered their hopes.","“You killed my third brother, you must die today!” The towering king of the nian beasts, with blood-red eyes, symbolized rage.","He had no choice!","Today it was either them or Jian Wushuang and his companions who would die.","“Trash!” Jian Wushuang spat disdainfully.","He had already figured out the nian beasts’ strength, without the Nianshen Secret Realm, they were nothing.","The Spacetime Sword just now broke the spacetime of the Dark Forest, instantly lowering their divine power to a freezing point, allowing him to easily kill them.","But that sword also cost him an important trump card.","In the depths of the Dark Forest, within a cave mansion.","“Shattered spacetime, he actually comprehended spacetime!” The decayed face showed a shocked expression, exclaiming, “He’s only in the Seventh Tribulation realm, yet he’s so strong and even mastered the power of the Starry Sky!”","He, coming from the Starry Sky, had great confidence after being transformed by that great figure of the Southern Spacetime, but seeing Jian Wushuang’s methods, he was still stunned.","The power of the Starry Sky, a very special power even in the Starry Sky, could only be mastered by a few.","But it wasn’t too extraordinary.","As a great expert of the Ninth Tribulation realm.","He had seen such geniuses before.","Mainly, Jian Wushuang’s spacetime realm truly amazed him.","“A Seventh Tribulation Universe Master from an attached spacetime, so strong, the Starry Sky geniuses taught by the Star Spirits are no better, can’t even compare to a Universe Master from an attached spacetime, how ridiculous!” The decayed face showed disdain for those geniuses in the Starry Sky and also jealousy.","Star Spirits!","Great figures in the Starry Sky, silently watching their struggle.","Universe Master?","Even a Ninth Tribulation realm Universe Master was nothing.","Powerful Ninth Tribulation realm Universe Masters could reach the demi-god level, comparable to so-called Starry Sky True Gods, but what did it matter?","In front of the Star Spirits, they were all fleeting clouds.","Only Star Spirits were eternal.","Ninth Tribulation realm, though undying, many had fallen through countless eras, they couldn’t be considered immortal.","Only the 12 Star Spirits eternally ruled the Starry Sky.","Unshakable.","The so-called Eternal Beings of the Northern Spacetime were a joke in front of the Star Spirits.","Being a disciple of the Star Spirits was every cultivator’s dream.","To become a disciple of the Star Spirits, at the very least, one had to be a demi-god.","Even able to surpass the Universe Master, to comprehend the supreme Law Rules.","As a Ninth Tribulation realm expert, this was also his dream.","But with his divine body shattered, he lost everything.","Expelled from the Giant God Clan, he wandered to the Southern Spacetime, enduring countless humiliations.","Finally, with the guidance of that great figure, he came to the Northern Spacetime.","By mastering the Nianshen Secret Realm, he regained his former confidence."]},{"number":6054,"title":"Chapter 6054: Using Dao Techniques to Practice Buddhism","paragraphs":["Chapter 6054: Using Dao Techniques to Practice Buddhism","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Now that the overall situation was taking shape, he needed to reclaim everything he once had.","Originally, it wouldn’t have been so soon, but unfortunately, Jian Wushuang and the others discovered his plan, forcing him to act ahead of schedule.","The power of decay spread through his divine body.","It eventually covered the entire cave mansion!","Above the Dark Forest.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, each facing one opponent.","The two kings of the Nianshen Clan, sparing no divine power, attacked frantically.","They had already reached a state of madness.","Unfortunately, although their divine power was strong, it could only bully ordinary beings in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","To Jian Wushuang, it posed no threat at all.","Because tms divine power did not originally Delong to tnem.","As for Hu Qing, he was even more at ease.","The divine power displayed by the Nianshen Clan, to be precise, was still too illusory.","They had no means of amplification, only relying on the terrain of the Nianshen Secret Realm to increase their divine power.","But the level of their life force had not changed at all.","This was the essential difference.","Their life force level remained unchanged.","It was like a child with the strength of an adult.","You might be strong, but your defense falls short.","And also, there’s the reaction speed.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power was clearly maintained at around 20 million, yet he could effortlessly outfight his opponent.","Holding the Wanjie Sword, he effortlessly dodged the attacks of the Nian Beast King.","Whoosh!","In the moment of passing by, he casually slapped the opponent’s back.","With a move of his divine power, his overwhelming strength, far surpassing the Nian Beast, directly tore the opponent’s back apart.","Exposing the transparent divine body.","“Death Sword!”","A sword shadow split out from his Origin Source, even without using the Wanjie Sword, it could unleash such a powerful Death Sword.","This was the Death Sword after reaching perfection.","Buzz!","Billions of sword shadows poured out, what Jian Wushuang saw was the black sword shadows condensed from the sky full of black mist.","But when the nian beast turned around, it saw countless death gods, wielding scythes as if to harvest its life.","The Death Sword was most suitable for dealing with those with lower Life force levels.","Everything restrained each other.","Jian Wushuang could restrain everything.","To deal with Life, he had Death.","To deal with Death, he had Life.","He would never be at a disadvantage.","“Die! ” A furious shout sealed the opponent’s fate.","The Nian Beast King stumbled and turned around, waving his hands helplessly to block.","But it couldn ‘t touch anything.","This was the gap in realms.","An unbridgeable gap.","Moreover, Death just happened to restrain his weak Life force.","At this moment, it could only wait for Death.","Countless black sword shadows pierced through the Nian Beast King’ s divine body.","Puff, puff, puff!! !!","The eyes of the Nian Beast King were filled with unwillingness.","At the moment of death, it seemed not to regret.","“Big brother!”","The other Nian Beast King, fighting Hu Qing from a distance, had also reached a dead end. Seeing its big brother fall, it could no longer endure.","After a mournful cry, a dazzling light burst from its divine body.","” Be careful! ” Jian Wushuang instantly retreated, simultaneously reminding, “This lunatic is going to self-destruct! ”","Having suffered once, how could he suffer a second time?","He immediately fled backwards.","Although the enemy’s Life force level was low, the power of his divine energy was real. Though somewhat illusory, when he exploded, the divine energy quantum he split into was not illusory at all. Last time, he almost died from this.","So he always guarded against it.","He would never fall for it a second time.","But Hu Qing remained unmoved.","Facing the self-destruction of the Nian Beast King head-on, he did not flinch!","Zen! ” Infinite! ”","“Universe!”","“Earth Bind!”","Hu Qing chanted, palms together!","With Daoist Spells, he walked the path of Buddhism!","Knowing and doing were united!","The four directions became one!","The explosion did not spread.","It stopped in front of Hu Qing and disappeared.","“Virtuous!” Putting his hands together and murmuring a chant, Hu Qing turned his head and said, “Brother Wushuang, let’s keep moving forward! ”","“Alright...”","Jian Wushuang felt a bit speechless, silently thinking to himself, “Is it necessary? A single movement could get us away, but he insists on crushing the last shred of hope for the opponent! ”","A monk!","Practicing Buddhism yet capable of creating more demonic thoughts.","No wonder the Tongtian Buddha transformed into the infernal demon.","There are traces to follow.","Always thinking of doing good deeds.","If peace reigned throughout the world, they would be useless.","So, wouldn’t a few demon children need to appear to show off their might!","Wutian could be said to have been born for this purpose.","After Hu Qing’s Buddhist Dao transformed, he improved quite a bit.","But his methods became more sharp and decisive, less dragging.","Thinking about it, it’s quite good.","Swoosh!","“Wait for me! ”","In a flash, he caught up.","They continued heading deeper into the Dark Forest.","Passing through the massive bushes, they didn ‘t see a single living thing.","There were no longer any nian beasts to obstruct them.","What they didn’t know was that all the nian beasts had disappeared at this point.","The power of decay had already covered the entire Nianshen Secret Realm.","Jian Wushuang had never encountered such power, so he didn’t find anything suspicious.","The power of the Starry Sky was extremely rare.","But the power of decay was even more special.","It belonged to a branch of destructive divine power.","It wasn’t considered the power of Destruction.","Because the power of Destruction transcended the supreme Law Rules, it was divine power.","It was the power used by gods.","The power of decay, when cultivated to its peak, could also rival divine power.","However, the power of the Starry Sky inherently came from the Starry Sky.","Even if cultivated to its peak, it would only be demigod level.","But the Starry Sky power that Jian Wushuang used came from his own Origin Source Starry Sky, so he didn’t have this limitation.","Even if he did, he wouldn’t know it.","They kept flying through the Dark Forest.","The less danger they encountered, the more cautious they became.","Even Hu Qing couldn’t detect any dangerous aura.","Either the opponent was hiding very well, or the opponent was truly powerful and didn’t need to hide, making them undetectable.","Huh","While they were flying mid-air, they noticed something was wrong on the ground.","Jian Wushuang was the first to stop, exclaiming, “Something’s off, why has the ground changed color?”","“Red, turning into black?” Hu Qing also showed a surprised expression.","When they entered the Dark Forest, the ground was red and the vegetation was black.","Now the ground and vegetation had merged, both turning black.","Swoosh!","The two of them landed on the ground.","Jian Wushuang gently scooped up a handful of black soil, sniffing it in his hand. A decaying aura instantly made his aura wilt by three points.","Then he used his Thought power to probe, and it also wilted.","“There’s something strange, the person behind this must be making a move! ”","Dropping the soil, he looked up into the distance.","From this soil, he smelled a threat.","This threat was right ahead.","The avatar within his Origin Source was contacting Frolasa.","He had missed asking some things earlier because of the Nian Beast King.","He only knew that the opponent was a Scattered Tribulation at the Ninth Tribulation realm.","But he hadn’t asked about the opponent’s methods.","To control the Nianshen Secret Realm and drive the nian beasts to attack them so madly..."]},{"number":6055,"title":"Chapter 6055: Universe God","paragraphs":["Chapter 6055: Universe God","His means were far superior to those of his past opponents; he was absolutely an existence on par with Mie Sheng.","If the person behind all this knew what Jian Wushuang was thinking, he might have let out a smile.","Because he thought too highly of himself.","The Ninth Tribulation realm was indeed powerful, but compared to the Death God in the Starry Sky, it was still far inferior.","That was a true god.","Universe Masters who could achieve the status of demi-gods were very few.","Let alone those comparable to true gods.","The gods in the Starry Sky and the gods born in spacetime were worlds apart.","The gap between them could not be bridged.","This was also why no true god from the subsidiary rivers of spacetime would stay in spacetime to cultivate; they all went to the Realm God Continent.","The difference was too great.","Only the Realm God Continent could be comparable to the Starry Sky.","It was also where the strong from the four subsidiary spacetimes and even the Starry Sky gathered.","Because even gods needed to improve themselves.","Look at Mie Sheng.","Whether it was Mie Sheng seeking to advance further or Danbao perfecting his Life secret methods, it all required cultivation and scheming.","They could not just sit idly by.","Even gods needed to cultivate and seek opportunities.","Cultivators even more so; they wanted to become stronger.","The Universe Masters of the Ninth Tribulation realm were not enough; they needed to achieve the status of demi-gods or even rival the gods.","They had to break through the boundaries of the universe.","If they had no chance of attaining godhood, they had to become the gods of their own universe.","Universe Gods!","Jian Wushuang learned of this term from Frolasa.","“Universe God!” he couldn’t help but mutter to himself.","Perhaps this was the highest position!","If there was no godhood, then he would create one with his own hands.","But his universe contained a Starry Sky.","And now he had to take a new path. What should he call himself then?","“Starry Sky God?”","He shook his head, feeling he was thinking too far ahead.","For now, he needed to focus on his opponent.","The former Ninth Tribulation Universe Master, known as a demi-god.","“Let’s go!” A confident expression appeared on his face. Knowing some information about the opponent, he no longer felt tense. Instead, he casually said to Hu Qing, “I found him.”","Hu Qing’s face lit up with joy. Even his own calculations hadn’t revealed anything, yet Jian Wushuang managed to locate the opponent.","“It seems your Thought strength has increased significantly with your cultivation, Brother Wushuang!”","“Don’t be modest; compared to your Zen insight, I’m far behind. I just happened to learn something from an old acquaintance!” He smiled bitterly and shook his head. It was actually due to that power.","And the words Frolasa had said caught his attention.","Hu Qing’s Zen insight couldn’t predict it because the opponent had never existed in the Northern Spacetime.","It was beyond Hu Qing’s understanding.","The prediction could only sense an unknown threat, which kept them on alert!","Now that they were prepared, they were less worried.","They didn’t need to fly anymore; they directly tore through the space and teleported to the source of the threat.","A cave mansion exuding a dark red aura.","“This is it!”","He looked at the cave mansion and found nothing special; there were no formations around.","It didn’t look like a place where a strong person would retreat and rest.","According to Frolasa, the opponent was merely a Scattered Tribulation who was barely surviving.","Although he was in the Ninth Tribulation realm, he had lost his Origin Source, and even his divine body was shattered.","Only in the Starry Sky, where life was abundant, his life level had been elevated to perfection.","He wouldn’t die.","But he would deteriorate.","Deterioration was not like death.","It was something more terrifying than death.","Because once deteriorated, resurrection was useless.","Unless he could rebuild his divine body.","Even if he no longer needed the Origin Source and took the divine body route alone.","But rebuilding the divine body was no different from reincarnation.","Divine power was in the divine body. If the divine body had to be reforged, they might as well","start over with the soul too.","Sure, here is the translated script in past tense:","Without divine power, and with the Origin Source shattered after failing the Tribulation, only the soul remained. Starting from scratch, no matter how strong one’s state of mind was, it was difficult to reach new heights.","Moreover, it would be ten times more exhausting than the first time.","One would only avoid a few detours.","The early stages would go smoothly, but the later stages would be a kind of torment.","No one would use this method.","Most would choose to reincarnate.","But countless strong individuals disappeared after reincarnation.","Because to recover their past life memories, they needed to surpass their previous life’s","achievements.","Thus, countless reincarnated strong ones were lost.","But this was the best approach.","If unwilling to let the soul sink, one would fall into a closed loop, unable to surpass their","peak.","Tribulation!","Far more cruel than they had imagined.","Originally, they thought that reaching the Ninth Tribulation realm was the end.","Unexpectedly, there was still this barrier blocking their way forward.","The one in the cave had reached this dead end.","Of course, this was what Jian Wushuang believed.","He couldn’t figure out what the other party’s real purpose was.","Surely they weren’t here to sightsee in the Northern Spacetime!","Stretching his wrist, Jian Wushuang shouted loudly, “Sir, are you inviting us into the cave to","catch up, or will you come out to meet us?”","Either they went in, or the other party came out to meet.","Jian Wushuang could accept either choice.","He truly wanted to see how the other party managed to create the Nianshen Secret Realm,","able to isolate the Northern Spacetime, achieving true isolation from the heavens.","At this moment, they were like on the Realm God Continent.","Without restrictions.","“No movement?”","After shouting, the two waited for a long time, a full incense stick’s time, without any","movement, which made Jian Wushuang feel a bit awkward.","They had no choice but to be invited in.","Facing the dark red cave, Jian Wushuang felt no fear.","He wanted to see what was hidden inside!","Bang!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward but was stopped by Hu Qing before entering the cave.","“Brother Wushuang, why don’t I go ahead and explore, and you cover from behind!” “No, we can’t split up, it’s better to act together!” Without any hesitation, he directly rejected","Hu Qing’s suggestion. Although confident, he was not arrogant.","Splitting up left him without confidence.","Hu Qing’s strength was three points higher than his.","Before reaching the Eighth Tribulation realm, he couldn’t guarantee victory over Hu Qing.","The other party, like him, was also extraordinary, unable to fight across realms against Hu","Qing.","Together, without the constraints of divine power, they could face a Ninth Tribulation realm","opponent.","But if separated, it would be risky.","Seeing his determination, Hu Qing couldn’t argue further.","He prepared to enter together.","But at this moment, a violent force burst out from the cave.","Jian Wushuang struggled to resist, his divine power constantly shrinking.","His whole being began to wither.","“The King of Decay!” Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and shouted, “I know who you are, no need to hide!”","This time, as soon as he finished speaking, there was a response.","“Oh?” A lazy voice came from the cave, followed by a slightly surprised question, “Did Juyang","tell you?”"]},{"number":6056,"title":"Chapter 6056: My Name Is Berut","paragraphs":["Chapter 6056: My Name Is Berut","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Northern Spacetime, only Immortal Lord Juyang of the Giant God Clan knew his identity.","If it weren’t for the immense favor granted by the old ancestor of the Giant God Clan, he wouldn’t have bothered with those few members of the Giant God Clan.","Even if he was expelled, before disrupting the entire mid-level spacetime, he chose to notify the other party.","Unexpectedly, the other party turned around and betrayed him.","That last bit of gratitude was gone, and from then on, he had no connection with the Giant God Clan.","In the dark red cave dwelling, a withered leg emerged.","The missing pants leg revealed ghastly white bones.","Swoosh!","The entire figure appeared before Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","A skinny figure, with a nearly destroyed flesh body, and even the divine body showed numerous cracks.","Jian Wushuang, having seen much of the world, was not surprised by this.","Decay!","It was as expected.","Moreover, he clearly felt the other party’s divine power; with the flesh almost gone, the divine body was exposed and somewhat broken.","There was no way to conceal it.","Only the unique Decay power of the other party, which they had never seen before, prevented them from detecting it.","Now that they had witnessed this power, they could naturally pinpoint the other party next time.","But there would be no next time.","Meeting face to face, they were bound to determine victory or death.","A threat to the Northern Spacetime had to be eliminated.","Moreover, the other party had indeed done this.","The aura of Decay had already spread throughout the entire mid-level spacetime.","If allowed to succeed, the entire spacetime in mid-level would be completely cut off from the upper and lower levels.","Without the flow of the mid-level spacetime, the downstream and endstream would also be doomed.","By then, the entire Northern Spacetime would be left with only the upstream or upper level.","Realm King would be infuriated.","The figure with an incomplete face stood before Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, yet he exuded absolute confidence.","“To let you understand me better, listen carefully to every word I’m about to say!”","Jian Wushuang, intrigued, remained calm and gestured with his hand, “No rush, speak slowly!”","At their level, even if they were to decide life and death in the next moment, they had to remain calm!","That was the aura of a strong person.","“My name is Berut, from the Starry Sky!”","“I know!” Jian Wushuang spread his hands and continued, “Why don’t you tell us about the Nianshen Secret Realm? I’m very curious why divine power is not restricted here?”","“Well...” Berut looked somewhat embarrassed and awkwardly smiled, “I’m afraid you’ll only know after you kill me!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and said, “Then there’s no need for more useless talk!”","“Do it!”","“Take him down!”","He and Hu Qing each moved apart, forming a triangle to besiege Berut.","A Ninth Tribulation expert from the Starry Sky, Jian Wushuang had long wanted to test his strength.","This was the chance.","Buzz!","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","The perfect Super Eternal Ancient Transformation instantly brought his divine power to its peak.","Then came the descending arena.","Three rounds of sun and moon slowly rose, hanging high in the sky.","Jian Wushuang stood on Sky-Supporting Mountain, his right hand slightly trembling.","This wasn’t due to nervousness or fear, but because in his mind, he was constantly calculating the speed of drawing his sword.","To achieve the step of calculating ten thousand steps.","He had learned this from Hu Qing.","In battle, one must achieve the utmost perfection.","Fighting those nian beasts held no meaning; it didn’t allow him to feel the clash between strong individuals.","On the other side, Hu Qing also took his stance.","The third eye on his forehead had already manifested.","The Origin Source arena transformed into a chessboard.","Two figures emerged from it.","Future Self!","Equally heaven-defying secret techniques.","Divine power continued to climb.","Both their divine powers surpassed 25 million.","In the Dark Forest, more perfect and complete than that fiery mountain.","Their divine power was pushed to the extreme.","However, Hu Qing still had some hidden abilities. If he fully unleashed his future self, there might be no limits.","This was the terrifying part.","How powerful he would be in the future, he would be now.","The key was that Hu Qing’s Future Self was only maintaining the state of himself after 10 million or even 100 million eras.","If he could improve further and maintain the state of himself after a billion eras, he would likely be even more powerful.","“25 million, 27 million!”","Berut tilted his head, glanced at Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, and his expression was somewhat disdainful.","With a casual wave, a bright armor appeared on his body.","“If this is all you can do, then it will be you who will die!”","As soon as he finished speaking.","The battle wind gradually rose.","None of the three took the initiative to attack.","They were observing the changes in the aura.","Preparing to strike at the moment most advantageous to them.","Hu Qing’s Zen Insight played the greatest role at this moment.","He would be the first to break the deadlock.","“Zen!”","Buzz!","Hu Qing’s Future Self, with eyes wide open in rage, suddenly glared at Berut. His body twisted, hands moving back and forth, and a staff appeared in his hands.","Swinging the staff, he formed a shape resembling the sun and moon, and instantly attacked Berut.","Jian Wushuang, however, did not rush. He prepared to act at the opportune moment.","He had not yet seen Berut make a move.","Hence, he couldn’t draw his sword yet.","This time, he intended to use his strongest sword move.","To forcibly perform the Spacetime Reincarnation sword move.","He would use Berut, this Ninth Tribulation realm powerhouse, as his target.","Boom!","Before Hu Qing’s swung staff could land on Berut, it was blocked by a single finger from the latter!","“Hmph!” Berut sneered disdainfully, “Is that all?”","With a flick of his finger, he blocked.","With a second flick, he attacked!","In just the blink of an eye, Hu Qing’s Future Self was repelled.","That powerful force shot straight into the sky.","Hu Qing was entirely shaken back, clutching his chest as he felt the trembling of his Origin Source.","“Just now... what happened?” Hu Qing, after being repelled, still found it somewhat unbelievable. His attack had a divine power of 27 million, but when he approached the opponent, it suddenly decreased by 7 million.","Yet, the opponent’s strength hadn’t changed at all.","While Hu Qing was still puzzled, Jian Wushuang reminded him, “It’s the power of Decay; we’re still being constrained!”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang understood the problem.","He had felt it when the opponent appeared.","At that time, his divine power suddenly dropped, then surged back to its peak.","But Berut’s strength had never changed.","The threshold for the Ninth Tribulation realm was 20 million divine power.","But Berut was a genuine Ninth Tribulation powerhouse, with divine power definitely exceeding 30 million.","Even after achieving the Decaying Body, his divine power would still be above 20 million.","Even so, he and Hu Qing had this strength too!","Logically, they should be on par with him.","It was impossible for the gap to be so large.","One finger blocked Hu Qing’s attack, the second finger repelled him.","There was only one possibility.","They still hadn’t broken through that boundary.","Or rather, this boundary was controlled by Berut himself.","The opponent’s divine power, without their constraint, was indeed nothing special.","After coming to the Nianshen Secret Realm, Jian Wushuang felt his whole being elevate."]},{"number":6057,"title":"Chapter 6057: The Proudest Sword Strike","paragraphs":["Chapter 6057: The Proudest Sword Strike","The feeling of having no restraints made him overly confident.","Now, suddenly being grabbed by the throat, he realized just how difficult it was to surpass 20 million units of divine power.","Clang!","However!","No matter how powerful the opponent was, this place was still the Northern Spacetime.","He had to draw his sword and fight!","“Spacetime!”","Buzz!","The surrounding spacetime isolated the force of Decay, and his divine power was restored once again.","Although it would still be suppressed upon encountering the opponent, he couldn’t even touch the opponent without enhancing his power beyond 20 million.","“Reincarnation!”","The twin sword moves merged.","Spacetime Reincarnation!","With one strike, the vortex in the spacetime began to condense.","Forging the Spacetime Reincarnation.","“This is my proudest sword strike to date!”","Swoosh!","Sword Qi filled the sky, permeating the entire reincarnation.","A reincarnation forged by the sword.","Then let it be destroyed by the sword.","The fifth sword move of the Starry Sky Chronicles.","At this moment, it officially took form, symbolizing that he had reached a stage where he could fully execute a single complete strike since his initiation.","If this sword could not break through the power enveloping the opponent.","Then this time, they and Hu Qing had indeed hit a tough nut.","A thousand Tribulations forging reincarnation.","The Sword of Time suppressed spacetime.","The entire Dark Forest trembled!","“Spacetime, Reincarnation?” Berut showed a look of apprehension, his figure constantly retreating. The decayed figure wanted to evade but found that the surrounding area was all spacetime, making it impossible to escape.","His decayed body also had life.","The end of life was the cycle of death and reincarnation.","How could that be avoided?","“Domain!”","Knowing he couldn’t evade, Berut prepared to withstand this sword strike.","The Spacetime Reincarnation Sword contained the power of Origin Source.","It was augmented by the Origin Source of three perfect universes, equivalent to divine power exceeding 25 million.","At this moment, Berut’s divine power was about the same.","He naturally didn’t dare to confront it head-on, using the same means he had employed against Hu Qing once more.","Domain!","It was also the core of this Nianshen Secret Realm.","Buzz!","“Eh?” Jian Wushuang frowned, clearly feeling his power continuously weakening.","However, the weakening power was divine power, not his Origin Source.","Thus, the Spacetime Reincarnation Sword did not retreat at all; instead, the Origin Source surged.","“Haha!” At this moment, he also realized it and mocked, “Berut, your tricks are useless against me!”","The gigantic sword shadow condensed by the Spacetime Reincarnation tore through the entire Dark Forest, charging towards Berut.","The power of this sword strike was undeniably genuine.","As Berut resisted, his arms were directly shattered.","His already decayed body suffered even more damage at this moment.","“If you think this can defeat me, then you’re underestimating it!” A trace of blood appeared in Berut’s eyes, his lips curling up crazily.","He was known as the King of Decay, already beyond repair, so why fear damage to his divine","body?","Moreover, his reliance was not on the little divine power within himself.","It was the Nianshen Secret Realm beneath his feet.","“Domain!”","It could also be called “Divine Domain!”","In the domain, he was invincible.","“Break!”","Berut’s ethereal divine body merged into the domain, and the Dark Forest completely","vanished.","A grand dark abyss appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","At this moment, all the cultivators outside and all the super strong practitioners of the mid- level spacetime could see a massive abyss appearing in the Nianshen Secret Realm.","The abyss spun, slowly consuming the Origin Source and divine power of the entire miv-level spacetime.","Jian Wushuang’s most prideful strike fell into the abyss, like a stone sinking into the sea, without any reaction.","“Devour!”","The abyss continuously contracted, absorbing the essence of the entire mid-level spacetime.","This was true devouring.","The disappearance of the dark forest, leaving behind scorched earth, was evidence!","Just like what happened in Moro Spacetime.","He couldn’t help but swallow nervously, his voice trembling, “It’s over. He intends to devour","the entire mid-level spacetime!”","“Devour the entire mid-level spacetime?” Hu Qing was also stunned.","Mid-level spacetime, though not as profound as the upper-level spacetime, was not","something a single cultivator could contend with.","If the opponent could truly devour and assimilate it, by then, the entire mid-level spacetime","would be under Berut’s control, and the two of them wouldn’t even have the ability to escape.","“Stop him!” Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate; there was only one solution now.","Stop the opponent, or they would surely face death.","But how to stop him?","The abyss was Berut’s so-called ‘Domain’!","They couldn’t even find Berut’s true body.","They couldn’t possibly destroy this abyss!","For a moment, Jian Wushuang didn’t know where to start.","Gazing into the abyss, the abyss also stared back at him!","“Domain!” Hu Qing frowned, “Let me deduce it and see what makes this domain so","remarkable!”","Seeing Hu Qing’s confident expression, Jian Wushuang also smiled.","Facing everything head-on.","Fearless!","Whoosh!","Transforming into thousands, he rushed in all directions.","“I can devour too!”","In an instant, the entire Nianshen Secret Realm fell into the abyss.","Fortunately, the pyramid was fast enough not to be trapped inside.","The choice they made back then was correct, sending Wu Zuo and the others ahead.","Otherwise, they would all be doomed here.","“Wu Zuo, don’t come back, leave the mid-level spacetime directly!!!”","Realizing something was wrong, he had already informed Wu Zuo to leave.","And told him to inform Realm King of the situation here.","In fact, there was no need to notify; Realm King already knew.","The moment Berut stepped out of his cave, Realm King noticed the anomaly in mid-level","spacetime.","This made Realm King very distressed!","In his heart, he also complained why disasters followed Jian Wushuang and his group","wherever they went.","He really wanted to send them out of the Northern Spacetime immediately.","Sending them to the Realm God Continent, he didn’t believe they could cause any trouble","there.","In fact, before reaching the Realm God Continent, they had already sown the seeds of several formidable enemies.","Going there would mean becoming enemies with everyone?","Inside the pyramid leaving the Nianshen Secret Realm, Wu Zuo was uneasy after receiving the","transmission, but Babata ignored him and headed directly downstream.","“Wushuang, this joke has gone too far this time!”","In his anxiety, Wu Zuo summoned everyone to discuss countermeasures.","As for Realm King, he couldn’t be relied upon.","Now, he didn’t even have the qualification to enter the mid-level spacetime.","At this moment, the mid-level spacetime was like it was on the edge of an abyss.","To salvage it, they could only break the abyss.","Realm King’s avatar was blocked outside by the Law Rules within the abyss’s Domain.","He couldn’t get in, and even if he could, there was nothing he could do.","At most, he could only stand there in frustration!","“No!” Realm King gritted his teeth, standing outside the spacetime, unwilling to accept this!","His Northern Spacetime had suffered countless disasters, his true self had fallen in one of","those disasters, and if he lost the mid-level spacetime too, it would mean losing the lower-","level spacetime as well.","The lower-level spacetime wasn’t too important, but the end-level spacetime had a stabilizing effect on the Northern Spacetime. Losing the convergence point of the end-level spacetime would spell the end for the Northern Spacetime."]},{"number":6058,"title":"Chapter 6058: The Elder Brother of Realm King","paragraphs":["Chapter 6058: The Elder Brother of Realm King","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Only my elder brother can help now!” Realm King said helplessly as he traversed through spacetime, returning to the Realm God Continent and heading directly to a small island in the sea.","Last time, for the sake of the God of Life, he had visited several bigwigs in the Starry Sky, and in the end, Weiss intervened.","As a result, the Wanliu Divine Tree was almost destroyed.","Weiss was not going to help him again.","Moreover, seeking help from the Starry Sky at this time was useless; he could only rely on his friends on the Realm God Continent.","For instance, the “Great Realm King,” who governed the four subsidiary spacetimes.","Outside the Starry Sky, there were four subsidiary spacetimes.","Each had a Realm King representing the east, south, west, and north.","Above Realm Kings but below Realm King God.","There was also a low-key god.","He was the Great Realm King.","This Great Realm King was extremely low-key, rarely showing up, and few knew his whereabouts.","Only the four Realm Kings and Realm King God knew his residence.","The Northern Realm King adjusted his attire and, with a move, landed on the island.","“Elder Brother!”","Standing on the beach, Realm King called out, but no one responded.","After calling again, there was a slight sound from the island’s only wooden house.","The door of the wooden house was pushed open from the inside.","A delicate child walked out, and upon seeing the Northern Realm King, his face lit up with joy. He said, “Master predicted correctly, Uncle has indeed come!”","“Jing Xu, where is your master?” Northern Realm King had no time for pleasantries and quickly inquired about the whereabouts of the Great Realm King. If he were here, he would have come out, which clearly meant he wasn’t present.","Seeing the anxious look on the Northern Realm King’s face, Jing Xu calmly said, “Master has gone to Nantian Mansion to visit a friend. He should have just arrived!”","“Then I will...” Knowing the Great Realm King had gone to Nantian Mansion, the Northern Realm King prepared to leave immediately.","As he was about to leave, Jing Xu stopped him, “Uncle Bei, are you here because of Berut in the mid-level spacetime?”","“How did you know?” Northern Realm King was taken aback.","Even he had just learned about this matter.","Could it be that Jian Wushuang’s connections were so extensive that they had ties on the Realm God Continent?","He knew Jian Wushuang had ties with Weiss, but Weiss never came to the Realm God Continent, nor would he ask the Great Realm King for help.","Besides, Weiss was one of the 12 Star Spirits and had no time for such trivial matters.","If he wanted to, he would have dealt with Berut long ago.","Berut was just a demigod at his peak, not a real threat.","He couldn’t even compare to Mie Sheng.","Jing Xu, anticipating this, explained, “Master told me you would come and that it was because of the mid-level spacetime. Master went to Nantian Mansion to visit friends because of this matter!”","“Oh?” Realm King was delighted upon hearing this. He hadn’t expected his elder brother to be aware of the trouble in the mid-elvel spacetime of the Northern Starry Sky.","It was indeed a case of getting what he wanted without much effort.","“So, the Great Realm King knows about Berut?”","In fact, he didn’t know much about Berut, not even why he had such powerful treasures.","He could devour the entire mid-level spacetime.","“That, I don’t know either. My master only instructed that when my martial uncle arrives, I am to follow him to the Northern Spacetime and kill Berut!”","“Kill Berut!”","Jing Xu, who still looked like a child, spoke such domineering words.","However, his aura seemed ordinary, showing nothing special.","Even in the Ninth Tribulation realm, divine power would be suppressed to 20 million in the Northern Spacetime. How could he kill Berut?","Realm King did not doubt his words at all.","Since the Great Realm King had given the order, there must be confidence behind it.","Moreover, this martial nephew of his was not simple; he was a demigod.","Despite his childlike appearance, once he exploded into action, transforming into his divine demon form, he had few opponents in the Ninth Tribulation realm.","He once had a formidable record of fighting three demigods alone.","“Good! Good! Good!”","Realm King said ‘good’ three times in succession, then quickly took Jing Xu, left the island, tore through space, and headed straight for Northern Spacetime.","At this time, the mid-level of the Northern Spacetime had completely collapsed.","Only the Abyssal Spacetime was still struggling.","Almost all the Universe Masters of the mid-level spacetime had gathered there.","“What happened in the Nianshen Secret Realm that destroyed more than 30 spacetime zones in a row, leaving only the Abyssal Spacetime stable!”","“Hard to say. It’s probably related to those super-strong beings from the upper-level spacetime. In any case, this time we leave it to fate!”","Those who were unaware had resigned themselves to fate. Only a few of the Giant God Clan knew the truth.","However, their expressions were not good.","They could have escaped, but they heeded Flrosa’s words and decided to stay and gamble once.","It seemed they had bet wrong.","“Frolasa, this is all your fault! If it weren’t for you, we would have already gone to the Giant God Mountain in the Starry Sky. Aren’t there plenty of treasures in the Starry Sky?” The red-browed one couldn’t help but complain.","Although Immortal Lord Juyang looked distressed, he said nothing, mainly because he also didn’t want to leave.","The Starry Sky, the Giant God Mountain, the territory of the Giant God Clan.","There were countless opportunities in the Starry Sky, but their strength was insufficient.","In the Starry Sky, they’d be subordinates.","In the Northern Spacetime, they were the bosses.","No one liked being a subordinate.","He was only at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","There was no need to return to the Starry Sky so early.","At least he wanted to reach the perfection of the Eighth Tribulation realm before considering returning to the clan to break through to the Ninth Tribulation realm.","That way, it would be a triumphant return, and he’d be a big shot even in the Starry Sky.","“Shut up!” Fuego yelled angrily.","He believed in Frolasa, but the current situation was indeed unfavorable for them.","He might have to fall again.","Last time, Frolasa had revived him, so he had faith in Frolasa.","If they bet wrong, they would accept it.","Seeing the gloomy faces of the few from the Giant God Clan, the Abyss Lord wanted to approach and extract information.","However, despite internal issues, they presented a united front externally, ignoring the Abyss Lord.","“Sigh!” The Abyss Lord couldn’t help but sigh, glancing back at the abyss opposite the Nianshen Secret Realm.","He had a feeling that something major was about to happen.","Buzz!","From the abyss of the Nianshen Secret Realm came a strange sound.","Countless red eyes opened from within.","The Abyssal Spacetime reacted similarly. The sudden appearance of these eyes drew the attention of many strong beings, causing them to retreat.","The eyes revealed their forms from the darkness—The Decay Legion!","It had devoured the essence of the entire mid-level spacetime.","Even at his peak as a demigod, Berut couldn’t fully absorb it.","He had only absorbed a portion of the devoured power.","The remaining power transformed into his Decay Legion.","Countless bats unfurled their massive wings and rushed out of the abyss.","Each bat beast had the combat power of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Especially those from the Nianshen Secret Realm, where large groups of bat beasts even reached the Eighth Tribulation realm."]},{"number":6059,"title":"Chapter 6059: Helper Arrives","paragraphs":["Chapter 6059: Helper Arrives","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Abyssal Spacetime was thrown into chaos.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing were still managing; although they hadn’t yet found Berut himself, dealing with the bats wasn’t an issue.","These bats were formed from the essence of the mid-level spacetime.","Naturally, they were also part of the Northern Spacetime’s lifeforms.","Their divine power reached up to 20 million at most.","“Hu Qing, stop deducing. Let’s leave here while the devouring power of the abyss hasn’t reached its peak!” Jian Wushuang was growing anxious.","After searching around and not finding any trace of Berut, they were now faced with an increasing number of bats in the abyss.","Berut was likely devouring the entire essence of the mid-level spacetime.","At this point, not only could they not find him, but even if they did, they wouldn’t be a match for him.","It had reached an unstoppable stage.","The only option left was to escape!","As long as the green hills remain, there will be wood to burn.","“But!” Hu Qing was still hesitant.","He had already deduced a way out.","That path seemed to be related to time.","As long as they waited, they could break through!","“Forget it, let’s get out of here first!” Jian Wushuang immediately used cosmic traversal, pulling Hu Qing along as they began to flee.","They paid no heed to the bats and wild beasts.","But as they prepared to escape, a black mist surged out from the abyss.","The black mist instantly filled the entire Nianshen Secret Realm, transforming into a gigantic human face.","“Coming and going as you please, isn’t that underestimating me too much?” Berut’s voice echoed from the mist-filled sky.","Jian Wushuang halted, not by choice, but because a barrier blocked their path.","Whoosh!","In the divine domain, divine power was once again unrestrained.","He looked up at the sky, his tone weakening slightly as he spoke, “Berut, aren’t you afraid of Realm King?”","He was still trying to use Realm King to intimidate his opponent.","Little did he know, even Realm King had to seek reinforcements against Berut.","“Haha!” Upon hearing this threat, Berut laughed wildly, “A Realm King without his true body, what is he worth?”","Berut emerged from the black mist, wielding a broken sword blade, speaking arrogantly, “I dared to come to your Northern Spacetime because I never feared him!”","As he finished speaking, the spacetime of the Nianshen Secret Realm was torn open.","A fat and a thin figure, one blue and one white, appeared in the secret realm.","The fat one, touching his nose, just happened to hear Berut’s words.","“Is that so?”","The newcomer was the Realm King, and the white-faced child beside him was naturally the Great Realm King’s disciple, Jing Xu.","Speaking of which, Jing Xu and Wu Zuo were of the same generation.","All were disciples of Realm King.","Yet, the differences were so vast.","One was at a Seventh Tribulation, another was a demigod.","Even a Universe Master at the Ninth Tribulation, upon reaching the limit, could not become a demigod. It required not only opportunity but also personal perseverance.","Those who reached the level of a demigod were not weaker than true gods of spacetime.","Of course, this referred to their combat strength.","For instance, after Danbao perfected the Life secret technique and cultivated Life divine power, transitioning to Life divine power might give him the combat strength of a demigod.","The relationship between divine position and combat strength was not significant.","It was just that cultivation was much more convenient for those with divine positions compared to ordinary cultivators.","Realm Kings, being spacetime gods, naturally had innate physiques suitable for cultivation, along with endless opportunities and treasures. However, how far they could go was unpredictable.","Take the Northern Realm King, for example. He could be considered the weakest among the five great Realm Kings.","Even his true self was gone.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been oppressed by various external strongmen.","Except for Mie Sheng.","As a true god of the Starry Sky, Mie Sheng was on the same level as the Realm King. Crucially, Mie Sheng had existed much longer than the Realm King.","When the Starry Sky was first formed, there were no four subsidiary spacetimes, nor the Realm God Continent. At that time, Mie Sheng was born, perfected the power of Death, and later refined the Death divine power to its peak.","His true self’s combat strength probably surpassed that of demigod cultivators.","He stood above ordinary cultivators.","Only gods of the same kind in the Starry Sky could match Mie Sheng.","Hu Qing was startled when he saw the Realm King appear. The path to survival was indeed the Realm King.","The method he deduced to break the predicament, which was related to time, made sense now. It required waiting for reinforcements.","Now that the Realm King had arrived, the key to breaking the predicament had also arrived.","“Senior Realm King!” Jian Wushuang was also very happy to see Realm King appear. He had no solutions left here and could only rely on Realm King to save the day.","Mainly because Berut had a Divine Domain, otherwise, he could still fight.","Now, with Berut’s true self and the Divine Domain devouring the mid-level spacetime, his divine power had likely reached an astonishing level. No matter how strong he and Hu Qing were, it was difficult to defeat the opponent.","Realm King pressed his hand down and said calmly, “I’ll explain later. Let’s deal with this little fellow first!”","Bringing Jing Xu along, Realm King was naturally confident.","If it were other demigod powerhouses, he might still worry, but Jing Xu was a disciple of the Great Realm King and had received the Great Realm King’s instructions, naturally holding a trump card against Berut.","“Deal with me?” Berut was taken aback, as if hearing a great joke, and laughed wildly, “Just with you, a Realm King without a true self, you want to deal with me!”","The sudden appearance of the Realm King indeed surprised him. He had sealed spacetime, and it was strange that the other party could forcefully enter. This was his divine domain, and theoretically, he was the god here.","He didn’t expect the Realm King could still enter!","Even though Realm King was the Master of the Northern Spacetime, he couldn’t break his Domain.","The Divine Domain!","It controlled the entire Nianshen Secret Realm.","It could allow the life forms within its range to escape the constraints of Life divine power, achieving maximum performance. This ability surpassed Realm King’s scope.","It also indirectly reflected the uniqueness of the Divine Domain.","This was Berut’s confidence.","After losing his true self, the Realm King also lost his so-called dignity. Being mocked by a Tribulation realm powerhouse without an Origin Source didn’t anger him. He just calmly replied, “I indeed lack that ability, but someone can!”","He slowly turned and looked at Jing Xu.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing also turned their gaze to the person behind Realm King.","“A kid?” Berut outwardly appeared calm and slightly disdainful, but inwardly, he was assessing the other party.","The person who could make Northern Realm King so confident was certainly not ordinary.","Within his Divine Domain, he couldn’t see through the other’s depth, only feeling that the power was similar to his peak period.","Jian Wushuang also scrutinized closely but didn’t find anything special, so he turned to Hu Qing and asked via voice transmission, “This person, should not be a powerhouse of our Northern Spacetime, but I wonder about his strength!”","“He’s not Berut’s opponent!”","“Not his opponent?” Jian Wushuang was surprised, not expecting Hu Qing to say it so directly. He then asked, “What did you notice?”","Hu Qing shook his head and replied, “Just a hunch. My intuition tells me that he’s not Berut’s opponent. He might have some treasure to counter Berut, but I still don’t think highly of him. The Divine Domain of the Nianshen Secret Realm is the most unique treasure I’ve ever seen.”"]},{"number":6060,"title":"Chapter 6060: Stuffing Him to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 6060: Stuffing Him to Death","This kind of deduction wasn’t usually accurate, and Hu Qing wouldn’t easily mention it under normal circumstances.","But this time, her decisiveness surprised Jian Wushuang and made him more vigilant.","Actually, Hu Qing was right. The uniqueness of the Divine Domain was evident to them all.","It could isolate the life levels of the Northern Spacetime.","Within the Divine Domain, it was like a miniature Realm God Continent.","Without any restrictions, it was the Divine Domain.","It was similar to the Universe Sea of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Except that no one could control Wanliu.","But Berut could control the Divine Domain and use it as his own Origin Source.","Its power was beyond their imagination.","“Be careful. If things go wrong, we should escape!” Jian Wushuang transmitted his thoughts silently, retreating to the back of Realm King, preparing to observe the battle.","“No, if we join forces, we still have a chance!” Hu Qing’s eyes showed a fighting spirit, and she","clenched her fists.","Jian Wushuang was a bit puzzled. In the current situation, how could he make a move? It was impossible to attack Berut. Even if the two of them joined forces, it would only force Berut to make one more move at most.","Were they supposed to use someone like Jing Xu as a shield?","Hu Qing turned to stare at him, transmitting her thoughts, “Brother Wushuang, although this Divine Domain is special, we are also within it. It is not as simple as the Origin Source Dojo. If it were, we wouldn’t have any chance. But the Divine Domain is different from the Origin Source Dojo in one aspect: we are not restricted here!”","“But that aspect can be controlled by the opponent!” Jian Wushuang immediately retorted. Earlier, Hu Qing’s own attack was easily blocked by Berut.","Berut reduced Hu Qing’s divine power and increased his own.","“If he could truly do anything within the Divine Domain, he would have absorbed all the foundations of the Middle Spacetime long ago. But he hasn’t done that; instead, he created those bat desolate beasts. I guess Berut’s Decay Divine Body cannot bear the foundations of the Middle Spacetime. This is our opportunity!”","Hu Qing continued to explain, “As long as we unleash our divine power and rush into the abyss, using divine power and Origin Source freely, the more we give the Divine Domain to devour, the greater Berut’s burden will be!”","“Why didn’t I think of that!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. Such a simple principle, and he had not thought of it.","In this way, with his and Hu Qing’s divine power, they could bring infinite power to the abyss. He didn’t know how much foundation Hu Qing had, butThis kind of deduction wasn’t usually accurate, and Hu Qing wouldn’t easily mention it under normal circumstances.","But this time, her decisiveness surprised Jian Wushuang and made him more vigilant. Actually, Hu Qing was right. The uniqueness of the Divine Domain was evident to them all.","It could isolate the life levels of the Northern Spacetime.","Within the Divine Domain, it was like a miniature Realm God Continent.","Without any restrictions, it was the Divine Domain.","It was similar to the Universe Sea of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Except that no one could control Wanliu.","But Berut could control the Divine Domain and use it as his own Origin Source.","Its power was beyond their imagination.","“Be careful. If things go wrong, we should escape!” Jian Wushuang transmitted his thoughts silently, retreating to the back of Realm King, preparing to observe the battle.","“No, if we join forces, we still have a chance!” Hu Qing’s eyes showed a fighting spirit, and he clenched his fists.","Jian Wushuang was a bit puzzled. In the current situation, how could he make a move? It was impossible to attack Berut. Even if the two of them joined forces, it would only force Berut to make one more move at most.","Were they supposed to use someone like Jing Xu as a shield?","Hu Qing turned to stare at him, transmitting his thoughts, “Brother Wushuang, although this Divine Domain is special, we are also within it. It is not as simple as the Origin Source Dao Arena. If it were, we wouldn’t have any chance. But the Divine Domain is different from the Origin Source Dao Arena in one aspect: we are not restricted here!”","“But that aspect can be controlled by the opponent!” Jian Wushuang immediately retorted. Earlier, Hu Qing’s own attack was easily blocked by Berut.","Berut reduced Hu Qing’s divine power and increased his own.","“If he could truly do anything within the Divine Domain, he would have absorbed all the foundations of the mid-level spacetime long ago. But he hasn’t done that; instead, he created those bat desolate beasts. I guess Berut’s decay divine body cannot bear the foundations of the mid-level spacetime. This is our opportunity!”","Hu Qing continued to explain, “As long as we unleash our divine power and rush into the abyss, using divine power and Origin Source freely, the more we give the Divine Domain to devour, the greater Berut’s burden will be!”","“Why didn’t I think of that!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. Such a simple principle, and he had not thought of it.","In this way, with his and Hu Qing’s divine power, they could bring infinite power to the abyss. He didn’t know how much foundation Hu Qing had, but his Origin Source Starry Sky contained infinite power.","Now, three universes were already complete, not losing to any of the middle-level spacetime tributaries.","Spacetime was higher than the universe.","But it also depended on what kind of universe and what kind of spacetime river it was.","If it was the tributaries of the lower stream, where time was extremely chaotic and space was","not as vast as the universe.","It couldn’t compare with Jian Wushuang’s perfect universe at all.","Even the middle spacetime rivers couldn’t compare.","His perfect universe alone could rival those tributaries.","Three complete universes, erupting together and letting the abyss devour them at will, were","enough to rival the entire mid-level spacetime.","Hu Qing’s original self might not have enough depth, but his future self was definitely not","weaker than him.","The two indeed had a chance to fill this abyss.","Now they just waited for the experts brought by Realm King to make their move.","“Jian Wushuang, do not be afraid, it will be resolved soon!” Realm King held his head high, very confident, and shouted at Jing Xu, “Take action!”","Buzz!","The aura that shook the Divine Domain instantly surged.","Jing Xu’s small frame instantly transformed into a size of a million miles, like a god or","demon, and his face turned ferocious.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but exclaim, “He’s not of the human race?”","“Heh heh!” Realm King introduced, “Jing Xu is a strong member of the Nakamon Clan in the Starry Sky, not a human race expert, but do not underestimate him. His power is even more terrifying than Chi Jiuxiao, whom you encountered before!”","This did not need Realm King to say, as Jian Wushuang could already see it.","The aura of Chi Jiuxiao in the past could at least allow him to estimate how much divine power","he had.","However, after Jing Xu erupted with such a terrifying aura, he could not see through it.","He was definitely an existence surpassing 30 million divine power.","Jing Xu’s towering figure, with six arms, each holding a broken spear, roared, “Berut, I am","ordered by the Great Realm King to take your life!”","“Great Realm King?” Berut waved the Decay Blade in his hand, not showing the slightest fear,","and coldly said, “Then come on!”","As soon as he finished speaking, his figure also transformed into a size of a million miles,","with divine power reaching over 30 million as well.","He had returned to his former peak.","The form of a demigod!","The battle between the two could be said to be the ultimate simplicity of the Dao, without any","apparent difference, but each strike’s power was so pure.","They had reached the pinnacle of cultivation.","Jian Wushuang, watching from the side, couldn’t help but exclaim, “Worthy of being a","demigod, the purity of this power is almost on par with a true god.”","The power of a true god.","In fact, the Dao was the same.","For example, the Life force Jian Wushuang possessed, Danbao also had it, and it was even","stronger than Jian Wushuang’s.","In the Northern Spacetime, Danbao’s Life force was like the sky!","The true perfection, the strongest Life force.","The Life force Jian Wushuang used, although it also came from his Starry Sky Origin Source,","was not as strong as Danbao’s.","Because he was not a god!","At this moment, the battle between Jing Xu and Berut, using divine power and the power of Decay, had reached the divine realm!","Realm King stroked his beard and commented, “Tsk tsk, there is still a bit of a gap after all!”","A demigod!","After all, it was just a demigod.","To call it a god was merely a term.","It was just some cultivators who had reached perfection.","They were already at the end of the cultivation road, and ahead was the true god.","But the god positions were limited.","To break this limit was like breaking the supreme Law Rule.","“Lord Realm King, what is the difference between this demigod and the titled demigod of the","past?” Jian Wushuang was somewhat puzzled. He had heard Danbao say before that they","could be helped to become demigods.","At that time, he thought it was just a title, nothing great, and preferred to walk his own path,","so he didn’t delve into it. But now, seeing the demigod experts in action, he regretted it a bit. The battle between Jing Xu and Berut could not be decided in a short time.","With nothing else to do, Realm King began to explain the path of cultivation to Jian","Wushuang and Hu Qing.","“You are familiar with the general realms of cultivators, from mortals to the so-called","Immortal beings, merging the understood Dao into the Origin Source to cross into the Emperor realm, then to the Universe Master, and the Tribulation realm!”","If you divide it carefully, each spacetime or even each universe is different.","But it was very simple when explained by Realm King.","The mortal realm, according to the path Jian Wushuang had walked, was below the Immortal","realm.","Then came the Emperor realm.","his Origin Source Starry Sky contained infinite power.","Now, three universes were already complete, not losing to any of the middle spacetime","tributaries.","Spacetime was higher than the universe.","But it also depended on what kind of universe and what kind of spacetime river it was.","If it was the tributaries of the lower stream, where time was extremely chaotic and space was","not as vast as the universe.","It couldn’t compare with Jian Wushuang’s perfect universe at all.","Even the middle spacetime rivers couldn’t compare.","His perfect universe alone could rival those tributaries.","Three complete universes, erupting together and letting the abyss devour them at will, were","enough to rival the entire mid-level spacetime.","Hu Qing’s original self might not have enough depth, but his future self was definitely not","weaker than him.","The two indeed had a chance to fill this abyss.","Now they just waited for the experts brought by Realm King to make their move.","“Jian Wushuang, do not be afraid, it will be resolved soon!” Realm King held his head high,","very confident, and shouted at Jing Xu, “Take action!”","Buzz!","The aura that shook the Divine Domain instantly surged.","Jing Xu’s small frame instantly transformed into a size of a million miles, like a god or","demon, and his face turned ferocious.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but exclaim, “He’s not of the human race?” “Heh heh!” Realm King introduced, “Jing Xu is a strong member of the Nakamon clan in the","Starry Sky, not a human race expert, but do not underestimate him. His power is even more terrifying than Chi Jiuxiao, whom you encountered before!”","This did not need Realm King to say, as Jian Wushuang could already see it.","The aura of Chi Jiuxiao in the past could at least allow him to estimate how much divine power","he had.","However, after Jing Xu erupted with such a terrifying aura, he could not see through it.","He was definitely an existence surpassing thirty million divine power.","Jing Xu’s towering figure, with six arms, each holding a broken spear, roared, “Berut, I am","ordered by the Great Realm King to take your life!”","“Great Realm King?” Berut waved the Decay Blade in his hand, not showing the slightest fear,","and coldly said, “Then come on!”","As soon as he finished speaking, his figure also transformed into a size of a million miles,","with divine power reaching over thirty million as well.","He had returned to his former peak.","The form of a demigod!","The battle between the two could be said to be the ultimate simplicity of the Dao, without any","apparent difference, but each strike’s power was so pure.","They had reached the pinnacle of cultivation.","Jian Wushuang, watching from the side, couldn’t help but exclaim, “Worthy of being a","demigod, the purity of this power is almost on par with a true god.”","The power of a true god.","In fact, the Dao was the same.","For example, the life force Jian Wushuang possessed, Danbao also had it, and it was even","stronger than Jian Wushuang’s.","In the Northern Spacetime, Danbao’s life force was like the sky!","The true perfection, the strongest life force.","The life force Jian Wushuang used, although it also came from his starry sky origin source,","was not as strong as Danbao’s.","Because he was not a god!","At this moment, the battle between Jing Xu and Berut, using divine power and the power of","decay, had reached the divine realm!","Realm King stroked his beard and commented, “Tsk tsk, there is still a bit of a gap after all!”","A demigod!","After all, it was just a demigod.","To call it a god was merely a term.","It was just some cultivators who had reached perfection.","They were already at the end of the cultivation road, and ahead was the true god.","But the god positions were limited.","To break this limit was like breaking the supreme rule.","“Lord Realm King, what is the difference between this demigod and the titled demigod of the","past?” Jian Wushuang was somewhat puzzled. He had heard Danbao say before that they could be helped to become demigods.","At that time, he thought it was just a title, nothing great, and preferred to walk his own path,","so he didn’t delve into it. But now, seeing the demigod experts in action, he regretted it a bit. The battle between Jing Xu and Berut could not be decided in a short time. With nothing else to do, Realm King began to explain the path of cultivation to Jian","Wushuang and Hu Qing.","“You are familiar with the general realms of cultivators, from mortals to the so-called","immortal celestial beings, merging the understood Dao into the origin source to cross into","the Emperor realm, then to the Universe Master, and the Tribulation realm!”","If you divide it carefully, each spacetime or even each universe is different.","But it was very simple when explained by Realm King.","The mortal realm, according to the path Jian Wushuang had walked, was below the evolving","celestial.","Then came the Emperor realm."]},{"number":6061,"title":"Chapter 6061: The Limit of a Cultivator","paragraphs":["Chapter 6061: The Limit of a Cultivator","When in the Great Si Domain, Jian Wushuang had once been told by Zhen Wuyang, with his half-understanding, that it was due to luck that one could become an Emperor.","In fact, this statement was rather general.","After all, how many Emperors were there at that time?","The Great Si Region was less than one ten-thousandth of the original universe.","Naturally, their knowledge was limited.","Later, he came to understand what it meant to Dao merge.","What it meant to be an Emperor.","After arriving at the Nine Great Spacetime, Jian Wushuang also understood what a Universe Master was.","He was now already a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulations realm.","Actually, there was no specific division for Universe Masters.","It was just this title of Universe Master.","But the realms were divided in detail, based on the number of Tribulations undergone.","Ninth Tribulations was the pinnacle.","The more tribulations one underwent, the stronger they became.","The Universe Master could be said to have reached the limit of this world.","The Starry Sky gave birth to rivers, forming the long river of spacetime, with four subsidiary spacetimes.","Within the long river of spacetime, those Original Universes were nurtured.","An Emperor who mastered the universe was a Universe Master.","According to this calculation, mastering spacetime would make one a Master of Spacetime.","Speaking of which, Realm King’s realm was that of a Master of Spacetime.","Mastering a spacetime, isn’t that akin to being a god?","But this had nothing to do with cultivators.","Because cultivators simply could not master spacetime.","Those initial speculations were all wrong.","“Is the Universe Master truly the end?”","Jian Wushuang looked up at the battle above the abyss. The two semi-god beings were also at the level of Universe Masters.","Their combat power had actually surpassed that of the Gods of Spacetime.","When Danbao mastered the Immortal Divine Temple, the power he unleashed was also at this level.","If this was the end, it was quite boring.","Thinking of this, he felt a bit lost.","He had always been thinking about reaching the peak one day.","Success after success, restart after restart.","Now that he had reached the end, he felt somewhat unaccustomed.","Realm King smiled lightly and said, “Yes, and no!”","“Please just say it directly!” Jian Wushuang, feeling a bit down, couldn’t help but say, seeing Realm King still trying to be mysterious, “The path of cultivation is the path of the cultivator. Perhaps one doesn’t need others to set the path, they can walk it themselves!”","“Haha, I’m very pleased with your ambition!” Realm King no longer hid it and said directly, “Above the Universe Master, there is indeed another realm, or rather, it’s not a very certain realm, but many people have reached it. It is a realm where one has broken free from the Supreme Law Rules!”","Upon hearing this, Hu Qing was not surprised but calmly said, “Universe God?”","Universe God!","This time Realm King was very surprised, but after a moment, he understood why Hu Qing knew.","“Was it the Heavenly Maiden who told you?”","Hu Qing nodded in acknowledgment without saying much.","Jian Wushuang, who was beside him, became interested and asked, “Universe God... what is the difference from the Universe Master, is it just breaking free from the Supreme Law Rules?”","If this were the case, it was very similar to what he initially thought: breaking through with sheer force.","No wonder the peak existences of Universe Masters all followed the path of divine power.","Perhaps it was also to break the highest rules.","Divine status was not conferred but was attained through one’s own strength.","“Literally, it is below the God of Spacetime position, but stronger than the Universe Master. However, the battle power of the Universe God is not as singular as the divine status. For instance, the Mie Sheng you encountered merely mastered the power of Death. Even if he’s a Starry Sky God, so what? Gods are too singular, and so is their battle power. Hence, he aim to merge life and replace the position of the God of Reincarnation!” Realm King spoke helplessly. Actually, gods had already reached the pinnacle, so why pursue those extreme battle powers?","Jian Wushuang finally understood this time.","Under the Starry Sky, those who surpassed cultivators were always the divine statuses.","Gods of Starry Sky, Gods of Spacetime.","These positions were personally selected by the Supreme Law Rules.","For example, the God of Life in the Northern Spacetime was chosen and then trained by Realm","King.","Dan Bao was the God of Spacetime.","Besides the God of Spacetime, there was also Realm King.","In fact, theoretically, the power mastered by Realm King was not singular and could be said to be omnipotent. Unfortunately, the true form of the Northern Realm King had long fallen. Otherwise, there wouldn’t be any threats, and they wouldn’t need to seek help everywhere.","God of Starry Sky!","In fact, it wasn’t much different from the God of Spacetime, only that they resided in different","places.","Naturally, the Starry Sky was stronger than Spacetime, so Mie Sheng looked down upon the","Gods of Spacetime.","Universe God!","It sounded low-level, but its battle power could surpass that of the Gods of Starry Sky.","Because once a cultivator broke free from the Supreme Law Rules, there was no upper limit.","Divine status was a symbol of power and battle strength!","Yet, it was also a cage. Once you stepped onto it, you could never escape.","Mie Sheng did not hesitate to traverse spacetime to break the cage and advance further.","Divine status held ruling power but also the fate of being bound.","The Universe God, however, was different.","It had no upper limit!","Jian Wushuang was quite excited!","This was the path he pursued, the road he wanted to walk.","An end?","There was no such thing.","Everyone had their own end, and his end was to surpass everyone.","To become the strongest.","That was the end.","“My path, only I make the decisions!”","Realm King also saw Jian Wushuang’s ambition, his expression shifting slightly, and thought","secretly, “Perhaps, he can become a Universe God!”","After all, even Wes highly regarded Jian Wushuang, and he had no reason not to. From his performance, Jian Wushuang was the most potential-laden cultivator in the entire Northern","Spacetime.","As Realm King, his vision was high, and he was proficient in all paths, capable of seeing","through everything.","In Jian Wushuang, he saw a path of cultivation never before seen.","This was already a prerequisite for breaking the Supreme Law Rules.","“Hu Qing, let’s get ready to move!”","After understanding the route of the Universe Master, he neither belittled himself nor indulged in fantasies, but aimed to walk each step well.","The appearance of Berut gave him a brand-new understanding of divine status. The opponent controlled the divine realm and could even devour the Origin Source of","subordinate spacetime. This was intolerable.","Threatening the Origin Source of Northern Spacetime was equivalent to threatening themselves.","The foundation of Northern Spacetime was linked to them.","If Northern Spacetime were to shatter, not to mention reaching the Nine Tribulations Realm,","maintaining the current situation would be impossible.","Therefore, Berut had to die.","Fortunately, they discovered the opponent’s strangeness early on.","Hu Qing, who grasped the Heavenly Dao, thought far ahead and insisted on staying.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, he also prepared slightly, ready to act at any moment.","At this moment, high above the abyss, Jing Xu had already firmly taken the upper hand, continuously suppressing Berut.","Had it not been for the decayed power from the abyss supplementing Berut, he would have","been killed long ago.","“Ha!”","The spear, like a lightning bolt, pierced through everything.","Jing Xu, with his towering god-demon form, wielded six broken spears, attacking frantically.","He pierced Berut’s divine body multiple times but could do nothing more, unable to kill him."]},{"number":6062,"title":"Chapter 6062: Extreme Light Tower","paragraphs":["Chapter 6062: Extreme Light Tower","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Berut, although continuously beaten, showed no signs of panic. Instead, he sneered, “Haha, come on... let’s see if your divine power is more than the power of Decay in the divine realm!”","He was absolutely confident!","Jing Xu’s divine body was strong, but it could not withstand such consumption.","However, Berut could replenish himself infinitely.","He was essentially imperishable.","“Too arrogant!” Jing Xu coldly shouted, and his six arms expanded once more, divine power pushing the limits of the Universe Master’s capabilities each time.","If it weren’t for the divine suppression above, he would have already broken through to the highest Law Rules.","The boundary of the Northern Spacetime was the Ninth Tribulation realm.","In the Realm God Continent, though it was said there were no boundaries in the divine realm, there were still the Supreme Law Rules restraining it, making it impossible to break through to the extreme.","Only by becoming a Universe God could one achieve that.","Jing Xu’s strength was formidable, ranking among the top ten in the Realm God Continent’s demigods.","However, compared to a true Universe God, he was far inferior.","Even if he erupted again, reaching his peak state and shattering Berut’s divine body, he still could not kill him in one strike.","At his peak, Berut was also a demigod, and now fully recovered, he was even stronger than before.","In the same rank, he was practically imperishable.","Unless a Universe God appeared, almost no one could kill him.","To kill a peak demigod in one blow was incredibly difficult.","Perhaps such a powerful being existed in the Starry Sky, but Realm King could not invite them.","Such super beings would not care about the life and death of the affiliated spacetime.","The affiliated spacetime was originally a desolate world, and without the decree of a major figure in the Starry Sky, the four major affiliated spacetimes would not even have life.","Therefore, in the Starry Sky, the presence of the affiliated spacetimes was very low.","It was only the practitioners within the spacetimes who often mentioned the four major affiliated spacetimes.","This was why Mie Sheng dared to traverse the spacetime so recklessly, entering the affiliated spacetimes to ambush the Gods of Spacetime.","Because they simply did not fear!","In their eyes, even Realm King was nothing.","Realm King managed the affiliated spacetime, but it had nothing to do with them.","Only if a Realm King had exceptionally strong personal combat power would they earn some respect.","Unfortunately, the Northern Realm King’s true self had fallen, leaving no combat power.","In the eyes of those strong beings in the Starry Sky, he was a waste.","No one respected him.","This was the sorrow of the Northern Realm King. When you think about it, he was a tragic figure, not only having to develop the Northern Spacetime but also protecting it from the strong beings of other spacetimes. Even his true self had fallen. His journey had not been easy.","“Realm King, let me handle this!”","Jian Wushuang silently vowed, his aura suddenly erupting. He shouted angrily, “Now, enter the abyss!”","Whoosh!!","Without waiting for Realm King’s response, he and Hu Qing instantly disappeared, reappearing within the abyss.","“Down below!”","Buzz!","Hu Qing took the lead, pointing to the depths of the abyss and said, “The Origin Source swallowed by the divine realm is down there. We must get closer!”","“Alright!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate and immediately rushed down.","Realm King outside the abyss finally reacted, realizing that Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing had both entered the abyss. He hurriedly sent a message, “Are you two crazy? That’s the core of the abyss! If you go in, there won’t even be bones left of you!”","Realm King was anxious. Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing were highly potential practitioners of the Northern Spacetime, future pillars of the Northern Spacetime. They must not fall due to the strong beings from other spacetimes!","If they fell because of this, it would be a huge loss and his dereliction of duty.","“Jing Xu, don’t hold back anymore. Kill Berut quickly!”","He couldn’t stop them and could only pin his hopes on Jing Xu, urging him to kill Berut quickly.","Jing Xu originally wanting to probe a bit more, but when he heard Northern Realm King’s words, also noticed Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing entering the abyss. He didn’t understand but didn’t think much of it.","The divine demon form vanished in an instant, reverting to the appearance of a child, with a small obtuse tower appearing in his hand.","Holding the tower in one hand, his expression turned solemn.","“The Extreme Light Tower!”","Seeing the small tower in Jing Xu’s hand, Realm King and Berut couldn’t help but exclaim in surprise!","The reputation of this treasure was too immense.","That aura made all cultivators tremble with fear.","Even the Realm King couldn’t help but shrink his neck.","Berut, who had been quite indifferent, was so frightened that he quickly retreated, not even bothering to pay attention to Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing entering the abyss.","Although he didn’t know what these two intended to do, they couldn’t threaten him.","And they certainly couldn’t threaten the abyss.","He didn’t care about devouring the Origin Sources of two more cultivators.","But the Extreme Light Tower posed a significant threat to him.","Even now, possessing the divine realm, he dared not be careless.","“I didn’t expect that to deal with me, the Great Realm King would lend you the Extreme Light Tower!” Berut frowned, privately transmitting a message to a super existence supporting him.","Though the super strong in the Starry Sky didn’t think much of these Realm Kings,","the Great Realm King was different.","In the entire Realm God Continent, he ranked among the top three super existences.","Besides the Realm King God, among the four subsidiary spacetime and the Realm God Continent, the Great Realm King held the highest divine position.","He stood above the four major Realm Kings, and his original body’s combat power was incredibly formidable.","He had once killed a Universe God from the Starry Sky.","Using this very Extreme Light Tower!","A single strike to kill!","From then on, he was deified in a single battle.","In the past, the Great Realm King had a reputation for being gentle, humble, and non-competitive, always going with the flow.","But even such a kind person had moments of anger.","Back then, when the Realm God Continent gave birth to a Starry Sky-level secret realm, it attracted super strong from the Starry Sky to explore.","Among them were several Universe Gods.","These Universe Gods looked down on the Gods of Spacetime and sealed off the Starry Sky secret realm of the Realm God Continent, allowing only the strong from the Starry Sky to explore.","This action greatly displeased the strong of the Realm God Continent and the four major spacetimes, but no one dared to object.","Because there were few Universe Gods on the Realm God Continent, and their strength was lacking.","Many Universe Gods on the Realm God Continent also came from the Starry Sky. Since their interests weren’t harmed, they wouldn’t stand up for justice.","At this point, the Great Realm King and the other four Realm Kings had not taken action.","They couldn’t, as their strength was insufficient, and they couldn’t blame others for that.","But the few Universe Gods from the Starry Sky became more and more excessive.","Not only did they occupy the Starry Sky secret realm birthed by the Realm God Continent, but they also seized some sect forces from the Realm God Continent.","All who resisted were annihilated, everything suppressed.","Unbelievably arrogant.","At that time, the young North Realm King couldn’t stand it and took action, trying to drive away those Universe Gods from the Starry Sky.","But his strength was insufficient.","The Northern Spacetime was the last to be born, and the North Realm King’s strength was the weakest.","In terms of combat power, he was at most comparable to a Universe God.","But he had to face several Universe Gods from the Starry Sky, who had broken through countless eras."]},{"number":6063,"title":"Chapter 6063: The Source of the Northern Spacetime","paragraphs":["Chapter 6063: The Source of the Northern Spacetime","There was no limit to the terror of a Universe God.","The Northern Realm King was still too young and believed that no matter how excessive the other party was, they wouldn’t dare to kill him.","He hadn’t expected that his Temporal Origin Source would be abolished directly by the other party, and his divine body shattered.","Only a single strand of will was left to him.","He could still manage the Northern Spacetime, but he could no longer cultivate.","It was because of this incident that the Great Realm King erupted completely.","He fought tirelessly, seeking vengeance for the Northern Realm King.","With the Extreme Light Tower in hand, he swiftly killed the God of Spacetime who had ruined the Northern Realm King.","All other participating Universe Gods had their Origin Source shattered.","This battle shocked the entire Starry Sky.","From then on, those Universe Gods no longer dared to be arrogant on the Realm God Continent.","Even if they went to the Realm God Continent, they were extremely low-key.","When the Northern Realm King saw that Extreme Light Tower again, he couldn’t help but recall the past, tears streaming down his aged face!","Everything could never go back to how it was.","Without his true body, he became depressed and melancholy.","Later, the Great Realm King promised that once the Northern Spacetime was completely stabilized and enough Universe Gods were born, he would plead with the Realm King to reconstruct a true body for him.","“Sigh!”","The Northern Realm King couldn’t help but sigh.","From then on, the Great Realm King took special care of him.","He even obtained the Wanliu Divine Tree from Weiss to enhance the life level of the Northern","Spacetime, allowing it to give birth to a Ninth Tribulation earlier.","With a Ninth Tribulation realm!","A subsequent enhancement would allow the birth of Universe Gods.","The Realm King had been striving for this promise all along.","He was truly resilient despite his physical disability.","However, as a Realm King without a true body, he was constantly bullied by powerful beings from different spacetime.","Now, they even wanted to destroy his Northern Spacetime.","He had no choice but to seek help from the Great Realm King.","Unexpectedly, this time, the Great Realm King went all out and directly handed over the","Extreme Light Tower to his direct disciple, Jing Xu, to help him through the crisis.","Although the Great Realm King’s combat power was immense, there were still some powerful beings in the Starry Sky or Realm God Continent that he feared.","Such as the existence behind Berut.","This was why the Great Realm King did not take action himself and sent his disciple instead.","With the Extreme Light Tower, it was enough.","“No wonder you’re so confident!” Berut couldn’t help but take half a step back, standing above the abyss, and continued, “But even so, what can you do?”","Jing Xu was taken aback, “What?”","“Could it be that you really intend to kill me?” Berut sneered, “Tsk tsk, you’ll understand soon enough!”","At this moment, the Northern Realm King suddenly thought of something, his face turning grim.","“Haha, the power of Decay I’ve devoured is about enough. I can retreat unscathed now!” Berut turned to look at the Northern Realm King, mocking, “This time, you’re lucky. I’ll take half for now, but sooner or later, I’ll devour your entire Northern Spacetime and kill all the human race!”","Looking at the other party’s arrogant expression, the Realm King was helpless.","Because the Great Realm King had just transmitted a message to him, ordering him to release Berut.","There was no choice; the other party’s background was too powerful.","Even the Great Realm King had to compromise.","“Jing Xu, let him go!” The Realm King’s face was somewhat embarrassed. He turned his head and glanced at Berut again, coldly saying, “However, before you leave, release the two practitioners from the abyss!”","Berut’s mouth curved into a smile, only now remembering that there were still two foolish practitioners trapped in the abyss.","Two Universe Masters were nothing. Even though they had previously erupted with divine power surpassing 20 million, they posed no threat. Whether to release them or not was a matter of a single thought.","This favor, he could choose not to give.","“What if I don’t release them?” Berut said with a teasing expression, “Not only will they die, but I will also kill all the practitioners in the mid-tier spacetime. Consider that as interest!”","The Realm King clenched his fists tightly, his expression extremely dark.","But he could do nothing.","This was a form of torture for him.","Seeing the Realm King in immense distress, Berut smiled.","The more painful his opponent was, the more excited he became.","Jing Xu stood to the side, at a loss. Originally, his master had instructed him to follow the Northern Realm King to slay Berut. Now, however, they were to let him go.","Moreover, Berut’s extremely arrogant demeanor made him very unhappy.","At this moment, he couldn’t help but inquire through telepathy, “Master, why did you let Berut go? Give me three breaths’ time, and I could have killed him!”","...","The Realm God Continent was vast and majestic.","To call it a continent was an understatement; it was more like an extraordinarily perfect","world.","It was neither spacetime nor a universe.","Above the heavens and beneath the earth, it spanned vast territories.","It was just one world.","Yet it could surpass spacetime and the universe.","This was the Realm God Continent crafted by the Realm King God.","The location of Nantian Mansion was situated within a star domain in the southern part of the","Realm God Continent.","To call it a Star Domain was actually to describe a Universe Sea connected by countless","universes.","In this place, there were countless universes, all of which were the Origin Universes of","Universe Masters.","Among them, one particularly dazzling universe was known as the “Hunyuan Universe”!","It was the brightest universe in the entire Star Domain.","Because its owner was a Universe God.","Having already reached the status of a Universe God, the Origin Souce Universe could have long been incorporated into his divine body, yet its owner did not do so, leaving the Origin Source Universe casually placed there.","This demonstrated absolute confidence, not needing to carry the Origin Source Dao Arena","wherever he went.","And its owner indeed had such strength.","Looking across the entire Realm God Continent, he was nearly invincible.","Even in the Starry Sky, he had few opponents.","He!","Was the strongest practitioner to emerge from the four spacetimes.","And was also the future successor of the Realm King God.","“Zamasu!”","He came from the southern spacetime as a Universe God.","And was the pride of the Southern Spacetime.","Because a super existence had emerged from the spacetime he controlled, and he was the","future Realm King God, making the Realm King of the Southern Spacetime extremely proud.","Compared to the Northern Realm King, it was like heaven and earth.","A Universe God emerging from spacetime had even brought the Great Realm King to personally visit. One could only imagine the strength and background of this person, which","surpassed that of the Realm King.","Even the Realm King God valued him highly.","It was rare for the Great Realm King to personally visit and plead.","In the depths of the Hunyuan Universe, within a simple wooden courtyard, the Great Realm","King and Zamasu sat on the ground, drinking tea.","“Zamasu!” The Great Realm King said with a gentle expression, “Your strength is growing stronger by the day. It’s certain that you will become the Realm King God in the future. Why do you insist on targeting the small northern spacetime?”","He couldn’t understand. As the chosen one, Zamasu, the future Realm King God, with","immense divine power and authority, supported by the old Realm King God, repeatedly","plotted against the northern spacetime.","The metal lifeform in the Wanliu Divine Tree was one instance. Mie Sheng was also related to","him, followed by Berut now.","The investment of resources and manpower was enormous.","Yet these people were all interested in the Northern Spacetime.","Those who weren’t interested, Zamasu would create interest. It could be said he went to great","lengths."]},{"number":6064,"title":"Chapter 6064: Great Realm King vs Zamasu","paragraphs":["Chapter 6064: Great Realm King vs Zamasu","If the Wanliu Divine Tree was a coincidence, then attracting Mie Sheng to the Northern Spacetime was a conspiracy.","Arranging for Berut to enter the Northern Spacetime and creating a Divine Domain was blatant persecution!","Each time, the actions were vicious, aiming to completely destroy all life in the Northern Spacetime.","Zamasu himself had his limits; he knew that the existence of the subsidiary spacetime was to maintain the stability of the Starry Sky and dared not destroy the entire Northern Spacetime. However, there was no concern about annihilating the human race in the Northern Spacetime. The only one protecting the Northern Spacetime was the Great Realm King, whom Zamasu dared to offend!","“Realm King, aren’t your words a bit too arbitrary?” Zamasu’s expression paused as he looked up at the Great Realm King.","“You can help the Northern Realm King, and I naturally will help my own friend. Mie Sheng wanted to advance further; I merely gave him some guidance. His erasure by Lord Weiss was deserved and had nothing to do with me. The matter of the Wanliu Divine Tree was indeed arranged by me, but you should also know, the Wanliu Divine Tree hadn’t appeared for many years. I arranged for a friend to contend for the opportunity; isn’t that quite normal? Moreover, Lord Weiss did not stop it!”","The only one Zamasu feared was a Star Spirit!","Weiss was one of the 12 Star Spirits. Although his title was similar to the Realm King God, his combat power was terrifying, even surpassing the Realm King God.","Even Zamasu had to show utmost respect when meeting him.","“And what about Berut?” Great Realm King’s eyebrows slightly furrowed. “The Divine Domain you crafted is so precious. If it truly needed to devour an Origin Source, why not devour the secret sealm instead of the Origin Source of the Northern Spacetime?”","Zamasu took a deep breath and calmly replied, “I’ve already said, it was to help a friend. As for the Divine Domain, although it’s somewhat special, to me, it’s just ordinary. Giving it away was no big deal. The persecution of the Northern Spacetime doesn’t count; it’s merely that Berut happened to need the Origin Source of the Northern Spacetime!”","He had distanced himself from the matter neatly.","Don’t ask; if asked, it was for helping out.","He had little to do with it.","“The Northern Realm King once made sacrifices for the Realm God Continent. I don’t want you to go to such extremes. This time, I will give the Realm King God some face, but there should not be a next time!” The Great Realm King downed his tea in one gulp, then stood up to leave.","Zamasu’s eyelids lifted as he rolled his eyes, speaking in a sarcastic tone, “So, you mean that next time you’ll take action against me?”","“You could say that!” Great Realm King stopped in his tracks, slowly turned around, and a murderous look appeared in his eyes. “I don’t know what the Realm King God is thinking, choosing you as the next Realm King God. But before you become the Realm King God, you are not qualified to meddle so far!”","“Haha!”","Zamasu couldn’t help but laugh, then slowly stood up and provocatively said, “Actually, I’ve never believed your strength to be that formidable. Now that you’ve lost the Extreme Light Tower, I wonder how much power you have left!”","Great Realm King’s expression changed as he sneered, “You can try!”","Buzz!","The Hunyuan Universe erupted instantly!","Two super beings standing at the peak of spacetime and the Starry Sky clashed fiercely.","The power they unleashed was nearly equal, but Zamasu was more aggressive.","The Great Realm King had deep foundations!","“Let’s end it here today!” Zamasu’s face grew increasingly grim as he fell into a disadvantage after exchanging several blows.","And this was the Great Realm King without the Extreme Light Tower.","If he had the Extrem eLight Tower, he might have been able to kill Zamasu.","It was merely a probe from the start.","Neither of them intended to kill.","However, Zamasu had already used 90 percent of his strength and still wasn’t a match.","Great Realm King wanted to seize this opportunity to teach Zamasu a lesson.","Before stopping, he unleashed a full-power energy wave, creating a dazzling beam that pierced through the entire Hunyuan Universe.","“You!” Zamasu felt a massive threat.","Facing the energy wave, an evil glint appeared in his eyes, and his power surged.","His green skin burst open!","He seemed to transform completely, raising his hand to send the Great Realm King’s energy beam back.","Great Realm King’s face darkened upon sensing the evil aura. He was stunned for a moment, and the beam he had just unleashed was now in front of him.","Boom!","He had to cross his arms to block it, forcibly stopping it.","“Your power is a bit strange!”","Zamasu sneered, “Strange? It’s not for you to question!”","Unable to resist an outburst just now, he was discovered by the other party.","If he used that power, he should be able to take down the current Great Realm King. Unfortunately, this was the Realm God Continent, and he was not yet the Realm King God. Killing a Great Realm King would be too risky for him, so he suppressed his killing intent. The Great Realm King stared intently at Zamasu, “I will keep a close eye on you!”","He pointed at his own eyes with his fingers, then disappeared directly into the Hunyuan Universe.","“You ignorant old fool!” Zamasu sneered coldly, “The day I become the Realm King God will be the day you fall. By then, the Extreme Light Tower will also be mine.”","The clash between Zamasu and the Great Realm King was a contest in the Northern Spacetime.","After their confrontation, the Great Realm King also transmitted a message to the Northern Realm King and his disciple Jing Xu, informing them that Berut could leave.","At this time, Jing Xu transmitted a message to inquire further, but he didn’t know how to respond and could only sigh. “Forget it, let him go!”","Although Jing Xu was unwilling, he dared not disobey his master’s orders.","As for the Northern Realm King, he had already troubled the Great Realm King enough this time and did not want to make more demands.","In his heart, he could only pray silently, “Jian Wushuang, you must not fall so easily!”","In the abyss, Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing had already entered deep within, unaware that the outside had already ceased fighting.","Moreover, Zamasu and the Great Realm King had chosen to make peace, meaning the crisis was now resolved.","If Jian Wushuang knew this, he might have retreated, as there was no more danger to face.","“Hu Qing, why is it so quiet outside?”","“The abyss is still operating, and Berut hasn’t stopped, I’m afraid...”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed, and he exclaimed, “You calculated it correctly, Jing Xu really didn’t capture Berut. It looks like we still have to rely on ourselves outside!”","“Let’s begin!” Hu Qing spread his hands, and terrifying divine power began to erupt. This","place was the devouring Origin Source of the abyss.","They would release all the Origin Source, pushing the abyss to its limit, to overwhelm Berut.","If he liked devouring so much, they would let him devour to his heart’s content. Back at the Qishen Temple, Jian Wushuang had also devoured countless entities, fully understanding the pitfalls of devouring.","Once it reached the limit, one must stop, or else the divine body and Origin Source would","explode.","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","Jian Wushuang crossed his arms and lifted them sharply, his divine power instantly surpassing 20 million. In the abyss, there were still no restrictions, and with his own Origin Source Dao Arena, he directly pushed his divine power to the limit."]},{"number":6065,"title":"Chapter 6065: You Must Die Today!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6065: You Must Die Today!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The count reached twenty-five million.","The Origin Sources of the three perfect universes also erupted with boundless Origin Source power, continuously flowing into the devouring Origin Source within the abyss.","Buzz!","Sensing the proactively approaching Origin Source, the abyss began to devour it madly.","To it, this was simply a delicacy.","Above the abyss, Berut was stunned.","He hadn’t actively devoured Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, yet these two fools revealed their Origin Source themselves, standing there to be devoured.","“Offering themselves to death?” He couldn’t help but show a smile on his face, mocking the Realm King, “This time, don’t say I didn’t give you face. They are offering themselves to death, I think...”","Before he finished speaking, Berut’s smile froze on his face.","His body also uncontrollably expanded at that moment.","Realm King was also stunned, not knowing what was happening.","But he could see that Berut’s divine power was continuously rising, already touching the level of a Universe God.","In an instant, his divine power doubled, making Berut’s figure grow larger by a circle.","“This... how is this possible?” Berut’s eyes were filled with disbelief, unable to believe the power he had just devoured and absorbed.","In just an instant, cracks appeared on his divine body.","At this moment, Jing Xu saw the problem, pointing at Berut with one hand and clutching his stomach with the other, laughing, “Don’t you like to eat? This time it seems you’ve eaten too much!”","“It’s Jian Wushuang!” Realm King also reacted, showing joy, “Berut, this time it’s your bad luck!”","With his divine body fused with the devouring Origin Source in the abyss, Berut could only be forced to absorb the continuously incoming power, his face turning purple.","Clearly, he had reached his limit.","Whoosh!","He flashed and directly entered the abyss.","He wanted to kill Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","“You deserve to die!” Berut shouted madly, forming a colorful light ball with one hand and continuously throwing it into the abyss.","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing in the abyss hurriedly dodged, but all the attacks fell into the devouring Origin Source, ultimately feeding back to Berut.","Making his divine body explode even more severely.","Jian Wushuang sneered, looking up at the embarrassed Berut, “Stop wasting your efforts. If you really kill me, my Origin Source will directly merge into the devouring Origin Source. By then, you will surely die!”","“If... if I don’t take action... I... I might still fall!” Berut could barely speak, no longer having the strength to attack.","Although he had boundless power, he was now like a bloated universe with divine power but unable to use it because all his power was suppressing itself, not daring to be displayed.","One careless move, and this bloated universe would explode.","Out of options, Berut could only send a message to Zamasu for help.","“How long can you hold on?” Jian Wushuang’s cold eyes stared at him, releasing the power from the Origin Source again to feed the devouring Origin Source.","Hu Qing also pushed his Future Self to the limit, almost diving headfirst into the devouring Origin Source.","“Ahhhhhh!!!!!!”","Berut went completely mad, absorbing more power in the abyss, unable to stop, and could only escape the abyss.","Realm King, who had been somewhat worried, sighed in relief seeing Berut fly out of the abyss.","In the abyss, Hu Qing looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Brother Wushuang, Berut has lost his defensive ability. Now he just needs one more push, shall we go out and fight?”","“Virtuous!”","This time Jian Wushuang clasped his hands together, wrapped Hu Qing in his Thought power, and forcefully left the abyss using Universe Supertravel.","With a swift motion, he appeared above the abyss once more.","Clang!","Jian Wushuang drew the Wanjie Sword, its blue blade pointing towards Berut. “Today, you must die!”","He intended to kill Berut!","At this moment, Berut was utterly panicked.","Realm King without his true form posed no threat to him, and Jing Xu was the Great Realm King’s man.","It was evident that the Great Realm King and Zamasu had ceased their actions and wouldn’t intervene.","But who could stop Jian Wushuang if he wanted to kill him?","A native cultivator from the Northern Spacetime killing a threat from another spacetime.","The Heavenly Dao was not on his side.","“You can’t kill me!” Berut retreated frantically, threatening, “I belong to Zamasu. If you kill me and go to the Realm God Continent, you will have no place to stay!”","Jian Wushuang, however, treated these words as mere background noise, completely unconcerned.","Did he have few enemies?","Back then, the metallic life forms had threatened him similarly. What happened afterward?","The threat wasn’t visible for the moment. According to the Realm King, they were also taken to the Realm God Continent.","And then there was the threat from Xilu, also on the Realm God Continent.","What else did he have to fear!","Zamasu?","He had heard of him but had never feared him!","“Spacetime!”","“Reincarnation!”","Jian Wushuang roared consecutively, and the Wanjie Sword emitted an incredibly terrifying sword cry!","It thirsted for blood!","At this moment, his Wanjie Sword had an insatiable desire.","A desire for the taste of blood!","His intent to kill had also reached its peak.","Even if the King of Heaven came today, he wouldn’t be able to stop him.","Buzz!","The sword shadow shot up to the clouds, following the tip of the sword.","Opening spacetime, forging reincarnation.","With one sword, he sealed your past and present lives, leaving no possibility of reincarnation!","This was sword move, ‘Spacetime Reincarnation’.","Swish!","The sword shadow covered the entire middle spacetime.","This sword had already touched the level of major achievement.","Originally at the entry level, it had astonishingly risen two levels.","This was the beauty of battle.","It could always bring unexpected gains, and the sudden breakthrough filled Jian Wushuang’s eyes with joy.","The sword shadow tore through spacetime, directly striking towards Berut.","If it had been Berut at his peak, this sword strike couldn’t have killed him.","But now, Berut, swollen to the brink of bursting, couldn’t resist at all. Even a slight attack could lead to his downfall.","“Zamasu, save me!”","In his desperation, Berut could only call out Zamasu’s name.","“Don’t mention Zamasu. Even if Whis came, he couldn’t save you!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate, his killing intent soaring.","He had to eliminate him.","Although he didn’t care about verbal threats, living threats mattered to him.","If he could eliminate them, he would. Keeping them around would only cause trouble for himself.","So from the start, he didn’t hold back, launching a full-force attack aimed at killing.","Berut, facing this sword, had no power to resist. He could only transmit his despairing message to Zamasu, “If I fall, your divine realm will also fall into the Northern Spacetime. By then, the human race will grow even stronger!”","On the Realm God Continent.","Originally indifferent to Berut’s life or death, Zamasu stood up upon hearing this message.","He rubbed the ring on his hand, frowning slightly, “What a useless fool!”","The ring burst into a rainbow light, and Zamasu’s figure vanished from the Hunyuan Universe.","Buzz!","At the same time, a rainbow light appeared in the Abyssal Spacetime.","A figure slowly rose from the abyss.","The newcomer was Zamasu."]},{"number":6066,"title":"Chapter 6066: Unwillingness","paragraphs":["Chapter 6066: Unwillingness","He single-handedly blocked Jian Wushuang’s most powerful sword strike.","However, it was just an incarnation.","His true self was outside of the Northern Spacetime.","As a Universe God, he couldn’t enter lower spacetime.","The divine power of the incarnation, although only 20 million, was enough to save Berut.","“Who are you?” Jian Wushuang looked at the figure, recalling the carving in the formation of the City of the Sky. It looked very similar.","While he was astonished.","Jing Xu and Realm King shouted the name in unison!","“Zamasu!”","Hearing this name, Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing began to scrutinize him closely.","This was not the first time they had heard the name Zamasu.","Every time there was a threat to the Northern Spacetime, this person was behind it.","Seeing him this time, there was nothing particularly special.","An incarnation, 20 million divine power.","That’s it.","At this moment, Realm King reminded through Thought power, “Don’t underestimate him. This is an affiliated spacetime. As a Universe God, entering an affiliated spacetime means being restricted by the Supreme Law Rules again, which makes his divine power seem very weak. If he were on the Realm God Continent, he could kill a demigod with a mere breath!”","“So strong?” Jian Wushuang found it hard to believe.","“Don’t doubt my words. We can’t afford to provoke him!” Realm King sighed.","The more he said this, the more Jian Wushuang wanted to try.","Why couldn’t they provoke him?","When he was an Emperor, he dared to oppose the Starry Sky God “Mie Sheng” and managed to escape from him multiple times.","Now, as a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm, there was nothing to fear.","He looked at Zamasu recklessly.","“Brother Wushuang, it’s better to be careful. Zamasu has a special power that we are far from being able to match!” Hu Qing also shook his head in dissuasion.","That aura was too overwhelming.","Jian Wushuang nodded and did not act rashly.","However, he had already made it clear that no matter who came today, it wouldn’t matter.","Zamasu hovered in mid-air, ignoring everyone. He glanced at the continuously expanding Berut, his expression cold, “Trash!”","Whoosh!","He raised his hand, forcibly wrapping Berut in a thought force, intending to take him away.","Jian Wushuang stepped forward, blocking his way.","“Trying to leave?”","His action startled Realm King.","There was no time to stop him.","Jing Xu also held his breath. Although he was a disciple of the Great Realm King and a pinnacle existence among demigods, in front of a giant like Zamasu, he was like an ant.","Seeing Jian Wushuang daring to block a peak Universe God, he secretly admired his courage.","Perhaps this was the fearlessness of the ignorant!","“Huh?” Zamasu was also amused by Jian Wushuang’s stance. After glancing at him seriously, he frowned, “Boy, are you talking to me?”","Jian Wushuang didn’t feel anything wrong. Berut was about to destroy the Northern Spacetime, so he stepped in to stop him. Wasn’t that the right thing to do?","“Like I said, today he must stay!”","This time, Realm King finally had a chance to intervene. He hurriedly rushed over, blocking Jian Wushuang.","Looking at Zamasu, he softened his tone, “Lord Zamasu, he hasn’t been to the Realm God Continent yet and doesn’t know your identity. Please be lenient!”","“Tsk, tsk, this just shows that your Northern Spacetime is full of talents! So arrogant without even having been to the Realm God Continent. If he had been, would he have directly attacked me?”","Zamasu glanced sideways at the Northern Realm King, not taking him seriously at all.","Even so, Realm King endured it and hastily apologized.","“Keep your dog on a leash. There won’t be a next time!”","If not for the lack of other manifestations, he would have killed Jian Wushuang long ago.","Or rather, if he encountered Jian Wushuang on the Realm God Continent in the future, he would kill him.","He already detested humans, and now being reprimanded by a human cultivator was a great humiliation for him.","Without another glance, he prepared to leave with Berut.","Zamasu had his pride.","So did Jian Wushuang.","He had never been humiliated like this before. Ignoring Realm King’s obstruction, he directly","attacked Zamasu.","This Zamasu was merely an avatar, with limited divine power.","How strong could he be?","“Life!”","The perfect Life Sword move struck out directly.","Buzz!","“Hmm?” Zamasu didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to dare to attack him. With a single hand, he","released a wave of energy, directly blocking the sword.","“Jian Wushuang!”","Realm King shouted, but this time he did not intervene.","Even a cultivator knew about dignity.","He was, after all, Realm King of the Northern Spacetime.","Why did Jian Wushuang attack now?","To save face for the Northern Spacetime.","If he intervened again, how would he face the Realm God Continent in the future?","Besides, Jing Xu was standing nearby!","If word got out, he would be disgraced.","Although his reputation was already mediocre.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, glanced at Realm King, and then stared at Zamasu, saying,","“Maybe one day I will bow to you gods, but it won’t be today!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he attacked again.","Time and space converged once more.","This time, Zamasu wanted to block it but couldn’t.","Because his manifestation’s divine power was almost depleted.","He had initially intended to use his status to forcibly take Berut away from the Northern","Spacetime.","But he didn’t expect to be stopped by a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation level like","Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, his expression was somewhat embarrassed.","As a Universe God and future successor of Realm King God, he disdained making threats.","He simply gave Jian Wushuang a clear look and dissolved his avatar.","Berut’s fall meant nothing to him.","Even if the divine domain was lost, it didn’t matter.","He just didn’t want humans to gain a treasure for nothing.","“Zamasu, just left like that?” Jing Xu, in the distance, couldn’t believe it. Zamasu, who was so","domineering on the Realm God Continent, had been humbled in the Northern Spacetime by a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master.","If this got out, those Universe Gods on the Realm God Continent wouldn’t believe it.","Zamasu didn’t even give the Great Realm King face, extremely arrogant and ruthless.","Yet, he bowed his head in the Northern Spacetime.","Seeing Zamasu leave voluntarily, Realm King also breathed a sigh of relief.","But the words Jian Wushuang had just spoken made his aura surge.","For a moment, he felt proud.","In his youth, he had also been this glorious, but he couldn’t defeat time in the end.","At this moment, Berut was in despair.","Even Zamasu couldn’t protect him.","Now, he could only await death. Feelings of unwillingness filled him.","His eyes glared at Jian Wushuang, “You will regret this!”","Regret!","Everyone has regrets, it all depends on one’s mindset.","Jian Wushuang also had regrets, but he didn’t dwell on them. It only made him a bit more","burdened."]},{"number":6067,"title":"Chapter 6067: Unfortunately, Not Today!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6067: Unfortunately, Not Today!","What did this matter?","“Perhaps!” He faced Berut calmly and said, “Maybe one day I will regret this, but not today!”","He had already offended Zamasu, and today Berut was destined to fall.","The Spacetime Reincarnation Sword directly crushed the expanding Berut, turning his divine body into dust and completely obliterating his soul.","He was utterly annihilated.","No one could save Berut.","With Berut’s demise, the devouring Origin Source in the abyss became masterless.","The bat-like desolate beasts were drawn back to the devouring Origin Source in the abyss.","The devoured power of the Origin Source also returned to the entire mid-level spacetime at that moment.","This crisis was considered resolved.","However, the power that Berut had absorbed entered Jian Wushuang’s reincarnation.","“Jian Wushuang, can you handle it?” Realm King was a bit worried. After all, Berut at his peak was a demigod, and the absorbed power of the Origin Source was something that ordinary Ninth Tribulation cultivators couldn’t withstand.","Now this Origin Source was being devoured again.","Devoured by Jian Wushuang’s Spacetime Reincarnation.","However, Jian Wushuang could control his devouring power, absorbing when he wanted and stopping when he didn’t.","He had none of Berut’s drawbacks.","“Realm King, about the Abyssal Divine Domain?” As he absorbed the power of the Origin Source that Berut had absorbed, he asked about the Abyssal Divine Domain.","This matter had not yet been explained by Realm King.","Why did Berut come to the Northern Spacetime?","Because of Zamasu?","Realm King sighed and explained, “I don’t know much about Zamasu either, but this Abyssal Divine Domain should be modeled after the abyss created by the Realm King God. The mid- level Abyssal Spacetime was created by the Realm King God. Zamasu brought Berut to the Northern Spacetime, along with the Divine Domain, probably because of the Abyssal Spacetime. If you have time, you can go to the Abyssal Spacetime. It might be helpful to you.” “The Abyssal Spacetime!” Jian Wushuang nodded. He had long suspected that Berut’s Abyssal Divine Domain had some connection with the Abyssal Spacetime.","Now hearing the Realm King’s explanation, he understood.","Berut’s Abyssal Divine Domain was created by Zamasu, while the mid-level Abyssal Spacetime was created by the Realm King God.","Perhaps this was why they targeted the Northern Spacetime!","His thinking was simple, purely for profit.","But he didn’t understand that Zamasu’s hatred for the Northern Spacetime, and even for the human race, was far more than just profit.","The Abyssal Divine Domain was also built to rival the Abyssal Spacetime created by Realm King God, the core of the Northern Spacetime.","The aim was to show an outstanding performance and take over the position of the Realm King God sooner.","“Whew!”","The power that Berut had absorbed, if not entering the Spacetime Reincarnation, wouldn’t return to the Origin Source of the mid-level spacetime, which meant he benefited from it.","Infinite power, all compressed into the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","This power was enough to double his Origin Source.","At least, it would light up three more universes.","By then, he would almost be at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation.","The distance to the Eighth Tribulation was not far.","Repeated life-and-death opportunities allowed Jian Wushuang’s growth to bear fruit.","If he weren’t in a hurry to return to Qishen Temple, he might have had the chance to break through to the Eighth Tribulation within ten epochs.","However, now that Wu Zuo had already taken people back to the low-level spacetimes, they couldn’t delay any longer.","“Realm King, there’s nothing more here. Hu Qing and I will take our leave.”","“Wait!” Realm King took out a ring from his pocket and smiled, saying, “Berut was killed by you, and the Abyssal Divine Domain left behind naturally belongs to you. Keep it!”","Jian Wushuang was somewhat puzzled as to why he was being given this ring.","As for the Abyssal Divine Domain, he hadn’t even thought about it. He only wanted to understand the secrets behind the Divine Domain. Now that he knew Zamasu was behind it, there was no research value left.","He didn’t dare to think about obtaining this super treasure.","“Don’t overthink it. This treasure is useless to me!” Realm King patted Jian Wushuang on the shoulder. “Focus on your cultivation. You don’t need to worry about the matters of the Realm God Continent!”","Jian Wushuang was stunned for a moment, then understood.","This Abyssal Divine Domain was created by Zamasu. Once it appeared on the Realm God Continent, Zamasu could take it away at any time.","Now they had thoroughly offended Zamasu, so they might as well keep this treasure.","Since Jian Wushuang had killed Berut, it was most appropriate to give it to him.","Understanding this, he did not refuse. After putting on the ring, he pointed a finger and stored the ownerless Divine Domain into the ring.","He was not Berut, who did not have an Origin Source.","Thus, he treated the Divine Domain as his Origin Source, attempting to expand it to","perfection and become a god himself.","Such a god could be considered a false god!","However, their combat power was much stronger than a demigod’s.","This was also the promise Zamasu had made to Berut.","Jian Wushuang, having the Starry Sky Origin Source, did not need to treat the Divine Domain","as his Origin Source, but he could use it as a supreme treasure of the Domain.","Once unleashed, it could cover the entire spacetime, and everyone within would be without","restrictions.","It was indeed a good treasure.","However, this Domain would be ineffective against a Starry Sky God like Mie Sheng.","On the contrary, it could even implicate himself.","Without restrictions, he would at most have 25 divine power.","But without restrictions, Mie Sheng...","He could likely shatter the Abyssal Divine Domain.","This treasure needed further exploration and refinement, and couldn’t be used lightly.","“Then I’ll accept it!” After accepting the Abyssal Divine Domain and bidding farewell to the","Realm King, he left the Nianshen Secret Realm with Hu Qing.","Without the Divine Domain, the Nianshen Secret Realm began to break apart.","It scattered into various cosmic secret realms.","Drifting everywhere.","Among them was a scorched land, the former Moro Spacetime.","“Berut probably had schemes in the former Moro Spacetime as well. It’s a pity he died too easily, and there’s no chance to learn some of the secrets of the former Moro Spacetime!” Jian","Wushuang felt a bit regretful.","When Berut was killed, only big figures appeared.","No one would care about a Moro Spacetime.","Even if he asked directly, they wouldn’t tell him.","With the Nianshen Secret Realm shattered, and no spacetime Origin Source to support it,","these cosmic-level secret realms would no longer be a threat.","This period would also be an explosive time for mid-level spacetimes.","Countless strong beings would rise from this.","But this had nothing to do with them anymore.","Whoosh!","Passing by the ruins of Moro Spacetime, Hu Qing couldn’t help but collect the scorched land","left by Moro Spacetime.","“Perhaps it might be of some help to Qishen Temple!” Hu Qing carefully put it away. According to his calculations, this scorched land had some causal connection with Qishen Temple. Taking it along wouldn’t cost anything, so why not.","Jian Wushuang said nothing more, leaving the Nianshen Secret Realm but not heading","directly to the lower reaches of spacetime.","Because there was one more thing to solve.","It wasn’t a big deal.","Just visiting an old acquaintance.","“The Giant God Clan!”","“Shen Ling Frolasa!”","And Fuego, who had resurrected in the Three King Court.","It was said they were now Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Even Frolasa had reached the Seventh Tribulation realm, his cultivation speed no slower than","theirs."]},{"number":6068,"title":"Chapter 6068: Meeting an Old Friend","paragraphs":["Chapter 6068: Meeting an Old Friend","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It should be noted that Frolasa back then was just an ordinary Tribulation realm, and Fuego had recovered to the Sixth Tribulation realm because of his Life force.","From the Sixth Tribulation realm to the Eighth Tribulation realm, it seemed like only two Tribulations apart, but some people could be stuck here for a lifetime.","Frolasa breaking through from the First Tribulation realm to the Seventh Tribulation realm was already terrifying.","No wonder they were the first group in the Starry Sky.","The entire Giant God Clan of the Northern Spacetime probably had no more than two digits, and almost all of them could reach the Seventh Tribulation realm or higher.","This kind of potential was indeed heaven-defying.","Moreover, they had not yet returned to their homeland.","Once they returned to the Starry Sky, they could quickly improve again.","No wonder they became the first group.","Thinking of past encounters with them, Jian Wushuang smiled lightly.","The speed of the two was extremely fast, not inferior to the pyramid.","Now, Jian Wushuang could fully exert speed beyond the Universe Master level.","Continuously traversing through spacetime, they quickly arrived at the location Frolasa mentioned.","The Abyss Spacetime!","The most powerful spacetime in the middle-level, they didn’t yet know that this spacetime was created by an extraordinary being for the Northern Spacetime, serving as the foundation of the Northern Spacetime.","Not to mention the middle tier spacetime, it was the most powerful spacetime in the entire Northern Spacetime.","Swish!","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing appeared, and from a distance, they felt a familiar aura.","Before they could move forward, Frolasa and others had already approached.","“Jian Wushuang!”","From a great distance, a familiar voice was heard.","“Lord Frolasa!” Jian Wushuang teased.","Back then, he had called the other party ‘Lord Shen Ling’ for a long time.","Meeting again, the two were already at the same level, and Jian Wushuang was much stronger than the other.","The once so-called ‘Divine Spirit’ Frolasa was not too surprised. He had always felt that Jian Wushuang would sooner or later become super strong, surpassing him was not an issue.","After all, he had mastered the power of Life early on, and even as a Dao Lord, he could rival ordinary Tribulation realm cultivators.","To call him a heaven-defying Dao Lord was not an exaggeration.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s address, Frolasa’s face froze for a moment, then he smiled and said, “Just call me Frolasa, now you are stronger than me!”","The strong are respected.","That’s how it is.","Jian Wushuang had no discomfort and talked calmly with the other party.","This time, in dealing with Berut, the other party also helped a lot by letting Wu Zuo and others leave in advance, otherwise, there would still be some danger.","After chatting for a while, Immortal Lord Juyang and others also arrived.","There was also Fuego, who had devoured Bai Junwang back then.","Jian Wushuang did not speak, just waved a greeting, then looked at Immortal Lord Juyang, “According to what Frolasa said, you know a lot about Abyssal Spacetime?”","This time, coming to see Frolasa was not just a casual visit.","Even Realm King had proactively asked him to go to the Abyssal Spacetime, indicating that there was something there that could enhance his abilities. Currently, Frolasa also summoned him for this reason.","“I know a bit about it. If you ask who in the entire middle-tier spacetime knows the most about the Abyss, it must be the Abyssal Lord!” Immortal Lord Juyang, being a peak existence of the Eighth Tribulation realm, was very respectful towards Jian Wushuang.","They had felt the intensity of the battle in the Nianshen Secret Realm earlier.","Moreover, Berut had already fallen, which was likely closely related to the person in front of them.","How could he dare to be careless?","Jian Wushuang had long heard of the Abyssal Lord and wasted no words. The other party’s presence was in the Abyssal Spacetime.","Buzz!","He tore through spacetime with one hand, extending his arm into the crack. After searching for a moment, he pulled out the Abyssal Lord, the foremost expert of the middle-level spacetime, with one hand.","This scene left Immortal Lord Juyang and Fuego breathless.","Both of them were Eighth Tribulation realm experts, with Immortal Lord Juyang even being a Universe Master at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm. Yet, neither was a match for the Abyssal Lord. However, in Jian Wushuang’s hand, the Abyssal Lord was like a baby, easily captured.","One should know that the Abyssal Lord’s divine power exceeded 15 million.","For Jian Wushuang to capture him effortlessly, he must have at least 20 million in divine power and an overwhelming advantage in cultivation realm.","But Jian Wushuang was only in the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Frolasa, however, was not surprised at all. When Jian Wushuang was a Dao Lord, he was already that strong. Now that he had reached the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, Frolasa believed he could surpass the Eighth Tribulation, even the Ninth Tribulation.","In reality, only Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing knew it wasn’t that exaggerated.","It was mainly due to the Divine Domain.","Using the Divine Domain against ordinary practitioners was the most effective.","Throughout the Northern Spacetime, except for the three Eternal Beings, Jian Wushuang could freely use the Divine Domain.","Of course, this excluded Mie Sheng.","As for the Eternal Beings, it was because they had reached the Ninth Tribulation. If he used the Divine Domain, the three Eternal Beings could unleash divine power exceeding 30 million.","If there was another one to add, it would be Hu Qing.","Hu Qing’s future self could barely reach 30 million in divine power.","Jian Wushuang himself, due to the refining of his divine power, could break through 10,000, achieving such an increase.","Now, using the Divine Domain, he could elevate his divine power to 25 million.","Without using the Divine Domain, he could reach over 15 million.","Overall, in the entire Northern Spacetime, there were no more opponents.","The few strongmen of the Giant God Clan, while shocked, turned to look at the Abyssal Lord.","At this moment, the Abyssal Lord was the most speechless. He didn’t know what had happened. Just a moment ago, he was celebrating the passing of a Tribulation with friends and family, and now he was captured.","Instantly, he understood who this unfamiliar young man before him was.","“Are you a senior from the upper-level spacetime?”","Jian Wushuang saw that the other party was still somewhat sensible and casually tossed him aside, his voice cold, “You don’t need to be afraid. I just want to explore the Abyssal Spacetime, along with these friends of mine!”","He gestured towards the members of the Giant God Clan.","This could also be considered a repayment.","Previously, he had informed them about Berut’s situation. Now, this was to repay the favor, settling the debt.","“No problem!” The Abyssal Lord agreed immediately.","No matter what, the Abyss was his territory. Even if Jian Wushuang was extremely powerful, he still needed to be greeted.","The Abyssal Lord, who had fought Immortal Lord Juyang for several eras, never expected this to be the outcome.","The Abyss had devoured countless treasures and secret realms, simultaneously providing feedback to the entire spacetime.","As a member of the Giant God Clan, Immortal Lord Juyang was aware of the Abyss’s special nature. Entering the Abyss was also for cultivation.","Treasures were secondary.","The Abyss had both devouring and feedback capabilities.","Injecting one’s power into the Abyss would result in greater power being fed back into the divine body and Origin Source.","Simply put, it was an ultimate treasure trove that could significantly enhance a practitioner in a short time.","The Abyssal Lord, who had been guarding the Abyss, became the first expert of the middle-level spacetime for this reason.","Realm King letting Jian Wushuang enter the Abyss was actually to allow him to comprehend the Law Rules within it.","However, he had his own plans, intending to search for the treasures left behind by Moro Spacetime."]},{"number":6069,"title":"Chapter 6069: Beast God Weapon","paragraphs":["Chapter 6069: Beast God Weapon","Beast God Weapon!","As for enhancing his Origin Source, he absorbed the power left by Berut, which had not yet been exhausted. With the help of Abyssal Spacetime, he could completely absorb this power and significantly enhance his Starry Sky Origin Source.","“Abyssal Lord, I hope you don’t mind me saying something!” At this moment, Hu Qing interjected, causing the Abyssal Lord to look over.","Hu Qing’s expression was calm, but the aura around him was extraordinary. The Abyssal Lord could sense the gap between them and spoke very politely, “This senior, please feel free to speak!”","“Abyssal Spacetime does not belong to anyone. You know its function. Why monopolize it?” Hu Qing’s words sounded ridiculous. Such a heaven-defying treasure should be enjoyed exclusively, right?","Contributing it would be laughable.","This was just the surface view.","In fact, the Abyssal Lord had initially thought about this.","Hearing Hu Qing’s words now, he fell into deep thought and then explained, “Senior may not know that there is a barrier between the mid-level spacetime and the upper-level spacetime. This barrier also blocks the opportunities for ordinary cultivators. Without this barrier, the mid-level spacetime would also face pressure from the upper-level spacetime. Perhaps then, I would open up Abyssal Spacetime!”","Simply put, currently, Abyssal Spacetime had no pressure.","Hu Qing smiled after hearing this, “You are right. If there were external pressure, the mid- level spacetime with Abyssal Spacetime would likely not be inferior to the upper-level spacetime!”","Tsk, tsk!","Jian Wushuang clicked his tongue and turned to the Abyssal Lord, saying, “This time, I give you a chance. I will make an oath with you. Ten eras from now, I will lead the lower level to attack the mid-level. I give you ten eras. If you can stop us, I will join your Abyssal Spacetime and break the barrier of the upper-level spacetime!”","The Abyssal Lord’s face froze in surprise, “This...you seniors think too highly of the mid-level spacetime. Even with the super treasure of Abyssal Spacetime, it would be difficult to","cultivate super-powerful beings in ten eras. At most, it can only elevate the overall strength by one level!”","“Haha, since you lack confidence, I will let you control Abyssal Spacetime for another ten eras. After this time, I will lead the cultivator army from the lower level to attack the mid- level!” Jian Wushuang originally intended to compete fairly with the other party and forcibly take over Abyssal Spacetime.","But he did not have the time now, so he set it for ten eras later.","After dealing with Mie Sheng, he would break the barrier between the lower and mid-levels, lead the cultivators from the lower level to attack the mid-level, take over Abyssal Spacetime, cultivate a large number of powerful beings, and then break the barrier of the upper level, entering the upper level.","Until he unified the entire Northern Spacetime.","The appearance of Berut and Zamasu made him understand the vast gap between the Northern Spacetime and the Realm God Continent, and even the other spacetimes.","The Realm King who ruled the Northern Spacetime had lost his true self. Protecting the Northern Spacetime depended on the strength of the cultivators themselves.","The current Northern Spacetime had barriers between the upper, middle, and lower levels, and the gaps were too large.","To break this gap and improve overall strength.","By then, Danbao would have almost created the resurrection secret method, greatly","enhancing the overall strength of the Northern Spacetime.","This was exactly what he wanted to see, and it also helped Zhen Ling fulfill the promise of making Qishen Temple great again.","With his strength, he could achieve this.","Among those present, only Hu Qing and Frolasa knew his intentions.","The Abyssal Lord stood frozen in place, not daring to speak.","If Jian Wushuang really wanted to do this, the Abyssal Lord could only retreat and give way.","“Alright, let’s go take a look inside the abyss first!” Seeing Abyssal Lord’s frightened expression, he said no more and led the group towards the core of the abyss.","Abyssal Spacetime, truly the largest spacetime in the mid-level, comparable to Ancient Moon Spacetime.","However, this distance was just a step away for him.","When Immortal Lord Juyang saw the dark spacetime, his face was excited. He had waited countless years for this moment, and this time he had to thank Frolasa, or else he would have already reached the Starry Sky.","Returning to the Starry Sky could still bring improvement, but he wanted to test his limits. When he returned to the Starry Sky later, he could perform better and obtain more resources.","“The abyss here is indeed different from the one in the Divine Domain!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered when he saw the true abyss.","“It seems that Zamasu is far inferior to the Realm King God!” Hu Qing remarked calmly after seeing it.","The Divine Domain was far away, and just absorbing a mid-level spacetime had caused a burden.","However, this abyss could sustain the entire Northern Spacetime with plenty to spare.","Everyone standing above the abyss could feel their power draining and then being","replenished.","This feeling was too marvelous!","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t entered yet, Immortal Lord Juyang couldn’t have resisted rushing in","first.","“Let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t stay any longer and led the way in.","The others followed him inside.","Within the abyss, it was dark and incredibly silent.","There was no danger at all.","According to the Abyssal Lord’s explanation, the abyss had no dangers but possessed an","immensely strong gravitational pull.","Below the Tribulation level, one could only practice in the air above the abyss.","Upon entering, Jian Wushuang saw that the surroundings of the abyss were filled with great halls, likely belonging to the strong ones of Abyssal Spacetime.","As for the depths of the abyss, few ventured there without the Abyssal Lord’s orders.","Through countless eras, only the descendants of the Abyssal Lord had the privilege to go","deep.","After delving 10,000 miles, the gravitational force was strong enough to forcibly pull in Universe Masters of the Fifth Tribulation.","Here, there were no more training halls or caves.","And every 10,000 miles, there was a flag.","It indicated the required realm and divine power needed to continue descending.","Since the era when the Abyssal Lord took control, the deepest record for descending into the","abyss was set by the Abyssal Lord himself, reaching a depth of 190,000 miles.","That was his limit; any further and his divine body would be crushed.","Actually, the abyss didn’t necessarily become more effective the deeper it went.","The required depth varied with strength.","For those at the Tribulation level, 50,000 miles was roughly the limit.","That was just right for pressure-free training.","“Jian Wushuang, I won’t accompany you further down!”","At the 5,000 mile mark, Frolasa and a few Giants stayed behind.","The others continued to descend.","At 130,000 miles, Fuego also stayed behind.","At this point, only four remained.","Jian Wushuang, Hu Qing, the Abyssal Lord, and Immortal Lord Juyang.","The Abyssal Lord’s training spot was at 190,000 miles, about the same for Immortal Lord","Juyang.","Their strengths were almost on par, but the Abyssal Lord, with the help of the great formation surrounding the abyss and his own Origin Source Dao Arena, could easily block Immortal Lord","Juyang."]},{"number":6070,"title":"Chapter 6070: The Mask of Greed “Tie Mian”","paragraphs":["Chapter 6070: The Mask of Greed “Tie Mian”","To seize this precious land from the Abyssal Lord, at least 18 million units of divine power were needed.","“Whew!”","180,000 miles!","Immortal Lord Juyang also stopped; he had reached his limit.","“Dao Friend Wushuang, this is as far as I can go!”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and continued to descend with Hu Qing.","Not long after, the Abyssal Lord also stopped.","In the end, only Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing were left.","“Even with the blessing of the Origin Source Dao Arena, it’s still quite strenuous!” Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly. The ring on his finger then burst out with a black mist ring.","It enveloped him and Hu Qing.","Without the suppression of the Supreme Law Rules, their divine power exceeded 20 million as they rushed to the bottom of the abyss.","Without anyone else, the two of them descended at the fastest speed.","“Mm!” During the descent, Jian Wushuang sensed a familiar aura.","The power there had already surpassed 18 million units of divine power.","To enter this place, even a supreme treasure needed to be at the top level of the Eight Tribulation.","“Beast God Weapon!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up when he saw a dark red mask floating in the abyss.","Above it, the power of the Beast God was still emanating.","“Tie Mian, the Beast God of Glutton!”","The Beast God Tie Mian, also known as the Mask of Greed.","It was one of the Nine Great Beast God Weapons, alongside Candle Dragon.","He didn’t expect it to be floating here.","When entering the abyss, he had asked the Abyssal Lord if the treasures he had acquired from the abyss were still there, and the other had said they were, allowing him to choose freely when he left. Jian Wushuang had thought that the treasures left in the Moro Spacetime had been taken by the Abyssal Lord.","In fact, most of the treasures had been collected into the Qishen Temple before the destruction of Moro Spacetime.","Moreover, the treasures of Moro Spacetime, those that surpassed the Universe-tier artifacts, had been brought by Mie Sheng and were still in his possession.","How many could have truly fallen into the abyss?","Finding this Mask of Greed here made him very happy.","After a slight observation with his mind, he found that the Origin Source of the mask had reached the perfection of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","It was","treasure of the perfect Eighth Tribulation realm.","No wonder it appeared here.","After countless years of tempering in the abyss, the mask had reached the limit that the Northern Spacetime could bear.","Though not a divine artifact, it had reached the level of a sub-divine artifact.","“Now, you have a master!”","With a thought, he forcibly established ownership.","The mask emitted a low hum of resistance but ultimately couldn’t withstand Jian Wushuang’s control.","Finally, it quieted down in his hand.","“Congratulations, Brother Wushuang!”","Jian Wushuang was also very happy, smiling faintly, “I finally got my second Beast God Weapon, still quite a few to go to complete the collection!”","“It will happen!” Hu Qing nodded solemnly. He could foresee that Jian Wushuang would complete the collection of Beast God Weapons, though the journey would be fraught with difficulties.","He didn’t mention this.","“Let’s go, keep descending!”","He couldn’t wait to explore the bottom.","It was said the abyss was a million miles deep.","They were still far from reaching their limit.","Only at a million miles would they reach the bottom.","Without demigod power, it was impossible to reach the bottom.","However, with their divine power, reaching halfway posed no problem.","They continued to descend for another hour, and they gathered quite a few treasures.","All of them were treasures of the complete Eighth Tribulation realm, but compared to the","Beast God Weapons, these treasures were quite ordinary.","Neither of them took a fancy to the treasures, so they didn’t bother collecting any.","They decided to leave them for those destined to find them in the future.","350,000 miles!","400,000 miles!","500,000 miles...","“Whew!” Hu Qing took a deep breath, “I’ve reached my limit.”","Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow, a bit surprised. He hadn’t felt any discomfort yet; how","could Hu Qing have reached his limit already?","Their strengths were actually quite close. If one were to argue who was stronger, it would undoubtedly be Hu Qing’s future self.","Hu Qing’s true self had stopped at 300,000 miles.","His Future Self, however, had reached 570,000 miles.","His divine power exceeded 25 million.","“Hu Qing, your Future Self’s divine power surpasses 25 million; how could you be feeling pressure?” Jian Wushuang asked, puzzled, “Could it be that you’ve discovered something?”","Hu Qing shook his head, glanced at the abyss below, and said calmly: “Wushuang, the abyss is just a place for me to cultivate. My true self had already achieved enough cultivation at 300,000 miles. I only followed this far out of curiosity.” Indeed, if it was just for cultivation, there was no need to insist on reaching the bottom.","It was merely curiosity.","Curiosity about what treasures might be at the bottom!","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Alright, you stay here and cultivate. I’ll continue to","descend. This time, the cultivation might not take too long. Wu Zuo and the others have already returned to the downstream spacetime. We can’t waste too much time. If Mie","Sheng...”","He was worried about the safety of Wu Zuo and the others.","They still needed to return soon.","“Don’t worry, Wu Zuo and the others won’t be in danger!” Hu Qing calculated slightly and","gave the answer.","But Jian Wushuang thought otherwise. Mie Sheng was not a constant; he was a variable, and","anything could happen.","It was better to be cautious.","They couldn’t waste too much time here.","“I’ll go down and test my limits. From the looks of it, I might be close to the bottom. I’ll take","a look and come back up. It won’t take more than a hundred years, and then we should leave!”","After parting with Hu Qing, he continued to descend.","His divine power kept increasing.","He soon broke through six hundred thousand miles.","Still feeling no significant pressure, he continued downward.","Perhaps it was related to the abyss he controlled; the deeper he went, the easier it felt.","In contrast, at depths of three to four hundred thousand miles, he felt great pressure. At that","time, he had not yet used his divine domain.","After using his divine domain, his speed increased continuously.","Swish!","Only 10,000 miles remained to the bottom.","“It seems I can really reach the bottom!” His speed did not decrease and even accelerated.","10,000 miles were just a blink of an eye for him. Although this place was an abyss, it posed no","pressure on him.","Bang!","With a momentum, his figure instantly touched the ground.","“I’ve reached the bottom!” Jian Wushuang looked around. The bottom of the abyss was","different from what he had imagined.","The bottom of the abyss refined by Zamasu’s Divine Domain was a Devouring Origin Source.","The bottom of the abyss refined by Realm King was flat and empty.","After slightly adjusting his breathing, his mind power began to spread, gradually covering the","entire bottom of the abyss.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes moved; his Thought power observed a ruined Dao Arena.","His Thought power covered the entire bottom of the abyss; there was only this one","dilapidated Dao Arena, no living creatures.","There was no sign of any aura.","He relaxed his vigilance and walked forward slowly.","After passing two huge pillars, he entered the ruined Dao Arena.","Contrary to his expectations, there were no treasures here.","If there were any treasures swallowed here, they would probably only be divine artifacts.","He had some fantasies, but they were dashed. Now he could only see if there was anything in this Dao Arena that could help him!","The dilapidated Dao Arena was quite shabby, with only a damaged statue whose face could not be seen clearly."]},{"number":6071,"title":"Chapter 6071: Zamasu Statue?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6071: Zamasu Statue?","Judging by the clothing, it should have been a human.","It was not a god, but a cultivator.","At the very least, it was a demigod, or a super-strong Universe God.","Looking at it from below, this dojo did not seem to have been swallowed into this place; it looked more like it originally existed here.","“Unfortunately, there’s no face, so I don’t know what it looks like!” He looked up at the sculpture, feeling a sense of familiarity, but couldn’t pinpoint where he knew it from.","The head of the statue was incomplete, making it impossible to see the facial features, and thus, it was naturally impossible to know who it was.","After circling the statue once, he found nothing else around it.","Feeling a bit disappointed, he prepared to turn and leave to find an open spot to recover the power of Berut that he had absorbed within himself.","However, as he turned his head, a bright light reflected back at him, shining at a perfect angle into his eyes. The blinding light made it impossible for him to open his eyes. Shielding his eyes with his hand, he took a closer look and was startled.","A head!","It was the head of the statue.","There were cracks on the neck that matched the break on the statue, indicating that it had fallen from there.","The light that had been refracted came from the ear of the head.","“My Thought power couldn’t detect it?” Jian Wushuang was a bit surprised. He had just scanned everything in the surrounding darkness but didn’t find this head.","He walked over slowly, with one hand already reaching for the hilt of his Wanjie Sword behind him. However, when he approached the broken head, he discovered a weak barrier around it that could block Thought power.","Crash!","With just a gentle touch, he shattered the barrier, releasing an ancient aura.","This barrier seemed to be a self-protective one, not deliberately placed by someone, otherwise, it wouldn’t have been so weak.","As for the ancient aura, it was probably due to being sealed for too long.","Poof!","A bright lamp appeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand. Using its light, he saw the head clearly. Ugly!","What appeared before his eyes was an extremely ugly face.","The face was ferocious and colored.","However, it was only half.","Half of the face was green, and the other half was black.","The mouth was grinning, and the eyes were wide open.","Jian Wushuang found the sight quite horrifying.","“This... why does it look so much like Zamasu?” After observing the ugly face for a long time, he finally realized where the familiarity came from.","He glanced back at the statue behind him.","Thinking of Zamasu’s appearance, he turned back to the head in horror.","It looked alike!","It looked exactly alike.","If it weren’t for the half-black face, he would have recognized it immediately.","It was just that the carved appearance was too ferocious, making it hard to associate it with the calm-faced Zamasu.","“Zamasu!”","After confirming completely, he took a deep breath, feeling a turmoil in his heart.","In the abyss built by the Realm King God, there was a figure of Zamasu.","Moreover, it seemed that the figure should be of two people, just combined into one.","How could such a figure appear here?","Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","Perhaps only the Realm King God would know!","After thinking it over without any clues, he decided not to dwell on it. He didn’t have the time to research, so he wanted to take this Dao Arena away. Although it had no value, he could ask the Realm King about it in the future.","Zamasu had caused no small amount of trouble in the Northern Spacetime. Perhaps from this sculpture, he could find some clues to avoid being persecuted by Zamasu again.","He had worried greatly for the Northern Spacetime.","In the future, he would need to have the Realm King compensate him.","Swish!","He raised his hand and directly put the entire broken Dao Arena into his space ring, finally nodding in satisfaction, ready to start digesting the power he had devoured.","But just as the Dao Arena entered the mustard seed, it instantly turned to dust.","He was startled and tried to retrieve it, but it was too late.","He directly crushed the mustard seed, and the shattered ring in his hand revealed the destroyed space within.","This kind of space ring, he could create with a wave of his hand. As long as he mastered space, even an Emperor could create it. But after becoming a Universe Master, he had an Origin Source in the Starry Sky and was too lazy to make these rings or mustard seeds. Most of the treasures were thrown into the Origin Source, where the space was far more stable than the mustard seed.","Since the figure was related to Zamasu, he had put it in the ring for safety.","He didn’t expect the Dao Arena to disappear after entering the mustard seed.","After crushing the ring, a pair of earrings appeared in his hand!","“What is this...” Jian Wushuang didn’t expect the figure to yield a treasure.","He held the earrings and scrutinized them closely, finding nothing special.","But he remembered the origin of the earrings.","They were worn on the sharp ears of that head.","This meant the earrings belonged to Zamasu.","His interest was piqued. He gently probed the earrings with his Thought energy, but was slightly disappointed when no special power emerged, only a Life force.","This Life force was very ordinary, something he had in abundance. To him, it was like trash no one would pick up from the street. After probing and finding nothing, he casually threw them","into the Origin Source.","Since they were related to Zamasu, he would ask Realm King about them later!","Now he had to quickly digest the power he had absorbed.","Whoosh!","He exhaled a turbid breath.","The power had already dissipated into the Origin Source.","The dissipated power naturally entered the abyss.","Buzz!","After absorbing his power, the entire abyss trembled.","Clearly, his power was immense within the Northern Spacetime.","It was enough to rival a long river of spacetime.","Within Jian Wushuang’s own Origin Starry Sky, it suddenly contracted, and three super","universes rotated around him in an unbreakable pattern.","He sent out all the absorbed power, and even exhausted all his divine power. The next","moment, a vast amount of power began to feed back.","At the bottom of the abyss, he could absorb the purest power.","The feedback power was uniform, not like the mixed power actively devoured.","This was the benefit of the abyss.","It could quickly enhance strength.","Origin Source!","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists. At this moment, he did not use any secret methods, merely","using the three universes to enhance his Origin Source.","Flashes of light also glittered in the Starry Sky.","Those were stars, with black holes in their centers.","Then came the secret realms.","In just an instant, the framework of a universe was formed.","“The fourth universe!” Jian Wushuang pointed with a finger, and the fourth bright light in the","starry sky lit up.","The universe was formed!","Then came the fifth universe.","The continuous feedback of power made his Origin soar.","The first universe had taken him a lifetime.","The second universe, only a few eons. The third universe, only a few years.","The fourth universe took just an instant.","The fifth universe slowed down.","Because the feedback power was also weakening.","It couldn’t be as strong as before."]},{"number":6072,"title":"Chapter 6072: A Firm Path!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6072: A Firm Path!","However, the speed was still not slow.","Earlier, based on his estimation, using the absorption of Berut’s power, he could condense three Origin Source Universes.","Now, in the Abyss, he could condense even more.","These powers originally came from the Northern Spacetime, absorbed by Berut through the Divine Domain. After Berut’s fall, because these powers had entered Berut’s divine body, they couldn’t return to the middle-level spacetimes. Keeping them would be a waste, so Jian Wushuang took advantage of it.","Now in the Abyss, he was able to fully utilize these powers.","The fifth universe was also slowly forming.","The power weakened once again.","The remaining power could still condense at least two universes.","That would complete the seventh universe.","However, he still couldn’t sense the Heavenly Tribulation from the Supreme Law Rules.","It seemed that even seven universes were not enough.","If he could sense the Tribulation, he would have wanted to undergo it immediately.","Now the power in the Origin Source was very abundant, and he didn’t need Origin Stones to succeed.","Unfortunately, his current realm was still insufficient. He could only put it off for later. Fortunately, the bottle of blood-colored power was with him, allowing him to further enhance his basic divine power here.","After overcoming the Seventh Tribulation, he had yet to increase his divine power.","His divine body had reached its peak, capable of bearing stronger divine power. 3 million divine power to him was like a feather, without weight.","“Whew!”","Illuminating the universe and absorbing the feedback power, the further it went, the weaker the power became. The universe’s formation also slowed down, but this was slow only compared to the speed of forming the fourth and fifth universes.","Actually, it was still very fast, taking just a few years to complete.","Now, in his Origin Source Starry Sky, seven universes were shining brightly.","They connected into a single line.","There was a timeline between each universe.","“River of Time and Space?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed as he stared at his Origin Source Universe.","The connected universes indeed had the shadow of the River of Time and Space.","As he thought before, above the Universe Master was the Master of Time and Space, which made some sense, but no one called it that.","Universe Master, Universe God?","He always felt there was no difference between the two.","It seemed someone deliberately didn’t let them continue to enhance their Origin Source. When they were weak, they thought the Origin Source was the most important. Following the divine power route seemed counterproductive, like practicing Qi versus refining the body. Refining the body to the point of survival was enough, or buying a piece of extremely strong defensive armor was sufficient, just like improving one’s realm through practicing Qi. However, after becoming Universe Masters, they found everyone focused on divine power and the divine body, losing interest in the Origin Source.","In discussions, almost everyone said cultivating the Origin Source was a waste of time.","It was better to directly enhance divine power for more noticeable effects.","As a result, he started to doubt himself. Fortunately, he didn’t give up.","His Origin Source had always been stronger than his divine power.","Even creating the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation secret technique was based mainly","on the Origin Source, with divine power as a supplement.","The Starry Sky Chronicles focused on the Origin Source of Sword Dao as the core, serving as his strongest trump card.","“Maybe I’m wrong, but I don’t want to regret it later!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, solidifying his Dao Heart.","A goal must be unwavering, or it wouldn’t be a goal.","He wanted to break through the Nine Tribulations and become a true God of Spacetime, not some Universe God with no limits.","Why call it Universe God if it had no limits?","It was still due to the Origin Source being too weak.","If one created a long river of spacetime, could it be considered that they were Realm King?","They would directly surpass the Universe Master.","Wouldn’t that be delightful?","Buzz!","“Divine power?” He waved his hand, and a powerful force entered his body.","The blood-red color spread to the entire bottom of the abyss.","Crack!","A burst of explosive sound echoed, and the blood mist shattered into particles.","Jian Wushuang’s expression froze in surprise and he exclaimed, “Disintegration?”","That blood-red power actually disintegrated his divine power.","The seemingly intangible blood-red color seemed to be engaging in some kind of power","struggle.","He had never encountered such a situation before.","Originally, he thought he would enhance his basic divine power while at the bottom of the abyss, but unexpectedly, he encountered this situation.","It startled him.","When absorbing the blood-red power, he became extremely cautious.","Absorbing just a trace almost caused his eyes to burst.","That kind of power, as if a primordial murderer appeared within his body, trying to break free","from his restraint.","For a moment, he almost lost consciousness.","Frightened, he quickly expelled the blood-red power again.","He dared not easily absorb it again.","Gazing at the pervasive blood mist, he waited for the blood-red power and the invisible","power to distinguish the winner before trying again.","The blood mist surged!","Thunder rumbled around him.","As a result, the blood mist he saw was like the thunder mist on a rainy day, with flashes of","light inside, shaking his heart.","This situation persisted for several hours before it stopped.","“Could it be that the abyss is incompatible with the blood-red power?” He muttered to","himself. The abyss was refined by the Realm King, and the blood-red power came from Xilu,","which was created by Zamasu.","So, the power in the abyss was incompatible with Zamasu?","It didn’t seem possible!","The Divine Domain refined by Zamasu was in his hand, and he used it in the abyss without any","side effects.","Why was the abyss only incompatible with this blood-red power?","This question, perhaps only the Realm King God could answer, and even the Realm King","might not know.","To verify it, he might have to wait for a long time.","At least until he reached the Realm God Continent. “Forget it, I’ll just absorb some and try!” Looking at the calm blood-red power in front of","him, he absorbed a trace, and this time there was no reaction as severe as before, and he could","already control it.","After several trials, he began to boldly devour it.","After absorbing, he released more blood-red power, waiting for several hours of struggle","before absorbing again.","Repeatedly, absorbing the blood-red power in the abyss to enhance his divine power, the","speed was indeed fast.","Unconsciously, his divine power had reached five million.","But it still hadn’t reached the limit.","He continued to enhance it.","Time passed quickly.","30 years later.","Jian Wushuang’s clofthes were mostly tattered because even his clothes were shattered by the","absorption of divine power.","Now, his divine power had reached 8 million.","It had also reached the limit of his divine body.","Clenching his fists, he suddenly exploded, causing the surrounding space to tremble.","“Tribulation Armor!”","He shouted angrily, and dark red battle armor appeared on his body.","At this moment, his basic divine power was 10 million.","“Ah!!!!” He clenched his fists and widened his eyes in anger, “Super Eternal Ancient","Transformation!”","Boom!","The immense aura caused the entire abyss to tremble.","Now his divine power was 20 million.","Even without using the Origin Source Dao Arena, his divine power had reached 20 million.","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation’s amplified divine power began to decrease at this","moment.","But with the growth of double the power, he was still very satisfied!"]},{"number":6073,"title":"Chapter 6073: Lead the Way","paragraphs":["Chapter 6073: Lead the Way","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, with its amplified divine power, was based on the Origin Source.","The divine power of 20 million corresponded exactly to the limit of the Northern Spacetime.","If he used the Origin Source Dao Arena again!","In the Divine Domain, his divine power would soar.","Now, with the Origin Source Dao Arena of seven universes, it could already amplify by 70 percent.","Three universes increased by 60 percent, seven universes by 70 percent.","It seemed unreasonable, but it was actually very reasonable.","Because the Origin Source was like this.","This was also why so many people switched to the divine power route.","There was no choice; the effects were too slow.","The reason he was so determined to follow the Origin Source route was actually influenced by the Qishen Temple.","The shock brought by the Origin Source of All Things was too great at that time.","So much so that it made him firmly believe that the Origin Source was the strongest.","Up to now, he had no regrets.","Whoosh!","With one hand clenched into a fist, the power of the Origin Source gathered in his palm. Buzz!","An invincible force erupted from his body.","“This?”","That powerful force surprised even Jian Wushuang!","Such strength was never imagined.","Or rather, he had not thought he would be this strong in the Northern Spacetime!","The Origin Source had no restrictions, even outside the Divine Domain.","Easily surpassing divine power.","Even without using the Starry Sky Chronicles, his Origin Source power could easily surpass his own divine power.","It meant that his current Origin Source could exert power exceeding 20 million divine power. This was without using the Divine Domain.","Once using the Divine Domain, without restrictions, divine power would also soar.","The Origin Source Dao Arena descended, amplifying divine power by 70 percent.","20 million divine power, amplified by 70 percent, was 34 million.","Much stronger than Hu Qing’s Future Self.","30 million divine power was already the combat power of the Ninth Tribulation.","34 million divine power was definitely a strong figure in the Ninth Tribulation.","Not the pinnacle, but definitely not ordinary.","The threshold for the Ninth Tribulation was 20 million divine power.","30 million was the normal standard, 34 million was already a strong figure among them.","Plus his Origin Source power.","Seven universes, containing the power of 700,000 black holes.","Probably the universe of a Universe Master was comparable to the power of his seven universes!","After all, most Universe Masters still followed the divine power route, and almost none followed the Origin Source route.","Because it was too difficult, in the same realm, it was simply incomparable to divine power. Jian Wushuang had the Extreme Dao Starry Sky, so the Origin Source was very strong. Without the Extreme Dao, even if he mastered the Ultimate Dao, he would not have such a strong Origin Source universe in the Universe Master realm.","At that time, he might also choose the divine power route.","Some paths were not voluntary, but forced.","The Origin Source Dao Arena disappeared, his aura retreated, maintaining only the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","“It was time to leave!”","Unconsciously, he had already spent several decades at the bottom of the abyss.","It was time to go.","Swoosh!","Coming in had been somewhat troublesome, but getting out was relatively easy. He could swiftly leave the abyss without even using his divine power.","Soon he saw Hu Qing. After gesturing for Hu Qing to follow, they continued upward.","He didn’t tell Hu Qing about what had happened at the bottom of the abyss because he hadn’t figured it out himself, so there was no point in explaining.","“Brother Wushuang, your Origin Source and divine power have both changed. It seems you’ve gained a lot this time!” Hu Qing couldn’t help but exclaim upon seeing his divine power.","20 million divine power.","Hu Qing, without using his future body, was also roughly at this level.","He had also improved considerably in the abyss, but it was still much less compared to Jian","Wushuang.","If Jian Wushuang used his Origin Source Dao Arena, he could unleash a maximum divine","power of 34 million in the divine domain.","Hu Qing’s Future Self was no more than 30 million.","He had surpassed Hu Qing.","“Just a slight breakthrough!” Jian Wushuang responded with a faint smile.","Their speed increased, and soon they saw the Abyssal Lord. After casually pulling him up, they","bid farewell to Fuluosa and others, leaving the abyss.","The people of the Giant God Clan rarely entered the abyss. They wouldn’t come out unless they had reached their limits.","However, the Abyssal Lord had been cultivating here for many years. It was no longer much help to him unless he reached the Ninth Tribulation realm.","But in the current Northern Spacetime, it was still a long way from the Ninth Tribulation","realm.","They had to wait for Danbao to create the resurrection secret method.","Once the scattered cultivators could rekindle their path of cultivation, the next step would be to elevate the overall level of life.","Step by step, they would perfect the life system of the Northern Spacetime.","Although this had little to do with Jian Wushuang, he was not a Scattered Tribulation, and the Ninth Tribulation realm was far off for him. However, after experiencing the incident with Berut, he felt that to protect the Northern Spacetime, he first needed to make the Northern","Spacetime stronger.","Of course, he also needed to become stronger.","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation was currently his fastest method to increase divine","power, and it needed further innovation.","But this time, he needed a Beast God Weapon.","The Beast God Weapon would merge with the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation. “Abyssal Lord, have you ever found such a treasure in the abyss?” Jian Wushuang took out the Mask of Greed, or the Greedy Wolf Mask, he had obtained in the abyss.","The dark red divine power of the beast on it was particularly eye-catching.","The Abyssal Lord glanced at it and nodded, saying, “Yes, I once found such an item in the abyss. However, the aura of that treasure was much weaker than this mask. The one I found was only at the Seventh Tribulation level, and its Origin Source was already damaged, so it was useless to me. I threw it into the treasury!”","“Lead the way!” Jian Wushuang did not ask more, but a gleam of joy flashed in his eyes.","He didn’t expect to find such an item from the Abyssal Lord.","When he obtained the Greedy Wolf Mask, he thought those Beast God Weapons would be at least below 20,000 miles, but he didn’t expect to find weaker ones.","It seemed that without the Origin Source, they floated on the surface of the abyss.","Just as he finished gathering the Greedy Wolf Mask, he sensed a similar aura and stopped in mid-air.","“Hmm?” The Abyssal Lord was somewhat surprised.","However, he didn’t dare say much and stood silently aside, waiting.","Jian Wushuang used his mind to quickly search for the similar aura he had just detected.","“Found it!” He casually tore open the space, and just like when he grabbed the Abyssal Lord, The rummaged through the rift. Soon, he brought a cultivator before him.","Seeing this person, the Abyssal Lord exclaimed in surprise, “It’s you!”","Jian Wushuang glanced at the Abyssal Lord and noticed he recognized the person. He asked,","“You know him?”","“Yes, this kid once sneaked into the abyss, and I happened to catch him. But seeing his","potential, I didn’t make things difficult for him!” The Abyssal Lord laughed awkwardly.","The person’s strength was indeed impressive. A Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation level, with a divine power of 1.2 million, was already considered a peak expert among the Sixth Tribulation.","Seeing that the person was no longer struggling, Jian Wushuang threw him aside.","The captured Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation level was bewildered. Seeing the","Abyssal Lord, he revealed an angry expression and said coldly, “Abyssal Lord, you imprisoned me for tens of thousands of epochs, and now you’ve brought me here again. What do you","want?”"]},{"number":6074,"title":"Chapter 6074: Beast God: Qilin","paragraphs":["Chapter 6074: Beast God: Qilin","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Uh...” Abyssal Lord was somewhat embarrassed. After glancing at Jian Wushuang, he finally said, “Ye Tian, it is this senior who is looking for you, not me!”","Ye Tian turned his head to look at Jian Wushuang, feeling a bit surprised. Such a young man, whose presence he couldn’t even sense, and even Abyssal Lord called him Senior. He suddenly realized and exclaimed, “Could it be that senior is at the Ninth Tribulation realm?”","The uninformed Ye Tian did not know that Jian Wushuang was still a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation.","Jian Wushuang shook his head with a bitter smile and personally explained, “Young friend Ye, I am not at the Ninth Tribulation. We in the Northern Spacetime do not have a Universe Master at the Ninth Tribulation. If one day you are about to cross the Ninth Tribulation, you must go to the upper-level spacetimes to visit a being called Tian Cang. He will tell you everything!”","“No Ninth Tribulation realm?” Ye Tian was still pondering the first sentence, then thought of Jian Wushuang’s advice and quickly thanked him, “Thank you, senior, for your guidance!”","At this moment, he remembered that it was Jian Wushuang who wanted to see him, so he asked, “I don’t know what business senior has with this junior. I am willing to be of service!”","“There is something I need your help with. I wonder if you can part with it,” Jian Wushuang said very politely. He did not intend to seize it by force, as there were so many people watching; he couldn’t afford to lose face.","A little guy at the Sixth Tribulation realm had obtained the Beast God Weapon, which he could easily buy.","Casually tossing out a treasure could make even an Eighth Tribulation realm envious. To buy a treasure from a little guy at the Sixth Tribulation realm was very simple.","Ye Tian, however, felt a tremor in his heart. He suddenly understood that this was a forced buy!","The key was that he really had an irreplaceable treasure on him.","It was his life-bound treasure, indispensable on his path of cultivation. If he lost it, his cultivation journey would almost come to an end.","No matter how strong Jian Wushuang was, no matter how many treasures he offered, he was unwilling to sell it.","But facing a strong man, what could he do?","Jian Wushuang was not a fool. He clearly saw the other’s hesitation and remained silent, waiting for a response.","This treasure had to be taken away today no matter what.","Seeing the other hesitate, Hu Qing quietly transmitted a message, “Young Friend, there is no need to hesitate. The treasure we want is not your innate treasure, but the one you obtained from the Abyss.”","A treasure from the Abyss?","Ye Tian was stunned for a moment, then remembered the strange item he had obtained in the Abyss.","A blood-red cloak.","Moving without wind, majestic.","The Qilin Armor!","When he first obtained it, he was still an ordinary Universe Master. His Origin Source was strong enough to activate the treasure, but later he could no longer use it. Out of curiosity about the Origin Source within the treasure, he dismantled the Qilin Armor, kept the Origin Source, but the Qilin Armor was taken away during a battle.","Upon hearing this result, Jian Wushuang frowned.","He silently cursed the other as a wastrel. If the Origin Source was insufficient, why not cultivate it?","Dismantled?","Taken away during a battle?","With the Origin Source stripped away, the Qilin Armor probably no longer had the aura of the Beast God. Where could he find it now?","“If senior is interested in that treasure, this junior is willing to give you the Origin Source. As for the Qilin Armor, it was taken by a Seventh Tribulation realm expert from Giant Peak Spacetime. I have no way to get it back!” Ye Tian carefully took out the Beast God Origin Source and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","After handing it over, he stepped back again.","Holding the blood-red Origin Source, Jian Wushuang remembered an introduction by the old ram-headed man about a super treasure.","One of the Nine Beast God Weapons, “Qilin”","It was a cloak.","Now only the Origin Source remained, and the Qilin Armor was lost.","“How could I covet the belongings of a junior like you? I think this treasure is enough to buy this Beast God Origin Source!” Jian Wushuang casually pulled out a wooden box, and before handing it over, he opened it and introduced, “This contains a Heavenly Eye Spring Pearl, which will help you in crossing the Seventh Tribulation. I see that your divine power has reached perfection. With this pearl, you have a 90 percent chance of success in the Tribulation!”","Ye Tian, who initially wanted to refuse, widened his eyes when he heard that the success rate of passing the Seventh Tribulation was 90 percent. He hurriedly stepped forward to receive it, so shocked that he forgot to thank Jian Wushuang.","It was Abyssal Lord who reminded him, “Ye Tian, quickly thank the senior for his gracious gift!”","“Thank you, senior!” Ye Tian’s expression changed, and he immediately adopted a respectful and admiring demeanor, bowing deeply.","Jian Wushuang, however, waved his hand, showing little interest in such formalities. It was merely a fair trade, and there was no need for an exaggerated display of gratitude.","Though the world was inherently unfair, the fairest principle was that the strong were revered.","But sometimes, at a certain level, things would change.","For example, Hu Qing would show compassion for the weak.","Tongtian Buddha had even fallen into the demonic path to break through his power limits.","As for himself, Jian Wushuang had no particular thoughts; it was just an ordinary transaction.","Though he could bully others with his power, there was no need to.","If he engaged in wanton slaughter, it would provoke countless powerful adversaries, and it was time to curb his bloodthirsty impulses.","“By the way, you still need to stay by my side for a while. I need you to help me find the strong Seventh Tribulation being and retrieve the Qilin Armor!” Jian Wushuang continued, “But you won’t be at a disadvantage. During this time, I can give you some guidance in your cultivation.”","Upon hearing that he only needed to lead the way and would receive guidance from someone whom even Abyssal Lord respected so much, Ye Tian immediately agreed, realizing this was the greatest opportunity he had encountered in recent years.","Jian Wushuang was not surprised by this reaction. He turned to Abyssal Lord and said, “Let’s go. It’s time to bother you for a bit.”","“Not at all. It’s an honor to have you at my humble abode!” Abyssal Lord was very humble, taking the initiative to lead Jian Wushuang and his group to another core of the Abyssal Spacetime.","This was also the stronghold of Abyssal Lord.","However, Jian Wushuang didn’t stay long. After obtaining the treasure, he left in a hurry.","The advance of Wu Zuo and his group made him uneasy.","Revealing his strength likely caused Mie Sheng to make full preparations.","Therefore, he had to act quickly.","“Flowing Cloud Boots!”","A pair of ancient green battle boots, containing a dragon’s roar, one of the nine Beast God Weapons, representing the Azure Dragon.","With this Beast God Weapon, he now had three and a half.","The Qilin Cloak was still incomplete, but it was close. If he personally pursued it, he would definitely retrieve it.","His opponent was a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master, and there was no escaping from him.","If it were an Emperor, it might have been troublesome, requiring Hu Qing’s deduction. But a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master couldn’t hide.","Slash!","Tearing through space, they arrived at Giant Peak Spacetime almost instantly.","This place was the territory of Immortal Lord Juyang.","Before entering, he informed him, as they were acquaintances after all."]},{"number":6075,"title":"Chapter 6075: Lord Zhada","paragraphs":["Chapter 6075: Lord Zhada","When stepping into someone else’s territory, it’s always polite especially when it involves seizing a treasure.","Of course, it couldn’t be called seizing; it was more like returni owner.","The other party had taken advantage of their powerful strengt! Ye Tian’s elder, it was reasonable for him to use his strength to","“Lord Zhada?”","What a strange name!","“I found him!”","Paragraph comment","Paragraph comment feature now on the Web! Move mou over any paragraph and click the icon to add your commer Also, you can always turn it off/on in Settings.","GOT IT","His Thought power covered the entire Giant Peak Spacetime, almost instantly locking onto the opponent’s position.","On a secluded star.","It was on the edge of Giant Peak Spacetime, and a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation was cultivating on such a desolate planet, which surprised Jian Wushuang.","When he arrived, there was a group of alien powerhouses living on this planet.","“Senior, this Lord Zhada is originally an alien. If it weren’t for the protection of Immortal Lord Juyang, he would have been killed by our human powerhouses long ago!” Ye Tian narrated the story of Lord Zhada beside him.","Jian Wushuang was somewhat moved.","What he saw in Lord Zhada was a kindly old man, carefully teaching those alien powerhouses how to cultivate and how to survive.","Especially how to survive among human powerhouses.","This group of aliens living among human powerhouses was far less prosperous than those in the upper spacetime.","Because in the upper spacetime, individual strength was valued, regardless of race.","As long as one was a super powerhouse, they would be respected regardless of their origin.","But it was different in the middle spacetime, where it was difficult for alien powerhouses to survive.","Only a giant god race like Immortal Lord Juyang could dominate one side.","Any other race would have been besieged long ago.","Because the Giant God Clan came from the Starry Sky.","They were the number one race.","That was why they were respected.","This was also why Lord Zhada sought refuge under Immortal Lord Juyang.","“Ye Tian, call him over!” Jian Wushuang’s tone was calm. He had initially planned to take it directly, but seeing the other party’s difficult situation, he reconsidered.","A bitter fate!","Just like his own!","No one pitied him, but he could pity others.","Upon hearing this, Ye Tian’s face lit up with joy. He immediately obeyed and rushed down. “Zhada!”","“Zhada!”","“Zhada!”","Ye Tian’s voice echoed across the entire planet.","Lord Zhada, who had been lecturing to the many aliens, frowned and looked up at Ye Tian.","At the same time, he noticed Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","Two powerful beings without any aura, hidden in the void.","Of course, it was only a simple concealment. If it were a deeper concealment, Lord Zhada would not have been able to detect it.","But even so, if he hadn’t captured them with his naked eyes, he wouldn’t have noticed them.","Lord Zhada immediately stood up and flashed to Ye Tian’s side. After glancing at Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, he respectfully said, “You must be Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing. The Immortal Lord has already informed me that you would come!”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang was a bit surprised!","He had only told Immortal Lord Juyang that he would go to Giant Peak Spacetime to look for a treasure, but he hadn’t mentioned who would come!","Could this have been predicted?","Was it a reminder from the Abyssal Lord?","It shouldn’t be the Abyssal Lord, as the two were not on good terms.","Predicting it was even less likely, as Immortal Lord Juyang was not Hu Qing.","While he hesitated, a familiar aura appeared on the body of Lord Zhada.","Buzz!","The twilight aura hovered in the heavens and the earth.","“Xuanwu Shield, Shield Void!” Lord Zhada respectfully held it in his hands and said, “Junior has learned that Senior is searching for the same treasure and is willing to offer the Shield","Void!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was serious when he saw this Beast God Weapon, but he said nothing and casually beckoned it over.","As he caressed this Xuanwu, one of the nine Beast God Weapons, he finally understood.","The primary function of this Beast God Weapon was to isolate everything.","It could achieve an effect akin to absolute isolation from heaven and earth.","No wonder he couldn’t sense it.","The key was that he hadn’t expected the other party to possess this treasure.","This was probably related to Immortal Lord Juyang.","Frosa knew he had a Beast God Weapon, and this matter should have been mentioned to Immortal Lord Juyang, and possibly even brought up with Lord Zhada.","So when he mentioned going to Giant Peak Spacetime, Immortal Lord Juyang informed Lord Zhada, who then proactively delivered the treasure back.","For Jian Wushuang, this was akin to searching high and low for something only to find it","effortlessly.","Suddenly, he had another one.","It was simply an unexpected gain.","“This is the Fire Cloud Cloak: Qilin!” Lord Zhada took out the Fire Cloud Cloak that had been snatched from Ye Tian’s hands and handed it to Jian Wushuang again, “The Origin Source is in Ye Tian’s hands, and Senior must have already obtained it!”","Jian Wushuang saw no need to hide the truth and nodded, “You actually knew that the Qilin’s Origin Source was with Ye Tian?”","“I knew, I discovered it when I fought with Ye Tian back then!”","This time, it was Ye Tian’s turn to be puzzled, “Since you knew, why didn’t you also take the","Origin Source?”","“I’m not a human race powerhouse; if I act too absolutely, it won’t be good!” Lord Zhada shook his head helplessly.","Ye Tian took a deep breath, never having imagined that a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation would be so cautious in dealing with a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation.","In a world where the strong ruled, if they were all humans, even the Abyssal Lord’s son would","be robbed.","But Lord Zhada was humble to this extent.","Jian Wushuang felt a pang of sympathy for the other party. He rummaged through his Origin Source and took out a mustard seed, saying, “Take this, consider the treasure bought by me. Although it might feel like a forced sale, this treasure is of great use to me, so take it as","compensation!”","“No, no, Immortal Lord Juyang has already promised, we can’t take Senior’s treasure anymore!” Lord Zhada hurriedly declined.","In fact, this transaction was entirely voluntary on his part.","Because Immortal Lord Juyang promised him that in the future, all the aliens in Giant Peak Spacetime could be under his command, and one-tenth of the domain would be handed over","to him.","This was an opportunity for their alien race to rise.","It was much more important to him than an Eight Tribulation Realm treasure.","Jian Wushuang noticed the other party’s hesitation and explained, “I am not a practitioner of","the mid-level spacetime. You can keep these treasures; no one will trouble you!”","You?","Lord Zhada, after hearing this, turned to look at the little ones on the planet, his heart warmed. He did not refuse any longer, accepted the mustard seed, and bowed deeply to Jian","Wushuang.","With a lump in his throat, he had thousands of words but couldn’t say anything, so he buried","them deep in his heart.","When he stood up again, Jian Wushuang and his companions had disappeared.","Only he remained, standing in the void, feeling lost.","With a thought, he looked at the treasure within the mustard seed, his expression changed drastically. After looking around, he joyfully flew back to the planet.","...","Outside Giant Peak Spacetime.","“Two Seniors, this is where we part ways!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “What you lack is not time, remember that!”","“Remember that!” Ye Tian nodded excitedly.","Jian Wushuang had kept his promise to give him guidance.","It was time to part ways.","“Go now!”","Jian Wushuang opened a spacetime passage for the other party."]},{"number":6076,"title":"Chapter 6076: You’ve Changed!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6076: You’ve Changed!","“Once you reach the Upper Spacetime, you can go to the Ancient Tomb Sect or Tian Cang Palace. Just mention my name!”","“The kindness of my elder, I will never forget!”","Ye Tian’s eyes were filled with excitement as he took a deep look at Jian Wushuang before turning and entering the spacetime tunnel.","This time, he had obtained two Beast God Weapons, both bought from practitioners.","Although it was essentially coercion, he had given the other party ample compensation.","They shouldn’t hold a grudge against him.","At least, that’s what he believed.","Originally, he planned to send away Lord Zhada along with them, but when the other party mentioned the promise of Immortal Lord Juyang, he saw a glimmer of light in Lord Zhada’s eyes.","That was attachment, and also faith.","Therefore, he didn’t bring it up and just gave the other party enough treasures.","Those treasures could help Lord Zhada achieve his dreams.","“Brother Wushuang, you’ve changed!”","Watching everything, Hu Qing smiled at him.","Jian Wushuang replied with a smile, “Sometimes, when I think about it, it seems like we don’t really have enemies. Perhaps we can all sit down and talk peacefully. Just like Ye Tian and Lord Zhada, the Beast God Weapons might be crucial treasures for them, but they voluntarily handed them over to me. In truth, it was strength that took the lead. But to ensure they had no regrets, I gave them enough compensation. If I could dedicate my life to Mie Sheng, I’m afraid they would be deeply grateful too!”","“Haha!” The last sentence made Hu Qing laugh out loud.","In fact, the reason for being so devoted to Ye Tian and Lord Zhada was for another reason.","One reason was Ye Tian. He was a wandering cultivator.","To help him, it was necessary to provide a better environment.","Back then, Teacher Xuan Yi had also helped him in this way.","As for Lord Zhada, it was different.","From him, he saw the shadow of Realm King.","The two had no connection, but what they did was admirable.","Realm King devoted himself to the Northern Spacetime, even when facing a demigod like Berut, he appeared very humble. He dared not retort even when insulted and had to seek reinforcements. The final decisions were not in his hands, and the Northern Spacetime, although already very low-key, still had countless predators eyeing it.","Lord Zhada, for his kin, dealt with a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation very cautiously.","Different identities, different statuses, yet they had similar experiences.","That was why he wanted to help them.","But he didn’t say it out loud.","“By the way, I just sensed the aura of the pyramid. Brother Wu Zuo and the others should still be in the middle-level or middle stream spacetimes!” Hu Qing suddenly remembered the aura he had sensed earlier and quickly reminded, “If we head there now, we should be able to go back together!”","“Alright!”","Immediately, Hu Qing led the way, and Jian Wushuang hurried at full speed towards the junction of the middle and lower reaches.","The pyramid was there!","However, its aura was already cut off from the Middle Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t sense it.","It was Hu Qing who deduced it.","One had to admit that the path of Zen became more effective in the later stages.","If they were treasure hunting together, they would have to treat Hu Qing like a god of wealth.","He was practically a treasure god.","Jian Wushuang turned to look at Hu Qing, thinking of Qishen Temple.","He very much wanted Hu Qing to deduce the current state of Qishen Temple, but in the end, he did not ask.","Such a simple matter, could Hu Qing have not thought of it?","Either it was impossible to predict, because the presence of Mie Sheng caused the downstream spacetime to become chaotic and unpredictable.","Or he had foreseen something bad.","One of these was bound to be true.","He hoped it was the former.","Mie Sheng came for him.","He probably wouldn’t destroy Qishen Temple.","If Qishen Temple were destroyed, he wouldn’t have to return.","He would directly go to Realm God Continent and continue to hide.","Leaving Qishen Temple was also to keep him there.","To force him to fulfill his promise.","To return to Qishen Temple!","After acquiring the divine domain, he could surpass his limits at any time, and his speed naturally increased several times over.","In just a few days, he reached the confluence of the middle and lower streams.","From the middle stream to the lower stream was very simple for him.","Go with the flow!","Swim against the current!","Strong beings from the middle stream rarely went to the lower stream.","In the lower stream spacetime, there were more than a hundred tributaries, but in these tributaries, there were not even a few Universe Masters.","In the tributary where the primitive universe was located, there were no Universe Masters at","all.","Now, millions of epochs had passed.","There should have been many Universe Masters born.","When they left, Shang was already at the Tribulation level.","As long as he didn’t fall, he should now be at least a Fifth or Sixth Tribulation Universe","Master.","He acknowledged Shang’s potential.","Besides him and Hu Qing, Shang was definitely the most promising Inheritor of Qishen","Temple.","At the very least, a Fifth Tribulation level, and if he was fast, he could reach Sixth Tribulation","levels.","If he had followed them to the upper stream spacetime, his achievements would not have been inferior to theirs.","At the very least, he would have been a Seventh Tribulation level, possibly even an Eighth Tribulation level.","Hu Qing became an Eighth Tribulation level because the Celestial Maiden scattered her Origin Source and gave it to Hu Qing.","But Shang’s foundation was much deeper than theirs, having cultivated for millions of epochs in the upper stream spacetimes, plus the opportunities given by Realm King, reaching Eighth Tribulation levels would not have been difficult.","What a pity.","He stayed behind for their sake.","Back then, he took so many people away, leaving Qishen Temple without any powerful beings","to face the Temple of World Annihilation.","If Shang also left, Qishen Temple would have no leader.","The four Temple Masters were all puppets, without room for growth, not cultivators, and","would eventually decline.","Cultivators grew stronger.","They grew weaker.","Hoo!","Passing through the rapid river, Jian Wushuang finally saw the appearance of the lower stream","spacetime.","A hundred tributaries spread in all directions.","Incredibly magnificent.","Compared to the middle stream, the lower stream had a larger space.","But it was also more desolate.","The tributaries were much smaller.","The living space was also smaller.","But the overall space was the largest.","Ten times larger than the middle stream spacetime.","A hundred times larger than the upper stream spacetime.","Having a large space was actually not good.","It made the coverage of Origin Source power thinner.","The lower stream spacetime started slowly for this reason.","The upper stream spacetime, with smaller space, had much stronger Origin Source power.","There was actually a way to improve, which was to refine the Origin Source of the lower","stream spacetime.","But this was too difficult.","Even a Universe God couldn’t do it.","Let alone refining hundreds of spacetime rivers, even refining one was hard.","With that effort, it was better to light up his own universe.","Jian Wushuang wouldn’t waste time on such foolish things.","Not to mention Realm King willing to part with it, even if it came with treasures, he wouldn’t","want it.","Refining the lower stream spacetime into his own Origin Source Dao Arena would enhance his","overall strength.","This had precedents.","The northern spacetime didn’t have it, but other spacetimes did!","It was a special existence, a super-strong Universe God.","Then he refined the Origin Source of his own spacetime, reaching an unfathomable level of","power, an absolute strongman in the starry sky.","He heard about this from Weiss."]},{"number":6077,"title":"Chapter 6077: Gate of Death!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6077: Gate of Death!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was too far from him.","“Brother Wushuang?”","Swish!","The pyramid sensed his and Huiqing’s aura and flew over on its own.","Wu Zuo was the first to step out. Seeing that he and Huiqing were unharmed, he breathed a sigh of relief.","“Why did you stop here?”","“Sigh, don’t mention it. Go take a look up ahead!” Wu Zuo sighed and pointed forward. “You’ll understand once you see it.”","Jian Wushuang’s figure flickered and he arrived at the spot Wu Zuo indicated in an instant.","It was the barrier of the downstream spacetime. Passing through it would lead to the downstream.","He was just one step away from his home world.","But when he saw the barrier, he was stunned.","The barrier, originally condensed from spacetime, had turned black.","The Gate of Death?","Jian Wushuang immediately thought of a mystical phenomenon he had heard about.","A barrier representing death.","Passing through it would lead to demise.","Wu Zuo must have known this, or he would have already fallen for it.","“A child’s game. Mie Sheng actually tried to use this to trap me. It seems he isn’t well-prepared!” He was only slightly surprised and didn’t care much.","The Gate of Death sounded terrifying.","But it was actually nothing much.","If one passed through recklessly, their life force would be devoured.","The weak would fall directly.","Those below the Seven Tribulations Realm would experience life withering, but it wouldn’t affect divine power.","If Wu Zuo and the others had passed through recklessly, the pyramid would have shielded them, and they wouldn’t be harmed.","Even without the pyramid, passing through would at most result in the loss of some life force and being tainted by the power of death.","This would be more troublesome, requiring careful removal.","A single misstep could harm one’s Origin Source.","Wu Zuo couldn’t be certain about this, so he had stopped, mainly wanting to wait for Jian Wushuang to arrive.","This way, he could feel more at ease.","“Is he underestimating us, or is he trying to cover something up?”","Jian Wushuang frowned, unable to see through Mie Sheng for a moment.","It seemed he had never seen through him.","The Gate of Death might work against Universe Masters below the Seven Tribulations Realm, but it was far from enough to trap him!","“What do you mean?” Wu Zuo, who had followed, was somewhat puzzled and looked at him in surprise.","Swish!","Jian Wushuang casually parted the barrier and said indifferently, “Nothing, just go ahead!”","“We’ve been waiting for you to say that!”","Wu Zuo didn’t hesitate and stepped in directly.","At this moment, everyone inside the pyramid came out.","They couldn’t sit still as they were about to enter the downstream spacetime.","Swish!!!!","Everyone entered one by one, just like when they entered the upstream spacetime.","Only this time, they stood together.","Whoosh!","The first breath of air from the downstream spacetime made everyone savor it.","“I’m back!” Wu Zuo couldn’t help but shout excitedly, startling everyone.","Wutian said grumpily, “You’re back, so what? Why shout so loudly?”","“What?” Wu Zuo turned and glared at Wutian. “We’ve traveled such a long way, can’t I shout now that we’re back?”","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing ignored the two others, instead using their mind power to investigate the entire downstream area.","With the naked eye, nothing could be seen.","Only with mind power could the current situation be clearly observed.","The entire downstream spacetime was shrouded in a black fog.","The scent of death.","The black fog moved with the wind.","“The wind carries a chill!” Jian Wushuang reached out to grasp it, but it had already dissipated. He turned to look at the pyramid. “Babata, how long will it take to reach Qishen Temple, and is the journey smooth?”","He had just detected Qishen Temple with his Thought power, and it was still in its original position without any changes.","However, there was no Inheritor of Qishen Temple outside the Original Universe.","It seemed they had already retreated to a single location.","Inside the pyramid, Babata flew out, hovering in mid-air, respectfully saying, “Master, the distance to Qishen Temple will take the pyramid one era! There are no obstacles along the way, only cultivators below the Seven Tribulations Realm, so there is no danger.”","“Too slow!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","There was no way; the downstream was too vast.","Even at the pyramid’s speed, it would take an era.","However, one advantage over the mid and upper reaches was that one could traverse freely.","The downstream spacetime was large, but the Origin Source was weak.","Space and time were also relatively weak.","They could be freely altered.","Of course, it depended on who was altering them.","Hiss!","Everyone was incredibly astonished as they looked at Jian Wushuang.","The others still didn’t know about the matters of the Divine Domain. Seeing him unleash divine power exceeding 20 million, achieving the ability to alter spacetime, they couldn’t help but gasp.","They thought Jian Wushuang had been hiding too deeply, never revealing his power before.","“Just now, that was divine power exceeding 20 million!” Wu Zuo’s voice trembled, overwhelmed by Jian Wushuang’s strength.","The others felt the same.","Guangying and Gu Qianluo’s faces turned pale.","They originally thought the gap had narrowed, at least reaching the same realm, as Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters.","But now, the gap seemed even larger.","Their divine power hadn’t even surpassed 10 million.","Jian Wushuang had directly exceeded 20 million.","Wu Tian couldn’t help but swallow hard, his breath taken away by Jian Wushuang’s strength.","“What are you all standing around for? Come in!”","Hearing his call, everyone snapped back to reality and quickly followed him inside.","Originally, Jian Wushuang intended to be low-key and fly slowly.","But now that he was in the downstream spacetime, he couldn’t wait to see the current situation of Qishen Temple, so he didn’t hide anything and directly altered spacetime, arriving outside Qishen Temple in one step.","At the same time, he also revealed the Divine Domain.","Wow!","When everyone reappeared, they were already at the familiar Qishen Temple.","The intersection of the Great Si Region and the Tongtian Buddha Realm, “Great Wilderness.”","Qishen Temple was located here.","Remembering the past!","Once upon a time, the winds and clouds surged.","He and Hu Qing were pursued by millions of troops.","In the midst of the army, Jian Wushuang fought from the north to the south, escaping the encirclement with Hu Qing.","Because of a piece of Bodhi Heartwood, he stepped into the ranks of heart power cultivators and awakened the journey of the Starry Sky, mastering the Extreme Dao.","Later, he broke through to the level of Grand Yan Immortal, and Hu Qing also advanced to the NIne Revolutions.","They each had their own paths.","Now, they were starting anew.","Looking back, it was yesterday.","This departure had cost them much.","The original universe had changed a lot too.","Especially around Qishen Temple.","Due to its proximity to Qishen Temple.","And the threat of the Demon Lord.","The Great Domain was gone.","The Tongtian Buddha Realm was also gone.","All around was empty.","Deep in the Great Si Region, the place that held all Jian Wushuang’s memories had also disappeared.","It was everything he once had.","Now, there was nothing left.","Further away, there were only war fortresses, countless armies of cultivators, eyeing Qishen Temple covetously.","These cultivators were all native to the downstream.","After entering the downstream spacetime, he discovered that hundreds of spacetime paths had been occupied by the Temple of World Annihilation."]},{"number":6078,"title":"Chapter 6078: Sorry for the Long Wait, Everyone!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6078: Sorry for the Long Wait, Everyone!","Naturally, they turned all the practitioners in the downstream spacetime into their own minions.","It was quite laughable.","These practitioners, under the banner of exterminating foreign practitioners, besieged Qishen Temple.","Little did they know, it was the Temple of World Annihilation that would truly destroy the world.","From a great distance, he could feel the power of death emanating from the Temple of World Annihilation, interfering with the Origin Source of the entire downstream spacetime, continuously eroding the entire downstream Origin Source.","This was a cancer!","Just as everyone was reminiscing, an angry shout came from afar.","“The strong ones of Qishen Temple have come out, follow me to kill the traitors!” Buzz!","In an instant, a squad of practitioners charged in this direction.","A ten-person team, one at the second Tribulation level, and nine at the peak.","These people were all practitioners from the downstream spacetimes, even from the Original Universe.","Now they were going to attack Jian Wushuang and his companions.","A nameless fury surged up, Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened with anger, and with a single glance, time and space stood still.","The entire void began to perish.","Those practitioners charging forward did not notice that their bodies were disappearing.","It was not until they completely lost consciousness that they realized they had fallen. Boom!","The frozen space shattered instantly.","At the edge of the void, a gigantic face appeared.","He glanced at everyone and finally looked at Jian Wushuang.","“You finally returned!”","“I’ve been waiting!”","Facing each other from a distance.","The clash of auras.","Repeated probing pushed both sides’ battle intent to the peak.","The person most interested in Jian Wushuang was none other than Mie Sheng.","“Don’t rush, take your time!” Mie Sheng’s voice echoed through the entire spacetime, “The day you return is the day my Temple of World Annihilation launches a full attack on Qishen Temple. If you still act like a coward as before, then stay hidden in Qishen Temple forever and never come out!”","This time, Jian Wushuang did not avoid it.","He stared straight at Mie Sheng and shouted loudly, “I will be waiting for you!”","At this moment, the grand curtain rose.","Zhen Ling in Qishen Temple couldn’t believe that Jian Wushuang and the others had returned.","Familiar figures brought tears to his eyes.","How many years had it been?","Epoch after epoch passed, and he was about to give up.","Fan Tianfeng, who returned first, had fallen for many years, and he thought the others would soon follow.","But he feared they would follow in Fan Tianfeng’s footsteps.","His heart was always conflicted.","Now, seeing Jian Wushuang confronting Mie Sheng head-on, he felt reassured.","He had waited too long for this moment.","Jian Wushuang was curious why Mie Sheng was afraid of him hiding.","Back then, hiding in Qishen Temple was due to his lack of strength.","At that time, Mie Sheng had just awakened and wasn’t that powerful either.","So many years had passed.","Why was Mie Sheng still afraid of him hiding?","Was Qishen Temple really that strong?","Could it block Mie Sheng?","He was somewhat uncertain and needed to ask the true spirits.","Mie Sheng retreated.","Zhen Ling appeared.","Thinking of the farewell scene back then, how similar it was to now.","A thousand bones pave the way for one general’s success!","The true spirit did not believe it.","Jian Wushuang did not believe it either.","This time, they had returned almost intact.","If it weren’t for Fan Tianfeng’s private return and Zhen Wuyang’s many changes in the Wanliu","Divine Tree, making him reluctant to return.","He could have brought everyone back.","But now it was enough.","They returned after learning, vowing to become dragon-slaying youths!","“Have you returned?”","Upon their meeting, Zhen Ling was not as emotional as one might have expected, only feeling","a bittersweetness.","Seeing Jian Wushuang and the others return alive, he was very happy.","This was the greatest support in his heart over the years.","As long as Jian Wushuang and the others did not return, he had hope.","“We have returned!” everyone said in unison.","Zhen Ling wanted to smile, but his face was covered in tears. In a hoarse voice, he said, “It’s","good to have you back, it’s good to have you back!”","“Let’s go home!”","The word “home” made everyone sigh with emotion.","In the upstream spacetimes, they had never felt a sense of belonging.","At this moment, this place was home.","Jian Wushuang’s former home could not be defended; now only Qishen Temple remained!","The gates of Qishen Temple opened wide.","Everyone followed Zhen Ling back to the most familiar place.","The four great secret realms had changed a lot.","There were more people, and more strong individuals.","Originally, Qishen Temple and the Temple of World Annihilation had been evenly matched.","Later, the front lines kept shrinking until they eventually merged into one.","Everyone entered Qishen Temple.","Even so, not everyone was brought in.","After entering this special treasure of Qishen Temple, Universe Masters could no longer","improve.","Fortunately, the Universe Masters of the past had moved the entire universe into Qishen","Temple.","Otherwise, outside, they would have been destroyed by the experts of the Temple of World","Annihilation.","Grave God Mountain!","Zhen Ling led them first to Grave God Mountain, the place where they had left.","In front of the Grave God Monument, just like before, everyone offered incense and","worshiped.","“I knew you would come back, and finally, today has come!” After regaining his composure,","Zhen Ling restrained his excitement and said, “Do you know how many years I have waited for","this day?”","He turned to look at everyone, speaking word by word, “I have waited for five million epochs, just for today, to sound the horn of counterattack!”","With a wave of his hand, Zhen Ling made a huge map appear in front of everyone.","“Look here!” He pointed to a red mark and said, “This is the location of the Temple of World","Annihilation!”","Around the red mark, there were many dark red marks, clearly large war fortresses waiting for","them to clear.","“When Fan Tianfeng returned, I was very happy, pointing it out to her, but unfortunately, she never came back!” Zhen Ling sighed, “She never returned and died in battle!”","“I don’t want you to follow in her footsteps either!” Zhen Ling shook his head, “This time, we must be fully prepared. It’s also time to reveal all the secrets of Qishen Temple to you because this is the last chance!”","Jian Wushuang and the others were Qishen Temple’s greatest support.","It was time for Zhen Ling to let go.","He turned to look at everyone, recounting the past and present of Qishen Temple.","Qishen!","From the moment of his fall, he began to refine the Origin Source of Qishen Temple.","Why did he refine it?","Everyone knew it was to make Qishen’s legacy great again. But in fact, there was another","reason: to guard against one person!","Mie Sheng!","Qishen cooperated with Mie Sheng; this was true.","Over the years, Zhen Ling had also gleaned useful information.","But why guard against him?","If they were partners, why still guard against Mie Sheng, even creating a Zhen Ling clone","avatar?","An avatar with a different personality and future layout from Qishen’s.","Wasn’t this creating trouble for oneself?","Zhen Ling had even doubted himself.","He almost defected to Mie Sheng.","But he got his answer from the Heart Demon.","The Heart Demon captured by Jian Wushuang had changed everything.","Qishen!","One body, not one person.","Mind and spirit were not unified. This was the reason for Qishen’s Tribulation failure.","Everyone knew people had two sides. But no one could separate the two sides.","But Qishen did it.","He cut out his greedy side, which was the Path of Devouring. He left his benevolent side to","Qishen Temple."]},{"number":6079,"title":"Chapter 6079: Always Winning","paragraphs":["Chapter 6079: Always Winning","He regarded Qishen Temple as his fallback.","That was why he guarded against Mie Sheng.","To the extent that even though Mie Sheng had reached this point, he still could not enter Qishen Temple.","On the other hand, collaborating with Mie Sheng was for his own path of devouring.","Even though they were separated, he never gave up.","The three Great Demons.","Shan Jun, Gu Jun, and Mo Jun.","They could still merge again.","This was his collaboration with Mie Sheng.","Mie Sheng left with Shan Jun and the others back then because of this reason.","Betting on both sides.","Cunning!","Too cunning.","For Qishen, it didn’t matter who won.","After all, in the end, he was the biggest winner.","If Mie Sheng succeeded and mastered reincarnation, Qishen could fully resurrect.","If Zhen Ling won, then he would continue his fallback, and Qishen Temple would definitely be great again.","The most crucial point was that he knew Mie Sheng was the God of Death.","Then the one who defeated Mie Sheng would be the God of Life.","Death devours life, forging reincarnation.","The end of life leads to death, which can also forge reincarnation.","Always winning!","Simply winning big!","Everyone listening nodded in agreement.","“Truly, my eyes are opened again!” Wu Zuo couldn’t help but exclaim, “I didn’t expect Master to calculate so perfectly, truly admirable!”","Zhen Ling smugly smiled, “You need to see who it is. Otherwise, how could I be so smart? I inherited Qishen’s wisdom, unlike the three Great Demons, each foolish, now all...”","He was speaking with enthusiasm but thought of Jian Wushuang’s relationship with Shan Jun, so he didn’t say more.","“What about the strength of the Temple of World Annihilation?”","Jian Wushuang didn’t care about this and instead asked about the Temple of World Annihilation.","As for Qishen, he had already guessed most of it, so listening now was the same as not listening.","The only thing that surprised him was that Qishen could single-handedly guard against Mie Sheng.","Was this still a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm?","Able to block a true God of Starry Sky.","Simply unbelievable.","There must be an unspeakable secret, but unfortunately, Zhen Ling didn’t know.","He was really curious about how to restrain a Starry Sky God.","Hearing his question, Zhen Ling beckoned everyone to change locations to talk.","It was no different from before, still at the top of the Grave God Mountain.","In the Cloud Viewing Pavilion.","Everyone took their seats.","Swoosh!!","As soon as they sat down, a familiar figure descended, accompanied by an unfamiliar woman.","“Shang!”","Jian Wushuang stood up, smiling.","Dongsheng and Wanyan also stood up; they were all old acquaintances.","“Long time no see!” Hu Qing also stood up to welcome them.","Wu Zuo, however, was a bit arrogant, looking at Shang, then at the unfamiliar woman beside Shang, surprised, “This fellow Daoist is so powerful, I haven’t seen her before, could she be a second-generation Inheritor?”","“Ahem!” Zhen Ling cleared his throat. If it weren’t for the fact that Wu Zuo had just returned, he would have slapped the back of his head. Holding back his thoughts, he said calmly, “Shang, why don’t you introduce her first!”","After millions of epochs, Shang had become more and more reserved.","He had always been like this, and now after so many years, he hadn’t changed at all, still so calm and steady. No wonder he was the top figure in Qishen Temple over these years.","He was also a leader among practitioners, a pride among Inheritors.","Seeing Jian Wushuang and the others return, his usual demeanor changed, his eyes showed excitement, but he suppressed it and said solemnly, “She is Luo, my Daoist Companion, and the Hall Master of the Vermilion Bird Hall!”","“Luo!”","“Hall Master of the Vermilion Bird Hall!”","“Daoist Companion!!!!”","Jian Wushuang could see through her strength at a glance, a peak Seventh Tribulation realm","powerhouse.","Very young.","Through a trace of causality, he saw her entire life.","Actually, her cultivation time was not shorter than theirs.","She came from another spacetime. When Qishen Temple expanded, occupying several","tributaries.","Shang met “Luo” during that time!","At that time, Luo was already a Universe Master. She first competed with Shang, and later,","they developed feelings through their paths and got together.","“Greetings to all!” Luo gently bowed, revealing a smile.","Her appearance was stunning.","Upon seeing this scene, Wanyan thought of his own companion, feeling a chill in his heart!","“I am Jian Wushuang, greetings, sister-in-law!”","“I am from the Original Universe, Dongsheng!”","“I am from the Original Universe, Wanyan!”","“I am from the Tongtian Buddha Realm, Hu Qing!”","Only they were so courteous.","The rest just announced their names.","After getting to know each other, Zhen Ling gave a signal to the envoy, indicating that they","could begin.","“About the Qishen Temple...” the envoy began narrating about Qishen Temple.","From the time they had just left until the present, everything was recounted.","When Jian Wushuang and the others had just left, the number of strong members in Qishen","Temple was similar to that of the Mie Sheng Temple.","But at that time, Qishen Temple had already developed for an era.","Mie Sheng Temple had just started, yet it could match Qishen Temple.","Later, the gap widened.","While Qishen Temple was still fighting for those resource points, the strong members of Mie","Sheng Temple were in seclusion, cultivating.","The number of strong members almost doubled every era.","The biggest gap appeared when the Mo Jun emerged.","A six-Tribulation level strong member.","He almost destroyed all the sect forces outside Qishen Temple.","Fortunately, the envoy’s breakthrough was fast.","From First Tribulation to Sixth Tribulation, it only took several eras.","This surpassed everyone.","It also made everyone look up to the envoy once more, no longer so arrogant.","They all had the opportunities granted by the Realm King.","The envoy, however, fought for it with his life.","“Mo Jun!” the envoy sighed deeply, “When the Mo Jun descended, we...”","The following words were heavy.","Even Wutian showed respect.","That battle back then.","Many people fell.","Many of them were their friends.","Such as Ji Chaoyang!","Ji Chaoyang had just become a Universe Master and sacrificed himself to cover the emperor’s","retreat.","He was torn apart by the Mo Jun, leaving not even a corpse.","Hu Qing, upon hearing this, clasped his hands together and silently recited Buddhist","scriptures for Ji Chaoyang.","He also recalled the days and nights spent with him.","The Mo Jun broke free from the suppression of the Original Universe, making the strength of","Mie Sheng Temple completely surpass Qishen Temple.","Later, it was barely blocked by the envoy.","The front lines were forced to shrink continuously.","Until it shrunk within Qishen Temple.","“What is the Mo Jun’s strength now?” He saw that both the envoy and Luo were Universe","Masters at the Seventh Tribulation level, and Zhen Ling also considered the two as successors,","their strength not weak.","Even this couldn’t stop the Mo Jun?","It didn’t make sense!","Could it be that the Mo Jun had merged with Shan Jun?","Shang saw Jian Wushuang’s puzzlement and explained, “The most terrifying enemies of Mie","Sheng Temple are not the Mo Jun, but Broly and Jiang Shang!”","These two were like the Shang and Luo of Qishen Temple.","But their strength was even greater.","They had already reached the level of Half-Step Eighth Tribulation. Moreover, Mie Sheng Temple had ten Demon Generals.","Each with top-level Seventh Tribulation combat power.","In contrast, Qishen Temple had only two Universe Masters at the Seventh Tribulation level.","Not even a few Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation level."]},{"number":6080,"title":"Chapter 6080: Each of Them Has Their Own Unique Skills","paragraphs":["Chapter 6080: Each of Them Has Their Own Unique Skills","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The disparity was simply too great.","However!","To Jian Wushuang and his companions, those so-called experts of the Temple of World Annihilation were not worth mentioning.","A mere Seventh Tribulation, not even an Eighth Tribulation among them.","There was no need for Jian Wushuang to make a move; any one of them could easily crush the entire Qishen Temple.","Jian Wushuang was truly worried about Mie Sheng.","He had no interest in these minions.","“No Eighth Tribulation?” Wu Zuo frowned and sighed, “I thought the Temple of World Annihilation had some remarkable existence, but it turns out there isn’t even an Eighth Tribulation. How boring!”","Seeing Wu Zuo’s annoying expression, Jian Wushuang and the others said nothing.","It indeed was not what they had expected.","Mie Sheng was a true God of Starry Sky, yet he hadn’t cultivated even to the Eighth Tribulation level.","It didn’t make sense.","Given a few million epochs, even a Realm King could cultivate a group of Eighth Tribulation.","Mie Sheng wasn’t lacking in treasures or heritage!","How could there not be an Eighth Tribulation?","Zhen Ling felt a bit embarrassed, as if they were being criticized for being rubbish, not even able to handle a Seventh Tribulation, let alone an Eighth Tribulation.","Especially seeing the disappointed expressions on Wu Zuo and the others, he felt even more uncomfortable.","“I understand now, each of you possesses extraordinary skills, and you don’t regard opponents below the Eighth Tribulation as a challenge, right?” Zhen Ling glanced at everyone, eagerly saying, “Tell me, how strong are you all now?”","In fact, there was no need to ask; he could see the extraordinariness of everyone.","Especially Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, who were completely unreadable, at least Half-Step Eighth Tribulation, perhaps even comparable to super experts of the Eighth Tribulation.","Wu Zuo and the others were the same, each exuding the aura of a Seventh Tribulation, with divine power fluctuations above 2 million.","Shang and Luo were also curious about everyone.","Both of them were Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation and could see the distinctiveness of everyone.","“Ahem!” Wu Zuo cleared his throat and said nonchalantly, “Not much, just gained some heritage and became a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation. It’s quite embarrassing; Shang didn’t even go to the upper stream spacetimes but still became a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, making us seem like freeloaders.”","“Wu Zuo, you’re too modest. Although we are all Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation, I can see the difference in divine power!” Shang was very humble, but seeing the calm expressions of everyone, he felt assured. This time, they were really going to succeed.","The rescue troops they had awaited for countless years had finally arrived.","Eradicating the Temple of World Annihilation was urgent!","Luo was also very curious. She could see that everyone was a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, but their divine bodies were inscrutable, each seeming like an insurmountable mountain.","Although they were at the same level, it felt vastly different.","Especially Wu Zuo and Wutian, just seeing them was like looking at an abyss.","As for Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, they had reached the pinnacle of restraint, exuding an extraordinary aura without any trace of divine power.","Zhen Ling was the same. Although he was the master of the Qishen Temple, he could at most see that Wu Zuo and Wutian had extraordinary divine power, far stronger than any Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation he had seen. But he couldn’t discern anything from Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","Either they were far beyond him, or they had cultivated some secret method to conceal their aura.","“Alright, let’s not talk about this for now. Your return is a great blessing for our Qishen Temple. Today, we won’t discuss Mie Sheng. I have already asked Long Yi to prepare a banquet; we must celebrate!” Zhen Ling felt an unprecedented sense of relief, and his complexion improved significantly.","It had been many years since he had felt this way.","Although the threat of Mie Sheng remained, it wouldn’t make a difference in a day or two. Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement, saying, “I wonder how many familiar faces from the past are still around!”","“Not many of your batch of Inheritors are left!”","Zhen Ling’s eyes gleamed.","The banquet was held in the Heavenly Realm, not at the Tomb God Mountain.","That place was not suitable for a welcoming party.","Upon returning to the Heavenly Realm.","Looking around, everything had changed drastically.","The Yuanyang Palace still stood.","But the people were gone.","The current Yuanyang Palace had surpassed the Four Halls, becoming the foremost force in the Qishen Temple.","Even the Inheritors of Grave God Mountain couldn’t compare.","Because the threshold for Inheritors had been raised significantly, producing many experts, but their numbers were few.","Yuanyang Palace, however, followed the principle of teaching without discrimination, recruiting disciples widely in the Lower Spacetime and producing many Tribulation Realm experts.","The current Palace Master was Luo!","Luo had also joined Yuanyang Palace back then.","Shang was the leader of Grave God Mountain and also the leader of the entire Qishen Temple.","As for the Four Halls, their structure had long been disrupted. The former puppet hall masters had all retired to the background, handling some trivial matters.","The current four Hall Masters were all Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation level.","Even the hall masters of Yuanyang Palace were at the Sixth Tribulation level.","The group ascended to Yuanyang Island and entered the main hall.","On both sides, various figures could be seen. Some were familiar, but most were strangers.","After all, only a single epoch had passed initially.","But then came the sedimentation of millions of epochs.","Among the familiar figures, most were ordinary Tribulation realm practitioners, and some were Emperors.","After the cleansing of millions of epochs, Universe Masters had emerged, along with those who had fallen from grace.","When they saw Jian Wushuang and others return like heroes, their eyes gleamed with light.","A beam of light shone on the face of the first generation Inheritor.","It proved they had experienced those years.","They were Inheritors who had fought their way up from the Primordial Star.","Having gone through various adventures, the four great secret realms, and the threat of the Temple of World Annihilation.","These experiences had honed the light on their bodies.","Yet this light now appeared on Jian Wushuang and the others.","“If only Wan Xing were still alive, how great it would be!” A despondent woman, upon seeing the brilliance of Jian Wushuang and the others, thought of Wan Xing, who had once stood alongside them.","Unfortunately, he had already fallen.","Besides these disheartened old Inheritors, there were also some young Inheritors with confusion or resentment, even second-generation Inheritors.","They did not hold Jian Wushuang and the others in high regard.","“Are these the people that Lord Zhen Ling and others talk about?” A strong person among the four halls couldn’t help but mutter softly, “Why do I feel their divine power is quite average!”","“No, they are suppressing their divine power. The weakest among them is at the Seventh Tribulation level, comparable to the Palace Master. No wonder Lord Zhen Ling has waited so long and kept talking about them. They are indeed extraordinary!” Some young Inheritors noticed the exceptional nature of Jian Wushuang and the others, the invisible pressure they exuded was far beyond ordinary strong ones.","At the upper part of the hall, the six Palace Masters of Yuanyang Palace and the four Hall Masters sat on either side.","Each one was a super strong Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation level.","They were comparable to the ten Demon Generals of the Temple of World Annihilation."]},{"number":6081,"title":"Chapter 6081: Shang and Luo","paragraphs":["Chapter 6081: Shang and Luo","Above, on the two main seats, sat Shang and Luo.","This surprised Jian Wushuang.","Judging by the setup, Shang and Luo had completely sidelined Zhen Ling, who didn’t even have a seat.","Shang, as the successor and heir of Qishen Temple, naturally had no objections to sitting in the main seat.","But it was unexpected that Luo also held such significant power.","“Everyone, take your seats!” Upon reaching the main hall, Shang demonstrated his status by immediately gesturing for everyone to be seated.","Zhen Ling, however, stood at the top of the hall, not taking a seat, but simply smiling and watching everyone.","With just a glance, Jian Wushuang understood the current structure of Qishen Temple.","The inheritors had reorganized and formed new factions.","The four great halls remained as before, but were now controlled by the Inheritors.","Then there was Yuanyang Palace, which, following Zhen Ling’s plan, had been developed into a power that not only wasn’t weaker but even surpassed the four halls.","Lastly, there was the Grave God Mountain.","Led personally by Shang, Tomb God Mountain also had several super-strong figures, making it Shang’s personal faction.","They stood behind Shang, seven Universe Masters, each at the peak of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Not weaker than those hall masters and sect leaders.","Jian Wushuang scanned around, nodding slightly to acknowledge some familiar faces. “Brother Wushuang, has Zhen Ling really been sidelined? How come he doesn’t even have a place at the table?” Wu Zuo quietly transmitted his thoughts.","It was anticipated that Zhen Ling would hand Qishen Temple over to Shang.","For years, Shang had been at the forefront, so no one had any objections.","Moreover, after experiencing the outside world, they held only gratitude towards Qishen Temple, without the previous competitive stance.","“You’re underestimating Zhen Ling too much!” Jian Wushuang sighed, shaking his head.","At first, he also noticed some peculiarities, but now he understood.","Zhen Ling’s emotions were written all over his face.","Seeing his current leisurely demeanor, it was clear that while Shang appeared to be leading Qishen Temple, Zhen Ling was still pulling the strings behind the scenes.","Despite losing those puppets, Shang’s will was more obedient than those puppets ever were.","It’s a matter of character, hard to change.","Moreover, Zhen Ling was still Shang’s mentor. How could he be sidelined? Especially now, with Qishen Temple facing external threats, there was no room for internal strife.","Just as Jian Wushuang thought.","After Shang sat down, he briefly introduced Jian Wushuang and others, then actively introduced some current strong figures of Qishen Temple to them.","After a brief introduction, he finally looked at Zhen Ling, clearly waiting for him to speak.","“Ahem!” Zhen Ling knew it was his turn to speak. With many thoughts in mind, he chose to go last. After Jian Wushuang and others became acquainted with the strong figures of Qishen Temple, he began his performance.","He had waited countless years for this day.","But he also had concerns.","He feared Jian Wushuang and the others had changed their minds.","“Everyone, taking this opportunity, I have an important announcement regarding the inheritance of Qishen Temple!”","At these words, everyone looked towards Zhen Ling.","Jian Wushuang also put down his wine cup, looking at Zhen Ling, curious to see what tricks the old man had up his sleeve.","Jian Wushuang knew of Zhen Ling’s suspicious nature.","Once, because of a single word from Teacher Xuan Yi, Zhen Ling nearly played him to death.","He was always suspicious of who would destroy this long river of spacetime.","In the end, he found out it was himself!","Afterwards, he was too embarrassed to bring it up again.","Now, pulling such a stunt, he probably feared they wouldn’t give their best effort.","Perspective!","It could be said Zhen Ling’s perspective was small, or Jian Wushuang and the others’ perspective was big.","They had traveled so far without any thought of evading anything.","Even when Zhen Wuyang chose to stay in the Wanliu Divine Tree, it wasn’t out of fear!","Instead, he had his own circle and could not jump out of it.","No one knew what Zhen Wuyang had gone through at that time.","In a strange world, he couldn’t find a sense of belonging, and his Dao heart wavered.","He treated the past as a dream!","So he did not make things difficult for Zhen Wuyang; he just advised him a few times.","Eventually, he gave up.","Respecting others’ choices.","However, the people who chose to come back were not afraid of danger.","At least, the threats mentioned by Zhen Ling were not worth fearing.","“Lord Zhen Ling, whatever you want to say, just say it. We are all Inheritors of Qishen Temple!” Seeing Zhen Ling looking at him, Jian Wushuang was the first to speak.","His resolve had always been firm.","Wu Zuo and the others also nodded, looking at Zhen Ling.","Seeing that no one had any objections, he completely ignored the strange looks from the second-generation inheritors and, after pausing for a moment, said, “I have decided to establish the position of the Divine Lord today!”","Divine Lord!","The system originally established by Qishen.","Although Qishen Temple had cultivated strong individuals comparable to those from the Moro Spacetime over the years, they had not established a new Divine Lord position.","Now, they suddenly wanted to establish the position of Divine Lord.","This aroused the curiosity of many strong individuals in the temple.","Jian Wushuang and the others did not know the reason behind it; they were just curious and did not feel anything was wrong. Moreover, they did not crave the position of Divine Lord.","But others thought differently.","Because the Origin Source Sea of Qishen Temple always reserved the position of Divine Lord, once someone became the Divine Lord, they could place their Origin Source Universe into the","Origin Source Sea of Qishen Temple.","This was what they aimed to obtain.","With the nurturing of the Universe Sea, the Origin Source would continually improve, making","it a perfect auxiliary treasure.","But this position was limited!","In the past, it was not proposed because once Mie Sheng attacked, Qishen Temple could escape with the Origin Source Sea.","But with Jian Wushuang and the others returning, they had the confidence for a final battle and did not need to escape, so they decided to establish the position of Divine Lord.","“Divine Lord!”","Jian Wushuang did not know, but Wu Zuo did!","Even in the upper spacetime, where he had seen so much, he was tempted by the position of","Divine Lord.","Luo, sitting next to Shang, was also extremely shocked upon hearing this. She was already the","co-lord of Yuanyang Palace, and her Origin Source resided in the Origin Source Sea. She had not considered the position of Divine Lord much, but now that Zhen Ling announced this, it was clearly due to the return of Jian Wushuang and the others.","As a second-generation inheritor, she actually only had awe for Jian Wushuang and the others, not respect.","Because all these years, it was they who had been guarding Qishen Temple.","Why should the position of Divine Lord be given to Jian Wushuang and the others?","This was also very normal.","No one would be so selfless.","How many people had died over these years...","Only they knew.","Now, who should be given the position of Divine Lord?","Zhen Ling, thinking from the overall perspective, was not wrong.","He just wanted to protect Qishen Temple.","He remembered those who had fallen!","“Establishing the Divine Lord will witness the return of Qishen Temple’s greatness and glory.","This is the rule set back then, and today it shall begin!” As Zhen Ling spoke, he pointed his","finger, and the great hall instantly transformed.","Everyone in the hall was transported to the God’s Tomb.","Qishen’s Dao Arena.","Everyone was familiar with this place.","Because those qualified to enter the great hall were either Universe Masters or extremely","powerful emperors, they had all been here before."]},{"number":6082,"title":"Chapter 6082: I Won’t Die in Vain!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6082: I Won’t Die in Vain!","They had been here at least twice.","Once when they received their inheritance.","Once when a superpower from the Qishen Temple fell.","Upon arriving at this place, everyone felt a deep sense of reverence.","Even Jian Wushuang was the same.","Because behind the Qishen’s Dao Arena, there was a mountain.","Or rather, it was a tombstone.","On top of it were numerous portraits.","Among them were familiar faces.","There were Wan Xing, Ji Chaoyang, and other contemporaries who inherited power. There were also those resurrected emperors.","One of them, Yang Sanmu, who had helped Jian Wushuang, was among the first to fall.","There were Qiu Huang and those fifth-tier Emperors from the original universe.","Such as Zhu Tian!","There were too many.","Each portrait captured their moments of glory on the battlefield.","Zhen Ling brought them to this place, and many had tears in their eyes.","“Take a look!” Zhen Ling pointed at the countless portraits, trembling as he spoke, “They did not die in vain, they did not die in vain!”","At that moment, Jian Wushuang understood Zhen Ling’s meaning and murmured, “They won’t.”","“They won’t die in vain...”","Zhen Ling took a deep breath, turned to the crowd, and said, “Today, the inheritance returns. I did not want to mention war again, but seeing you all, I must say that the Qishen Temple is in grave danger. The position of the Divine Lord must be established because they are the only hope for Qishen Temple. If we fail, the first to fall will be the Divine Lord, then you, and I will take you into eternal slumber. Even if we fail, we will not let Mie Sheng step into Qishen Temple!”","“Lord Zhen Ling, you overthink...” Wu Zuo wanted to reveal Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing’s true strength but was abruptly interrupted by Zhen Ling.","He turned and glared at Wu Zuo, shouting, “Shut up!”","This angry shout reminded Wu Zuo of those miserable years, and he didn’t dare to say more. “The position of Divine Lord, I will personally establish today. If any of you have complaints, come to me!” Zhen Ling’s words were firm.","At this moment, a decision needed to be made without considering too much.","But Jian Wushuang was not one to take advantage of such a situation.","“Lord Zhen Ling, I cannot accept this honor without merit. I don’t need the position of Divine Lord to prove anything. Let me first defeat Mie Sheng’s Origin Source, then it will not be too late to establish it.”","“Agreed, I share the same sentiment as Brother Wushuang!” Hu Qing’s clear gaze showed his support as he stood beside Jian Wushuang.","Wu Zuo also came to his senses and said, “I agree as well!”","The rest followed suit.","This scene earned respect from many second-generation inheritors.","Zhen Ling’s eyes glowed with excitement as he said, “You have indeed grown, but the position of Divine Lord...”","“If Lord Zhen Ling insists, why not give it a name first and discuss the establishment later?” Jian Wushuang didn’t expect Zhen Ling to be so resolute and offered a compromise.","After all, he didn’t care much for Qishen Temple’s cosmic sea. He hadn’t coveted the vast cosmic sea of Wanliu Shenmu, how could he be interested in Qishen Temple’s small cosmic sea?","Even if he swallowed the entire cosmic sea of Qishen Temple, it wouldn’t enhance him much. Besides, if he shamelessly took it, it would be unfair to those fallen inheritors.","The establishment could be delayed.","He understood Zhen Ling’s intent-to fear their lack of effort or their retreat after seeing the power of the Temple of World Annihilation.","Thus, he wanted to bind them to Qishen Temple.","Because of Zhen Wuyang’s example, Zhen Ling knew the oaths of the past no longer held","much weight.","He was worried about people not giving their best.","It was a painstaking effort.","Jian Wushuang saw through Zhen Ling’s helpless move and didn’t say much, only giving Zhen","Ling another promise.","He would fulfill what he promised.","Now, seeing Zhen Ling, he found the other quite admirable.","Like an old man pulling a group of children.","Now that the children had grown up, the old man feared they would abandon him, showing all his weaknesses and making this move.","Pitiful!","Zhen Ling, with his small eyes darting around, reluctantly said, “Since you insist, let’s first establish the position of Divine Lord. Later, I will open up the Origin Source for you from the","cosmic sea!”","“Everything will be decided based on merit!”","“Yes, based on merit!”","Everyone nodded in agreement.","With this, even the second-generation successors had no objections. They had accumulated a large number of merit points but were hesitant to exchange them due to the limited treasures in Qishen Temple. Even for essential items, they were cautious.","They were all considering the well-being of Qishen Temple.","“Then it will be decided by merit!” Zhen Ling made the final decision and continued, “But you are already the most brilliant successors of Qishen Temple. You cannot act without a proper title. The position of the Divine Lord will be temporarily held by you. If someone surpasses you in merit after eliminating Mie Sheng, don’t blame me!”","“Haha!” Wu Zuo couldn’t help but laugh, “Don’t worry, we won’t be surpassed!”","Everyone then relaxed.","Simultaneously, ten vortexes appeared in the sky.","One by one, stone pillars emerged.","Zhen Ling pointed a finger and loudly proclaimed, “The First Divine Lord!”","This was the position of the First Divine Lord of Qishen Temple.","Everyone watched closely.","Many had already guessed who it would be.","“Jian Wushuang!”","Hearing his name, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He immediately soared into the air and","stood atop the stone pillar.","The position was given to him not because of his merits or combat strength, but because he nearly fulfilled his promise to bring everyone back.","Fan Tianfeng had returned and perished, but that was not discussed.","As for Zhen Wuyang, it could only be said that fate was unpredictable.","There was nothing that could be done.","The rest were brought back safely, and their strengths were astonishing.","This was considered a merit.","In terms of brilliance within Qishen Temple, Jian Wushuang was not the most outstanding.","When he first entered Qishen Temple, Hu Qing was the most brilliant among that batch of","Inheritors.","Later, Jian Wushuang began to shine, but Shang was still above him.","He was never the first.","This time, because he fulfilled his promise to Zhen Ling, the position of First Divine Lord was","given to him.","“The Second Divine Lord!” Zhen Ling’s gaze naturally fell on Hu Qing.","The position of Second Divine Lord should go to Hu Qing.","Among the first batch of successors of Qishen Temple, he was the most brilliant and created","many legends.","Whoosh!","Hu Qing’s figure flickered, and he lightly landed on the pillar.","There was almost no opposition to this distribution.","But when it came to the Third Divine Lord, many showed expressions of dissatisfaction.","“Wu Zuo!”","The sole surviving named disciple of Qishen.","The position was given to Wu Zuo.","Even Wu Zuo himself was shocked.","If it were based on true strength, he was indeed the third.","But besides Jian Wushuang and a few others, no one knew his real combat power.","Yet, Zhen Ling gave the position to him."]},{"number":6083,"title":"Chapter 6083: Position of Divine Lord","paragraphs":["Chapter 6083: Position of Divine Lord","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He glanced at Zhen Ling in surprise, then turned his head to look at Jian Wushuang.","He assumed it was Jian Wushuang’s idea.","But Jian Wushuang shook his head!","This matter was not Jian Wushuang revealing their true strength, but Zhen Ling’s own decision.","“Back then, I wronged you. This is a form of compensation, but don’t get complacent, the order is only temporary!” Zhen Ling smiled faintly and patted Wu Zuo’s shoulder.","Wu Zuo was taken aback, and his eyes turned red; he hadn’t expected that Zhen Ling would care so much about him one day.","It was a kind of care that didn’t depend on strength.","It wasn’t because he was powerful that he was cared about.","Since returning to Qishen Temple, he had often wanted to show off in front of Zhen Ling, to let Zhen Ling see how strong he had become.","He didn’t want to disgrace his master.","But he had never had the opportunity to showcase his abilities.","The confidence he displayed in front of Zhen Ling was all due to his own strength.","But now, Zhen Ling didn’t consider his strength and just gave him the position of the third divine lord. How could he not be excited?","“Yes!” He nodded heavily, stepping forward with a heavy thud on the stone pillar, as if to say he would definitely keep this position.","Zhen Ling also nodded in satisfaction.","The positions of the three divine lords had already been filled.","For the subsequent positions, Zhen Ling would decide based on who had the stronger aura.","The fourth Divine Lord was “Wutian!”","The name Wutian was unfamiliar, but everyone knew about the Tongtian Buddha.","Even in the current Qishen Temple, Tongtian Buddha had left behind the most disciples and followers.","The once Wuliang Buddha was now a Universe Master in the Fourth Tribulation realm. He also found Wutian unfamiliar, completely different from the Tongtian Buddha he once knew.","The former Tongtian Buddha, in Wuliang Buddha’s eyes, was a complete scoundrel, only well disguised.","But now it seemed he was no longer pretending, having directly transformed into a demon.","His strength had reached an unattainable height, and he felt relieved in his heart.","He was just a small elder in Yuanyang Palace, while the former Tongtian Buddha, now Wutian, had become the fourth Divine Lord.","Indeed, they couldn’t be compared.","So, from the bottom of his heart, he gave his blessings.","But those disciples of Tongtian Buddha couldn’t accept it.","They couldn’t accept that Tongtian Buddha had fallen into the demonic path, becoming Wutian, the Demon Buddha of Nether Hell.","However, at this level, those laws had faded, only the human heart remained unchanged.","After appointing the fourth divine lord, the fifth Divine Lord was even more unexpected.","“Lord Guangying!”","The first among the initial batch of trial participants.","Also a dazzling prodigy.","But few remembered him.","Because it was too long ago, back when those trial participants still had youthful faces, now each one had become a super existence, rivaling the ancients.","Because few recognized him, they were only briefly surprised.","On the other hand, Gu Qianluo felt somewhat dissatisfied, being placed behind Guangying. He silently vowed to surpass him, even to personally kill Mie Sheng and seize the top merit, claiming the position of the strongest Divine Lord.","“The sixth Divine Lord...” Zhen Ling drew out his voice, looking at the remaining three, building up anticipation, and finally pointed to a despondent figure.","“Wanyan!”","Standing in the corner, Wanyan thought he had misheard.","This time upon returning, his condition was the worst among everyone, looking dejected and dispirited, with little hope.","Unexpectedly, he was ranked sixth.","His combat strength was not as strong as Gu Qianluo’s, not even as strong as Dongsheng’s, yet he was placed sixth. For a moment, his gloom dissipated, and a surge of pride filled his heart. He immediately accepted the position, steadily landing on the sixth stone pillar.","Dongsheng didn’t feel any resentment about Wanyan being placed ahead of him; instead, he was happy for Wanyan.","Among the second-generation Inheritors, several of Wanyan’s descendants also felt proud of their ancestor.","Only Gu Qianluo felt it was unfair, but he couldn’t voice it.","He could only silently resolve in his heart to astonish everyone and surpass them all.","At the same time, he eagerly awaited the announcement of the seventh divine lord.","This time it should be him, right?","Unfortunately, Zhen Ling called out a name that even he found unfamiliar.","It was not Dongsheng.","“Grave God Mountain, Fifth Mountain Lord, Xin Jiu!”","This name caused everyone to be shocked.","Especially those second-generation Inheritors.","Xin Jiu!","A Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation level.","He was not an ordinary Inheritor, so many people were astonished!","Even Shang was very surprised!","“Xin Jiu!” Jian Wushuang also silently recited this name, recalling the young man he encountered while hunting Jiang Shang in the human realm secret territory, and a slight smile appeared on his lips.","The title of the Fifth Mountain Lord of Grave God Mountain was actually conferred by Shang.","Because Xin Jiu belonged to Shang.","A Universe Master at the peak of the Sixth Tribulation level, not the Hall Master or the Temple Master, but a Mountain Lord without much power, merely the master of one of the peaks established by Grave God Mountain.","But in the fight against the Temple of World Annihilation, he was a sharp blade, having achievements in killing strong opponents of the same level.","It must be noted that after reaching the Fifth Tribulations level, killing an opponent of the same level became a very difficult task, especially in a small place like the downstream spacetime.","Xin Jiu, who was somewhat wooden, did not expect to become a Divine Lord, feeling overwhelmed under countless gazes.","“Go ahead, child, it belongs to you!” Zhen Ling raised his hand and pointed to the seventh pillar.","Only then did Xin Jiu slowly fly over. The moment he landed on the pillar, he could hardly believe it was true.","But a gaze made him tremble all over.","“Congratulations!” Jian Wushuang cupped his fists and smiled at him.","This surprised many people, as Jian Wushuang had not spoken or congratulated anyone since he arrived at the first pillar, but now he was very courteous in cupping his fists to congratulate Xin Jiu.","“Senior...” At this moment, Xin Jiu saw the figure of the person who had led him onto the path of cultivation.","At first, he did not know it was Jian Wushuang, but later, as his strength grew, he began to search for Jian Wushuang’s whereabouts and learned from Zhen Ling that it was Jian Wushuang who had saved him.","He always remembered this name.","He had been waiting for Jian Wushuang’s return.","Now, hearing the praise from that senior, he felt all his past efforts were worthwhile.","He changed the human realm secret territory and also changed his own Dao Heart.","Among the ten Divine Lords, the first local strongman of Qishen Temple had emerged.","Xin Jiu, from the human realm secret territory, claimed the seventh Divine Lord position.","Next, the eighth Divine Lord was given to Dongsheng.","This time there was not much commotion, as the second-generation Inheritors also understood that the Divine Lord position was prepared for Jian Wushuang and his companions.","However, among them, an ordinary Universe Master at the Third Tribulations level showed a proud expression.","Divine General Moyin.","Dongsheng and Wanyan’s master, and their former patron.","Now, in the blink of an eye, his disciples had become Divine Lords.","This made Divine General Moyin feel proud.","In a blink of an eye, the two disciples he had casually accepted back then had both become Divine Lords."]},{"number":6084,"title":"Chapter 6084: A Few Old Friends Sigh","paragraphs":["Chapter 6084: A Few Old Friends Sigh","Dongsheng did not hesitate and directly entered the Divine Pillar.","Below, Gu Qianluo gritted his teeth, seething with anger and frustration in his heart, “They ranked me ninth, just wait, I’ll show you what happens when you underestimate me!”","He intended to make a stunning debut!","If it weren’t for being in the God’s Tomb, he would have unleashed some divine power to show these people just how powerful he really was.","Unfortunately, he never imagined that even the ninth position of the Divine Lord would not be his.","Instead, it went to a second-generation Inheritor.","Among the ten Divine Lords, Jian Wushuang and his group were definitely going to occupy eight positions.","The remaining two spots, one went to a strong contender from Qishen Temple, “Xin Jiu”. The other was naturally chosen from the second-generation Inheritors.","And this candidate surprised everyone.","It was a very young Inheritor who had reached the Sixth Tribulation realm only recently.","He had not made any significant moves since reaching the Sixth Tribulation realm, so few knew his true strength.","Speaking of which, this person had some connection to Jian Wushuang.","Though the connection was not significant, it was more related to the person’s mother.","“Gong Miaoyi!”","When he appeared, Jian Wushuang felt an invisible force of karma.","Back then, he had broken Gong Miaoyi’s heart, and now her son had grown so much.","However, after entering Qishen Temple, he did not sense Gong Miaoyi’s presence.","There was no portrait of Gong Miaoyi on the mountain either.","But he was certain that Gong Miaoyi had already fallen.","Her son, named “Gong Ming”, was the most talented Universe Master Qishen Temple had seen in nearly 100,000 eras.","Since his birth until now, which was just 100,000 eras, he had already become a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master.","However, after becoming a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master, he remained in the Grave God Mountain. He did not belong to Shang’s faction, nor was he a strong contender of the Four Temples and Yuanyang Palace.","He was a direct subordinate of Zhen Ling.","Of course, this also had to do with his background.","Jian Wushuang could see the story in him, fearing it was another tragic end.","Regardless, the ninth Divine Lord came from the second-generation Inheritors.","Even if he did not belong to any faction, this fact could not be changed.","Gu Qianluo was on the verge of madness, being ranked behind a young kid.","Xin Jiu was one thing; despite being a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master, he had at least killed peers of the same level, earning some respect. Plus, Dongsheng ranked just above him, which was not too humiliating.","Now, things had changed.","Seventh was Xin Jiu, eighth was Dongsheng, and ninth was Gong Ming, a Universe Master who had cultivated for 100,000 eras and not long ago broke through to the Sixth Tribulation realm. He also ranked above him.","He was not convinced!","He was truly not convinced.","But he couldn’t argue with juniors over this and could only prove himself through future achievements.","The position of the tenth Divine Lord was no longer in doubt.","Naturally, it belonged to Gu Qianluo.","No one cared what Zhen Ling had to say anymore.","This time, Zhen Ling was much more succinct, directly saying, “Gu Qianluo, this last pillar is yours. I made you the finale; you won’t blame me for that, right?”","He didn’t forget to strike a blow to his confidence.","Gu Qianluo could only show a faint smile and said calmly, “How could that be? I am a person without merit, bearing the title of Divine Lord makes me feel ashamed, so how could I care about the order of things!”","“Haha, that’s good!” Zhen Ling laughed heartily, not paying further attention to him.","Who would have the nerve to protest such things!","One can only swallow the bitterness.","Actually, it’s just a case of inner vanity wanting to compare.","If it were Jian Wushuang, he certainly wouldn’t care about this.","The position of Divine Lord was established.","Next was to plan the expedition.","Everyone had returned, and the great battle was about to commence.","Shang, who had been standing nearby, saw Zhen Ling’s signal and stepped forward to announce, “Three days from now, the major Temple Masters and Hall Masters, along with the newly appointed ten Divine Lords, will gather here to discuss the expedition. The rest of you should prepare; we will attack the Temple of World Annihilation soon!”","Upon hearing this, countless people were filled with battle spirit.","They had been stifled for too long over the years.","They had long wanted to battle the Temple of World Annihilation, but without Zhen Ling’s command, they couldn’t leave and had to wait in frustration.","Today, that day had finally arrived.","With Shang’s announcement, the crowd began to disperse.","However, Jian Wushuang and others stayed where they were, unsure of where to go.","At this moment, Xin Jiu stepped forward and respectfully said, “Thank you, senior, for your guidance many years ago. Xin Jiu will never forget it!”","“You don’t need to thank me. Your achievements today are due to your hard work!” Jian Wushuang didn’t expect Xin Jiu’s accomplishments to be so high. Back then, he merely thought Xin Jiu had great potential. Unexpectedly, upon returning this time, Xin Jiu had already become a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation.","And he had even killed peers of the same level.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t crossed the Seventh Tribulation before returning, he would have","nearly been on the same level as Xin Jiu.","This indeed exceeded his expectations, showing Xin Jiu’s greater effort.","This brought to mind the scenes from the future when he traversed in the Mahayana Spirit","Mountain.","In the future, when he failed in merging paths, it was Xin Jiu who protected and redeemed","him all the way.","In fact, their debts to each other were already settled.","He chatted with Xin Jiu on equal terms for half a day before being called away by Shang,","leaving reluctantly.","The discussion about the Temple of World Annihilation three days later made the Four Great Secret Realms bustling, with everyone eager for action.","However, treasures were scarce!","At this time, the treasures brought by Wu Zuo came in handy.","Jian Wushuang also took the opportunity to gather a lot of Life force and brought out his","treasures.","He gave almost all the treasures that were of no use to him to Zhen Ling.","This instantly expanded the treasury of Qishen Temple.","Previously, there were only over ten thousand types of treasures, but now there were tens of","millions.","The treasures collected by Qishen Temple were actually not much.","Even the so-called treasures of time and space were due to Mie Sheng’s influence, obtained from the Heavens.","Ordinary treasures were quite a lot. After all, Qishen’s strength was not weak back then, and","he had collected nearly all the treasures of Moro Spacetime, allowing Qishen Temple to","cultivate so many Universe Masters.","Of course, it was also related to the downstream spacetime.","But eventually, treasures would run out.","Over the years, without Zhen Ling’s frugality, they would have been begging for food.","Fortunately, Wu Zuo had foresight and gathered a batch of treasures early on.","Now they were put to good use.","This made Zhen Ling very happy, gratified, and said, “My judgment was indeed correct back","then, to have accepted you as a disciple!”","Wu Zuo was also very pleased, he enjoyed this kind of praise.","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to find Gong Ming, who had been appointed as the ninth","Divine Lord.","After all, he was a descendant of an old acquaintance, so he had to take care of him a bit.","Anyway, he had nothing else to do these days. Those he wanted to visit had mostly fallen. “Senior!” Gong Ming, noticing Jian Wushuang approaching, quickly bowed respectfully. He was obedient and showed no arrogance of a genius."]},{"number":6085,"title":"Chapter 6085: Cunning Villain?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6085: Cunning Villain?","This surprised Jian Wushuang greatly. In his impression, Gong Miaoyi was not someone who would bow her head, yet her son had such a different character.","He really wondered who the child’s father was and how good his personality had to be to raise such a son.","Jian Wushuang looked at the other person and smiled faintly, “No need to be nervous. I was an old acquaintance of your mother. I didn’t expect her to... sigh!”","He couldn’t help but sigh as he spoke.","“Mother...” Gong Ming took a deep breath, recalling what his mother had told him before. He wasn’t sure whether to say it or not, but he could feel that Jian Wushuang had no malice toward him.","However, what his mother said before her death was very different from what he saw now. Because before his mother fell, she had explained that in the future, if there was trouble, he could seek help from Jian Wushuang, but it depended on Jian Wushuang’s temperament at the time.","If Jian Wushuang had a violent temperament, then stay as far away as possible.","If he had a calm temperament, he still needed to be cautious.","At least observe for 30,000 to 50,000 eras before approaching.","But upon meeting him, Gong Ming felt that Jian Wushuang was not like what his mother described, a treacherous villain or a great demon.","Instead, he felt that Jian Wushuang was very kind to others.","He didn’t know how badly Jian Wushuang had harmed Gong Miaoyi in the past. If he had known, he wouldn’t have thought this way.","Jian Wushuang was kind to Gong Ming only because he felt he owed Gong Miaoyi back then. He would inquire about his well-being and even offer precious treasures.","This made Gong Ming doubt his mother’s character. Jian Wushuang seemed like a great philanthropist!","How could he be a treacherous villain?","“Dear nephew, if you encounter difficulties in the future, you can come to me with this token. Your Uncle Wushuang may not be able to do much, but I can still protect you in this Northern Spacetime!” Jian Wushuang didn’t exaggerate. In the entire Northern Spacetime, his main concern was Mie Sheng. Once he dealt with Mie Sheng, he would be almost invincible.","Protecting one person would be an easy task.","Moreover, he intended to make the other person a rising star in Qishen Temple in the future.","A grand blueprint had already formed in his mind, but with the threat of Mie Sheng, he couldn’t implement it. Once Mie Sheng was dealt with, it would be the time for Qishen Temple to expand.","Gong Ming was deeply moved upon receiving the token. He nodded solemnly and expressed his gratitude, “I will!”","After caring for the junior, Jian Wushuang began to prepare for the main task.","This time, returning to Qishen Temple, he had another matter to attend to.","It was related to the Beast God Weapon.","“Ahem!” He approached Zhen Ling, glanced at Wu Zuo, who was still bragging endlessly, and coughed twice, signaling that it was enough. He had a part in acquiring these treasures and couldn’t let Wu Zuo take all the credit.","Wu Zuo was in high spirits and didn’t pay attention to Jian Wushuang’s reminder, continuing to boast about his vast connections in the upper spacetime, making Zhen Ling’s eyes sparkle.","Without resolving Mie Sheng, he already fantasized about entering the upper spacetime and dominating the entire Northern Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang coughed for a while before pulling Zhen Ling back to reality.","“Well, Little Wu Zuo, why don’t you go talk to Shang first? We are not in a hurry!” Zhen Ling also felt that he was thinking too much and wanted to send Wu Zuo away.","But Wu Zuo was so engrossed in talking that he didn’t notice the signal.","If it weren’t for the sake of the treasures, Zhen Ling would have slapped Wu Zuo on the head. So lacking in awareness.","“No rush, no rush!” Jian Wushuang smiled awkwardly, “It’s rare for Brother Wu Zuo to be in such high spirits!”","“Forget it, we’ll talk next time. I know you have business to discuss!” Wu Zuo finally noticed Jian Wushuang behind him, hurriedly made way, and went to find Shang.","At this time, Hui Qing and others were also catching up with Shang, talking about things that had happened over the years.","Of course, the major events had been covered by Zhen Ling, and now they were discussing some small matters and sharing their experiences in the upper spacetime with everyone.","It also allowed those powerful figures of the past to realize how vast and marvelous the outside world was.","In fact, that was nothing much anymore.","The entire upper stream of spacetime no longer posed much of a challenge for them.","Of course, this included only Hu Qing and him.","If there was one more, it would be Wu Zuo.","Who could deny his extraordinary background?","“Wushuang, do you have something to discuss with me?” Zhen Ling saw Jian Wushuang’s serious expression and assumed it was something significant, instantly becoming earnest. Jian Wushuang smiled lightly, “It’s not really a big matter. To be honest, I feel somewhat embarrassed. I wanted to ask Lord Zhen Ling for help in gathering the remaining Beast God Weapons.”","“Beast God Weapons!” Upon hearing this, Zhen Ling smiled faintly, “It seems you have discovered the uniqueness of the Beast God Weapons!”","Seeing Zhen Ling’s expression, Jian Wushuang asked in surprise, “You know?”","He hadn’t expected Zhen Ling to be aware of the special nature of the nine Beast God","Weapons.","With this knowledge, he could also inquire about how these weapons were crafted.","Qishen, a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, was able to forge such powerful treasures, there must have been a reason behind it.","He had been curious before, but now that he knew Zhen Ling was also aware, his curiosity","deepened.","“Haha, I was the one who crafted them, how could I not know!” Zhen Ling said, his beard bristling with pride as he began to boast about the crafting of the Beast God Weapons.","In truth, he only possessed the memories of crafting the Beast God Weapons.","At that time in Moro Spacetime, there were nine great Beast Gods.","Each of these Beast Gods was at the level of the Seventh Tribulation, all of whom were slain by","Qishen and ultimately forged into the nine Beast God Weapons!","“Since you already know, I won’t beat around the bush. Simply put, I want to gather all nine Beast God Weapons!” Jian Wushuang said directly, not holding back his purpose.","He intended to collect the nine Beast God Weapons and, combined with the Origin Source of the Nian Beast he had obtained, refine the nine Beast God Weapons into one. Although his current increase in divine power relied entirely on the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, it was no longer sufficient for him.","Or rather, besides the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, he had no other means to","enhance his power.","His fundamental divine power had already reached perfection.","Only by reaching the Eighth Tribulation could he enhance his power further.","And even then, the enhancement would be limited, depending on how he overcame his","tribulations.","He needed to plan ahead and prepare for the future.","Upon hearing his intent to gather the nine Beast God Weapons, Zhen Ling was momentarily stunned and exclaimed, “What do you need these for? Though I was highly skilled back then, these nine Beast God Weapons are considered innate Universe Treasures, but their enhancement limits are very low. Even if you gather all nine, they would at most become treasures at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation level. I see you don’t lack such treasures!” Jian Wushuang had just taken out several treasures at the complete-stage Eighth Tribulation level; why would he be interested in these Beast God Weapons? This puzzled Zhen Ling. Jian Wushuang did not hide his understanding of the Beast God Weapons. This matter was not urgent and could be addressed slowly after dealing with Mie Sheng.","After hearing his explanation, Zhen Ling showed a trace of shock. Even he hadn’t expected the upper limits of the Beast God Weapons to be so high."]},{"number":6086,"title":"Chapter 6086 The History of the Second Nascent Soul’s Destruction!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6086 The History of the Second Nascent Soul’s Destruction!","In the hands of Jian Wushuang, this weapon would reach its highest potential.","If it were given to a worthless person, it might not even be able to display its full power.","“It seems Wu Zuo has told you. Qishen Temple has three other Beast God Weapons. As for the rest, I don’t know where they are. Most likely, they ended up scattered,” Zhen Ling said with a bit of embarrassment. He wasn’t particularly concerned about these treasures, but the fact that they were already in someone’s possession, leaving only one in his hands, made him feel awkward.","Jian Wushuang noticed this and straightforwardly said, “I can do my best to exchange for them. I can meet any opportunity below the Tribulation level.”","“Haha, you’re too formal with me. But with the great war approaching...” Zhen Ling didn’t hide the truth and candidly said, “I originally had three Beast God Weapons, but I gave two of them to Shang and Luo.”","“The Jiangliang Polearm and the Fengyu Spear!”","Hearing that these weapons were in the hands of Shang and Luo, Jian Wushuang felt it inappropriate to ask for them. The couple had guarded Qishen Temple for billions of years. Having just returned and taken the position of the Divine Lord, it would be unreasonable to ask for their treasures now.","Fortunately, they were not their innate treasures and supreme treasures, so there was still hope.","Once Mie Sheng was dealt with, he would personally negotiate.","Zhen Ling’s words were unreliable; he feared that seeing Jian Wushuang’s real strength might dishearten Shang and Luo.","They were meritorious figures and shouldn’t be disheartened.","“No rush. It won’t be too late to talk after I’ve collected the other seven. Besides, there is no one in the Northern Spacetime who can help me condense the Nine Great Beast God Weapons. Even if I gather them all now, it would be useless,” he said, trying to ease the situation, indicating there was no hurry.","Zhen Ling, worried that Jian Wushuang might be anxious, quickly added, “You can take the one I have now!”","He then took out the eighth Beast God Weapon.","A dark red battle helmet!","Beast God Weapon: Vermilion Bird Crown!","A mind treasure that could enhance one’s Thought power.","Jian Wushuang held it in his hand, not finding anything particularly special about it, just a simple enhancement of Thought power. But for ordinary strong beings, it was a super treasure, significantly boosting their Thought power, which was immensely important.","However, for him, it wasn’t as miraculous as the Candle Dragon.","He carefully accepted it and politely said, “Thank you!”","“No need to be so formal!” Zhen Ling waved his hand and changed the topic, saying, “It looks like you’ve almost gathered everything.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and nodded, “Yes, this is the sixth one in hand!”","From the first Beast God Weapon, Candle Dragon, to the later ones obtained in the Mid Spacetime—Glutton, Qilin, Azure Dragon, and Shield Space—plus the current Vermilion Bird, he had gathered six.","Counting Jiangliang and Fengyu.","Only one was still unaccounted for.","Hearing about the obtained ones, Zhen Ling couldn’t help but ask curiously, “Were they all found in the middle-tier spacetimes?”","“Yes!”","“Which... middle-tier spacetime?” Zhen Ling wanted to say more but stopped. With the sword still hanging over their heads, it wasn’t the time to worry about past matters.","Jian Wushuang, however, smiled and said, “I saw the former Moro Spacetime in the middle-tier spacetimes. It’s a pity!... Wu Zuo brought back the ruins of Moro Spacetime. If you...”","“Haha!” Zhen Ling laughed freely, “Forget it, it’s all ancient history!”","Although he said so, from his expression, it was clear that he still had feelings for the past.","Even if he had only inherited some memories, he couldn’t forget the past glories.","Qishen Temple would be great again.","Not far away.","Right in front of them.","After chatting with Zhen Ling for a while longer, Jian Wushuang left the Grave God Mountain alone.","With a few days left, he wanted to visit the Four Great Secret Realms.","Now that he had initially entered the Spacetime Realm, he didn’t need to use a teleportation array and could freely traverse the Four Great Secret Realms.","God’s Tomb!","grave God Mountain!","Ninety-nine layers!","He had long been able to reach them.","At this moment, he remembered that his second nascent soul was still there.","He had initially thought he would return after a few eras, at most tens of thousands of eras.","Unexpectedly, one departure lasted millions of eras.","As a result, his second nascent soul, long separated from his true self, had lost its Dao Heart.","Returning to his cave mansion once again.","Only the physical body remained.","The heart and Origin Source had long lost their color.","Even his hair had turned black.","He remembered that when he left, his hair was white.","Looking at his second nascent soul, he sighed and wanted to reach out and touch it. But before he could, the physical body turned to dust.","“What’s this?” He found it hard to believe. The second nascent soul, although its physical body wasn’t as strong as his original, was still Immortal!","It had turned into dust!","And even his divine sense couldn’t reconstruct this dust.","“Strange!”","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows, his divine sense probing into the Origin Source of the lower reaches of spacetime, attempting to find the lost Origin Source of his second nascent soul, but he found nothing.","Any cultivator who perished in the lower reaches of spacetime would have their Origin Source return to the Origin Source of the lower reaches.","Yet, he couldn’t find his own within the Origin Source of spacetime.","This meant that the Origin Source of his second nascent soul might not have perished after all.","But clearly, no one had left this place!","Even Zhen Ling couldn’t enter back then.","“Forget it. I’ll ask Realm King if I get the chance in the future!”","The Northern Spacetime was the Realm King’s domain, and perhaps he knew something.","After spending some time alone in the cave, with nothing more to reminisce about, he gathered the belongings left by his second nascent soul and left the Grave God’s Mountain.","He then headed straight to the Human Realm Secret Realm above the God’s Tomb Secret Realm.","This was Xin Jiu’s homeland.","Back then, he had chased after Jiang Shang here, and it was also where he first encountered Mie Sheng.","He remembered when he had just escaped from the First Prison, he had arrived at the Human Realm Secret Realm.","At that time, the Human Realm Secret Realm was already solidified, like an old stubborn man with no new blood being born. He gave Xin Jiu the hope to change all that.","Today’s Human Realm Secret Realm was as strong as any other place.","It had a multitude of powerful beings.","Of course, many had moved in later.","Because of the discussion about the expedition three days later, now the entire Qishen Temple’s strong were mobilizing.","In truth, the real decision-makers of victory were still them.","But these people were also useful.","That was for the Origin Source battle!","Fighting for the Origin Source of the lower reaches of spacetime.","This wasn’t something one person could withstand alone.","Currently, Mie Sheng controlled almost the entire lower reaches of spacetime, making the battle unfavorable for them.","To break this, they needed the emperors and tribulation realm experts to fight.","The foundation of the four great secret realms was still very solid.","There were many Emperors, enough to match the heritage of an entire spacetime.","Back then, Zhen Ling’s decision to open Qishen Temple and release all the Inheritors was the right one.","Establishing sects and nurturing a large number of strong individuals.","This was much better than staying cooped up in Qishen Temple. If not for the Temple of World Annihilation growing too fast, Qishen Temple would have been even stronger.","He only lingered in the Human Realm for a short while before leaving leisurely.","The Earth Realm.","The former west coast."]},{"number":6087,"title":"Chapter 6087 Revisiting the Four Great Secret Realms","paragraphs":["Chapter 6087 Revisiting the Four Great Secret Realms","The Mo Luo Kingdom still existed.","The Great Xia was no more.","He had spent considerable time in the mortal world, leaving behind many memories.","He had once impersonated a prince of the Great Xia and had wandered with Bai Junwang.","He had also encountered the opportunity with the Three Kings Court.","However, things had changed, and he no longer knew anyone there.","Bai Junwang had fallen even after his body was remolded.","The former Great Elder of the Mo Luo Kingdom, an outsider by birth, had left his life behind in the Mo Luo Kingdom.","“Sigh!”","Jian Wushuang sighed softly.","He turned and left the Earth Realm.","He did not go directly to the Heavenly Realm but instead headed to the Original Planet.","The Vermilion Bird Temple still stood.","In the dark red hall, figures moved hurriedly.","The current Temple Master of the Vermilion Bird Temple was a remarkable figure. Although not as powerful as Xin Jiu, she had unique methods. Among the four halls, the Vermilion Bird Temple, originally a secure rear hall, now boasted comprehensive combat strength comparable to the White Tiger Temple and excelled in external battles.","This was all due to the current Temple Master.","“Ji Wushuang!”","The young lady of the Ji family.","He still remembered the first time he met her.","The niece of Ji Chaoyang, she had now become a peak Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation.","The once naive and frivolous girl was now steady and imposing.","Jian Wushuang looked through the hall and glanced at her.","They had parted ways at the Grave God Mountain without catching up, and now she was busy arranging the expedition at the Vermilion Bird Temple.","She had indeed matured a lot.","In the past, she would have approached and greeted her elder.","Perhaps due to the weight of her responsibilities, she had set aside her old personality.","Through the hall, he did not disturb her. He casually stopped a steward of the Vermilion Bird Temple, “Give this mustard seed to your Temple Master!”","“Hmm?” The steward, a supreme expert, was startled. He felt a bit dazed as if he had received an irresistible task, and absent-mindedly took the mustard seed towards the Vermilion Bird Temple.","Only after handing over the mustard seed to Ji Wushuang did he regain his senses.","“Who gave you this mustard seed?” Ji Wushuang’s pupils dilated as she briefly checked the contents of the mustard seed, finding it hard to believe.","The steward, now fully aware, was confused to find himself inside the hall with the Temple Master questioning him. Nonetheless, he recounted the strange encounter.","Ji Wushuang immediately understood. Her usually calm and composed eyes revealed a hint of their former clarity. She gently said, “I understand, you may leave now.”","“Yes!” The steward, amazed that the voice had come from the Temple Master, hesitated before slowly retreating.","Meanwhile, he wondered what had made the Temple Master show a gentle side. He always thought she was cold and indifferent!","The hall was bustling, but Ji Wushuang stood in a daze for a moment. She looked outside but saw no familiar figure.","She sighed softly, accepted the mustard seed, and resumed her work.","At this time, Jian Wushuang had already left the front hall of the Vermilion Bird Temple.","The Vermilion Bird Temple had a rear hall as well.","There were no cultivators here, only puppets.","It was the predecessor of the Vermilion Bird Temple.","Zhu Yi was also here.","However, he was not looking for Zhu Yi but for Zhu Qi.","This former lover of Shan Jun.","Shan Jun had been kind to him, so he felt he should visit.","Since his return, he had not seen her.","After all, she was just an emperor puppet, no longer useful to the Qishen Temple.","They stayed in the Vermilion Bird Temple, now only handling miscellaneous tasks.","Even Zhu Yi was no exception.","Jian Wushuang quietly entered a side hall where Zhu Qi was.","She was organizing some files.","So engrossed in her work, she did not notice Jian Wushuang’s presence until he blocked the candlelight.","“It’s you?” Zhu Qi exclaimed, “Jian Wushuang?”","She found it hard to believe.","When Jian Wushuang and many others had disappeared, she learned he had gone to the outside world, never to be heard from again. She did not expect him to appear before her today, making it difficult to believe.","“Long time no see!” Jian Wushuang revealed a faint smile.","Zhu Qi quickly got up to pour water.","The two sat opposite each other and talked for a long time.","Of course, the topic of their conversation was still Shan Jun.","From the other’s words, Jian Wushuang once again understood Shan Jun.","Although he visited these people who had no direct relation to the grand scheme one by one, he was actually learning about this struggle.","Understanding Shan Jun was equivalent to understanding the Devouring Path of Qishen.","From Zhu Qi’s words and his own understanding, he couldn’t believe that Shan Jun was an obstacle to Qishen.","In other words, the Devouring Dao was not necessarily an evil path.","It wasn’t so despicable.","Perhaps the only mistake was Qishen himself.","After talking for a long time, he finally left.","Unfortunately, Zhu Qi was just a puppet; he couldn’t help her for now.","In the future, he could help her find a stronger body or a stronger Origin Source, allowing her to live like a real person.","He visited the four great temples in turn.","When he went to the White Tiger Temple, he was not very familiar with Bai Yi, so they just exchanged simple pleasantries.","The same was true for the Azure Dragon Temple.","Only when he reached the Black Tortoise Temple did he stay for a long time.","He talked with Xuan Yi of the Black Tortoise Temple for a long time.","“Back then, did he really say that?”","“Absolutely. That senior was just passing by Qishen Temple. He went to the depths of the Original Universe, saying he was looking for someone. He used my name and gave me an opportunity!”","Xuan Yi, recalling something, quickly took out a small box and said, “This is what the senior asked me to give you. He said to give it to you when you came to see me voluntarily!”","“Thank you!” Jian Wushuang stood up and respectfully accepted the box.","Holding the wooden box in his hands, his eyes flickered.","To Xuan Yi’s surprise, he left the Black Tortoise Temple.","The depths of the universe that the teacher mentioned were his hometown, but now everything was gone.","Having gone through so much, Jian Wushuang had thought deeply about it. He had always speculated about what his Teacher Xuan Yi intended to do.","Previously, he thought that his mysterious master might be a reincarnated mighty one who needed his help.","Later, when they met again in the Three Kings Court, he thought the teacher had something to entrust to him.","Now, he was given this wooden box.","He held it in his hand for a long time without opening it.","When he voluntarily met the Master of the Black Tortoise Temple, he was to hand over this item?","When he was a Dao Lord, he could meet the Master of the Black Tortoise Temple.","This item left behind was probably not a treasure.","Crack!","After hesitating for a long time, he cautiously opened the box.","The wooden box opened, and inside lay a token quietly.","On it were inscribed Starry Sky characters.","“God King!”","At the moment he saw the two ancient characters, a powerful pressure overwhelmed his aura."]},{"number":6088,"title":"Chapter 6088: Courage Given by His Teacher","paragraphs":["Chapter 6088: Courage Given by His Teacher","With just one glance, his Origin Source Starry Sky trembled.","The existence that had forged this token was probably much stronger than him.","At least a Universe Master.","Or perhaps a Starry Sky God.","Even the candidate for the Realm King, “Zamasu”, hadn’t given him such a huge impact.","If he had looked directly at this token when he was a Dao Lord, wouldn’t he have been directly shocked to death?","“No, that’s not right!” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. “It seems that my teacher had already foreseen this day!”","He had no reason to doubt this issue.","After all, at this level, he still couldn’t see through his teacher’s realm and identity. How could it be as naive as he imagined?","Thinking of this, he directly used his Thought power to probe the token.","As soon as his Thought power entered the token, a simple line of text appeared in his mind.","“If you encounter difficulties, you can crush the token, and someone will come to solve everything for you!”","“Solve everything?” Jian Wushuang murmured softly, his eyes reddening slightly.","The only person who could say such words to him was his master.","Like a towering tree.","Sheltering him from everything.","Carefully, he stored the token into his Origin Source.","It could be considered a rare trump card.","However, he only had one chance to crush the token.","He wouldn’t use it lightly.","Or rather, when he accepted it, he hadn’t planned on using it.","Now, he no longer needed protection; he had to bear everything himself.","Even if it meant fighting to his last breath.","Thinking of this, his gaze became firm, and with a flash, he reappeared in the Heavenly Realm.","The Four Great Secret Realms.","Only the brightness of the Heavenly Realm made him comfortable.","Especially at Yuanyang Lake in the Heavenly Realm.","Finding a secluded meadow, he sat cross-legged alone, drinking a pot of wine, feeling very content.","Nowadays, Qishen Temple was crowded with people.","There were few such secluded places left.","In three days, he spent only one day visiting old acquaintances.","The remaining two days, he just sat there in a daze.","He didn’t practice cultivation.","These were the slowest two days he had ever spent, feeling the passage of time on his body.","In the past, a single session of cultivation was calculated in ten thousand years.","Now, calming down, he felt the preciousness of time.","The downside of deep cultivation was that not feeling the passage of time would cause people to get stuck at bottlenecks.","This was what he realized in these two days.","Stopping suddenly to feel the mystery of time turned out to be more useful than cultivating for 100,000 years.","“Time is not about how much you have, but how you use it!”","He gently stood up and slightly closed his eyes.","When he opened them again, he was already at the Divine Tomb.","In Qishen Temple’s Dao Arena.","Ten Divine Lords.","Four Hall Masters.","Six Hall Masters from Yuanyang Palace.","And Shang and Luo, everyone was present.","In the center of the dojo, there was a long table.","The ten Divine Lords sat opposite the four Hall Masters and the six from Yuanyang Palace.","Shang and Luo sat at the front of the long table, one on each side.","In the middle, there was an empty seat reserved for Zhen Ling.","Now that everyone was present, only Zhen Ling was missing.","No one knew where the old man had gone.","After a while, Zhen Ling hurriedly arrived.","“Everyone is here, let’s start directly!” Zhen Ling sat down heavily. At this moment, he no longer pretended. The seating arrangement already made it clear that he was the leader.","Shang stood up and took out a jade slip, placing it on the long table. A map of the downstream spacetime appeared on the table.","“Everyone, please look, this is the map of the River of Time. The red marks are the locations where the strongholds of the Temple of World Annihilation are stationed. If we are to launch an expedition against the Temple of World Annihilation, we must remove these locations one","by one!”","The details of the discussion left Jian Wushuang and others in the dark. They really didn’t understand this part.","But it was a necessary struggle.","Otherwise, when the final battle came, they would have very little Origin Source to mobilize.","Just the first step took half a day of discussion to finalize.","The vanguard of the expedition was to remove several demonic regions in the original","universe.","There were three Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation stationed in the original","universe by the Temple of World Annihilation.","This task was assigned to the fourth Divine Lord, “Wutian”!","Among the three Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation, the one with the strongest","divine power was less than 3 million, so Wutian could handle it alone.","The remaining matters were actually quite similar to the beginning.","It was for Jian Wushuang and others to behead, while the rest was left to the strong ones from","the four halls and Yuanyang Palace to clean up.","Soon, everyone’s tasks were clearly assigned.","The red marks on the table were removed one by one.","Leaving only the headquarters of the Temple of World Annihilation.","At this time, Zhen Ling slowly said, “Once you act, I will move Qishen Temple next to the Temple of World Annihilation. Wait for your message, and once all the strong ones in the Temple of World Annihilation are eliminated, we will attack the Temple of World","Annihilation together.”","“Threat number one, Mie Sheng!”","Everyone present knew this.","But regarding Mie Sheng’s strength, besides Jian Wushuang, very few people knew.","“Jian Wushuang, you explain!” Zhen Ling knew Mie Sheng was here for Jian Wushuang, so he","let Jian Wushuang explain Mie Sheng’s strength.","Initially, Jian Wushuang didn’t plan to tell the truth to avoid shaking the army’s morale.","But then he thought, if he didn’t say anything, when Mie Sheng appeared, wouldn’t it be suicidal for some hotheads to rush at him?","However, he couldn’t directly reveal Mie Sheng’s identity; it would be too complicated to explain, and even if he did, few would understand.","So he simply said, “I want everyone to remember one thing: except for Hu Qing and me, everyone else should stay away from Mie Sheng. He is not your opponent. Your opponents are","those strong ones in the Temple of World Annihilation.”","These words were simple but also somewhat arrogant.","“Brother Wushuang, aren’t you exaggerating a bit? How strong can a little Mie Sheng be? Is","there a need for this?” Wu Zuo, who had just been appointed the third Divine Lord, was a bit","unconvinced.","How come besides Hu Qing, he wasn’t allowed to show his skills?","Jian Wushuang was firm, “I will sit in the middle. If I can’t handle it, you can step in. It won’t","be too late then!”","“Umm?” Wu Zuo felt a bit awkward.","If Jian Wushuang couldn’t handle it, wouldn’t it be suicidal for them to go?","So he decided not to say more.","Luo hesitated but didn’t speak either.","The final battle was a big deal.","It could change in an instant, not something that could be planned through discussions.","Seeing Jian Wushuang had said enough, Zhen Ling knocked on the armrest of his seat and","said, “Then it’s decided. If Mie Sheng appears, Jian Wushuang will deal with him first. If he can’t handle it, the second Divine Lord, Hu Qing, will join in!”","After talking about Mie Sheng, there were two more threats in the Temple of World","Annihilation.","They were Jiang Shang and Broly.","Both were from Qishen Temple, yet they posed the greatest threat.","“I’ll do it!” Hu Qing stood up to take the task.","Jiang Shang was his disciple, so he took this matter into his own hands.","Jian Wushuang hesitated, wanting to say something, but after seeing Hu Qing, he took a deep","breath and said, “I agree!”"]},{"number":6089,"title":"Chapter 6089: It’s Already Noon!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6089: It’s Already Noon!","At this moment, he could only say so much.","Only a few people knew about Jiang Shang’s situation.","If he let others handle Jiang Shang, it might disrupt Hu Qing’s state of mind. It was better for Hu Qing to resolve it himself.","Seeing that no one else had any objections, the matter was settled.","However, Broly’s attention was now on Wu Zuo.","This time, no one dared to dampen Wu Zuo’s spirits.","After discussing the first three matters, the open threats from the Temple of World Annihilation were reduced to just the Demon Lord and Mo Jun.","Currently, Gu Jun was still in Qishen Temple.","He was firmly suppressed by Zhen Ling.","The two Demon Lords, transformed by the Path of Devouring, were assigned to Shang and Luo.","The Fourth Divine Lord was to oversee the battle and assist if needed.","The others were to handle unexpected situations, as no one could say for sure that the Temple of World Annihilation didn’t have other strong fighters.","“I, with the power of Qishen, announce that we will set out tomorrow at noon. Assemble the army immediately and prepare to march!” Zhen Ling stood up and solemnly declared.","Everyone else stood up as well, their expressions serious.","“Dismissed!”","Shang and Luo, along with the experts from the Four Temples and Yuanyang Palace, left to prepare for the expedition.","All ten Divine Lords stayed behind.","They had no soldiers under their command.","Xin Jiu and Gong Ming were the same.","“You will wait here for a while. Tomorrow at noon, someone will take you out to eliminate the strongholds of the Temple of World Annihilation!” Zhen Ling gave his instructions and then left the Dao Arena.","Jian Wushuang and the others closed their eyes to rest.","The great battle was about to begin!","Everyone was waiting for that moment.","Meanwhile, the experts from the Four Great Secret Realms had been divided into twelve teams.","Shang and Luo each led a team.","The other ten teams were led by the four Temple Masters and the six Hall Masters of Yuanyang Palace.","“Noon has arrived!”","“Set off!”","At Qishen Dao Arena, Zhen Ling appeared.","The experts leading the army only sent their avatars.","“From now on, your true selves will leave Qishen Temple, leaving only avatars to report front-line intelligence!” Zhen Ling’s words were clear. After glancing at everyone, he shouted sternly, “Set off!”","“Yes!”","Everyone stood up, leaving behind transparent avatars in their seats.","These avatars were very fragile because they left all their divine power in their true bodies.","A desperate fight!","This was everyone’s determination.","Even Jian Wushuang and others left behind weak avatars.","They needed to show this kind of momentum.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang casually tore open a space crack and left the Qishen Temple.","When he reappeared, he was already in the Great Desolate Wilderness. Outside, 12 teams had already gathered.","The first battle, the vanguard of Wutian.","They all came out to oversee the battle.","At this time, Wutian had already led the fourth team, which consisted of the strong from the Vermilion Bird Temple, to the Great Dream Realm in the Original Universe.","Originally, this place was the territory of the Great Dream Ancestor, a middle-level domain. Now it was the main base of the Temple of World Annihilation in the Original Universe.","It housed three Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation level and dozens of Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation level.","In contrast, the Vermilion Bird Temple had only three Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation level.","Besides Ji Wushuang, the other two were just ordinary Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation level.","Although they had exchanged a lot of treasures in recent days, their strength had not","improved much, and their divine power was only about 800,000.","Far inferior to those Universe Masters in the upstream spacetime.","This was normal.","However, Ji Wushuang’s divine power had broken 1 million. In the upstream spacetime, he was also a super-strong in the Sixth Tribulation level.","Buzz!","Wutian was the first to strike without any nonsense.","He did not wait for Ji Wushuang to bring the army but transformed into a hellish scene that enveloped the entire Great Dream Realm.","However, he did not take all the credit. He just reduced everyone’s combat power by 90","percent.","As for the three Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation level, they were not so lucky.","“Ambush!”","“It’s the strong from the Qishen Temple!”","The strong of the Temple of World Annihilation in the Great Dream Realm instantly panicked.","This was not surprising, as Wutian’s methods were beyond their imagination.","In just a moment, he reduced their combat power by 90 percent.","Thus, when Ji Wushuang led the team, it was like cutting through butter, suppressing and slaughtering them one-sidedly.","Wutian had already reached the core of the Great Dream Realm.","The three Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation level had just appeared when their","pupils began to dilate.","“Umm?”","“Lord Mie Sheng...”","The situation here had not yet been reported. The three Universe Masters were instantly killed. Three round heads were already floating beside Wutian’s hand. His expression did not change, and with a flash of his body, he appeared in the void of the Great Dream Realm.","He did not leave directly but waited until the battle below was completely over before returning to the temporary base in the Great Desolate Wilderness with his men.","Swish!","Wutian appeared and directly threw the three heads on the ground.","He did not speak.","The place was dead silent.","Everyone was shocked by Wutian’s fierce combat power!","“So strong, I didn’t even have time to react, and it was over?” The strong from the four halls","and Yuanyang Palace were stunned, instantly buzzing with excitement.","At the same time, they gained endless confidence.","This was the strongest outpost of the Temple of World Annihilation outside.","It was easily resolved by the fourth Divine Lord alone.","They could just relax and prepare for the final battle.","Moreover, the final battle would have the first and second Divine Lords, so they probably","wouldn’t even be needed.","Just as everyone was showing a relaxed look, the shattered Great Dream Realm began to","tremble.","Jian Wushuang frowned, sensing the death aura, and stepped into the void of the Great Dream","Realm.","Upon approaching, he discovered that the death aura came from those shattered bodies.","So many strong had fallen that the Original Universe could not sustain it.","It had absorbed too much of the fallen Origin Source, needing time to digest. But the Death","aura here was not that simple.","At first glance, it seemed that Mie Sheng had arrived.","It was imaginable how terrifying the Death aura here was.","“It’s a self-sacrifice ritual!” Someone exclaimed, loudly reminding, “Be careful of that Death","aura, it will erode the Origin Source!”","Far away in the wilderness, everyone looked at Jian Wushuang.","Wutian felt it was his business and followed.","However, after sensing the Death aura, he kept retreating.","“Wutian, step back!” Jian Wushuang turned and said, “Leave this place to me!”","After speaking, he gathered countless Life power and scattered them below, completely suppressing the Death aura.","The Great Dream Realm stopped trembling.","The Death aura originally intended to manipulate the fallen cultivators was purified by Life","power.","The entire Great Dream Realm once again flourished with life, returning to normal.","After this incident, Jian Wushuang had to consider taking out some Life power to eliminate","future troubles.","Otherwise, attacking those outposts would be equivalent to increasing the opponent’s","strength.","But just after he washed away the Death aura with his Life force, the Origin Source returning","to the Original Universe disappeared.","The fallen Origin Source cultivators were actually practitioners from the downstream","spacetimes."]},{"number":6090,"title":"Chapter 6090: Return of Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 6090: Return of Death","They only relied on Mie Sheng.","Perhaps, in the eyes of these people, they were merely treacherous ministers and traitors.","But as soon as their Origin Source entered the Origin Source of the Original Universe after their fall, before it could be absorbed by the Original Universe, it was drawn by the power of Death, wanting to revive.","Now, after being washed by the power of Life, Jian Wushuang thought these Origin Sources would return to the Original Universe or the entire spacetime.","But now, he couldn’t feel those Origin Sources.","“Could it be?” He thought of the Temple of World Annihilation, his expression changing, “These Origin Sources won’t return to the Temple of World Annihilation, will they?”","If that’s the case, it would still mean increasing the opponent’s strength.","But according to Zhen Ling, not killing these people would also make Mie Sheng stronger. They seemed to be trapped in a closed loop.","No matter what, the Temple of World Annihilation was profiting.","The base of the Great Dream Realm was completely eradicated.","However, there was no movement from the Temple of World Annihilation.","Mie Sheng stood above the temple, quietly observing through spacetime.","Behind him, a burly man spoke in a dull voice, “Let me take action!”","“No!” Mie Sheng shook his head and pointed in the direction of Qishen Temple, “They must do it. Neither you nor Jiang Shang should intervene!”","...","On the Original Universe side.","Jian Wushuang didn’t reveal the truth because he couldn’t solve this matter either.","The others, even less so.","They could only provide some life force, instructing the various Divine Lords to use it to resist the power of death after eradicating the bases.","The first battle was victorious, although there were some minor incidents, they did not affect the morale.","Next was the second battle, where Wu Zuo cooperated with the strong ones from the Azure Dragon Temple to clear the bases in the neighboring universe.","The remaining teams were not idle either.","The eight of them cooperated with various teams to begin clearing the Temple of World Annihilation in the major universes.","Since learning of Mie Sheng’s intentions, Jian Wushuang also acted without restraint.","Knowing that Mie Sheng would not intervene, he informed Zhen Ling to speed up.","Within ten thousand years, all the bases in the lower spacetime were eradicated.","Although there were no orders from Mie Sheng.","The strong ones in those bases were not fools either.","As they continued to expand.","Those bases also began to unite, attempting to resist.","But no matter how many strong ones there were, they couldn’t stop the eight Divine Lords. Apart from Xin Jiu and Gong Ming.","The divine power of the other eight Divine Lords exceeded five million.","In the entire lower spacetime, strong ones with divine power exceeding 5 million seemed never to have appeared.","Perhaps Broly and Jiang Shang had, but these two seemed to have disappeared, never encountered from start to finish.","The original plan was to eradicate all bases within ten thousand years.","But it only took 3,000 years.","Because some bases were directly abandoned, the strong ones from the Temple of World Annihilation all gathered together.","At first, Jian Wushuang wanted to try imprisoning these people, not wanting to add nutrients to the Temple of World Annihilation.","Unfortunately, he still thought too simply.","Even if he didn’t take action, these people would sacrifice themselves.","Divine power directly doubled.","But life gradually faded.","Among them, a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm, after sacrificing himself, exploded with a divine power of 5 million at the last moment.","This was Jian Wushuang’s deliberate test, otherwise, he could have easily killed him at the moment of his sacrifice.","He wanted to see how strong these practitioners would become after sacrificing themselves.","Unexpectedly, it exceeded his expectations.","The strong ones from Qishen Temple, who could have been easily crushed, began to fall one after another.","Fortunately, he gave a reminder, otherwise, more would have fallen.","These strong ones from the Temple of World Annihilation were like madmen.","After sacrificing themselves, they were not afraid of death at all.","“An emergency situation has arisen in the Han Hai Universe of the seventy-fourth branch. The nearest team, hurry to the rescue!”","In the Qishen Dao Arena.","Gu Qianluo’s face was solemn as he called for help.","A person who treated his face as life, yet at this moment, called for help.","Now, the entire lower spacetime was almost leveled.","Only a few gathered bases remained.","“I’ll go!” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","His speed was the fastest.","“Can you hold on for the time of one incense stick?”","Gu Qianluo’s face was gloomy, just as he was about to nod, his expression changed drastically","again, anxiously saying, “I can’t hold on anymore, a Universe Master of the Seventh","Tribulation here has exploded with ten million divine power!”","“Ten million divine power!”","When they heard this number, everyone trembled.","Even Jian Wushuang frowned.","The real body took out the pyramid and shouted at Babata, “Activate the secret realm-level","speed!”","At the same time, on the avatar’s side, he let Gu Qianluo escape first.","10 million divine power.","Wu Zuo and Wutian were not opponents when they encountered it.","Not to mention others.","Especially Shang and Luo, when they heard 10 million divine power, they both showed an","expression of disbelief.","They had never encountered such a powerful Universe Master.","Their own divine power was only 3 million.","Now hearing that the Temple of World Annihilation had a Universe Master at the Seventh","Tribulation level with divine power reaching 10 million, they couldn’t remain calm.","At the same time, they were curious about Wutian’s strength.","To withstand an expert with 10 million divine power was not a simple feat, at least having","divine power above 5 million.","This was the weakest among Jian Wushuang and the others!","“If necessary, you escape first!” Jian Wushuang’s avatar left a sentence and then closed his","eyes, saying no more.","Because the real body was already close.","With the speed of the pyramid, it only took a few breaths to reach the vast cosmos sea.","Several strong people from branch timelines were gathered here.","Just cultivators at the level of Seventh Tribulation, there were three of them.","There were also many Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation.","Originally, to Gu Qianluo, this place posed no threat.","The strongest of those Universe Masters after sacrificing themselves only had 5 million divine","power.","But this time, they hit a hard rock.","The ninth team they followed was completely wiped out.","Including the Hall Master of Yuanyang Palace.","Only he was left!","Buzz!","When the pyramid descended, Gu Qianluo finally relaxed.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t given them a lot of life force earlier, he might have just perished.","He felt a sense of lingering fear at this moment.","The return battle was more brutal than they had imagined.","Jian Wushuang stepped out of the pyramid, and with just a finger, immobilized the Universe","Master at the Seventh Tribulation stage, who had broken through 10 million divine power, in","spacetime, unable to move.","Time stopped flowing.","But the opponent’s Life force kept dwindling.","This had nothing to do with time.","Until the last moment, the opponent’s divine power reached 12 million, then he fell with","resentment.","Jian Wushuang just wanted to see what the limit was.","Currently, a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation, after sacrificing themselves, had a divine power limit that surged to 12 million.","He immediately notified Zhen Ling, all teams stop.","The remaining strongholds were left to him and Hu Qing.","At the same time, he speculated in his heart, these Universe Masters after sacrificing themselves, with such strong divine power, would the Origin Source and divine body returning to the Temple of World Annihilation increase the temple’s power as much? If so, then how much divine power had the Temple of World Annihilation absorbed? It was a huge number, beyond his imagination."]},{"number":6091,"title":"Chapter 6091: No Need for Charity!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6091: No Need for Charity!","The key point was that this was only the beginning!","Jian Wushuang frowned, glanced at Gu Qianluo, and said calmly, “Come in, I’ll take you back!”","As for those fallen strong individuals, not even a body was left behind.","Gu Qianluo, who had been frightened, was somewhat in a daze. It wasn’t until he entered the pyramid that he came to his senses.","“Jian Wushuang, you knew all along, didn’t you!” Gu Qianluo glared, staring at Jian Wushuang.","Knowing what the other party was going to say, Jian Wushuang did not refute.","In fact, he had always emphasized that Mie Sheng was not that simple.","The Temple of World Annihilation was also not that simple.","But, unfortunately, they wouldn’t listen!","“If you’re scared, you can stay here forever!”","He turned his back, his tone indifferent.","Bringing Gu Qianluo back was already the completion of his task.","As for Mie Sheng, it had nothing to do with these people.","Moreover, over the past three thousand years, everyone had put in a lot of effort, which could","be considered as repaying Qishen Temple!","The remaining matters were now his alone.","He had never intended to drag these people into the water.","If they wanted to leave, they could do so at any time.","He would even personally escort them.","After all, the Original Universe and Qishen Temple needed to be left with a root!","“I know you look down on me!” Gu Qianluo smiled bitterly, clenched his fists, his eyes firm, and said loudly, “But I am not a coward, I am not afraid of death, and you don’t need to pity me!”","Gu Qianluo’s words made Jian Wushuang’s expression tremble. He hadn’t expected the other party to be so courageous.","He just shook his head in silence, saying no more.","In truth, he hoped Gu Qianluo would leave.","There was no need to stay and get involved in this mess.","Because this wasn’t Qishen Temple’s matter.","He rode the pyramid, not in a hurry to return, but instead, he made stops at other large strongholds, killing the strong individuals of the Temple of World Annihilation one by one.","He never encountered such formidable Universe Masters who sacrificed themselves again.","The entire downstream spacetime, which had endured thousands of years of slaughter, gradually calmed down.","The strong individuals of the Temple of World Annihilation, whether controlled or driven by their beliefs, did not flee.","They just faced their slaughter directly.","The Sword Tomb!","In a hidden universe in the downstream spacetime.","The Temple of World Annihilation had quietly descended.","It had shifted its position.","Although it had moved its position, it did not conceal any aura.","This was considered a battlefield chosen by the other side!","After sensing the eruption of that aura, Jian Wushuang transmitted his message to Zhen Ling.","Qishen Temple also set out at this moment.","All the powerful beings gathered together.","Jian Wushuang, at the fastest speed, arrived outside the Temple of World Annihilation first, waiting quietly for the arrival of Qishen Temple.","Standing beside him was Hu Qing.","As for the pyramid, it was left to Wu Zuo and others to avoid any more dangers.","Looking at the unfathomable Temple of World Annihilation, he indeed felt the same","oppressive feeling as from the Immortal Temple.","“It’s a divine artifact!” Hu Qing frowned slightly.","Jian Wushuang had expected this and said calmly, “Nothing remarkable!”","Feigning composure!","When the mountain arrives at your feet, there will naturally be a path.","At worst, just climb over it.","Buzz!","The violent spatial tremor caused the entire Sword Tomb to shake.","Then the entire space cracked open, and a towering temple smashed down below.","Countless figures began to appear and disappear above the temple, instantly condensing into their true forms.","These were the numerous powerful beings of Qishen Temple.","However, this time all who stepped out were Universe Masters of the six Tribulations realm","and above.","Including Jian Wushuang and others.","There were more than thirty of them.","Zhen Ling led them, staring straight at the Temple of World Annihilation, without any fear.","“Have you foreseen this scene?”","The majestic tone carried the shouts of countless people.","These were the numerous powerful beings from within Qishen Temple.","At this time, Yuanyang Lake in the secret realm of the Heavenly Realm turned into a sky curtain, and those Emperors, Universe Masters, even Dao Lords, and Yan Immortals who were not qualified to participate in the battle, were all watching.","The expectations of countless people.","This was momentum!","An unstoppable force!","At this moment, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but move his lips.","Waiting quietly for the movements from the Temple of World Annihilation.","“What a grand spectacle!”","Inside the Temple of World Annihilation, Mie Sheng stood at a dim window, his tone indifferent, his eyes looking at the Sword Tomb below.","The Sword Tomb!","Covered in ice, countless sword-shaped majestic mountains were skewed, outlining the word","‘sword’, hence the name Sword Tomb.","Mie Sheng chose this place also with a hidden meaning.","To take down Jian Wushuang!","“It’s time for me to make an appearance!” A robust voice echoed throughout the Temple of","World Annihilation.","It was Broly, born for battle.","He hadn’t changed at all, still as battle-hungry as ever.","Since Qishen Temple had withdrawn into a group, he hadn’t made a move again, if it wasn’t for Mie Sheng suppressing him, he would have left the downstream spacetime long ago. Now that Jian Wushuang had returned, this greatest enemy and greatest opponent appeared, his battle intent had long reached its peak.","“You, a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, can’t withstand a single sword strike from Jian Wushuang!” Mie Sheng sneered, “I think it’s better to let Jiang Shang do it!”","In the dim hall, two figures stepped forward together.","Standing in the only place with a beam of light.","The burly Broly was somewhat unconvinced, biting his teeth, suppressing his anger.","The petite Jiang Shang had undergone earth-shattering changes compared to before.","Now, Jiang Shang was the only Universe Master of the eight Tribulations realm in the","downstream spacetime besides Hu Qing.","The strongest existence under Mie Sheng.","In fact, both Jiang Shang and Broly were merely tools, but Jiang Shang’s achievements would","be higher than Broly’s.","Because Broly was a lunatic, Mie Sheng had always suppressed him.","The more suppressed, the more crazy Broly became, the crazier he became, the stronger he","got.","Don’t look at him as just a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, but due to the Ultimate Transformation Dao, he could undergo multiple transformations, causing his divine power to","surge repeatedly.","Even when Jiang Shang fought with Broly, she felt it was strenuous.","So Mie Sheng wanted Jiang Shang to go out first, to suppress Broly a bit.","But when Jiang Shang saw Hu Qing, there was hesitation in her eyes.","The grand words of the past instantly collapsed.","“I...” Jiang Shang’s breathing became a bit chaotic.","Mie Sheng revealed a slight smile, saying indifferently, “It’s something you have to face, isn’t","it?”","“I won’t let you down!” Jiang Shang adjusted her emotions, her eyes becoming cold.","“No!” Mie Sheng turned around, looking at Jiang Shang with gentle eyes, rejecting, “You’re","not doing this for me, you’re doing it for yourself. Actually, there are many things I don’t say,","but I think you should understand, I am not from this spacetime. I came here for the power of","Life, for Jian Wushuang, our goals are the same!”","Unified goals!","As the God of Death, the symbol of evil!","How could it be possible to have unified goals?","If Jian Wushuang surrendered, letting Mie Sheng kill Jiang Shang, he probably wouldn’t","hesitate a bit.","Jiang Shang wasn’t foolish.","She knew she was just a pawn, yet she had to be deeply involved.","Just because of justice.","“Why...” Jiang Shang appeared calm on the surface, but was roaring in her heart, “Why, the","one standing beside you is not me!”"]},{"number":6092,"title":"Chapter 6092: The Final Battle Is Coming","paragraphs":["Chapter 6092: The Final Battle Is Coming","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","She stared at Hu Qing beside Jian Wushuang with cold eyes.","Resentment!","Unwillingness!","Incomprehension!","It was clearly Jian Wushuang who was at fault, so why did her most respected master stand with her enemy?","Why couldn’t her master stand by her side?","“Go!” Seeing that the timing was right, Mie Sheng casually tore open space and sent Jiang Shang out.","Swish!","Above the Sword Tomb, Jiang Shang appeared in the void, holding the divine sword in reverse.","Her hair was disheveled, her fighting spirit and hatred intertwined.","She gathered an incredibly powerful aura.","Behind her, a towering giant tree appeared.","It was the Wanliu Divine Tree!","Even Jian Wushuang was taken aback when he saw it.","“The Wanliu Divine Tree!”","He was shocked.","Upon closer inspection, it was just a phantom, and he breathed a sigh of relief.","The Wanliu Divine Tree was brought by Weiss.","Jiang Shang’s previous life was the Celestial Maiden of the Ancient Moon Spacetime and also Weiss’s disciple.","Jiang Shang should have created the Origin Source Universe and pinnacle secret technique based on the Wanliu Divine Tree.","“Hu Qing!”","According to the original arrangement, Zhen Ling shouted, “Prepare to fight!”","“Understood!” Hu Qing clasped his hands together and stepped forward without any hesitation.","The two faced each other from a distance.","Jiang Shang was filled with killing intent.","Hu Qing remained calm.","“Master!” Jiang Shang’s tone was cold, “This is my last bit of gratitude to you. From now on, we owe each other nothing!”","Hu Qing just looked at her calmly, saying nothing.","Because he didn’t know what to say!","Should he tell his disciple to let go of her hatred and not to oppose them?","Even if he died, he wouldn’t say such words.","So he chose to remain silent.","And not make the first move.","He just wanted to deal with Mie Sheng first before making any decisions.","“Jian Wushuang, you always harm those closest to you!” Seeing Hu Qing unresponsive, Jiang Shang still couldn’t bear to make the first move.","She wanted Hu Qing to strike at her first.","It was better than her striking at her master.","For the master and disciple to end up like this, it was all Jian Wushuang’s fault.","Yet now Jian Wushuang acted as if nothing had happened, hiding in the back.","Like a coward.","Without any sense of responsibility.","Jiang Shang continuously attacked Jian Wushuang with her words.","This made the powerhouses on the side of Qishen Temple feel very humiliated.","Jian Wushuang was the first Divine Lord of Qishen Temple.","Yet he was being scolded right to his face.","Even Wu Zuo couldn’t stand it anymore, coughed lightly, and persuaded, “That’s enough. Don’t forget who saved you. Now you’re opposing Qishen Temple, you traitor, you have no right to say such things!”","“Wu Zuo!” Jian Wushuang reached out to stop him and said to Jiang Shang, “What happened to your brother is my fault, I admit it. If saying these things makes you feel better, then go ahead!”","This kind of blow was like a drizzle to him.","He had seen all kinds of big scenes.","He had encountered all kinds of enemies.","Right and wrong had become increasingly insignificant to him.","Sometimes, having too many concerns led to losing far more than gaining.","Jiang Shang took a deep breath, having vented most of his hatred.","But the battle had not yet begun.","Zhen Ling was pleased to see this scene; the fewer opponents, the better.","However, Mie Sheng couldn’t sit still. He had cultivated Jiang Shang for so long and couldn’t let him be swayed by a few words!","He saw through it now; Jiang Shang was just one word away from Hu Qing.","It was very likely that there would be no fight.","This couldn’t be allowed.","Jiang Shang had great potential and was of great use to him.","He was definitely a weapon to deal with Jian Wushuang.","He was unwilling to give up just like that.","“In that case, don’t blame me!” Mie Sheng held a trace of soul power and threw it outside the Temple of World Annihilation, loudly reminding, “Jiang Shang, don’t forget how your brother died. If I succeed in creating reincarnation, I can help you resurrect your brother!”","The soul power passed through the Temple of World Annihilation, transforming into an altar.","On top of the altar, scenes of the unyielding young boy were playing out.","Struggling in a pool of blood.","His eyes held determination, unwillingness, and reluctance.","The young face.","Made Jiang Shang remember for a lifetime.","So much so that her hands were trembling.","Zhen Ling, seeing this scene, jumped and cursed, “Mie Sheng, do you have no shame, bewitching a junior? If you have the guts, come out and fight Jian Wushuang. If you lose, I’ll admit defeat!”","“Too late!”","Jiang Shang, for the sake of her relatives, could give up everything.","Fight!","The divine sword, thin as a cicada’s wing, cut through spacetime, piercing everything!","It charged straight at Hu Qing in front of her.","In the end, she made a move.","Hu Qing clasped his hands together, instantly extending them forward, displaying an invincible stance.","The powerful divine power impacted the entire lower spacetime.","Everyone in Qishen Temple gasped.","The divine power fluctuation just now exceeded 15 million.","This was a very unfamiliar number to them.","Because 5 million was already a huge number in their eyes. It was only at the moment Hu Qing made his move that they understood why Jian Wushuang and others were so confident.","Zhen Ling smiled calmly; he had long known Hu Qing’s details.","Because Hu Qing didn’t hide anything. As long as you asked, he would tell.","If it were Jian Wushuang, he wouldn’t have done this.","So Zhen Ling never asked Jian Wushuang.","After Hu Qing returned to Qishen Temple, Zhen Ling had privately asked Hu Qing about his strength.","Divine power of 15 million.","At that time, Zhen Ling was as shocked and surprised as the others now.","But also filled with joy.","With such powerful combat strength, this battle was assured.","Although Jiang Shang was at the Eighth Tribulation realm, she only had barely 10 million divine power.","She was a peak Eighth Tribulation expert, but couldn’t compare to Hu Qing.","Everyone thought Hu Qing could easily take down Jiang Shang, knowing their master-disciple relationship, there was no need to kill, just suppress her.","This was everyone’s thought.","But only Jian Wushuang saw that Hu Qing didn’t intend to fight.","One palm extended but stopped an inch away from Jiang Shang’s face.","But Jiang Shang’s divine sword pierced Hu Qing’s chest.","Directly into the divine body and Origin Source.","Hu Qing had no defense at all.","No defense, exposing his Origin Source to let others attack.","Although Jiang Shang’s strength couldn’t compare to Hu Qing’s, without any defense, he was still seriously injured, with a trace of blood spilling from his mouth.","Hu Qing looked at Jiang Shang foolishly, just like before, “Do you know why I never persuaded you from beginning to end?”","“Why?” Jiang Shang’s gaze was cold, not giving up because of Hu Qing’s mercy, divine power continuously pouring in, constantly destroying Hu Qing’s Origin Source.","“Because I don’t want you to live in guilt in the future, so only one of us can live!”","If he died today, Jiang Shang would also die under Jian Wushuang’s sword.","It was better to let her understand everything!","Thinking of this, Hu Qing, regardless of his shattered Origin Source, forcibly increased his divine power.","“Hu Qing!” In the distance, Jian Wushuang’s gaze flashed, knowing Hu Qing’s intention, wanting to make a move.","He wasn’t worried about Hu Qing, but about Jiang Shang."]},{"number":6093,"title":"Chapter 6093: Must Kill","paragraphs":["Chapter 6093: Must Kill","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He saw through it.","Hu Qing truly intended to kill Jiang Shang this time.","This was not the illusion of Babidi.","Jiang Shang would truly fall.","The kind from which there was no resurrection!","The karma of Jiang Shang was originally sown by him.","Only he could resolve it.","He couldn’t let Hu Qing bear it alone.","So he had to intervene.","But it was too late.","Hu Qing’s palm had already touched Jiang Shang’s forehead.","A circular shockwave spread instantly, a palm strike with the force of ten thousand divine powers.","Enough to annihilate Jiang Shang in one blow.","Boom!","Jiang Shang’s body flew backward, falling.","His Origin Source and divine body shattered completely.","Even the Wanliu Divine Tree behind him collapsed at that moment.","In the Temple of World Annihilation.","“Broly, it’s your turn now!” Mie Sheng was indifferent to Jiang Shang’s defeat, showing no emotion, as if nothing had happened.","This made Broly very curious. Mie Sheng valued Jiang Shang the most, yet his Origin Source shattered, on the brink of falling, and Mie Sheng remained so indifferent.","Broly couldn’t help but ask curiously, “She’s fallen, aren’t you worried...”","“Worried about what?” Mie Sheng turned his head to look at Broly and said calmly, “Worried that you might fall too?”","Although Jiang Shang had fallen, Broly showed no sign of tension, instead, his fighting spirit grew stronger. He wasn’t afraid at all. Facing Mie Sheng’s words, he snorted coldly, “I will not lose!”","“Haha, I believe you. Take this Ling Crystal. If you are outmatched, crush it. Consider it a little help from me!” Mie Sheng tossed a black Ling Crystal to Broly. “Don’t waste it. It will be a testament to your finest hour!”","Originally, Broly wanted to be stubborn, but he didn’t refuse and caught the Ling Crystal. Without saying a word, he struck out, shattering the space of the Temple of World Annihilation and charged out.","Above the Sword Tomb.","Dragging his exhausted body, Hu Qing returned to the team, looking a bit desolate.","Because Jiang Shang had truly fallen this time.","Even her Origin Source had returned to the Temple of World Annihilation.","It was over.","The torment had ended.","All the guilt fell upon him.","From now on, he would be melancholy for life.","Living in pain.","This was a scene Jian Wushuang didn’t want to see.","If he had known, he would have acted himself.","At worst, let Hu Qing hate him for a lifetime, rather than let Hu Qing live in guilt.","“Hu Qing!”","“I’m fine!” Hu Qing forced a smile, shaking his head.","Anyone could see that he wasn’t fine.","Moreover, it was a knot in his heart that would be hard to untie for a lifetime.","“Back then, the Heavenly Maiden told me that she had made peace with herself. I don’t know how long it will take for me to make peace with myself!” Hu Qing smiled bitterly, sitting cross-legged and slowly closing his eyes.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, clenching his fists.","He blamed everything on Mie Sheng.","After devouring Mie Sheng’s Death power, he would seek Danbao’s help. He might still be able to revive Jiang Shang and her brother.","But it would take a long time.","Now, Danbao had no time, and he had not yet defeated Mie Sheng.","However, it could be considered his future goal.","Even if there were still strong enemies waiting for him on the Realm God Continent, debts were nothing new!","Swoosh!","Space trembled.","Cracks appeared in the mountain range below that had been frozen for countless eons.","A tall figure appeared in the void above the Sword Tomb.","Broly!","The last of the two strongest in the Temple of World Annihilation.","Jiang Shang had been casually dealt with by Hu Qing.","No one paid much attention to Broly.","Even though Jian Wushuang thought there was something about him, he didn’t pay much attention.","He had been waiting for Mie Sheng.","Now that Broly had appeared.","Mie Sheng would probably come out soon.","“Wu Zuo, it’s your turn!” Zhen Ling turned to Wu Zuo with a faint smile. “Don’t disappoint me, finish the fight quickly!”","Broly’s divine power was far inferior to Jiang Shang’s.","Moreover, he was merely a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulations.","The show-off Wu Zuo had long revealed all his secrets to Zhen Ling, knowing his divine power exceeded 8 million.","Dealing with a Broly was an effortless task.","Wu Zuo glanced at Hu Qing, feeling that the previous battle had been too sorrowful, so he thought to lighten the atmosphere. He moved his shoulders and neck in a very practiced manner, shook his wrists, and said indifferently, “Give me the time of one incense stick, and I will show you what divine power truly is!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he flashed and appeared before Broly.","“It’s you?” Broly didn’t expect Wu Zuo to be the one fighting, feeling that Qishen Temple was looking down on him. He roared in anger, and his divine power instantly soared to 5 million.","Leaping forward, he swung his fist at Wu Zuo.","Wu Zuo remained calm, neither dodging nor evading. At the moment Broly’s fist approached, he lifted his leg and kicked Broly’s face hard, sending him flying into the mountain below with just one kick.","With that kick, he only used 5 million divine power, but his technique overpowered Broly’s brute force punch.","Broly crashed into several towering mountains before coming to a stop.","“Not worth a fight!” Wu Zuo crossed his arms and looked down disdainfully at Broly who had fallen into the mountains. He then looked up at the Temple of World Annihilation and said, “Mie Sheng, why don’t you come and fight me so I can use seventy percent of my divine power? Otherwise, this is too...”","Before he finished speaking, a wild beast awoke amidst the shattered ice in the mountains.","Broly’s eyes turned red, his aura changed, he clenched his fists, and roared to the sky, “Ah!!!!!”","In that moment, his divine power began to surge.","From 5 million, it directly soared to 7 million.","Once again, he leaped into the air and charged at Wu Zuo.","“Wu Zuo, finish this quickly!” Jian Wushuang was somewhat worried and reminded him.","He knew how troublesome Broly could be.","Back then, Broly’s continuous increase in divine power had given him a headache.","If he hadn’t mastered the true essence of spacetime in advance, he might not have defeated Broly.","After all, Broly could withstand his strongest sword strike at the time.","Broly’s strength was definitely on par with Jiang Shang.","Even at the Seventh Tribulation level, he couldn’t be underestimated.","Unfortunately, Wu Zuo didn’t listen!","Seeing Broly’s strength increase excited him even more, and he willingly entered the mountain of swords for close combat with Broly.","But this time, Wu Zuo became serious.","He directly unleashed his peak state, 8 million divine power, continuously overpowering and beating Broly.","It could be said he was utterly crushing his opponent.","“Impressive!” Zhen Ling couldn’t help but praise.","Wu Zuo had grown too quickly.","In the blink of an eye, he had become so powerful.","8 million divine power might sound unimpressive, but in action, it was shocking.","Even at his peak, Qishen wasn’t this strong.","Even though Qishen cultivated Origin Source, his divine power conversion couldn’t match Wu Zuo’s.","Wu Zuo could rank in the top three among the Seventh Tribulation in the entire North Spacetime.","Naturally, he was much stronger than Qishen back then.","As for the first place, that of course belonged to Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":6094,"title":"Chapter 6094: Defeat Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 6094: Defeat Him","A Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation level could unleash a divine power of up to twenty million.","If it weren’t for the limitations of the Northern Spacetime, it could be even stronger.","“This Broly is really tough. Despite such intense attacks, his divine power hasn’t diminished!” Shang couldn’t help but exclaim. “Is the path of transformation he cultivates really that powerful?”","At this moment, the others also realized that despite Broly being continuously beaten, his divine power hadn’t decreased.","On the contrary, it was continually getting stronger.","By now, Wu Zuo’s power had begun to wane.","He had been fighting with all his might for more than the time it takes to burn a stick of incense, yet the battle was still unresolved.","This was somewhat unusual.","“Should I go help him?” Wutian, sensing something was amiss, glanced at Zhen Ling, seeking approval from this nominal leader.","Zhen Ling took a deep breath, growing impatient, and waved his hand, signaling, “Go ahead, it’s a good opportunity for you to practice as well!”","“Wait!” Jian Wushuang stopped Wutian from making a move and turned to Zhen Ling, saying, “It’s no use sending more people now.”","This was because Broly’s divine power had changed once again.","It had already matched Wu Zuo’s.","8 million!","And now, it was no longer a one-sided crush.","Broly was counterattacking.","Wu Zuo was even starting to struggle, his divine power steadily decreasing.","He was being surpassed by Broly.","Boom!","Caught off guard, Broly’s punch landed on Wu Zuo’s face, sending him crashing into the mountains.","Climbing out from the frozen, rigid rubble, Wu Zuo felt a pang of panic.","Just moments ago, he could easily dodge Broly’s punches, but now he couldn’t avoid them. Moreover, the power behind those punches surpassed his own.","“Damn it, this lunatic doesn’t have any advanced secret techniques. How can he be this strong?”","He was a direct disciple of the Realm King, having received numerous inheritances and even visited the Realm God Continent.","Among the Seventh Tribulation level, besides Jian Wushuang, no one else could claim to suppress him.","Even Wutian, who had fallen into the Nether Hell, didn’t exert this much pressure on him.","Yet now, facing a junior he once looked down upon, he found himself at a disadvantage. This was a blow to his pride.","“Realm King’s Power!”","He boosted his divine power once more, directly employing the Realm King’s secret technique.","His divine power surged to 9 million.","This was his limit.","Wutian, who had been restrained, couldn’t help but speak up, “Did you know Wu Zuo had another trump card?”","“No!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, then asserted, “Wu Zuo won’t win, neither of you can win!”","“How is that possible?” Wutian didn’t doubt Jian Wushuang’s insight, but he doubted Broly’s capability.","“Nothing is impossible. Broly is a lunatic who can give people infinite fantasies. Just watch!” Jian Wushuang crossed his arms, observing quietly.","When Broly had his second outburst, Jian Wushuang could tell that Broly still had a vast reserve of power within him.","His limit could reach at least 13 million.","Only he and Hu Qing could deal with him.","He was merely giving Wu Zuo face by not stepping in immediately.","However, he kept 30 percent of his Thought energy focused on Broly. If Broly exceeded Wu Zuo’s control, he would intervene at once.","But for now, Wu Zuo hadn’t shown his true strength.","He hadn’t even used the Realm King Fist yet.","But it would happen soon.","Jian Wushuang’s feet sank into the ground as he clenched his fists, his body bursting with a red glow. He shouted, “Realm King Fist!”","With a dragon’s roar, his figure instantly appeared behind Broly, launching a double-fisted strike directly at Broly’s sturdy back.","Boom!","Broly staggered, almost falling, and roared in pain. He turned around and opened his huge mouth, from which a destructive beam shot out.","Unable to dodge in time, Jian Wushuang had to brace himself to withstand the attack.","He pushed through the destructive beam and struck again.","The Realm King Fist continuously pounded Broly’s divine body.","Jian Wushuang was in a complete frenzy.","But in doing so, his divine power was rapidly depleting.","However, Broly’s divine power showed no change.","It neither decreased nor increased.","He was like an indestructible puppet.","No matter how much effort Jian Wushuang put in, it was to no avail.","Bang!","At close range, Jian Wushuang used divine power with one palm to push Broly back thousands","of miles, but his own body weakened.","Even though he wanted to save face, he felt exhausted, almost collapsing.","Looking towards the direction of the Qishen Temple, he gasped and shouted, “Brother Wushuang, quickly... give me some power of all things, I’m almost there!”","“Sigh!” Zhen Ling covered his face, thinking about Jian Wushuang’s earlier boasting and feeling embarrassed.","Jian Wushuang moved and landed on the mountain of the Sword Tomb. He didn’t look at Jian Wushuang, but gazed at Broly in the distance, calmly saying, “Here you go!”","He casually condensed a ball of the power of all things and tossed it to Jian Wushuang below.","Pfft!","Jian Wushuang caught it with his divine body, instantly absorbing it.","His divine power was restored to its peak in an instant.","9 million divine power exploded, and he wanted to strike again.","“Brother Wushuang!” Jian Wushuang finally looked down at Jian Wushuang and shouted,","“It’s better if you don’t come down. If you do, my hands will itch. Why don’t you let me take","over for a bit...”","The clever Jian Wushuang understood Jian Wushuang’s meaning. He was giving him a way","out.","The recent battle had almost made him vomit.","He had long wanted someone to take over.","He asked Jian Wushuang for the power of all things just to have Jian Wushuang help him.","But he was concerned about his pride and couldn’t ask directly.","So he pretended to be low on divine power and asked Jian Wushuang for the power of all","things.","Now that there was an out, he put on an embarrassed expression and sighed, “Only you, anyone else and I wouldn’t give up this credit, but we’re brothers, after all!”","“Then thank you!” Jian Wushuang could only cooperate with Jian Wushuang’s act, pretending","he was taking a great advantage.","Jian Wushuang adjusted his disheveled yellow robe, slowly ascended, and waved to Jian Wushuang, nonchalantly saying, “We’re all on the same side, no need to be so polite. Broly’s barely hanging on, one punch will take him down!”","“Ahem!” Zhen Ling covered his mouth and coughed dryly, even he felt Jian Wushuang was","being too shameless.","Everyone present, even the Universe Masters in the Sixth Tribulation, could see Jian","Wushuang was already outmatched.","Yet he still wanted to save face.","Who was he trying to fool?","Did he think he could deceive Mie Sheng?","Jian Wushuang, however, with a calm expression, returned to the ranks. Fortunately, he didn’t","boast about himself.","Jian Wushuang, who stayed below, agreed with Jian Wushuang’s last sentence.","One move to defeat the opponent.","Broly couldn’t be allowed to grow any further.","Even to preserve Jian Wushuang’s dignity, he had to succeed in one strike."]},{"number":6095,"title":"Chapter 6095: Power of Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 6095: Power of Death","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Clang!","He even drew his sword.","The blue blade was pulled out from behind.","“You are a puppet of death, so let death end you!”","Draw the sword, strike, and return to the sheath!","It was done in one fluid motion.","A black sword shadow descended from the sky.","Countless death energies fell, invading Broly’s divine body.","This sword was very ordinary.","Ordinary enough that no one felt anything was amiss, and it had already been executed.","Even Mie Sheng was very surprised, but he was astonished that Jian Wushuang had mastered the power of Death to this extent.","Broly faced the sword shadow without fear and used his hands to catch it.","He intended to resist it head-on.","However, Mie Sheng transmitted a reminder: “Dodge!”","“Can you dodge this sword strike?” Jian Wushuang sneered, his hands behind his back.","He waited quietly for Broly’s fall and Mie Sheng’s appearance.","In his view, this was destined.","But Broly, he just didn’t believe it.","He caught the Death sword shadow steadily with both hands.","But this was just the beginning.","The sword shadow continuously wrapped around Broly.","That was Death dragging him.","Once he got pulled in, he would truly die.","“Ahhh!!!!!”","Broly also felt unprecedented pressure, constantly roaring to increase his divine power, to withstand this sword strike.","Although Jian Wushuang did not use the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation,","his current basic divine power, combined with the Tribulation Armor, was already tens of millions.","Using the Origin Source of Sword Dao, it surpassed 15 million divine power.","His basic divine power, due to the Tribulation Armor, was around 10 million.","However, his basic Origin Source, if converted to divine power, would definitely exceed 15 million.","And this was the Sword of Death.","Containing the power of Death.","Even a practitioner with 15 million divine power couldn’t withstand this sword.","He didn’t believe Broly could withstand it.","The opponent had reached his limit.","He would soon fall.","But Broly’s next action shocked everyone.","Including Mie Sheng.","In his complete madness, Broly forgot to use the Black Ling Crystal that Mie Sheng had given him.","His mind was full of crushing the death sword shadow in front of him.","Unknowingly, his divine power broke through 10 million.","Quickly reaching as much as 15 million.","Far beyond Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","And exceeding Mie Sheng’s predictions.","This was a pleasant surprise.","If Broly used the Black Ling Crystal, Mie Sheng wouldn’t be surprised!","Because that was his accumulation over the years, all in the Black Ling Crystal.","According to his plan, after Broly used the Black Ling Crystal, no matter what powerful opportunities and inheritances Jian Wushuang obtained, he would fall today and be devoured by Mie Sheng.","“How is this possible?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened, staring at Broly in disbelief.","The opponent had given him countless surprises!","The Sword of Death was actually blocked.","And blocked head-on.","This time, it even sparked his fighting spirit.","The fighting spirit came from Broly.","“Hurry, crush the crystal!” Mie Sheng didn’t take it lightly and reminded Broly again through transmission.","Blocking didn’t mean winning.","The Sword of Death wasn’t broken, just holding it like this wasn’t a solution!","Could he just hold it forever?","Did he think Jian Wushuang was a fool?","Seeing Broly’s potential so great, Jian Wushuang’s killing intent had long been ignited.","And it was very firm.","One Shang Jiang already caused him a huge headache, he couldn’t have another Broly.","At this moment, Broly, regaining a bit of consciousness, also thought of the Black Ling Crystal and hurriedly took it out from his body.","At this time, Jian Wushuang also rushed over, his speed surpassing time.","He wanted to take the opportunity to kill Broly.","Especially when he saw the Black Ling Crystal.","But he was still a step too slow.","Just as he took out the Black Ling Crystal, Broly crushed it without hesitation.","Buzz!","A powerful aura erupted instantly, and Jian Wushuang, who had not yet approached Broly, was directly repelled.","The power came from the Black Ling Crystal.","And this power was very familiar to Jian Wushuang.","It was the power of Death.","The death power of those practitioners from the downstream spacetime.","Endless resentment and death gathered into a mass and entered Broly’s body.","The black armor that originally wrapped around his entire body shattered, revealing his sturdy chest and countless scars.","“Ah!” Broly shouted uncontrollably, and the last trace of his consciousness disappeared due to the Black Ling Crystal.","Without resisting the Sword of Death, Broly easily absorbed the Death power within the Sword of Death into his divine body.","Death!","Death Broly!","This made Jian Wushuang think of Chi Jiuxiao.","Also a madman, like Broly.","An incredibly terrifying madman.","A madman with divine power exceeding 30 million.","But when he had encountered that madman before, there were Divine Wood King, the Great Monk, and Danbao to hold him back.","This time, encountering the same kind of madman, there was no one to help him.","“Can’t delay anymore!” Jian Wushuang wanted to take advantage of Broly’s madness to solve him. He roared angrily and directly unleashed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","His divine power instantly exploded to 20 million.","He struck instantly.","Taking advantage of the fact that Broly had not fully absorbed the Death power, he aimed to end Broly’s life.","But when he rushed over, he found that he couldn’t even break through the Death shield around Broly’s body.","“How is this possible?” Zhen Ling was dumbfounded at the sight.","A moment ago, they had the absolute advantage, and in an instant, Broly had become so strong.","Now, Jian Wushuang’s aura was hard for him to see through.","It surpassed his understanding.","Yet, he still couldn’t directly defeat Broly.","Seeing the aura on Broly, Hu Qing opened his eyes and exclaimed, “It’s the power of those practitioners from the Temple of World Annihilation. No wonder I couldn’t find their Origin Source, they had gone to the Temple of World Annihilation.”","“What?” Wu Zuo exclaimed, “How can this be? Can Mie Sheng even manipulate the Origin Source of the downstream spacetime?”","“Not manipulation, but isolation, just like the Lord of Decay, Berut!” Hu Qing said calmly, “This is very simple for some gods. The Origin Source of the Northern Spacetime is vulnerable in the eyes of the gods!”","Though disheartening, it was the truth.","Berut could do it, and so could Mie Sheng.","The Realm King candidate Zamasu could also do it.","Northern Spacetime was like a plaything in the eyes of those great figures.","“What should we do now?” Zhen Ling was a bit flustered.","He didn’t understand what Wu Zuo and Hu Qing were talking about, but he could understand that now they couldn’t even solve Broly, let alone the unseen Mie Sheng.","Hu Qing stood up slowly and comforted him, “Don’t worry, Brother Wushuang’s strength is not as simple as you think!”","Indeed!","Jian Wushuang’s strength was far more than this.","At worst, he could use the Divine Domain.","Moreover, no matter how strong Broly was, he couldn’t break through the limit carried by the Northern Spacetime.","Both had 20 million divine power.","Jian Wushuang was not inferior to anyone.","So, he waited for Broly to fuse."]},{"number":6096,"title":"Chapter 6096: Fierce","paragraphs":["Chapter 6096: Fierce","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In any case, he couldn’t break through the opponent’s Death Shield.","The powerful power of Death had completely transformed Broly into a puppet of the afterlife.","Broly’s hair had turned a pale green.","Outside his divine body, there was a dark shield with some arcs of lightning flickering.","He had completely absorbed the power of Death and fully mastered it.","The current Broly was the true God of Death.","“Haha!” In the Temple of World Annihilation, Mie Sheng, alone, laughed madly, “Prepare to welcome death, mortals!”","Crack!","Broly slowly walked towards Jian Wushuang, each step crushing the ice stones that had been frozen for endless ages, the sound piercingly sharp.","On the opponent, Jian Wushuang felt the same sense of oppression as before.","He sheathed the Wanjie Sword.","This time, he intended to use divine power to defeat divine power.","“Ah!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fists, raising his divine power to the utmost, shouting, “Ha!”","By this time, Broly had also reached him.","The arcs of electricity on their divine bodies collided.","One tall, one short.","But their four eyes met.","And the distance between them was very close.","Only one foot apart.","They stared at each other, not knowing what they were waiting for.","The surroundings were eerily silent.","The sound of a fragment of rock cracking on the mountain could be heard clearly.","The strong ones from Zhen Ling and Qishen Temple watched this scene, holding their breath, not daring to blink, fearing they might miss the most spectacular duel between the two super strong ones.","“Whew!”","At the moment when his chest rose and fell, Jian Wushuang struck first.","He leaned back and punched, hitting Broly solidly in the abdomen.","This punch made Broly bend over.","Seizing the opportunity, Jian Wushuang kneed Broly in the face, the fierce blow kicking Broly into the air.","His figure flashed, surpassing the speed of the flying Broly, and just as Broly was about to stabilize himself, Jian Wushuang delivered a heavy double-fisted strike, slamming Broly into the ground.","This time, the entire Sword Tomb shattered.","Beneath the ice was a continuous flow of scorching lava.","The Sword Tomb turned into hell.","He unleashed a series of full-force attacks without holding back.","Divine power was brought to its extreme.","However, Broly, who had fallen into the lava, rose slowly as if nothing had happened, glanced up at Jian Wushuang, the corner of his mouth curling into what seemed like a sneer.","Jian Wushuang licked his lips, gathering abundant divine power in his hands, continuously unleashing blue beams that rained down from the sky, striking Broly below.","He refused to believe that his divine power could lose to one of the same level.","In truth, he and Broly were not of the same level.","Because the death power Broly had absorbed was equivalent to sacrificing himself.","Though he appeared strong now, he wouldn’t live much longer.","The opponent was not like Chi Jiuxiao, who had fully activated the Heart of Death; he only appeared to be.","Boom!","The violent noise shattered the spacetime of the Sword Tomb, turning the place into scorched earth.","All the power was shattered by Jian Wushuang’s divine power.","It was imaginable how powerful his recent outburst had been.","Even the Eternal Beings could hardly withstand it, and if they did, they would be severely injured.","The blood-colored lava surged backward, sweeping through the void.","It completely covered Broly.","As the lava gradually dissipated, Broly’s figure emerged from it.","Unscathed!","“How is this possible?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. The recent attack had no effect at all.","Over at Qishen Temple, Zhen Ling was holding his head in his hands, deep in thought.","He could not understand how a former Half-Step Seventh Tribulation like Mie Sheng could cultivate such a monster.","It was one thing for Jian Wushuang to defy the heavens. When he was at Qishen Temple, he was just an Emperor. His current strength was due to what he learned in the upstream spacetime.","How could Broly be so defiant as well?","Among the group of Inheritors back then, Broly was not one from the Grave God Mountain. Zhen Ling had not paid attention to him until he was captured by Mie Sheng and later realized his unusual potential, comparable to Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","This later proved his thoughts correct.","However, since Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing returned, he felt Broly could at most suppress Shang but was entirely different compared to Jian Wushuang or Hu Qing.","Now, he was proven wrong.","“Hu Qing, I feel something is wrong. Can you go help?” Zhen Ling turned to Hu Qing. Although his strength was not impressive, he had vision. Just now, even though Jian Wushuang did not draw his sword, the divine power he displayed was at its limit.","Yet, it did not hurt Broly in the slightest.","The other party absorbed that Death power and had not even made a move yet. What if he completely suppressed Jian Wushuang?","Now, the heavy burden of Qishen Temple rested on Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing. Nothing could go wrong.","Hu Qing also did not expect Broly to be so powerful.","He initially thought they could secure victory this time.","So, when he fought Jiang Shang, he wasted a lot of divine power and was now severely injured. His fundamental divine power remained, but he could no longer manifest his future self.","He could not help Jian Wushuang.","“Your injury?” Zhen Ling noticed Hu Qing’s pale face and quickly asked, “How long until your injury recovers? I still have some Life force...”","Hu Qing shook his head, “It’s useless. My current divine power cannot be restored with ordinary Life force!”","“We still need to give Brother Wushuang some confidence!” Wu Zuo stepped forward at this moment and comforted, “Although we can’t defeat Broly, he may not necessarily be able to defeat Wushuang either, there’s no need...”","Before he could finish speaking.","Broly, suspended above the scorching lava, had already made his move.","His divine power stirred the lava below, instantly creating huge waves that rose with his aura.","“Jian Wushuang!!!”","The low roar made the entire downstream spacetime tremble.","Jian Wushuang’s figure above was somewhat unstable, feeling an unprecedented sense of oppression gathering.","“Hmph!” He snorted coldly and advanced.","No one could help him now.","He could only face it alone.","Moreover, he had trump cards and backup plans.","No matter how powerful Broly was, he could not shake him.","But others did not know this!","In the battle with Broly, Jian Wushuang gradually fell into a disadvantage.","At the beginning of the fight, he could still hold his ground.","Later, Broly grew stronger with each fight, seemingly having endless divine power in his body that he could not release, breaking through limits time and again.","Although it was only 20 million divine power, it could burst out with the power of 25 million divine power.","It shook Jian Wushuang to the brink of collapse.","Broly’s punches were solid and extremely fierce.","Moreover, it was a kind of reckless fierceness, disregarding his own attacks, exposing his flaws to deliver the strongest blows.","Yet Jian Wushuang could not even break his defense.","He could only withstand Broly’s onslaught.","Bang! Bang! Bang!"]},{"number":6097,"title":"Chapter 6097: Drawing Sword","paragraphs":["Chapter 6097: Drawing Sword","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Broly continuously unleashed three extremely heavy fist shadows, rushing straight towards him.","The terrifying power tore through the space.","Even the tributary of this spacetime began to shatter.","The desolation on the other side began to break apart.","Jian Wushuang frowned, raised his hands to shield himself, and explosively released his energy.","“Starry Sky Dao Arena !”","He looked up and roared angrily, forcibly blocking the three fist shadows Broly unleashed.","But as a result, his divine body was shattered, and his chest began to cave in.","A surge of blood rose to his heart.","Pfft!","This time, he couldn’t hold it back and spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Damn it, how is his divine power still so strong!” Jian Wushuang cursed silently as he wiped the corner of his mouth. They had been fighting for almost a whole day, yet Broly’s divine power showed no signs of weakening.","How could he continue fighting?","His divine power was infinite to ordinary people.","But compared to this freak Broly, he was almost at his limit.","Fortunately, he had prepared enough, but that was meant for Mie Sheng.","He hadn’t even seen a shadow of Mie Sheng, yet Broly had consumed a significant amount of his primordial stones and the power of All Things.","This couldn’t continue.","He had to consider whether this was his strongest battle upon returning.","If not, he needed to make a quick decision.","He had to resolve the opponent swiftly.","Dragging it out any longer would be detrimental to him.","Moreover, Hu Qing was severely injured and couldn’t help him.","Clang!","After much hesitation, he finally chose to draw his sword.","The ice-blue blade pointed directly at Broly.","“Originally, you were not qualified to make me draw my sword... I don’t know if it’s your luck or my impatience...” Jian Wushuang crossed his arms, holding the Wanjie Sword, and passed through.","“Are you ready to face it?”","The strongest ultimate skill, the strongest secret technique.","Starry Sky Chronicles!","The frenzied Broly was stunned for a moment, tilted his head slightly, and without even looking directly at Jian Wushuang, he turned and rushed over again.","Clearly, he didn’t care about such verbal provocations!","“Ha!” Jian Wushuang was amused by Broly’s actions.","And amused by himself.","What was the point of talking to a madman?","Just fight directly.","“Double Sword!”","“Slash!”","One hand represented Death, the other Life.","The Wanjie Sword split into two, the twin swords crossed in front of him. Jian Wushuang transformed into a streak of light, instantly piercing through the onrushing Broly.","Even the spacetime was cleaved open.","“Whoosh!” He let out a light breath, the twin swords merged into one, held casually behind him.","He turned silently, looking at Broly.","The twin swords could even slash through the void, that was the power of the Starry Sky.","It transcended spacetime.","The brilliance of the twin swords made Mie Sheng feel a bit ashamed.","“The power of the Starry Sky, he has actually mastered it to this extent!” Mie Sheng frowned. He was a Starry Sky God, naturally also possessing the power of the Starry Sky.","Rooted in Death, he could also unleash a powerful Starry Sky power.","But currently, compared to Jian Wushuang, he was inferior.","If they were in the Starry Sky, Jian Wushuang naturally wouldn’t be much.","But this was the Northern Spacetime.","His Death power was suppressed, let alone the Starry Sky power.","“No wonder I couldn’t see through his future, or even alter it!” Mie Sheng’s eyes shifted, at this moment he felt a sense of unease.","That unease came from Jian Wushuang’s potential.","Broly was a variable to Jian Wushuang.","But Jian Wushuang was also a variable to Mie Sheng.","He suddenly vanished, and upon his return, had reached the pinnacle combat power of the Northern Spacetime.","“Fine, it’s better that I don’t need to suppress my strength anymore!”","When the time came, he could devour Jian Wushuang’s Life power in his peak state.","This would skip the growth steps ahead.","Allowing him to forge the cycle of reincarnation, returning to the position of Starry Sky God once more.","“Huh?” A familiar aura was spying on him.","Mie Sheng turned and shouted outside the hall, “Shan Jun, aren’t you going to check on your esteemed disciple?”","“Hehehe...” After a strange noise, an evil figure walked into the hall, the figure itself like an abyss, carrying devour.","It was Shan Jun.","Over the years, Mie Sheng had gathered all the other devouring demons.","Helping Shan Jun return to the level of the devouring demon lord.","Back then, Qishen’s Dao split into three, forming Shan Jun, Mo Jun, and Gu Jun.","And Shan Jun split into five, Shan Jun himself plus Ten-Thousand Demon, Wind Demon, Blood Demon, and Heart Demon.","“I’m not his master, I just thought he had the potential to inherit the Dao of Devour!” Shan Jun shook his head silently.","Mie Sheng snorted at this, coldly saying, “In that case, there’s even more reason not to hold back!”","“Do you think I have the luxury of holding back?” Shan Jun replied with a bitter smile.","He was now merely at the ordinary Seventh Tribulation level.","Even after devouring Mo Jun, he was at most the peak of the Seventh Tribulation level.","There was still Gu Jun trapped in the Qishen Temple, unable to be extracted all these years.","Back then, Zhen Ling had captured Shang and Luo, intending to exchange them for Gu Jun and Heart Demon.","But Zhen Ling refused to agree to the exchange, even at the cost of his life.","Finally, after much wrangling, they managed to exchange the lives of Shang and Luo for only the Heart Demon.","Afterward, Qishen Temple completely retreated, and the plan to extract Gu Jun was shelved.","Regarding this matter, Mie Sheng remained calm, not even looking at Shan Jun, and said firmly, “Don’t underestimate yourself, we still have a chance, and a significant one at that.”","“Tsk tsk, except for Hu Qing’s plan being relatively complete, you have already lost control over Jian Wushuang!” Shan Jun shook his head with a bitter smile, “You abandoned Jiang Shang too early, and Hu Qing’s threat isn’t as great as you think!”","Hearing Shan Jun’s last sentence, Mie Sheng frowned, slowly turned his head, his gaze cold, and said lowly, “You know nothing. Jian Wushuang is a variable, I can’t see his future, but I can see my own. I have a chance of winning against Jian Wushuang, but against Hu Qing, I’ve seen my own defeat!”","“So Jiang Shang must die, and he must die at Hu Qing’s hands. Bet everything on Broly, only then can we win, and you can survive through the Dao of Devour, returning to the Starry Sky with me, as a revived cultivator. Do you understand?” Mie Sheng’s voice carried anger; forging the cycle of reincarnation was his inner demon.","Traversing time, going to the future countless times, just for this moment.","Returning countless times in the past, yet failing to prevent defeat.","No one could shake his determination.","This was his closest attempt to success.","He must seize it.","Shan Jun clenched his fist, feeling angry, but all of this was his choice, he couldn’t blame anyone else.","The previous words were actually spoken to himself.","Just making peace with himself.","Watching the Qishen Temple’s lineage rise to glory again, contending with the God of Death.","While he, for the sake of survival, stood on the opposing side.","It was a form of torment.","Outside.","Jian Wushuang held the divine sword backward, turning to look at Broly.","“I thought you were invincible!” He raised his eyebrows, revealing a smile.","The two swords just now, although they hadn’t diminished Broly’s divine body, had broken through his Death Shield."]},{"number":6098,"title":"Chapter 6098: Reincarnation Sword","paragraphs":["Chapter 6098: Reincarnation Sword","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A single sword strike to kill might not be possible.","But what about 100 sword strikes, or 10,000 sword strikes?","Can you withstand them?","Broly, having been struck by the previous sword, was momentarily stunned. Shaking his head to clear his mind, he failed to realize that the previous strike had already threatened him. He charged towards Jian Wushuang once again.","Like a wild beast gone mad, he wanted to tear Jian Wushuang apart.","“Life and Death intertwined, Reincarnation never ceases!”","Jian Wushuang took his stance, raising the Wanjie Sword.","The Reincarnation Sword was gradually forming.","This sword was a hundred times, a thousand times more powerful than the previous Twin Swords Slash.","It was enough to drive Mie Sheng mad.","But Jian Wushuang condensed it into a single sword of cold light.","“Reincarnation Sword!”","Boom!!!!","The violent power of the Starry Sky wrote a tragic tale on the ground.","The aura spread, directly shaking Broly back.","The Reincarnation Sword followed through.","Sweeping everything, it aimed to shatter Broly.","This was the power of Reincarnation.","Caught within it, Broly could not control his retreat, his entire body entering the core of the Reincarnation Sword Strike.","Thousands of swords floated overhead.","The wind carried a chill.","Ice-blue blades hung high.","Broly felt that chill.","“Die!”","Jian Wushuang lightly uttered a word.","It was like a decree within the cycle of reincarnation, directly pronouncing the opponent’s death.","In reality, that was exactly what it meant.","Broly’s form began to distort.","The power of Death could not withstand the judgment of reincarnation.","“Ha!” Unwilling, Broly swung his hand, trying to crush those blades, but when he touched them, his divine body was cut open, and his divine power instantly dropped.","But the whirlpool of reincarnation grew smaller and smaller, ultimately aiming to completely shatter him.","At this moment, everyone stared at Broly, especially Zhen Ling, whose eyes widened, eagerly anticipating Broly’s fall.","“Just a bit more, hurry!” Zhen Ling couldn’t help but urge Broly’s death.","Wu Zuo was also very excited, “I told you Jian Wushuang could do it, this Broly will certainly fall today, not even Death can save him.”","Initially, he had been anxious to seek help from Realm King, but seeing Jian Wushuang gaining the upper hand, he ignored Realm King’s voice transmission.","“Jian Wushuang!” Shang looked at the once junior, now a towering figure, and felt a mix of emotions.","He once thought that one day he would bear the banner of the Qishen Temple.","Unexpectedly, as the Inheritor of the Qishen Temple, he ended up being merely a bystander.","He didn’t even have the ability to participate in the battle.","The powerful aura spread, and it wasn’t that he didn’t have the ability to participate, but he couldn’t even get close.","Luo also felt a bit of disappointment, but like Shang, she still held respect for Jian Wushuang.","In the past, when Zhen Ling spoke of Jian Wushuang, she felt somewhat unconvinced.","She thought she was the protagonist of this era.","Today, seeing Jian Wushuang’s peak combat power, she was completely convinced.","The Reincarnation Sword, carrying the chessboard of everyone, completely devoured and shattered Broly, sending him into a rift in spacetime.","They won!","Everyone cheered.","Even Hu Qing revealed a slight smile.","Dongsheng and Wanyan even jumped up directly.","“Ahem!” At this moment, Zhen Ling pretended to be calm and said, “What are you all doing? Mie Sheng hasn’t come out yet. Don’t think that Jian Wushuang has destroyed the Temple of World Annihilation!”","Indeed, it wasn’t time to relax yet.","There was still the threat of Mie Sheng.","They couldn’t be careless!","Seeing Zhen Ling speak, everyone quieted down.","But below, Jian Wushuang still didn’t relax his brow.","Because...","He could still feel the Death Origin Source returning to the Temple of World Annihilation.","Buzz!","The Temple of World Annihilation emitted a buzzing sound, and then the entire hall trembled.","The death power that had returned gathered once again within the Temple of World Annihilation, reconstituting Broly’s true form.","Swoosh!","Broly, carrying an oppressive aura, walked out of the Temple of World Annihilation, reappearing in front of everyone.","“Tsk!” Broly tilted his head, looking at Jian Wushuang with disdain.","The people of the Qishen Temple felt their scalps tingling and their backs chilled when they saw this scene.","They couldn’t believe that Broly was still alive.","He hadn’t fallen?","Was he invincible?","He simply couldn’t be killed!","“Hu Qing, Hu Qing!” Zhen Ling turned to look at Hu Qing, urgently saying, “Quickly deduce Broly’s weaknesses!”","Hu Qing, who practiced the path of Zen, was best at deduction.","Injuries to his divine body didn’t hinder his ability to deduce.","At this moment, Wu Zuo was also very anxious, having transmitted everything that happened here to Realm King, seeking a way to break the deadlock.","The Temple of World Annihilation was too special.","It was an artifact.","Yet it could resurrect the fallen Broly.","How could they fight this?","Moreover, Broly’s aura after resurrection was different, obviously stronger than before.","Now, the Reincarnation Sword was no longer enough to kill him.","“I can’t deduce it!” Hu Qing shook his head. If he could deduce it, he would have done so long ago.","That was the Temple of World Annihilation, an artifact.","Mie Sheng was also a Starry Sky God. If an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master like him could deduce it, it would be a miracle.","Seeing Hu Qing’s bewildered look, Zhen Ling gritted his teeth, not knowing what to do.","There was no way, as Jian Wushuang had too many debts to pay.","This time, he could only shoulder it alone.","Hu Qing also felt regret in his heart. If he had known, he would have been more cautious.","If he wasn’t injured, he could help Jian Wushuang share some of the pressure.","Now, he could only watch.","At the same time, his Origin Source and divine body were continuously recovering.","It just needed time.","Hopefully, during this time, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t be in trouble!","“Wow!”","Jian Wushuang floated above the magma, his face unrecognizable due to the thick smoke, but the sword in his hand was particularly dazzling.","“Just as I guessed, you really aren’t that easy to fall!” Facing Broly, he was relaxed. The oppressive feeling was numb to him.","He wouldn’t be nervous because of it.","Broly also stared at him, but didn’t speak, just stood quietly, yet the aura on his body kept erupting.","The divine power surged again and again, trying to break the 20 million limit of the Northern Spacetime.","This action made the entire North Spacetime tremble.","Realm King could feel it clearly.","However, he wasn’t in the North Spacetime now, but on the Realm God Continent.","Visiting the Great Realm King, trying to understand Mie Sheng from there.","When Weiss left, he told Jian Wushuang that this matter was for him to resolve.","That meant no one in the Starry Sky would intervene.","There were very few on the Realm God Continent who could help Realm King.","Cultivators couldn’t help.","The gods looked down on him.","Reaching this point, Realm King himself felt helpless, repeatedly imposing the belief that the strong were respected upon himself.","But for those past events, he had no regrets. Even in his current situation, he had no regrets.","Only a sense of regret.","If his original self hadn’t fallen, how could an outsider Starry Sky God bully him so?","And let a cultivator stand in front, while he, a Realm King, was of no use at all."]},{"number":6099,"title":"Chapter 6099: No Way Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 6099: No Way Out","At this moment, his embarrassment was quite similar to that of Shan Jun.","Both felt guilty.","Yet, there was nothing they could do!","“Since Lord Weiss has said so, this time...” Even the Great Realm King felt a bit reluctant.","But he couldn’t help.","The words of a Star Sprit were like an imperial decree.","The Northern Realm King slowly lowered his head, his voice ancient and weary. “I will endure it!”","After speaking, he prepared to leave.","Even if he had no combat power, he would go to supervise the battle.","Otherwise, others might think he was afraid.","“By the way, I heard from the Realm King God that a pair of earrings he left in your Northern Spacetime were obtained by that Jian Wushuang. Perhaps this is your Northern Spacetime’s chance to turn the tables, so you must seize it!” The Great Realm King remembered the Realm King God’s reminder and told the Northern Realm King at this moment.","He knew about that supreme treasure.","However, relying on that treasure to win seemed a very slim hope.","Hu Qing couldn’t deduce the Starry Sky God, but the Great Realm King could.","Although it was a bit blurry, he could still see the general outline.","The real threat was still Mie Sheng.","Far beyond the current Broly.","If they couldn’t even deal with Broly, then there was no hope at all.","“I will!” The Northern Realm King didn’t look back, only nodded heavily and then flashed away from the place.","After entering his Northern Spacetime, he went straight downstream.","From a great distance, he saw an oval-shaped sphere starting to shatter.","That was the powerful airwaves erupting from the battle.","It shook the entire Northern Spacetime.","Many strong ones from the midstream spacetime had now arrived at the confluence with the downstream, looking at that terrifying aura.","Although they didn’t know who was fighting, they could feel that this battle could likely destroy the entire downstream spacetime.","Even strong ones from the upstream spacetime could feel it.","Something major was happening in the Northern Spacetime.","Those cultivators who could connect with the Realm King were now inquiring about the downstream spacetime.","But the Realm King had no time to deal with them.","Swoosh!","Above the Qishen Temple, the Realm King’s phantom descended.","“Lord Realm King!” Hu Qing was the first to step forward. He was an old acquaintance of the Realm King, having once helped the Realm King drive away Xilu.","Later, he also had dealings with Berut.","Seeing the Realm King descend, both he and Wu Zuo hoped the other could provide them with help.","The others, however, didn’t understand who this blue-skinned chubby figure that appeared suddenly was!","It wasn’t until Wu Zuo pulled Realm King over to introduce him that everyone understood the general situation.","At the same time, they all showed the same hopeful eyes as Wu Zuo and Hu Qing, expecting Realm King to take action and help.","Looking at these people, Realm King took a deep breath, not knowing what to say for a moment.","If it hadn’t been for the Great Realm King reminding him before leaving that Jian Wushuang had obtained a pair of earrings from the Realm King God, he would have had no face to face these people.","At this awkward moment.","Mie Sheng appeared for the first time.","“Old friend, long time no see!” Mie Sheng’s phantom appeared beside Qishen Temple,","looking at Realm King with disdain in his eyes.","To him, Realm King of the Northern Spacetime was less powerful than air.","There was indeed nothing to worry about.","He came here also to witness his grand plan coming to fruition.","Realm King seized the opportunity to turn away from the people of Qishen Temple, pointing","in the direction of Jian Wushuang, and said, “Mie Sheng, you have chosen the wrong","opponent!”","“Oh?” Mie Sheng found it somewhat amusing, assuming a posture of listening attentively, and said, “Why do you say that?”","He wanted to hear what Realm King had to say, or perhaps defeat him with words?","Realm King glanced at Jian Wushuang, firmly saying, “You have chosen the wrong opponent, and you have found the wrong person!”","“Pfft!” Mie Sheng covered his mouth, almost laughing out loud.","If it weren’t for his tense expression, he really wouldn’t have been able to hold it in. “Hah!” The Realm King’s expression gradually turned cold, questioning, “I know you come from the future, I also know you have traversed spacetime, visited the Divine Tree of Wanliu, and I know you have failed many times. This time is just a reflection of your countless failures. If I guess correctly, your backup plan this time is to go to the upstream spacetime because you learned from Jiang Shang that the Wanliu Divine Tree is in the upstream spacetimes. However, now the Wanliu Divine Tree has been taken by Lord Weiss, so you can only traverse spacetime to the former upstream spacetime!”","At first, Mie Sheng looked down on Realm King, but the more he listened, the more he felt something was wrong, his brows already furrowed together.","“What do you want to say?”","“This time you have failed, and there is no retreat, because Lord Weiss has already sealed your retreat. Moreover, you will definitely fail this time, and you will be removed from the Starry Sky!” Realm King’s words were powerful and resonant.","The people of Qishen Temple stood behind him, although they didn’t fully understand, they listened intently, feeling hopeful this time.","The Realm King came, definitely bringing a way to save them.","Mie Sheng frowned, being discovered with his secret felt terrible, this exceeded his","calculations.","There was no way around it, having traversed so many times, this was a side effect.","It was normal to be discovered in advance.","He had been discovered before.","But those who discovered him had all perished.","But this time it was Star Spirit Weiss.","He was somewhat scared.","With his retreat sealed, it meant that the Grim Reaper of the current Starry Sky had been","removed.","Even if he devoured Jian Wushuang, he would still have to traverse time to the past to reunite","with his true self.","But the path of time traversal was blocked by Weiss.","“You are trying to scare me!” Mie Sheng didn’t dare to believe it. If this was true, then he was","really doomed this time.","At present, he thought Jian Wushuang would be the future God of Life.","He believed that devouring Jian Wushuang would forge reincarnation.","At this moment, it was the Realm King’s turn to show disdain. He also wanted to use words to","strike at the opponent, either making the opponent retreat voluntarily or driving him mad, a","double-edged sword.","But now, he was left with only this method.","Mie Sheng would not accept failure.","Or rather, he was unwilling to accept that he would perish.","If devouring failed, he still had a retreat, but now the retreat was gone.","So he couldn’t fail.","He could only bite the bullet and devour Jian Wushuang.","“Think whatever you want. I can also tell you that the God of Life in the Northern Spacetime","has already appeared, and it appeared in the Wanliu Divine Tree, and is now on the Realm God Continent!” Realm King spoke proudly.","This was also why he sent Danbao into the Realm God Continent early on, to prevent Mie","Sheng from going mad.","“Impossible!” Mie Sheng’s breath was somewhat disordered, shaking his head and saying,","“Weiss is just a Star Spirit, why would he care about your life and death, and it’s even more impossible for him to go against me!”","“Of course, Lord Star Spirit is extremely busy, how could he care about an affiliated spacetime? Even if we were exterminated, it wouldn’t make Lord Star Spirit frown!” Realm King first nodded in agreement, then his expression darkened, pointing at Jian Wushuang, and loudly said, “But you would never have expected that it was him, a cultivator,","who caught Lord Weiss’ attention, and was even accepted as a disciple by Lord Weiss! By the way, let me tell you one more thing, Lord Weiss has another disciple, who is the reincarnated","Jiang Shang.”"]},{"number":6100,"title":"Chapter 6100: Promise","paragraphs":["Chapter 6100: Promise","Though he called him a disciple, it was somewhat exaggerated.","There wasn’t much of a master-disciple relationship.","What existed was a sense of gratitude.","He helped Jian Wushuang eliminate Mie Sheng in the Wanliu Divine Tree.","He wouldn’t care about the matters here.","Mie Sheng’s true form in the Starry Sky had indeed fallen, not because of Weiss’s promise, but because Mie Sheng had violated the Supreme Law Rule.","He needed to be eradicated.","“Impossible!” Mie Sheng roared in impotent rage!","He vanished before everyone’s eyes with a flick of his hand.","He only fully erupted after returning to the Temple of World Annihilation.","He transformed into the true form of the God of Death.","Towering and shrouded in black mist, countless skeletons fell from his body.","“Damned, damned!”","Mie Sheng roared, his heart full of unwillingness.","The words of the Realm King had indeed taken effect.","He realized now that he had targeted the wrong opponent, that Jian Wushuang was not the God of Life at all.","Even winning was pointless!","He was now at his wit’s end.","All his plans had turned into bubbles.","He genuinely considered retreating.","But where could he retreat to now?","He couldn’t traverse time.","He couldn’t possibly appear in the Starry Sky in this form!","Even if he went, it would be death, and his strength couldn’t return to its peak.","Staying in the affiliated spacetime was also unsatisfactory.","He looked down on this place.","He came here to become stronger.","Now, not to mention becoming stronger, the path was completely blocked.","Just as he was going mad, a slender figure appeared in the Temple of World Annihilation.","“Are you giving up just like that?” a disdainful voice echoed in Mie Sheng’s ears, extremely harsh.","Mie Sheng regained a bit of composure, looked down at the figure in the hall, and didn’t know who it was.","But to enter his Temple of World Annihilation unnoticed was definitely not simple.","“Who are you?” At this moment, Mie Sheng was like a startled bird, the recent scare was still too great.","The figure, seeing his expression, showed some disdain, slowly walked out of the shadows, revealing his true form.","“Zamasu!”","A prominent figure of the Realm God Continent.","Also the next Realm King God, well-known even in the Starry Sky.","Mie Sheng naturally recognized him.","But he didn’t expect that a successor of the Realm King God would come to find him. “Mie Sheng, you have a divine position after all, and you’re scared to this extent because of a few words?” Zamasu frowned and said darkly, “You disappoint me!”","“Hmph!” Mie Sheng snorted coldly, “It’s not your place to mock me. If you have nothing else, get lost quickly!”","Zamasu didn’t get angry but laughed instead, saying with a smile, “If I really left, you would regret it!”","He wasn’t here to mock him.","Mie Sheng also knew about Zamasu and felt he wouldn’t be so bored as to come here for no","reason.","“Then let’s talk?”","“Let’s talk!” Zamasu nodded.","The people outside still didn’t know that another terrifying existence had descended, making their chances of winning drop once again.","...","Realm King had just faced Mie Sheng. Although he had said those words, he was sweating profusely, fearing that Mie Sheng might act recklessly and destroy the entire Northern Spacetime in a fit of rage.","If that happened, all his efforts over the years would be in vain.","Although the Origin Source of spacetime would repair itself over time,","who knew how long the next repair would take, and all life would perish.","At that time, only some spacetime gods would remain, which would be useless.","Because it is mortals that give gods their purpose.","Without a foundation, what use are gods?","He originally wanted to take the opportunity to persuade Mie Sheng, but he didn’t expect the latter to leave without a second thought.","So, Realm King was worried.","Now, he could only wait.","However, Jian Wushuang did not stop because of these things.","At this moment, he was still fighting with Broly.","Moreover, he had already killed Broly for the second time.","Now, the opponent had revived again from the Temple of World Annihilation.","“There must be a small reincarnation cycle inside the Temple of World Annihilation!” Jian Wushuang speculated in his heart, “Sending Jiang Shang to his death was probably for the Myriad Willow Divine Wood in his body. Absorbing the shadow of the Wanliu Divine Tree would provide Life force. Using such a small amount of Life force to create a reincarnation...”","Although he was an opponent, he had to admire Mie Sheng’s strength.","When he created the Reincarnation Sword back then, he used all his means.","In the end, it was formed with great difficulty.","Even now, it was only at the minor completion stage.","But Mie Sheng casually created a small reincarnation cycle.","After all, he was a god!","He became more and more eager to face Mie Sheng.","Unfortunately, he couldn’t even deal with a single Broly at the moment.","The newly revived Broly had his aura elevated to a new level.","“Spacetime Reincarnation!”","This time, he did not hesitate and unleashed his strongest sword move right away.","He defeated the opponent the second time because of this strongest sword move.","He just didn’t know how many sword strikes it would take to kill the opponent this time.","He didn’t believe that this small reincarnation cycle could keep reviving Broly endlessly.","With one strike, he cut Broly’s body in half.","But this time, the opponent did not fall.","This was as he expected.","If one sword strike wasn’t enough, then two.","Three sword strikes, or even ten thousand sword strikes.","He now seemed like a bully, blocking the door of someone else’s house, killing anyone who","came out.","The first two times were fine; he could still fight for a while.","The third time, Jian Wushuang couldn’t take it anymore because he lost his will to fight and","was left with only the intent to kill.","After a few strikes, the power of the Starry Sky had diminished significantly, and he","completely shattered the third resurrected Broly.","“Realm King, do you have a way?” He had known for a while that the Realm King had arrived,","but he didn’t have the time to pay attention to him. After killing Broly for the third time, he","turned to look at the Realm King.","At this moment, the Realm King hesitated and said, “There is a way, but...”","Seeing the Realm King so conflicted, Wu Zuo beside him couldn’t help but urge, “What","exactly is the way? Just say it, things have come to this point!”","“Shut up!”","Northern Realm King roared, more frustrated than anyone else.","“Just say it!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were firm as he waited for the Northern Realm King’s","solution.","But apart from the nonsense the Great Realm King said when he left, the Northern Realm King","had no solution. He was so anxious that his face turned red, but he couldn’t come up with a","plan.","After hesitating for a moment, the Northern Realm King’s eyes lit up as he suddenly thought","of something and quickly said, “Got it!”","This confused Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, Broly was still being nurtured in the Temple of World Annihilation!","But this time, the nurturing was different.","Because of Zamasu’s appearance, Mie Sheng’s original plan was advanced.","The small reincarnation cycle completely fused with Broly’s divine body.","A mad beast was about to be unleashed.","“His power...” Zamasu, seeing the Broly who had fused with the heart of reincarnation,","couldn’t help but be astonished, “It seems to exceed the Nine Tribulation Realm!”","Mie Sheng shook his head and said, “No, it’s still far off. The heart of reincarnation will","gradually enhance his power!”","“So, he will grow stronger the more he fights?”","“Sort of,” Mie Sheng said with a faint smile.","He wasn’t in a good mood now. First, he was struck by the Realm King, then Zamasu descended to cooperate with him.","But it hadn’t been of much use.","It went against his goal.","Although the Reincarnation Position was gone, there was a Realm King position available.","Zamasu had promised Mie Sheng the position of Realm King in the Northern Spacetime.","Initially, Mie Sheng didn’t care.","But Zamasu promised that as long as he became the candidate for the Realm King God, he would arrange for Mie Sheng to become the new Great Realm King.","The Great Realm King was not an ordinary spacetime god.","On par with the Starry Sky God.","If it were in the past, Mie Sheng wouldn’t have cared.","Because he was originally a Starry Sky God, but now he had no other way out. Maintaining his","former glory was enough.","As long as he stayed alive, there would be infinite opportunities in the future. “Alright, I won’t stay here any longer. I await your triumphant return!” Zamasu smiled and","threw a small wooden box to Mie Sheng, reminding him, “Remember, once you merge with it, you can never separate!”","Mie Sheng took a deep breath and, without saying a word, opened the box to find a jade slip","inside. He said in a deep voice, “Is this the secret technique created by the Realm King God? I didn’t expect I would need it one day!”","“Well!” Zamasu didn’t say anything else and left the Temple of World Annihilation.","To him, Mie Sheng had no way out and could only be manipulated by him. There was no need to superWeisse the battle; the other party would give their all to destroy","the entire Northern Spacetime.","After he left,","Mie Sheng first released Broly and then began the final step of his plan.","A plan that had never changed.","Even if he couldn’t achieve the Reincarnation Position,","this plan had to be carried out.","Because it was his promise to Shan Jun."]}]);
